window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4601,"title":"Chapter 4601: Re-establishment of Nine Suns Holy Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 4601: Re-establishment of Nine Suns Holy Land","“Announce to the public that Ling Han is the son-in-law of our clan. Anyone who wants to harm him is equivalent to making an enemy of our clan.” Chi Taiming’s voice continued to ring out.","The Crystal Saint found this a little strange, and said, “That brat already possesses Saint-level battle prowess, so there should be no one in this world that would dare to trifle with him.”","Thus, what need was there for them to do anything else?","“Heh, so why not do this kind of favor that would cost us nothing?” Chi Taiming asked calmly.","‘F*ck! He’s truly an old fox!’","The Crystal Saint only felt that he wasn’t as shameless as this.","“As long as there are no accidents, this boy will definitely become Emperor!” Chi Taiming continued, “In this way, our Chi Clan would be assured! Furthermore, if we can still get his children, and adopt them into our Chi Clan, then with the bloodline of two great Imperial Clans, just how amazing would their natural talent in cultivation be?”","“It is ultimately possible that there would be a second Great Emperor in our Chi Clan!”","The Crystal Saint nodded. He couldn’t see as far as Chi Taiming, and could only think of the Imperial Scroll, Destructive Energy and Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","However, would Ling Han not teach these techniques to his own child?","Wasn’t his and Chi Menghan’s child the bloodline of the Donglin Imperial Clan?","Worse come to worst, from the day that the child was born, they would treat him millions and millions of times better, so that he would return to the Chi Clan. In fact, they would even betroth him to a woman of the Chi Clan, so that they could become even closer.","Then, these precious techniques would still fall into the hands of the Chi Clan.","That’s right, that’s right. Previously, his behaviour was really too greedy and inappropriate. No wonder he had chased Ling Han away.","Thus, the older one was, the wiser they were.","Soon, the Chi Clan sent out news, expressing their approval of Ling Han as a son-in-law, and expressing their full support for him.","Instantly, the world shook.","This... was the Donglin Imperial Clan publicly slapping the Ziwei Imperial Clan’s face?","But upon further thought, the actions of the Donglin Imperial Clan were very realistic.","Was Ling Han powerful?","Strong, strong to the point of sweeping aside all opponents at the same cultivation level, capable of fighting.even someone with a higher cultivation level to a tie.","The possibility that this kind of person could become Emperor was much, much too high.","So, who could Chi Menghan be betrothed to what would bring the most benefits to the Chi Clan?","Ling Han or Ziwei Imperial Clan?","Moreover, with Ling Han’s personality, once he became Emperor, it was very likely that he would make the Ziwei Imperial Clan disappear from history.","Secondly, so what if they offended the Ziwei Imperial Clan?","Was the Donglin Imperial Clan afraid?","Both clans had similar backgrounds, with an Imperial Weapon standing guard, so what was there to be afraid of?","Thus, what did it matter if Donglin Imperial Clan gave Ziwei Imperial Clan a harsh slap?","Moreover, only by doing this, and publicly breaking off relations with the Ziwei Imperial Clan, would they be able to gain Ling Han’s favour.","—Previously, the Donglin Imperial Clan didn’t care about anything else and promised Chi Menghan to Baili Tian. Thus, they had to clearly express their stand on the matter now, right?","All of a sudden, the entire Galaxy Network was discussing this matter heatedly, and guessing how the Ziwei Imperial Clan would react.","Right at this moment, Ling Han and the others returned.","After introducing Chi Menghan to Hu Niu and the empress, Ling Han began to deal with serious matters after they spent a few days together.","Since Ling Han and Brother Monkey had either become a Saint or possessed Saint-level battle prowess, and since the little azure dragon and the large black dog were only one step away from becoming Saints, the matter of the reestablishing the Nine Suns Holy Land naturally had to be brought up the schedule.","Previously, the Nine Mountains Saint was all alone, and it was difficult for him to hold on alone.","But it was different now. There were as many as three cultivators with Saint-level battle prowess!","Thus, unless they could kill Ling Han and the others at the same time, as long as one of them slipped through the net, having become the target of a Saint, what force would be able to survive peacefully?","If they re-established the Nine Suns Holy Land now, Ling Han wasn’t worried that the Imperial Clans would come and cause trouble.","Moreover, just how terrifying was Ling Han’s potential?","As long as there was no guarantee that he could be killed, who would dare make a move on those close to him?","Then there was no need for Ling Han to become Emperor, because once he became a Saint, even a Nine-Star Saint would be terrified, right?","The time was ripe.","Ling Han got in touch with the Nine Mountains Sain, and said that he wanted to rebuild the Nine Suns Holy Land.","This naturally made the old man extremely happy. He immediately rushed over, and discussed the details of the reconstruction with Ling Han.","There were a lot of things to do, such as choosing a location and selecting the leader of the Holy Land.","Time passed quickly. A year later, Ling Han announced to the public that the Nine Suns Holy Land was reopening!","Four Origin Planet was chosen as the location. This was a great planet, but if it was used as a Holy Land sect, it seemed to be a little lacking in resources.","Ling Han didn’t care. He could slowly modify this planet, especially after he became a Saint. Just how powerful would he be by then?","Hence, this was not a problem.","The Master of the Holy Land was... Ling Han!","Additionally, the Nine Mountains Saint was the grand elder, Brother Monkey, the little azure dragon, and the large black dog were the guest elders. In fact, he even sent out an invitation to Ding Shu and the other Genesis World rulers, strongly inviting them to also take the position of guest elders.","However, at present, only Ding Shu and Jing Haoran had replied and expressed their agreement. There was still no news about the others.","This naturally would not have any effect on Ling Han. He had already sent out invitations widely, inviting the various great forces to attend the ceremony.","There were as many people that responded as clouds.","Ling Han had already used his heaven-defying battle merits to prove his strength. It could be said that even if he couldn’t become Emperor in the end, he would still become the most powerful Saint — and there was no other Saint.","This kind of elite, or even a future Great Emperor, since he had invited them, why others not come to show goodwill?","The day of the founding of the Holy Land was set for three years later, giving these guests who had come to attend the ceremony enough time to make arrangements.","On the other hand, they couldn’t just open the Holy Land. Without disciples, what was the point?","There was even less need to worry about this.","With Ling Han as their golden signboard, what need was there for them to be afraid of not being able to recruit outstanding disciples?","Of course, there was no time limit for the recruitment of disciples. It was always ongoing. On the day the Holy Land was established, it should be enough to form a larger scale establishment.","Ling Xi, Fu Tianxing, and so on had all joined and become a disciple of the Nine Suns Holy Land. In future, they could break away from it, but for now, they would just be there for appearances’ sake.","Ling Han, the Holy Land Master, was actually only in name. He was completely focused on cultivating, so how could he possibly bother with such trifling matters?","Thus, the grand elder, the Nine Mountains Saint became busy.","However, after the old man had reached the Saint Tier, his potential had practically been exhausted. Unless he obtained a great opportunity, it should be impossible for him to advance into Two Stars. Thus, with so many years of lifespan remaining, he had to find something to do, right?","Ling Han went to the front lines again, slaughtering Yin souls to increase his cultivation.","However, he was too strong now.","Even if he killed a Venerate Tier-level Yin soul, the rewards he received were pitifully little, and the help it provided to his cultivation was pitifully little.","And in the case of the Yin Saint... just how many Saints were there? Even if there were slightly more Yin Saints, it was still limited.","More importantly, killing Saintly corpses wasn’t beneficial to Ling Han at all. Otherwise, if he went to the Yin River and the sea of blood, he might be able to reap great rewards.","Ling Han was very depressed. Next, was he going to slowly increase his cultivation level?","The young king tiers of today were already close to advancing into Saint Tier. Though his battle prowess was not inferior, there was still a gap of a major tier between them.","Becoming Emperor naturally depended on cultivation level as well. He was definitely too far off!"]},{"number":4602,"title":"Chapter 4602: Heading to the edge of the universe","paragraphs":["Chapter 4602: Heading to the edge of the universe","Just as Ling Han was worrying about how to increase his cultivation level, Brother Monkey came over.","“Old Sun wants to go to the edge of the universe to find the whereabouts of my ancestor,” Brother Monkey said.","This was something that Brother Monkey had long since decided. As long as he became a Saint, he would go to the edge of the universe to find the whereabouts of the Battle Saint Emperor.","Whether he had lived or died, there had to be a conclusion.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head, and he said, “After the reconstruction ceremony of the Holy Land, I will go with you.”","He had just been worrying about the problem of improving his cultivation level, but if he went to the edge of the universe, would he gain something?","It should be known that it was highly possible that the secret of longevity was hidden there, so it would not be strange that there was a lot of Celestial Qi there.","Brother Monkey thought for a moment, then nodded, “All right!”","Ling Han had long since been anticipating this trip. However, his cultivation level previously had been too weak, and even if he used up his entire lifespan, he may not be able to make it there. Now that he possessed Saint-level battle prowess, he could give it a try.","Thus, the two brothers began to cultivate first, and waited quietly.","When the little azure dragon and the large black dog found out, they naturally clamored to go as well. However, Ling Han set a condition for them—they were not allowed to go unless they became Saints.","It should be known that even the Great Emperors considered that place a dangerous place. Just look at the Battle Saint Emperor and the others. Which one of them had returned?","If he hadn’t died of old age somewhere, he would have definitely been trapped.","Even the Great Emperor would be trapped, so just how terrifying was that place?","Thus, what would Venerates gp there for?","In fact, even Saints were completely unsafe. However, it could not hold up to the fact that both Ling Han and Brother Monkey were outrageously bold.","In the blink of an eye, three years had passed.","The Nine Suns Holy Land reopened, and today would be the day!","As early as a month ago, esteemed guests had already arrived, especially the Donglin Imperial Clan. The Donglin Imperial Clan had given enough face to this son-in-law of theirs, and the Crystal Saint had personally brought the juniors of the clan over to offer congratulations. He had even allowed a few juniors of his clan to join the Nine Suns Holy Land.","When the time came, even more forces would come.","There were innumerable Saint Tier and Venerate Tier-level forces, and there were even a few Imperial Clans that had sent envoys over to deliver generous gifts.","Though they had not sent out a Saint to lead the team, the fact that they were able to attend, and the gifts they had given were also considerably valuable, could be considered to have given Ling Han a lot of face.","These Imperial Clans naturally had never become enemies with Ling Han before, and other Imperial Clans like Ziwei Clan, Golden Cauldron Clan, White Feather Clan, Jade Drop Clan and so on didn’t send anyone over.","—Even their Imperial Son had been killed by Ling Han. This was a great enmity, so how could it be erased so easily?","Thus, these Imperial Clans only had one thought in their minds. They could either kill Ling Han, or push the Imperial Sons of their Clans to speed up their advance, so that they could become Emperor first.","Only one Great Emperor could appear in each era. Thus, no matter how freakish you were, if you were too late, there was still nothing you could do.","This was a grand feast. It was broadcasted live through the Galaxy Network, and not only did it allow the Nine Suns Holy Land to regain its former glory, it even surpassed it countless times over.","Just see how many Saints they had?","Three of them!","Furthermore, Ling Han and Brother Monkey’s potential was too great. They should be able to reach Three Stars, Five Stars, or even higher level of Saint Tier or battle prowess soon. There were also a great many disciples that had enrolled into Nine Suns Holy Land on the spot.","The Nine Mountains Saint was extremely pleased. Right now, he only had one hope, and that was for Ling Han to become Emperor and bring the Nine Suns Holy Land to an unprecedented height.","Ten days later, the feast ended, and the various forces left, one after another.","The Crystal Saint deliberately stayed behind to discuss some matters with Ling Han.","“When are you going to marry Menghan?” he asked directly.","As for that.","Ling Han thought for a moment, “When I become Emperor.”","“No, how can the princess of our Chi Clan follow you for such a long time without a proper status!” The Crystal Saint immediately shook his head.","The two of them argued for a while, and finally decided to set the wedding date on the day that Ling Han would become a Saint.","Not only did Ling Han want to marry Chi Menghan, but he also wanted to marry Song Lan.","This woman was also deeply in love with him. Moreover, he was the one who had snatched her from her wedding and saved her, so he had to take responsibility, right?","Otherwise, everyone knew that Ling Han was the one who had stolen her from her wedding. Would anyone still dare to marry Song Lan?","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry to set off.","Going to the edge of the universe was a very dangerous and possibly time-consuming matter. He had to make proper arrangements.","He walked around the Holy Land, guiding the cultivation of his disciples.","In truth, the majority of disciples were older than him, but on the path of martial arts, there was no seniority in learning, and those who were capable would be regarded as Master.","Ling Han took some time to refine the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower again. He then instilled the Seven Star Regulations into it, transforming it into a Seven Star Level Spirit Tool.","Unfortunately, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower wasn’t him, so it couldn’t intertwine Regulations and unleash battle prowess above its cultivation level.","Thus, the current Primal Chaos could only be considered the strongest seven-star Spirit Tool.","Ling Han didn’t take it to heart. He had always thought that his own strength was the most important.","On this trip to the edge of the universe, he had to bring the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower with him.","It wasn’t because of the might of the Spirit Tool, but rather because of the sturdiness of the Origin Gold. If it was used as a shield, even Saints wouldn’t be able to break through it.","After making the necessary arrangements, Ling Han and Brother Monkey decided to set off.","Because the little azure dragon and the large black dog hadn’t broken through yet, they naturally couldn’t follow him this time.","This was no joke.","The two of them tore a rip into space, and headed towards the edge of the universe.","Just how large was the universe?","No one knew about this. However, according to the information available, the distance between the two furthest planets would take a Saint about six days to travel.","From the sound of it, this seemed to be very close.","However, the distance from the final planet to the edge of the universe was astonishingly far. Even Saints couldn’t get close to it.","It could be said that the space that planets occupied in the universe was possibly only ten thousandth of the entire universe, or even smaller than that.","To go to the edge of the universe required a huge amount of courage and determination.","Ling Han and Brother Monkey entered into the Void, using Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and advanced rapidly.","Ling Han constructed a Transfer Formation on the final planet. This was a one-time Transfer Formation that expended extremely large amounts of resources. It could only be used once, and would become useless once it was used.","But its effect was that no matter how far away they were, they could be instantly transmitted back.","Ling Han didn’t know how long this trip would take. After all, they couldn’t spend their remaining life on traveling, right?","Hence, the time limit was ten years.","If they still couldn’t reach the edge of the universe in 10 years, then he and Brother Monkey would return through the Transfer Formation.","Time flew by. Every day, Ling Han and Brother Monkey’s daily routine was to travel. One year, two years, three years, the universe was endless and far-reaching. Every time they broke through the Void and came out, all they saw was an ice-cold, dark world.","There were no stars, no light, and nothing else existed.","Staying in this kind of place for too long, any normal person would probably go crazy, right?","Five years, eight years, ten years!","Finally, ten years had passed, but Ling Han and Brother Monkey still hadn’t reached the edge of the universe. They journeyed for another two years, but they still couldn’t see any signs of reaching the end.","Helpless, the two of them could only use the Transfer Formation to return.","Perhaps only Great Emperors had the right to explore the edge of the universe. So what if they were Saints? They didn’t even have the right to reach this place."]},{"number":4603,"title":"Chapter 4603: Assassination by a Saint","paragraphs":["Chapter 4603: Assassination by a Saint","After returning to the Four Origin Planet, Ling Han continued his previous routine.","He could guide the disciples of the sect in their cultivation, or become a middleman to earn the difference in quality of Celestial Qi.","Right now, he was in desperate need of Celestial Qi. Merely reaching the nine-star Venerate Tier would require a huge amount of Celestial Qi, and he encountered any trouble causing him to to break through some limits at the fourth pinnacle level, that would be fun.","Hence, if there was a large-scale invasion of Yin souls, he would definitely counterattack, and earn some rewards from heaven and earth.","In the Celestial Qi business, it was still a sure profit. After all, this only needed him to spend a little bit of time, and added with a bit of Celestial medicine, it would be done.","However, the Nine Suns Holy Land didn’t have much of a background at the moment. It didn’t even have the use of an exclusive medicinal planet.","The power structure of the forces in the universe had long since been decided. If they wanted to obtain new territory, there was only one way.","War.","Ling Han believed in the principle of ‘if you don’t trifle with me, I won’t trifle with you’. Thus, he naturally wouldn’t take the initiative to invade other planets. This was a little awkward. Celestial medicines could only be planted on Four Origin Planet.","Thankfully, he had moved a great many seven-star Great Herbs from the Ziwei Imperial Clan here. After a while, he would be able to reap some rewards.","Furthermore, since they were Great Herbs, they definitely needed an extremely long harvesting cycle, and that was why it was called background.","Relying on earning the quality difference in Celestial Qi, Ling Han’s cultivation level was slowly improving.","He didn’t dare to let others know that he was the one doing this business. Otherwise, forces like the Ziwei Imperial Clan would definitely cause trouble.","Ling Han attempted to truly solve the problem of Celestial Qi.","The Imperial Clan was able to easily obtain Celestial Qi through the Imperial Weapon, hooking it out of the Void and obtaining it. However, there were very few high-level Celestial Qi, after all. Thus, even the Imperial Clans had very few eight-star Celestial Qi, let alone nine-star Celestial Qi.","Ling Han wanted to give it a try.","However, no matter how he tried, he didn’t see any Celestial Qi being drawn over by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","This made him understand that the key to attracting Celestial Qi wasn’t the Origin Gold, but the Emperor-level Regulations.","He could only give up and obediently do his business as a middleman, earning the price difference.","And in these twelve years, the whole universe was peaceful, and nothing major had happened. If there was anything serious, it was that the invasion of the Yin souls was still progressing steadily. With the Skeleton Saint Tools clearing the way, the invasion of the Netherworld was unstoppable.","Unless the Pseudo-Emperor made a move, there should be no one at the level of Saint Tier that could stop the Skeleton Saint Tools.","For example, Baili Tian, Yan Dongming, and the other Golden Generations, had any of them truly advanced into Saint Tier?","Right now, it was as if the members of the Imperial Clans had all become extremely low-key. There was very little news about the Golden Generation. In fact, they didn’t even receive any news about the Silver Generation or the ordinary Imperial Sons.","Ling Han didn’t mind. So what if Baili Tian had truly become a Saint? Could it be that he would still be afraid?","Though he had always been the type to tell others to work and do nothing himself, as the Holy land’s Master, he couldn’t just do his own things all the time, right?","On this day, Ling Han came out and strolled around the Holy Land. When he saw disciples cultivating, he went over to take a look. If there was a problem with their cultivation, he would give them some guidance.","Before he knew it, he had arrived at a public square.","Here, there were a dozen over disciples sparring and practicing their sword techniques.","“Holy Land Master!”","“Lord Holy Land Master!”","Seeing Ling Han walk over, these disciples all paid their respects. Some of them even looked fanatical.","This was Ling Han, the strongest Sect Master in history, and also the strongest Venerate in history.","How many people had come because of the name of Ling Han?","However, Ling Han very rarely appeared, and now that they could see him from close quarters, they were naturally all extremely excited.","Ling Han nodded, indicating that there was no need for formalities. He hated this kind of red tape the most.","“Lord Holy Land Master, why don’t you teach us how to practice the sword,” a disciple said. The gaze she directed at Ling Han was filled with sincerity and admiration.","This was a female disciple. Upon a closer look, she was really good-looking, and her figure was even more alluring, causing quite a number of male disciples to be unable to take their eyes off her.","Ling Han smiled, not taking it to heart at all, “Sure.”","The disciples stepped forward to practice, one after another. Some of them followed the rules, while some of them were quite off. They needed Ling Han to correct them.","With a few pointers from him, the others also had great gains, nodding repeatedly.","It was the turn of a male disciple. This was a middle-aged man. Ordinarily speaking, he shouldn’t have been accepted into the Holy Land at such an age, but who asked the Nine Suns Holy Land to be newly reestablished? It needed people of all ages and cultivation levels to fill in the gaps.","At first, this man was still very clumsy, but with Ling Han’s guidance, he improved rapidly. Every time he channeled it again, it was enough to make people exclaim in surprise.","‘Hmm?’","There was killing intent!","Just as Ling Han’s heart clenched, that man suddenly exploded. Boom, a terrifying aura surged out. He was actually a Saint!","F***, a Saint actually impersonated a disciple of the Nine Suns Holy Land?","No, he had suppressed his cultivation level to sneak in!","Shua! The saintly might reverberated through the air as the sword slashed over.","Ling Han humphed coldly, brandishing his fists in response, his expression completely cold.","F*ck, coming to the Nine Suns Holy Land to cause trouble?","Peng!","The Saint’s attack was immediately blocked. However, Ling Han was at a disadvantage due to his power, and he was instantly sent flying.","However, right at this moment, another terrifying aura exploded. It was like the awakening of the Imperial Weapon, displaying its full might!","There was another Saint!","It was the woman who had asked for Ling Han’s guidance from the very beginning.","Right now, she was fully unleashing the might of a Saint. In her hand was a Divine Sword, and it was clear that this was a Saint Tool. It had already awakened, and its might was so great that it could easily obliterate even Four Origin Planet.","Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower at the first instant. Weng, this strike landed on the body of the tower. So what if it was a Saint Tool? It couldn’t do anything to the Origin Gold at all.","However, after the two attacks, the aftermath reverberated, causing a massive blow to the entire Nine Suns Holy Land. The disciples that were too close were directly crushed into dust by the terrifying power.","Xiu, xiu! Brother Monkey and the Nine Mountains Saint immediately flew out. When they saw this scene, they were both furious.","“Gegege, as expected of Ling Han. He’s really hard to kill.” The female Saint giggled delicately, and shook with delicately with her laughter. Meanwhile, that male Saint’s eyes were expressionless, as if he had no emotions at all.","Ling Han’s expression was livid. In this one move, a great many disciples of the Nine Suns Holy Land had died!","It should be known that even the Imperial Clans would not dare to come to the Nine Suns Holy Land and start a massacre. That was because unless it was guaranteed that they could kill Ling Han, Ling Han’s revenge would also cause them a headache.","In fact, they even thought further that what if Ling Han became Emperor?","The Great Emperor would begin a reckoning. Which force could escape?","Thus, even if the Ziwei Imperial Clan and the others became enemies with Ling Han, Ling Han wouldn’t be able to massacre the entire Imperial Clan even if he truly became a Great Emperor. They would still be able to leave behind descendants that would rise again in the future.","But if they came to the Nine Suns Holy Land to commit such wanton slaughter, Ling Han would definitely be forced to completely oppose them.","“You’re... from the Battle God Palace, right?” Ling Han said balefully. As Saints, they had deliberately disguised themselves to do such a thing. It was very likely that they were the wretches from the Battle God Palace."]},{"number":4604,"title":"Chapter 4604: Void Imperial Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4604: Void Imperial Clan","A proud expression appeared on the female Saint’s face, and she said, “You’ve guessed a part of it correctly. We have some relationship with the Battle God Palace, but we’re not members of the Battle God Palace.”","“Then who exactly are you people?” Ling Han’s killing intent flickered, and the Nine Mountains Saint and Brother Monkey’s eyes were also filled with viciousness.","They had already come here to commit murder, so what kind of provocation was this? Naturally, it was a life-or-death enmity.","“Oh, the Battle God Palace is only a force under the rule of our clan,” the female Saint said calmly.","What kind of astonishing news was this!","Throughout the ages, the Battle God Palace had always been a thorn in the side of every force. They wanted to eradicate it, yet they didn’t know where the lair of the Battle God Palace was.","But now, it was revealed that the Battle God Palace was actually a subordinate force of a larger force?","Hiss!","Was this for real?","Yet Ling Han believed this. That was because ever since Wu Yue had arrived, he had felt that the wealth of the Battle God Palace was not enough to support them in nurturing such a prodigy. Thus, if there was an even larger force behind the Battle God Palace, it naturally could be explained.","However, the Battle God Palace was already a Saint-level force, and there had always been a Killing Saint standing guard here. There had never been any lapses. This kind of organization was also one of the very best among Saint-level forces.","What stronger force could control the Battle God Palace?","There was only one answer.","Imperial Clan!","“Which Imperial Clan’s Saint are you?” Ling Han asked. He stared at the female Saint, not because she was beautiful, but because she was too young.","This flame of life had burned for over 10,000 years, at most. In terms of a Saint’s lifespan of over a million years, this flame of life was truly inconceivably young.","Even if she had become a Saint in 10,000 years, this rate of advancement was still astonishingly fast, what more when the other had not just advanced into Saint Tier, but had rather become a Three Star Saint!","She had reached the level of a Three Star Saint at such a young age, and this naturally required a huge amount of cultivation resources. More importantly, her natural talent was definitely incredible as well. Otherwise, how could she have achieved such a feat just by relying on resources?","The female Saint hesitated for a moment, then replied, “I am the descendant of the Void Great Emperor, Wu Xingtong.”","‘The Void Great Emperor?’","Yi, was there a Void Imperial Clan in the universe?","Ling Han looked towards Brother Monkey, and then glanced at the Nine Mountains Saint. Both of them shook their heads slightly at him, indicating that they had never heard of this.","This was strange. Why had an Imperial Clan that no one had ever heard of suddenly appeared?","Was there really such a Great Emperor that existed in the universe?","If there really was such an Imperial Clan, what need was there for them to be like an assassin’s organization, living so secretly?","“Wu Yue, whom you killed, is one of my younger brothers,” Wu Xingtong said calmly. “Although his cultivation level is higher than yours, and he was still killed by you, it is completely because he is too disappointing, but no matter what, he is still my younger brother!”","Ling Han clenched his fists, and said, “If you want to seek me out for revenge, fine, but why target innocent people?”","“Oh, you’re talking about these ants?” Wu Xingtong shook her head, “I thought that someone like you should only have the supreme peak of martial arts in his eyes, and would not care at all about the life and death of ordinary people.”","“You’re wrong,” Ling Han said darkly. “So, you have to pay with your life.”","“Oh, you think... you can kill me?” Wu Xingtong couldn’t help but laugh in spite of herself, “I am a Three Star Saint. At most, you would only be comparable to a One Star Saint. In front of me, you can only flee for your life.”","There was indeed nothing wrong with this. A Three Star Saint against a One Star Saint, that was an absolutely one-sided domination.","Even if the Nine Mountains Saint and Brother Monkey attacked together, they would still be suppressed.","Of course, the Nine Mountains Saint was still able to revive the Saint Tool. This had been personally refined by the Nine Suns Saint. Its might was astonishing.","Ling Han merely stared at Wu Xingtong, “It doesn’t matter if I can’t kill you now, but I swear that you will definitely die by my hands!”","He said these words very calmly, but there was a powerful confidence in his voice, as if he would definitely be able to do it once he said it.","Wu Xingtong’s heart involuntarily clenched, as if someone had squeezed it heavily.","She couldn’t help but pale slightly.","“Impossible!” “Impossible!”","“Is this Execution of Words1? Although its might is extremely weak, it can only cause a slight effect on me. It can’t hurt me at all.”","“But he only said a few words, and it made me feel a heart-wrenching pain. This is definitely Execution of Words!”","“Heavens, the Regulations of Karma are supreme Regulations that only a Great Emperor can use!”","All of a sudden, her thoughts raced, but her expression had long since returned to normal.","“Since that is the case, I will kill you now, so that you will never have this chance again!” Wu Xingtong declared balefully. This time, she was really filled with killing intent.","That was because this time, she truly felt threatened.","“Impossible!” the Nine Mountains Saint said coldly. He had already activated the Saint Tool.","This caused the expressions of Wu Xingtong and the other male Saint to change drastically. The Nine Suns Saint had once been known as the number one Saint. In fact, he could even exchange blows with Ancestral King Lingtian before he became the Great Emperor. Just how powerful was he?","Thus, the Saint Tool that he had left behind was naturally incredibly awesome.","“Ling Han, no matter how hard you try, you won’t be able to. In this era, hehe, your fate has long since been decided. You can only be a pitiful chess piece.” Wu Xingtong did not start the battle, but rather stretched out her hand to tear open the Void.","“I killed people, and left in such a grand manner, so you can only sit by and watch... Hehe, what do you mean by the strongest king tier? Bullsh*t!” As she said this, she stepped in.","“Haha!” The male Saint also chuckled coldly, and similarly tore a rip into space and left.","Ling Han didn’t move, and he simply hovered in the air.","Strength!","He was still not strong enough. Otherwise, if anyone dared to offend him, he would have directly killed thme with a single palm strike.","And now? He could only watch helplessly as the culprit left.","At first, he had thought that now that he possessed battle prowess of Saint-level, even the great Imperial Clans would not dare to fight him to the death. Thus, he boldly reopened the Nine Suns Holy Land.","However, reality slapped him across the face.","There was no need for the Battle God Palace to fear this kind of threat, because no one knew where the Battle God Palace was.","Ling Han couldn’t find a place to exact revenge even if he wanted to.","And the Void Imperial Clan was even more mysterious. They had hidden themselves behind the Battle God Palace for so many years.","Ling Han’s eyes were filled with fighting spirit. He definitely had to increase his cultivation level as soon as possible.","This was a blow to him, but it was completely impossible to defeat him. It would only make him work even harder.","Ling Han descended, and appeased the disciples beneath him. As for dealing with the funeral matters of those disciples that had died tragically, there was naturally no need for him to do it personally.","He had more important matters to attend to.","The defenses of Four Origin Planet were too weak.","This won’t do!","Ling Han’s group moved out, and began to roam the world, blending into the various Holy Lands, studying their Saint-level formations.","When one had reached such heights, even if he took a Formation Saint as Master, and even if the latter was willing to teach him Saint-level formations, that would be a matter of an unknown number of years later.","Thus, it was better to rely on oneself than on others.","Ling Han studied the formations of the various Holy Lands, turning it into his own understanding, improving his formation skills.","The present him was qualified to study Saint-level formations."]},{"number":4605,"title":"Chapter 4605: Arranging Formations","paragraphs":["Chapter 4605: Arranging Formations","Without a teacher, everything could only be comprehended by oneself.","Bit by bit, Ling Han was stealing the experience of his predecessors.","The formations that had been set up were the best teachers, but it was extremely difficult to figure them out.","Sometimes, Ling Han would even have to deliberately stimulate the formation to personally experience the profound secrets within, and the slightest changes.","Thankfully, he had the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Otherwise, some Saint-level formations had even reached the might of a nine-star Saint, and could easily kill him.","And just like that, Ling Han ran all over the universe. While studying formation techniques, he did not set aside the matter of cultivation, to capture Celestial Qi that could possibly appear.","A hundred years passed in a flash.","In the universe, a hundred years really wouldn’t make any ripples, and for elites, even if this bit of time wasn’t just a flash, it wasn’t much more than that.","When one had reached the level of Venerate Tier or Saint Tier, if they did not have astounding cultivation resources to spend, their progress would naturally be astonishingly slow.","If he wanted to increase his cultivation level by a minor level, it could easily take thousands or even tens of thousands of years.","Ling Han’s luck was very good. From time to time, he would be able to captureCelestial Qi. Thus, in these hundred years, he had almost reached the end of One Star Venerate Tier.","Furthermore, he had also concluded a pattern.","When he stimulated large amounts of Regulations, the chances of attracting Celestial Qi would increase greatly.","However, what made him the happiest was that he had finally created his own path in formations.","Accommodating the strengths of various formations, forming a single path of its own.","He returned to the Nine Suns Holy Land and began to set up the Great Protective Formation.","During these hundred years, the Nine Suns Holy Land was also preparing, storing a large amount of formation materials.","Thus, once Ling Han returned, he could begin.","This was a completely new formation, and it was completely set up according to Ling Han’s understanding. Thus, when it was set up, Brother Monkey, who had entered to test the waters, was almost blasted into smithereens.","Thankfully, Ling Han had given the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to him.","“Er, it was a mistake, a mistake. I know what the problem is. I’ll fix it immediately.”","“Hahaha, again, again!”","“I promise there won’t be a next time.”","“Er, this time is not counted.”","After continuous adjustments, this Great Protective Formation was finally formed, and the adjustments were completed.","It could block the attack of a nine-star Saint, and could kill a seven-star Saint!","That was how awesome it was.","Though this formation was used to protect the Four Origin Planet, there were a great many formation foundations that had been set up on the nearby planets, because the energy provided by a single planet was far from enough to block the attack of a Saint, what more kill a Saint.","Thus, this formation also had a fatal flaw. As long as others went to destroy the formation foundations on other planets first, this formation would lose its might.","Thus, Ling Han made some adjustments, allowing these planets to intertwine and protect each other.","As the saying went, a slight change would affect the whole body. This was precisely the logic.","—If a single planet was unable to match the might of a Saint, then what if 100 of them join forces?","Thus, as long as there weren’t multiple planets being bombarded at the same time, this formation could be channeled continuously.","Ling Han was very satisfied. After making a few more adjustments, he began to cultivate in seclusion, attempting to break through to Two Star Venerate Tier.","Of course, this was no problem for him. It was only nine days, and he had already come out of seclusion.","Finally, Two Star Venerate Tier.","Ling Han tested out his own battle prowess. The increase was not as great as he had imagined. It only allowed him to fire out five more Seven Star Regulations with a single strike.","If he continued to increase his cultivation level at this rate, then increasing his cultivation level by two minor levels would be comparable to increasing Saint Tier by one star.","That was awesome enough.","This was because it was far too difficult for Saints to advance a single step. Just take a look at Brother Monkey. He was still a One Star Saint, and he had only just reached the middle stage of One Star Saint Tier. He was still a long way off reaching the late stage, and he was still a long way off from reaching the end of One Star Saint Tier.","However, the little azure dragon and the large black dog had both become Saints, while Chi Menghan had also cultivated to reach nine-star Venerate Tier, and was only a step away from Saint Tier.","Casting one’s gaze across the universe, the Golden Generation elites had most likely all become Saints by now. However, Ling Han was far too freakish, so much so that even the Imperial Son couldn’t bring himself to publicize his achievement of becoming a Saint.","—Just look at Baili Tian; he had still been pummeled by Ling Han.","Although Baili Tian had only been a Half-Saint at that time, according to the current rumors, Ling Han had defeated Baili Tian, who was a Saint.","Thus, if he didn’t cultivate to the level of a three-star or four-star Saint, how could he bring himself to come out and meet others?","At present, the universe was very peaceful, if the invasion of Yin souls could be set aside.","When it came to the invasion of Yin souls, the situation was incredibly grim, because another twelve Skeleton Saint Tools had appeared in the Netherworld, causing their advance to further speed up.","Ling Han knew that behind the momentary silence of the Imperial Clans, an explosion was brewing.","Once they had full confidence that they could kill him, then he was sure that the Imperial Clans would bare their fangs, and ruthlessly pounce towards him.","Thus, Ling Han was extremely careful. He spent very little time on the Four Origin Planet, and this caused the Imperial Clans to feel apprehensive. This was because destroying the Nine Suns Holy Land was completely meaningless. Ling Han was the key.","Inspired by the formation, Ling Han suddenly had an idea. Could he use the formation to capture Celestial Qi?","The reason why Celestial Qi would drop from a high-level dimension to a low-level dimension was very likely because it was attracted by Regulations. The higher the level of Regulations, the higher the success rate of attracting Celestial Qi. This was also why the Imperial Clans could easily capture Celestial Qi.","This was because they had the Imperial Weapon, the Great Emperor Formation, and all of these involved the highest level of Regulations.","Ling Han couldn’t use the Nine Star Regulations, but through formations, Eight Star Regulations wouldn’t be a problem.","He chose an abandoned planet that had no living beings. It was said that a nine-star Veneratehad attempted to break through to Saint Tier here. In the end, he failed. Not only had he died, but the vitality of this planet had also been completely exhausted.","And now? There was not a single person here, nor was there the slightest bit of life, which was just right for Ling Han to live in.","He kept trying, piling up the Eight Star Regulations, and then stood guard at the side, to see whether there was any Celestial Qi that had appeared because of the formation.","Don’t say, this was really effective.","However, this was completely incomparable to the efficiency of the Imperial Clans. There were also very few Eight Star Celestial Qi.","No matter what, it was a good thing to have some gains. Ling Han wouldn’t be picky.","His cultivation speed increased again, but this was naturally in comparison to his previous cultivation rate. If he wanted to reach the end of Two Star Venerate Tier, he would probably need around 40 years.","Originally, when the world was fine, Ling Han would not mind being slower. In any case, he would eventually be able to cultivate to Saint Tier.","After reaching the level of Saint, what was needed was to strengthen the holy flame, which had nothing to do with the Celestial Qi.","And strengthening the holy flame was related to the power of belief and the grasp of Regulations. Ling Han was very confident in each of these two factors.","Thus, all the dilemmas were concentrated here.","How was he supposed to pass through the fourth pinnacle level?","As long as he advanced into Saint Tier, with the almost endless number of creatures in the dimensions in Ling Han’s body, the power of belief he reaped would be enough to make all the Saints in the universe kneel.","Er, he didn’t want to think about something so far ahead.","Not long after, the empress, Hu Niu, Chi Menghan, Song Lan and the other women also arrived. They accompanied Ling Han and lived the most ordinary life. There were no outsiders here, and it was just the few of them.","Life was extremely mundane, and after 40 years, Ling Han finally cultivated to the end of Two Stars."]},{"number":4606,"title":"Chapter 4606: Ancestral King City","paragraphs":["Chapter 4606: Ancestral King City","The threshold of Three Stars was still not difficult at all for Ling Han. He easily crossed it.","Sure enough, after reaching Three Star Venerate Tier, he could unleash as many as 30 Regulations with a single strike, increasing the number further by 5 additional Regulations.","What depressed Ling Han was the fact that he seemed to have unleashed his full potential, because even if he prepared and accumulated power, he would not be able to increase the number of Regulations.","His full-power attack was this kind of strength, and so was the burst of strength after accumulating power for a period of time.","Er... alright.","After coming out of seclusion, Ling Han made some detailed queries about the current situation.","Because of the invasion of the Yin souls, the various great forces all set aside their old enmity, and began to cooperate sincerely. One after another, academies of allied forces were established, and they did their best to nurture the younger generation, hoping that more elites would emerge.","Thus, there would be some martial arts competitions from time to time. Firstly, it was to nurture the unyielding character of the younger generation, and increase their actual battle prowess, and secondly, it was also to bestow more rewards, so that they could grow faster.","This could not be given for free. Only when there was competition, would it form a good atmosphere for cultivation, wherein everyone would be pursuing to surpass their peers.","The Nine Suns Holy Land also participated and organized many such martial arts competitions. Of course, though Ling Han was young, he definitely couldn’t participate. F***, why would an elite with Saint-level battle prowess like you participate?","To strike a blow to their pride?","Furthermore, what should be used to reward him?","None of this could attract Ling Han’s attention. He turned his attention to the Imperial Clans.","As expected, it wasn’t that the Imperial Clans didn’t make a move.","They had actually built an Ancestral King City.","What was it for?","They all took out an old item that the Great Emperor of their clan had used years ago. Though many, many years had passed, the Great Emperor was too strong, and his aura did not disperse for a very long time.","Thus, when these old items were placed together, they actually resonated with each other, forming a powerful Imperial Might.","Bathing in this kind of imperial aura, it was natural that there would be people who would feel their hearts tremble in fear, and lose the will to improve from now onwards, but those that could persevere would have astonishing improvement, and their future prospects would be limitless.","In the past, it would have been impossible for such sincere cooperation to appear, but the pressure exerted by the Netherworld was really too great, so the Imperial Clans could only set everything else aside.","Because of this, the Donglin Imperial Clan especially sent an invitation to Ling Han, telling him to go to the Ancestral King City as well. Even if he was still a Venerate, going would definitely be beneficial.","Previously, Ling Han had been on this abandoned planet all this while, so he had not received any notice. It was only now that he took the initiative to contact the Nine Suns Holy Land, and only then did he receive the news.","Then let’s go and take a look.","Because the empress and Hu Niu hadn’t broken through to Saint Tier yet, and Song Lan was still far from reaching Saint Tier, Ling Han had the three of them stay behind to guard the formation. If there was Celestial Qi, they would capture it. In any case, they only needed to send out a spiritual body, and there was no need for the main body to keep an eye on it all day.","Ling Han set off with Chi Menghan. Now, only Chi Menghan had broken through to Saint Tier among the women. Thus, this time, only Chi Menghan was qualified to go to the Ancestral King City.","Moreover, wasn’t the reason why the Donglin Imperial Clan sent an invitation to Ling Han also because of Chi Menghan?","Brother Monkey and the others would go themselves, so there was no need for Ling Han to worry.","The two of them tore a rip into space, and headed towards the Ancestral King City. That was the Heavenly Mother Planet, which was located far away.","It was said that a Great Emperor had once appeared on the Heavenly Mother Planet, but this Great Emperor streaked through the era like a shooting star, and did not leave behind any descendants or heirs.","And a great deal of history had been annihilated in the passage of time. Thus, no one knew what this Great Emperor’s title was.","However, there was really a person known as the Void Great Emperor.","Ling Han had the Donglin Imperial Clan search on his behalf. After flipping through a great many ancient records, it was confirmed that this Ancestral King had indeed existed. However, after this Ancestral King died, the entire Void Imperial Clan strangely disappeared.","There were gaps in history, so the Void Imperial Clan was erased from history.","If it weren’t for the fact that the Donglin Imperial Clan had deliberately flipped through ancient records, this would have been an eternal mystery.","Ling Han was astonished. Yang Yihuan, Di Wuji, and the others were most likely the sons of Great Emperors. They had been sealed by the Great Emperors until this generation—although they had occasionally appeared during this time, they had only walked the Imperial Path and recultivated their cultivation level.","However, in this lifetime, they all released the restrictions on their cultivation level, looking like they were going to fight for the position of Emperor in this era.","This made Ling Han feel curious. Which era couldn’t it be? Why did it have to be in this era?","Moreover, the Imperial Clan that had been living in seclusion for countless years had also suddenly appeared. It was clear that they too wanted to participate in this great era.","Just what was so special about this era?","With this question in mind, Ling Han arrived at the Heavenly Mother Planet.","The Ancestral King City was located in the extreme south of the Heavenly Mother Planet, and was not too far away.","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry to advance. Instead, he first set up a formation, connecting the hundreds of nearby planets. There were also seven suns among them, and this could bestow enough power on the formation, capable of posing a threat to Five-Star Saints.","It could not be helped. There was not enough time, and not enough ingredients. Furthermore, he could not possibly set it up with great fanfare. Being able to attain such might was already awesome enough.","After doing all this, Ling Han and Chi Menghan set out towards the Ancestral King City.","This was a new city that had just been built not too long ago. However, since it had been built by the great Imperial Clans, it was completed in a short few months.","From afar, this great city was exuding a dazzling light, grand and majestic.","The Imperial Might permeated through the air, causing one to feel suffocated.","They hadn’t even entered the city yet!","If they barged in forcefully, then as long as their divine sense was not strong enough, their willpower would definitely be forcefully erased by the Imperial Might, and they would become a walking corpse.","However, many people clearly knew that they would not have hopes of becoming Emperor, yet yearned to become stronger. Thus, they had also come here. However, they did not enter into the city, but rather set up camp nearby, anticipating what great fortune they would be able to obtain.","Thus, the great city was majestic, grand and imposing, but there were tents everywhere outside the city. A large number of residences had appeared, appearing very chaotic.","There were all kinds of people here. Those with the highest cultivation level had even reached the Venerate Tier, hoping that Imperial Might could help them take that last step. There were also those who had just stepped onto the Celestial Path, and were purely here to admire it.","“Greetings! Greetings!” Ling Han and Chi Menghan were surveying the surroundings, and they didn’t expect someone to approach them in such a sneaky manner.","Ling Han was astonished. He and Chi Menghan had clearly changed their appearances, yet they had still been discovered at the first instant?","But looking at this person... he was very ordinary. He had just advanced into the Core Formation Tier.","“Guys, I have two tickets for the ceremony here. Are you interested?” the man asked mysteriously. He even deliberately looked around, as if he wanted to confirm that no one was eavesdropping.","Oh, so their disguises had not collapsed.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief. Every time he disguised himself, his identity would be quickly exposed, which made him a little troubled.","“What ceremony tickets?” he asked.","The man confirmed that there was no one around to listen, then said quietly, “Lord Ling Han’s lecture on Dao!”","Yi?","Chi Menghan couldn’t help but turn around to look at Ling Han. She smiled, and the corners of her lips curled up. What she meant was, ‘Why didn’t I know that you were going to lecture on Dao?’","F***, I don’t know either.","Ling Han shook his head with a smile."]},{"number":4607,"title":"Chapter 4607: Ostentatious deception","paragraphs":["Chapter 4607: Ostentatious deception","The matter was very obvious. Someone was impersonating Ling Han, and swindling others.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face, and he said, “It’s actually Ling Han? Fine, fine, fine. I want it! I want it!”","The man immediately revealed a proud expression, as if he had long since expected Ling Han’s reaction. He revealed an arrogant expression, “Though Lord Ling Han never charges for his lectures, this is a ticket that I have spent a great many days queuing up to get.”","“Tell me, how much?” Ling Han said, acting rich and imposing.","He had caught a fat sheep.","The man thought for a moment. The price that had originally been decided must be too low.","“Lord Ling Han doesn’t lecture on Dao every day. Instead, it’s because he empathizes with people like us who were born in poverty that he deliberately organized a lecture,” he first emphasized.","What he meant was, even though I have obtained it for free, this opportunity is really too rare. If I give it up to you, I would lose this once in a thousand years opportunity.","Ling Han chuckled and said, “Money isn’t a problem.”","This would make things easier.","“1, 10,000 Dao Stones!” the man gritted his teeth and said loudly.","Judging by his expression, it seemed like this price was really too low.","However, he himself knew that he had initially planned to only demand a thousand Dao Stones.","This time, it had increased tenfold, causing his heart to beat wildly.","Ling Han’s expression instantly darkened, as if he was extremely displeased.","Not good, the price was too high.","‘Sigh, even if he’s a fat sheep, I can’t treat others like fools,’ the man immediately thought.","He was just about to adjust the price, when he saw that Ling Han had already spoken.","“Only 10,000 Dao Stones? Are you looking down on Lord Ling Han?” Ling Han said loudly, his face filled with anger.","Yi?","The man couldn’t help but stare in dumbfounded shock. How could this be?","Are you f****** stupid?","“Then... twenty thousand?” he asked weakly.","Ling Han glared at him fiercely.","“Thirty, thirty thousand!” That man mustered up his courage.","Pa, Ling Han slapped him across the face, “You actually dare to repeatedly insult Lord Ling Han?”","The man was dumbfounded. F***, he could still be beaten like this?","Was this the strangest reason for him to be beaten in this lifetime?","However, he should have been very angry, but why was there an indescribable chill at the bottom of his heart, suppressing him deeply, so that he could not feel the slightest bit of anger?","“100,000?” He looked at Ling Han, almost about to cry.","“That’s not right!” Ling Han slapped him again, causing the man to spin a few times on the spot.","Wrong again?","The man felt extremely aggrieved. He had never seen such a person before. Why was he so strange?","“Then how much do you think is suitable?” he asked.","Ling Han chuckled and said, “Lord Ling Han’s lecture on Dao is priceless!”","Priceless?","Then how was he supposed to sell it?","The man was speechless, and looked dumbly at Ling Han.","“It’s a priceless item. No matter how much your selling price is, it’s still a kind of blasphemy, understand?” Ling Han said righteously.","Er... the man suddenly understood.","After so much commotion, he hadn’t come across a fat sheep. Instead, he had come across a miser.","However, Ling Han had slapped him twice, and added with the mysterious chill in his heart, he didn’t dare to resist.","“I was wrong. These two tickets are for you,” he said honestly.","“En, that’s more like it.” Ling Han nodded, “Money isn’t a problem, the problem is I don’t have money!”","When these words fell, the man was almost angered to death, but a coldness rose up in his body, and he did not dare make a move.","He was curious. In the past, he had also been a ruthless person. Why did he not even have the courage to fight now?","As he thought this, he still obediently took out two tickets, and handed them over to Ling Han.","He wanted to leave, yet was stopped by Ling Han.","“You, what other commands do you have?” he asked cautiously. For some reason, a voice in his heart told him that he definitely could not offend this person in front of him.","This was his instinct. After so long, this had managed to save his life a great many times.","Hence, he also trusted this kind of instinct very much.","Ling Han shook his head, looking at him like he was an idiot.","“Location, pig!”","“Oh, oh, oh.” The man hurriedly nodded, and handed over the address.","Then, he carefully left. After taking a few steps, he would turn around, fearing that Ling Han would call out to him again, so that he could respond at the first instant.","After the man left, Chi Menghan couldn’t help but ask with a smile, “Is this how you usually tease people?”","“I have nothing else to do anyway,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Chi Menghan only felt that this was very amusing. Among Baili Tian and the other Imperial Sons, which one of them wasn’t extremely proud? Were any of them as interesting as Ling Han?","If they had encountered such a situation, they would definitely move to kill the other person.","Though Ling Han had always been known as the Imperial Son Killer, and the Great Demon, he was definitely not the kind of person to fuss over such trivial matters.","“Let’s go. I have to go and see this Lord Ling Han,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“M-hm.” Chi Menghan nodded.","The two of them followed this address, and saw that there had originally been an empty space here, but now, four walls had been set up with cloth, forming an open-air “place of enlightenment”.","Er, this was the place where Lord “Ling Han” lectured on Dao?","There was also a doorway here, and there were two people standing guard.","Ling Han and Chi Menghan walked over, and after handing over their tickets, they were allowed to pass.","After entering, they discovered that there were already many people seated on the ground, and all of them had heated gazes.","It could be imagined that those who would fall for it were definitely Ling Han’s blind admirers, and that was why they lacked basic judgement.","Ling Han and Chi Menghan also found a place to sit down. They had both changed their appearances, so they naturally didn’t need to worry about being recognized. However, it was natural instinct for anyone to admire beauty. Although Chi Menghan had changed her appearance, she was still extremely beautiful.","Thus, she immediately attracted the attention of many people.","However, though she had restrained the aura of a Saint, she was still an existence that stood at the apex of this world, after all. She had an intimidating aura, and who would really dare to mess around?","The two of them waited quietly. Time slowly passed, and a few more people came from behind. This place was more or less filled to the brim. Finally, a man who seemed to be the person-in-charge walked out.","“Everyone, you’ve all waited!” he said loudly. “So, without wasting words, let us immediately invite our Lord Ling Han!”","Instantly, thunderous applause rang out. Everyone was clapping crazily.","Tsk, so many hardcore admirers.","Chi Menghan glanced at Ling Han, her eyes filled with admiration. This was the man she had chosen. He was interesting, had a conscience, and was also incredibly powerful.","Xiu, a person appeared out of thin air, standing proudly.","“Yi?” A hint of surprise appeared on both Ling Han and Chi Menghan’s faces, because this person really looked like Ling Han.","En, he could no longer be described as similar, but exactly the same.","—To cultivators, it was extremely simple to change their appearance, so disguising themselves as others was naturally a piece of cake.","He had really put in a lot of effort.","A sliver of killing intent appeared on Ling Han’s face. If this “Ling Han” swindled too many people, or even deceived naive young girls, then he would definitely commit murder today."]},{"number":4608,"title":"Chapter 4608: Fake Ling Han","paragraphs":["Chapter 4608: Fake Ling Han","On the platform, the fake Ling Han began to lecture on Dao.","Hearing his nonsense, both Ling Han and Chi Menghan looked surprised.","That was because though this person boasted very much, there were still some things that he said that were very logical, and could give others inspiration.","Thus, though he was swindling others, it did not mean that he did not have the slightest ability.","After talking for half a day, the fake Ling Han announced the end of this lecture.","Everyone was reluctant to part with him, and tried their best to persuade him to stay, so that he could talk for a while longer.","“Alright, since everyone is so cordial,” the fake Ling Han said. “I was just planning to take in two disciples, so I wanted to see if there was anyone suitable among you.”","When these words fell, everyone’s eyes instantly shone with a peculiar light.","The fake Ling Han began to walk around in the crowd, talking to people as if he was trying to understand their backgrounds. However, Ling Han and Chi Menghan could see very clearly that the people this guy was talking to were mostly females, and beautiful females at that.","Not long after, he took in a disciple — of course, it was a female disciple.","Then, the fake Ling Han turned around, and appeared in front of Ling Han and Chi Menghan.","When he saw Chi Menghan, the fake Ling Han instantly looked stunned. After a long while, he didn’t retract his gaze, and asked in a perverted voice, “What’s your name?”","Chi Menghan didn’t reply. Instead,s he asked, “What I like most is Lord Ling Han barging into the Donglin Imperial Clan to snatch bride! I wonder if I can meet Celestial Maiden Chi?”","It was quite shameless of her to call herself a celestial maiden.","Ling Han thought internally. Of course, he could not say this out loud. Otherwise, he would definitely have to sleep on his own tonight.","The fake Ling Han was unhurried, and said, “Menghan has something to do, so you definitely won’t be able to see her for the time being. However, if you take me as master, you’ll have many more chances in the future.”","“Really?” Chi Menghan deliberately revealed an excited expression.","“Of course, it’s real.” The fake Ling Han couldn’t help but feel aroused. He stretched out a hand to grab Chi Menghan’s hand.","However, when he touched it, he gritted his teeth. Why was this hand not as delicate and smooth as he had imagined?","Upon another look, this was Ling Han’s hand!","He hurriedly let go. He had touched a man’s hand. Just thinking about it made him feel disgusted.","“I’m not talking to you yet, step aside!” he shouted at Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled and said, “I also have some questions that I want to ask. I’m very interested in the details of Ling Han snatching the bride.”","“That’s right, that’s right,” the people around them all said. To the general public, something like snatching a bride was something that was most worth talking about. It was something that could be talked about again and again.","“Alright, since everyone is so curious, I’ll relate it again,” the fake Ling Han said with a smile. He began to talk about the story of how “he” had barged into the Donglin Imperial Clan and battled Baili Tian to snatch the bride.","However, he was not a person who had experienced it personally, after all. Perhaps, he had watched it through the livestream of Galaxy Network, so flaws would ultimately be revealed in the details.","Ling Han and Chi Menghan would point out from time to time, yet the fake Ling Han was completely unconcerned, directly rebuking them for remembering wrongly.","When he finished speaking, everyone applauded. No matter how many times they heard this kind of story of a hero rescuing a beauty, they would not get tired of it.","Furthermore, in order to portray the gentle side of Ling Han, he had added a great many words of love. These were all words that Ling Han had “quietly” said to Chi Menghan, and had not been broadcasted live by Galaxy Network.","This naturally satisfied everyone’s curiosity greatly, and they all revealed satisfied expressions.","Chi Menghan couldn’t help but chuckle. She turned to Ling Han and asked, “Why don’t I remember you saying this to me?”","“Er, I don’t remember either.” Ling Han shook his head.","Chi Menghan looked at the fake Ling Han again, and said, “When did you become my husband? Why didn’t I know?”","Yi, what was the meaning of this?","With a thought from Chi Menghan, her appearance immediately changed, and she returned to her original appearance.","“Chi, Chi Menghan!”","“It’s Fairy Chi, Celestial maiden Chi!”","“It really is her!”","Everyone was exclaiming in shock. Following Chi Menghan’s transformation, as well as her vague Saint-level aura, everyone believed her from the bottom of their hearts.","Yi, that was strange.","If this was Chi Menghan, then why was she with an unfamiliar man? Moreover, “Ling Han” actually didn’t recognize her?","The fake Ling Han was also taken aback. He had not thought that he would actually encounter the main character through his ostentatious deception.","He laughed, “I woke up early in the morning, so I forgot to take a dump. Let me excuse myself first.”","“Hold it right there!” Chi Menghan chided. “You still haven’t given me an explanation!”","He could impersonate anyone, but to dare impersonate her man, that was definitely not allowed.","Boom! She unleashed the aura of a Saint as she charged at the fake Ling Han.","Even though it was only an aura, just how powerful was a Saint? It was guaranteed that under the barrage of this aura, the majority of Venerates would have to kneel.","However, the scene that followed gave both Ling Han and Chi Menghan a shock.","That was because when this aura struck the fake Ling Han, he actually did not have any reaction at all.","Ling Han’s fighting spirit instantly soared. With a wave of his hand, peng, an Earth Qi immediately shot out from the ground, turning into the same form as Ling Han, intercepting the fake Ling Han.","Everyone couldn’t help but exclaim in shock. They had seen it on the Galaxy Network livestream before. Summoning Earth Qi was Ling Han’s unique skill.","However, why did this Earth Qi block him instead?","Could it be?","Everyone turned to look at Ling Han and Chi Menghan. How could it be that it was these two that were the real deal?","“Ling Han!”","“Chi Menghan!”","Everyone was excited. After all this, it turned out that they had all been deceived. However, because of this, they had met the real deal.","The fake Ling Han also smiled, and did not panic at all after being exposed, “Sigh, my luck is really bad. The first time I impersonated him, I was exposed. Next time, before I impersonate him, I would have to burn joss sticks first.”","This seemed to be a self-criticism, but actually did not have the slightest intention of apologizing.","“Who are you?” Chi Menghan asked coldly.","“Little Han, I’m your Brother Han,” the fake Ling Han said with a smile1.","Boom!","The human figure that the Earth Qi had taken form in immediately threw a punch at the fake Ling Han. The real Ling Han did not make a move, because if he did, Saint-level power would be too terrifying. A large number of people here would probably die.","“Soft-hearted!” the fake Ling Han said calmly. He sent out a palm strike. Peng, the human figure that Earth Qi had taken form in immediately shattered, and under the impact of the Saint-level aura, the people here were instantly crushed into dust.","In fact, under the impact of the aftermath, the entire camp had also suffered a destructive blow. A great many people had not even realized what was going on, when they were turned into dust.","“You!” Ling Han’s eyes widened, and he looked furious.","This was too deranged.","“Let me teach you something. If you want to reach the apex, don’t feel any sympathy or pity. This kind of emotion will only drag you down,” the fake Ling Han said calmly. At this moment, his appearance also changed.","This was a tall, slender young man, dressed in a long black robe. He was handsome, and there was actually a hint of gold in the core of his pupils.","“This is the reason for you to commit murder?” Ling Han asked darkly.","“Could it be that you want to avenge them?” The fake Ling Han shrugged."]},{"number":4609,"title":"Chapter 4609: Bet a galaxy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4609: Bet a galaxy","“Let’s battle in the sky.” Ling Han led the way and flew into the sky.","The fake Ling Han, meanwhile, was neither too fast nor too slow. He too rose into the air. He looked at Ling Han, and showed a hint of pride, “With the body of a Venerate, capable of standing against a Saint, you are indeed extraordinary.”","“I don’t want to kill such a prodigy either!”","“I’ll give you a chance. Submit to me, and I can spare your life.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, “You really know how to daydream.”","His strength had already reached the Saint Tier, and this signified that even a Nine-Star Saint wouldn’t be able to stop him if he wanted to flee.","Thus, the Imperial Clans were extremely wary of him. They didn’t fart even when they saw the Nine Suns Holy Land start up again.","Because if they were unable to kill Ling Han, that would pose an incredibly great threat to themselves.","Unless they were also very ruffian, and no longer cared about the juniors of the Imperial Clan, or had made up their minds to nest in the imperial formation for the rest of their lives, right until Ling Han died of old age.","More importantly, Ling Han had a high chance of becoming Emperor, so what if they hid in the imperial formation?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! At this moment, the Imperial Sons of the Ancestral King City all flew out. They naturally sensed the commotion outside, and would definitely come out to check on the situation.","One of them was Ling Han, and anyone could recognize him with a single glance. However, who was the other?","They didn’t know this person at all.","However, this person was definitely young. At most, he was only over 10,000 years old. He didn’t match any of the current Saints.","“Brother, you’re here!” Brother Monkey also appeared. Beside him were the large black dog and the little azure dragon.","Ling Han smiled and said, “I’m here.”","In that one instant, the Imperial Sons all knew what had happened.","Saints were naturally sensitive to auras. The person who had attacked was the fake Ling Han, and it could not be any more obvious.","All of a sudden, they were all hostile towards this person. He dared to make a move outside the Ancestral King City, and he possessed a Saint-level power at that. He did not have any wariness of this place being outside Ancestral King City at all. This could be seen as a provocation to the Imperial Clans.","Faced with so many Saint-level Imperial Sons, the fake Ling Han was completely unconcerned. He even stretched out a hand to scratch his ear, “Yo, so many people have come.”","“Who are you?” Yan Anming of the Golden Generation asked, his expression baleful and menacing.","Originally, Ling Han’s enemy would be their friend, but you publicly used Saint-level power outside the Ancestral King City. That was going too far.","The fake Ling Han smiled faintly, “My name is Lu Xun.”","Yi, that was it?","Lu Xun? Did anyone know who he was?","“Who cares if you’re Lu Xun or Hai Xun1? Eat my punch first!” Ling Han charged over, throwing a punch.","Boom, this was a battle in space, so Ling Han naturally had no reservations.","Lu Xun smiled faintly, and placed one right hand behind his back. He merely used his left hand to exchange blows with Ling Han.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely. Lu Xun was calm and composed, appearing to be at ease.","“A Three Star Saint!” Everyone couldn’t help but exclaim in shock.","He was far too powerful! He was actually a Three Star Saint!","Ling Han was indeed freakish. He was clearly only a Three Star Venerate, but his abilities were practically comparable to a Two Star Saint. However, compared with a Three Star Saint, whether it was power or Regulations, he was not just a little bit weaker.","Moreover, Lu Xun could unleash four Eight Star Regulations with a single strike. This was a blatant advantage over Ling Han.","Thus, though he had only used one hand, he had easily blocked Ling Han’s attacks. In fact, he had even gotten the upper hand.","Of course, no one would underestimate Ling Han because of this.","A Three Star Venerate possessed the battle prowess of a Two Star Saint; wasn’t that awesome enough?","Really, if this guy had grown to become a nine-star Venerate, he would really be able to compete with a four-star or five-star Saint.","It should be known that how many Saints were there in this world? And how many of them were high-level Saints?","—If Ling Han became a nine-star Venerate, then the majority of Saints would definitely be no match for him.","Thinking about it this way, just how terrifying was it?","It should be known that it was considerably easier for Venerates to advance one minor level. After all, aside from comprehension of Heavenly Dao, they only needed Celestial Qi, but what about Saints?","Taking a step further was as difficult as ascending the heavens.","Just look, even if it was Brother Monkey, Baili Tian, Yan Anming, and the other young king tiers who had been the first to advance into Saint Tier, which of them had now advanced into Two Stars?","Not even one.","Ling Han should be the strongest of the younger generation.","But the problem here was, another young king tier had actually appeared. He was actually a Three Star Saint!","Hiss, how terrifying.","Where had he popped out from?","The two of them battled fiercely. Ling Han unleashed his full battle prowess, but the gap in strength was too wide. In the end, he was still unable to suppress the other.","He was just about to channel a formation, when he did not expect Lu Xun to send him backwards with a single palm strike, “It’s about time to get down to business.”","‘Business?’","Ling Han did not rush to make a move. He was also curious about Lu Xun’s origins, though he had already guessed half of it.","Lu Xun smiled faintly, and said, “Since everyone is here, you may all come out.”","Yi, who was he talking to?","Right at this moment, multiple figures tore a rip into the Void and appeared.","Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, He Luo, Di Wuji, Tong Ming... Wu Xingtong!","Hiss!","Realization dawned on all the Imperial Sons. These people represented the Netherworld.","It was very strange. Why would living people cooperate with Yin souls? Furthermore, how did they cooperate?","The Living Realm and Netherworld were the most fundamental opposites.","No matter how great the conflict between the Imperial Clans and Ling Han was, after Ling Han achieved Dao, even if they would seek revenge, it was basically impossible for the entire clan to be eliminated.","Every injustice had its perpetrator, and every debt had its debtor. It was impossible that there were no good people in the whole clan.","Would those who could become Emperor not have the slightest tolerance?","However, Yin souls were different.","Once the Netherworld occupied the Living Realm, all of the living creatures would be done for.","The environment of the Netherworld was completely unsuitable for living people to live in. This was the most fundamental opposing environment, and there was absolutely no space for harmony.","Thus, though the Imperial Sons hated Ling Han to death, they still had to unite against the enemy at this moment.","Of course, they were also very confused. Yin and Yang were clearly on opposing sides, so why would Yang Yihuan and the others cooperate with the Netherworld?","Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, He Luo, and the others had already become Saints. However, they were only One Star Saints at this moment. Di Wuji and Tong Ming were Two Star Saints, and only Lu Xun and Wu Xingtong had reached the level of Three Star Saint. White, red, and orange-colored holy flames pulsated in their minds, and could be seen clearly.","Looking at the Golden Generation’s holy flames, all of which were white in color, the gulf between them was quite large.","Lu Xun crossed his arms behind his back, and said to all the Imperial Sons, “I have come today to make a bet with you.”","“What are we betting on?” Yan Anming spoke up on behalf of all the Imperial Sons. Both he and Baili Tian were members of the Golden Generation that had been the first to advance into Saint Tier. Now that Baili Tian was not here, he naturally answered on behalf of the other Imperial Sons.","Lu Xun broke into a grin, “We are betting a galaxy.”","“If you win a single battle, we can return one of the galaxies that we have conquered to you. If you lose a single battle, then withdraw your defenses, and allow an entire galaxy to belong to us.”","What a huge gamble!","A galaxy, not a planet.","Yan Anming immediately shook his head, saying, “There are already two-star or even three-star Saints among you. What’s the worth in competing?”","Those that could advance into Saint Tier, which one of them was not a prodigy among prodigies?","Even the Golden Generation didn’t have much confidence in surpassing their cultivation level to challenge someone stronger than them. Moreover, Lu Xun and the others were most likely the sons of the ancient Great Emperors. Thus, their natural talent was no weaker than theirs.","Then wouldn’t it be a definite loss?"]},{"number":4610,"title":"Chapter 4610: Counter Challenge","paragraphs":["Chapter 4610: Counter Challenge","Lu Xun smiled slightly, “Don’t worry. If we really fight, we will all suppress our cultivation level, and guarantee a battle of equal cultivation levels.”","“How about it? Do you dare to take the gamble?”","With such words, how could the Imperial Sons not accept?","If they didn’t dare to battle at the same cultivation level, then how could they still have the face to attempt breaking through to become Emperor?","What Great Emperor would be so cowardly?","“Let’s make the bet!” A voice rang out from the Heavenly Mother Planet below, booming loudly and incredibly loud.","Yang Yihuan and the others all wore solemn expressions.","A Seven Star Saint, at least!","They were more powerful than ordinary Saints, yet their battle prowess could only surpass one or two stars at most. If there was a difference of four stars, they wouldn’t be able to match the opponent even if they teamed up. Instead, they would have to flee.","The Imperial Sons all knew that this was a Saint that was overseer of the Imperial Clans. Furthermore, he was not a seven-star Saint, but rather an eight-star Saint.","Xuan Huo Saint, belonging to Red Lotus Imperial Clan.","Since this Saint had already agreed, there was naturally nothing to be afraid of.","“All right, let’s make the bet.” Yan Dongming nodded, “What are the rules?”","“Send whoever you like. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, the loser cannot battle any longer, and the winner can only battle for three rounds, at most.” It was clear that Lu Xun had long since thought this through, and immediately announced the rules of the battles.","All the Imperial Sons nodded. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, if they could not win, then there was really nothing else they could say.","“I’ll go first.” Han Yun from the Jade Drop Imperial Clan stood up first.","“Hehe, I’ll do it.” Yang Yihuan smiled, crossed his arms behind his back, and walked out. His expression was calm, as if he didn’t take Han Yun seriously at all.","“Humph!” This made Han Yun extremely furious.","The two of them immediately started fighting. Han Yun unleashed his full battle prowess at the first instant, and two streaks of eight-star Regulations were fused into his terrifying power, causing his attacks to become incredibly domineering.","Though Yang Yihuan was no longer so sloppy, and had used both hands to fight Han Yun head-on, everyone had a feeling that he had not used his full strength yet.","Gasp! This was a battle between Saints, yet he still dared to hold back?","It should be known just how terrifying the attack of a Saint was. If it landed on a vital point, he would be done for.","Han Yun roared loudly, and Imperial Techniques appeared repeatedly. Meanwhile, he also drew out a Saint Tool, which boosted his battle prowess.","Once the Saint Tool appeared, even Yang Yihuan didn’t dare to be careless. He also drew the Saint Tool.","The two of them battled again, and the intensity of their battle increased further.","However, Yang Yihuan was indeed slightly more skilled. Everyone could clearly see that both of them had used two flashes of eight-star Regulations, but Yang Yihuan was more proficient in using them. In fact, he was even bold and unrestrained, using them in unexpected ways.","In just over a hundred moves, Han Yun had no choice but to withdraw from the battle, and take the initiative to admit defeat.","If they continued fighting, it was possible that he would be severely injured, or even killed.","Although admitting defeat meant losing a galaxy, how could a galaxy compare to his life?","Against Yin souls, Saints were the most important source of power.","In this way, the Living Realm lost one battle first.","Yang Yihuan challenged again, and on the Imperial Sons’ side, Yi Taishu approached, but he was still no match.","After three battles, Yang Yihuan emerged victorious in all of them.","By the fourth battle, Yang Yihuan smiled and retreated, with Feng Miaoling taking his place.","In the end, Feng Miaoling won another three victories.","This!","All the Imperial Sons were dejected. Six battles led to six defeats. Though there was still Yan Dongming among them that had not made a move, Yan Dongming was only slightly stronger than the others.","They were all members of the Golden Generation, so how could there be such a large gap between them?","What could they do?","No one else stepped forward to accept the challenge, which made He Luo feel very bored.","He chuckled, “Yi, where is my opponent?”","This caused all the Imperial Sons to feel very awkward. They were all being trampled over by their enemies, yet they could do nothing at all.","However, if they stubbornly charged forward, not only would they lose face, but they would also lose even more galaxies!","Who would be willing to do something that only had disadvantages?","“Sigh, so boring.” He Luo shook his head, his expression filled with disdain.","This was a blatant provocation, but what could the Imperial Sons do about it?","“I’ll fight you.” At this moment, a voice rang out.","Everyone turned to look. Wasn’t it Ling Han?","An awkward expression instantly appeared on He Luo’s face. If he had a full-out battle with Ling Han, he naturally wouldn’t lose. However, Ling Han was only a f*cking Venerate, and one that was only at three stars at that.","If he lowered his cultivation level to the Venerate Tier, how could he possibly be a match for Ling Han?","This gap was like heaven and earth.","“There’s no need to compete. We’ll consider it as you winning three rounds in a row,” Lu Xun said, very generous.","Even so, they had still obtained three victories, and could obtain three galaxies.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, “Since you’ve made a wager, I’ll also make a wager next. Do you dare to accept?”","“What wager?” Lu Xun asked, a faint smile on his face.","Ling Han smiled and said, “You guys don’t have to suppress your cultivation level to fight me. If you can defeat me, you’ll be able to obtain 10 galaxies! If you lose, however, you’ll have to hand over 10 galaxies.”","This was a counterattack!","However, the Imperial Sons all shook their heads.","Have you f****** gone mad?","No matter how strong you were, you would only be a Three Star Venerate. At most, your battle prowess would be comparable to a Two Star Saint, but on Lu Xun’s side, there were two Three Star Saints!","Their natural talent in cultivation was even slightly superior to that of the Golden Generation. Thus, the battle prowess of those like Lu Xun and Wu Xingtong could probably reach the level of Five Star Saints.","How are you going to win?","Wasn’t this just delivering the galaxies freely to them?","Could it be that... you are actually an undercover agent of the Netherworld?","“Hahahaha!” Lu Xun laughed loudly, then shook his head, “Can you make the decision?”","This battle involved ten galaxies. Though there were tens of thousands of galaxies in the Living Realm, under the present circumstances, every galaxy could not be lost. The stakes were too high.","“Ling Han, don’t mess around!”","“This is not the time for you to show off!”","All the Imperial Sons rebuked him. What a joke, there was no reason to deliver galaxies to them like this.","“Agreed!” Right at this moment, the voice of the high-level Saint rang out from the Heavenly Mother Planet again. It was extremely loud and clear.","What? The Xuan Huo Saint had actually agreed?","The Imperial Sons were all astounded, unable to believe this.","However, the Saint’s word was like the decree of heaven and earth. If one did not obey, he would be punished by the heaven and earth.","“All right, then let’s battle!” Lu Xun nodded.","“I’ll go first.” He Luo walked out, “I can win a few more battles.”","Previously, he had actually been displeased that Lu Xun had admitted defeat on his behalf.","However, in a battle of equal cultivation levels, he was indeed no match for Ling Han. There was nothing he could do.","Now, however, he was going all out. He naturally had to fight, and personally redeem his pride.","He was the son of a Great Emperor, so how proud was his pride?","Lu Xun thought for a moment, then nodded gladly.","Every time Ling Han lost another battle, they would be able to take another 10 galaxies, so why not?","He Luo’s eyes focused on Ling Han. Boom, a terrifying aura began to seep out of his body, and there was no longer any need to suppress it.","“Die!” He charged out, and as he delivered an attack, three eight-star Regulations shone brilliantly.","What!","All the Imperial Sons paled in shock. A One Star Saint was actually capable of unleashing three flashes of eight-star Regulations?"]},{"number":4611,"title":"Chapter 4611: Getting one victory first","paragraphs":["Chapter 4611: Getting one victory first","He Luo was He Luo, after all. He was an ancient prodigy, and had been buried for generation after generation. Furthermore, he had continuously walked the Imperial Path. If he was still only capable of being on par with the Golden Generation, how humiliating would that be?","When one had reached the level of Saint, eight-star Regulations wasn’t something that could be unleashed just by accumulating power.","It was all based on his comprehension of the heaven and earth!","However many Regulations you grasped, that was however many Regulations you could unleash. There was no such thing as accumulation.","Being able to become a Saint, how could there be mediocre people? Which one of them was not a prodigy among prodigies?","Ordinarily speaking, a One Star Saint would only be able to grasp one eight-star Regulations. If one’s talent was slightly more impressive, they would only be able to grasp two. However, He Luo had actually unleashed three Regulations with a single strike. This naturally stunned everyone.","This battle prowess was on par with a Two Star Saint of the Golden Generation. Tsk, tsk.","No wonder Han Yun and the others had suffered a terrible defeat previously — how could they not lose?","Ling Han laughed loudly, and greeted the incoming attack with a punch. Thirty Seven Star Regulations intertwined, and the battle prowess they released was not the slightest bit inferior to the Eight Star Regulations.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them clashed. In terms of Regulations, Ling Han was not inferior at all, but in terms of power, the Venerate was ultimately no match for the Saint.","Thus, Ling Han was at a disadvantage. However, this little bit of gap was still not enough to decide the outcome of the battle. The battle between the two of them was incredibly intense.","They were of the same level in terms of Regulations, and the gap in power wasn’t large to the point of crushing. This would depend on each individual’s impromptu performance.","In everyone’s eyes, it should be He Luo who would emerge victorious.","That was because He Luo had lived far longer than Ling Han. Furthermore, he had walked through Imperial Path many times, and had battled fiercely with prodigies from different eras. In fact, it was possible that the Great Emperors of the past were among them!","Just what kind of astonishing battle experience was this?","On the other hand, what about Ling Han?","No matter how prodigious he was, he had only lived for a few hundred years. Could he compete with He Luo in experience?","Thus, if they battled for too long, both sides would definitely reveal flaws, and He Luo’s ability to grasp flaws would definitely force Ling Han to attack.","In the first round, Ling Han was going to suffer a terrible defeat.","All the Imperial Sons shook their heads. At first, they had thought that Ling Han would be able to win at least one battle. Then, they would take advantage of the opening to call a ceasefire, and in turn, they would be able to win seven galaxies.","But now? They were about to lose thirteen galaxies.","Yang Yihuan and the others all smiled. In their eyes, it was only natural that He Luo would win.","As long as battle prowess was equal, then in terms of battle experience, who could compare to ancient king tiers like them?","But as the battle continued, everyone shockingly discovered that it was actually Ling Han who had the advantage in ability to grasp weaknesses!","How was this possible?","No one’s attack would be perfect. The only difference was how to hide a weak point and not let the other party catch hold of it, or when battle prowess was overwhelming, then it didn’t matter whether there was a weak point or not, and one would be able to crush their opponent directly.","Hence, in a battle on the same level of battle prowess, no one would be able to defeat their opponent head-on. In truth, it was just a clash of grasping and concealing weaknesses.","This was battle experience.","However, He Luo was actually inferior to Ling Han!","How was this possible?","Yang Yihuan and the others were all in disbelief. All of them wore solemn expressions. They couldn’t understand.","Was there really such a prodigy of battle, whose battle experience of a mere few hundred years had surpassed his opponent who had battle experience of more than ten thousand years?","This!","However, how could they know that Ling Han had indeed only lived for around 200 years in this world? But how long had he lived in the Genesis World?","Though the battle styles in the Genesis World were completely different, the idea of grasping the weak points and hiding weaknesses was the same.","In this battle, everyone could clearly see that Ling Han had clearly hidden his weak points better, and his ability to grasp weak points far surpassed He Luo’s.","If it was not for the fact that He Luo still had an advantage in power, he would probably have long since been defeated by Ling Han.","Even so, he was still at a disadvantage. It was only a matter of time before he lost.","“Ling Han!”","“As expected of the number one Venerate in history, too awesome.”","“Even the Imperial Sons can’t block him. He’s one major tier weaker than He Luo, yet he’s about to turn the tables!”","“Haha, win glory for the Living Realm!”","Of course, it was not just the Imperial Sons here. There were also a great many people from other small forces, and they were all elated when they saw the fierce battle in space.","Previously, the Living Realm had lost consecutive battles, which was a great blow to everyone’s morale. At this most crucial moment, when everyone needed a hero the most, Ling Han stepped out.","After Ling Han gained the upper hand, the pressure he exerted on He Luo became greater and greater, continuously enlarging his advantage.","After He Luo forcibly blocked a few hundred moves, he had no choice but to lower his head and admit defeat.","If this was a mortal duel, he still had a great many powerful moves that he could use, but if it was only a contest, he was not willing to reveal his trump cards.","In truth, Ling Han also had powerful moves that he had yet to use.","He had done it on purpose. That was because if he had revealed his trump cards too quickly, would there still be anyone left willing to fight him?","“Hehe, Brother Ling Ling is indeed powerful!” Di Wuji exclaimed, “Too bad, too bad, you were really born in the wrong era.”","He walked out, and became Ling Han’s second opponent.","Ling Han’s expression became serious. This was a Two Star Saint.","Di Wuji moved. Boom, Regulations intertwined to form a giant black wolf that pounced towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and beckoned with his hand. Earth Qi surged out, turning into a human figure that greeted the giant wolf’s attack.","Peng!","The giant wolf was too terrifying. With a pounce, the Earth Qi human figure was shattered, and it continued to charge over.","However, with this block, the might of the giant wolf had also been greatly expended. Ling Han threw another punch, and easily dispersed this attack.","“Your battle prowess is only on the level of the strongest One Star Saint. You are definitely no match for me!” Di Wuji stated calmly. His figure charged out. Boom, light interwove behind him, turning into the form of a massive wolf.","Ling Han’s expression was stern. Faced with Di Wuji, whether it was Regulations or power, he was far inferior.","Thus, in a battle with Di Wuji, there was no such thing as grasping or hiding weak points, because the latter’s battle prowess was superior to his.","—Even if there was a flaw in Di Wuji’s attack, so what? He could not grasp it at all.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Di Wuji’s attack speed became faster and faster. Fighting a Venerate as a Two Star Saint was already humiliating enough. Thus, it was naturally best to end the battle as soon as possible.","Seeing that Ling Han no longer had the ability to counter, everyone shook their heads.","It could not be helped. He was about to lose.","The 10 galaxies that he had just won would have to be returned to the other side.","Everyone felt that it was a pity. However, just how wide was the gap between their cultivation levels?","Even the Golden Generation elites hadn’t been able to win face, yet Ling Han had. What more could they ask for?","Furthermore, if Ling Han could become a Saint... f*ck, wouldn’t all Saints be swept aside by him?","In fact, so what if it was the Skeleton Saint Tool? Was it a match for him?","Perhaps only a Pseudo-Emperor could rival him?","Thinking of this, a great many people started a call for action on the Galaxy Network, wanting to appeal to the Imperial Clans to use all their resources to nurture Ling Han.","As long as Ling Han became a Saint, it would be equivalent to having another Pseudo-Emperor in the Living Realm. At that time, if he joined forces with Buddha Doga, would they still have to worry about not being able to reverse the decline of the Living Realm?"]},{"number":4612,"title":"Chapter 4612: Formation Saint","paragraphs":["Chapter 4612: Formation Saint","The appeals of these people caused a storm on the Galaxy Network.","More and more people joined in on the appeals. In fact, there was no shortage of elders of the older generation that stepped out to speak, hoping that the Imperial Clans could let go of their prejudices, and under the prerequisite that the Living Realm was facing such danger, they could prioritize the big picture.","Of course, on the other hand, they also advised Ling Han to be magnanimous like a Great Emperor and benevolent to the world, letting bygones be bygones.","The Donglin Imperial Clan responded at the first instant, expressing their willingness to use all the resources in their clan to help Ling Han.","Then, the Donglin Imperial Clan asked the other Imperial Clans one by one whether they were going to follow up or not.","F***!","This caused the other Imperial Clans to curse.","Ling Han was your family’s son-in-law, so of course you guys can be so generous, but for the other Imperial Clans, what benefits would that bring?","The things they took out were genuine, but what gains could they obtain?","But now, all the public opinion in the world was leaning towards Ling Han’s side. If the Imperial Clans did not express anything at this time, that would be equivalent to labelling themselves as “disregarding the big picture, being selfish and self-centred”.","If this was any other time, they naturally would not be concerned. The Imperial Clans were a transcendent existence, so who would dare criticize them?","However, things were different now. The Netherworld was invading, and they needed to combine all of their power to resist them.","Oh, your Imperial Clans can be selfish, so what right do you have to make others throw away their lives and shed blood for you?","At this moment, the members of the Imperial Clans all hated the person who had posted the notice on the Galaxy Network. F*ck! If it weren’t for him, would they have been stuck in such a dilemma?","They contacted the Chang Clan, and asked the Chang Clan to investigate who the person who had caused the trouble was. The result... was that it was a large black dog!","The one by Ling Han’s side.","The members of the Imperial Clans were so infuriated that their faces were twisted. Despicable dog, oh, despicable dog. This move was really too vicious. They were clearly filled with hatred, yet they could not show it.","It could not be helped. In order to stabilize the morale of the army, and for the sake of maintaining morale, the various great Imperial Clans announced that they would help Ling Han’s growth.","Of course, they would only help him. As for how far they would help him, that was still up to them to decide.","No matter what, this was already a huge victory.","The large black dog couldn’t help but snicker, exchanging a high-five with the little azure dragon. It was the mastermind, while the little azure dragon was the “accomplice”. The two of them had been pushing the public opinion on the Galaxy Network just now, and it finally had an effect.","However, the battle between Ling Han and Di Wuji was still continuing. It was still Ling Han that was at a disadvantage, and the situation was precarious.","“Little Han, it’s done,” the large black dog said to Ling Han through divine sense.","Ling Han nodded in understanding. He wouldn’t hide his strength anymore.","Boom! Destructive Energy surged, and he immediately launched a counterattack.","Previously, the large black dog had an idea to stimulate public opinion on the Galaxy Network. This naturally required Ling Han’s cooperation — he had to pretend to be weak.","Otherwise, how could there be such a one-sided opinion on the Galaxy Network?","Now, it was time to counterattack.","Destructive Energy could destroy anything, and even the eight-star Regulations could only block it to a limited extent. This allowed Ling Han to just barely compensate for the gap of two Regulations.","It was still not enough.","Again!","He beckoned with his hand, and in the distance, the planets all responded. One after another, Earth Qi flew over, turning into human figures that joined the battle.","In this way, the scales of victory and defeat were finally leaning towards being equally balanced.","It was possible that either of them could win.","This naturally caused everyone great joy. Since the battle was tied now, Ling Han had hopes of winning.","‘Go!’","Whether it was the spectators on the venue or the Galaxy Network, they were all cheering Ling Han on.","This was a contest with the Netherworld, and its significance surpassed that of ordinary battles of courage and ruthlessness. Its significance was too great.","Di Wuji felt immense pressure. Firstly, it was indeed because Ling Han’s counterattack was too strong, and secondly, it was psychological pressure.","If he lost... he would be humiliated!","He could only battle.","Di Wuji summoned the Saint Tool, but Ling Han also had the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Though this could only be considered a seven-star Spirit Tool, which was slightly inferior to the Saint Tool, the defenses of the Origin Gold was Great Emperor-level.","Thus, so what if it was a Saint Tool? It couldn’t do anything to Ling Han at all.","After fighting for three days, it was still a tie.","In the end, the battle was forcefully stopped, and Di Wuji was judged to have lost.","Why was it Di Wuji’s loss?","It was very simple. You, a Two Star Saint, were unable to defeat a Venerate, so who would be considered the loser if not you?","Two wins!","In this manner, the Living Realm had won seventeen galaxies.","Everyone was overjoyed. However, the Netherworld’s side still had Lu Xun and Wu Xingtong, two three-star Saints. What were they to do?","Against Di Wuji, Ling Han had obviously used all his trump cards. Even so, they could only fight to a tie. Then, against the stronger Lu Xun and Wu Xingtong, Ling Han would definitely lose.","Then, losing two times in a row would mean paying the price of twenty galaxies. Then wouldn’t that mean losing another three galaxies?","However, could they call a halt now?","Lu Xun revealed a smile, and said slowly, “Ling Han, you are really surprising! However, in front of me, how many moves can you take?”","He raised his hand, and with a light wave, seven eight-star Regulations were instantly activated.","Seven flashes!","Everyone was in despair. Seven streaks! In terms of Regulations, he had suppressed Ling Han by a whole four stars. How could this battle be fought?","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Ten moves, then.”","Ten moves?","Everyone shook their heads. The gap in strength was too wide. Even Ling Han had completely lost all confidence, and thought that he could only withstand ten moves from Lu Xun.","“Haha, you do have some self-awareness.” Lu Xun laughed loudly.","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, “It seems like you have misunderstood. When I say ten moves, it is you that can block ten moves from me, at most.”","Yi?","All of a sudden, everyone was incredibly shocked.","What was going on?","This was really boasting too much.","There was absolutely no way that you could be a match for Lu Xun, and you actually said that you would deal with him in ten moves. Wasn’t that a joke?","Lu Xun was also slightly surprised. His expression darkened, “This is not funny at all.”","“I don’t find it funny either. I’m just stating a fact,” Ling Han said with a smile. “What is it? Do you think I’m telling you a joke?”","“Humph, you’ll be struck by lightning for showing off!” Lu Xun couldn’t help but mock, “What’s the point? When you’re defeated by me, just how humiliating would that be?”","“Yi, I already said that I can defeat you within ten moves. Where did you get all this nonsense from?” Ling Han was surprised.","“You’re seeking death!” Lu Xun humphed, and charged towards Ling Han.","Boom!","Right at this moment, over a hundred stars in the surrounding universe shot out brilliant pillars of light at the same time. Then, they intertwined, turning into an even thicker pillar of light that shot towards Lu Xun.","At the same time, Ling Han also charged out.","This!","“Formation!”","“Saint-level formation!”","“F***, I forgot something important. Ling Han is still a Formation Master!”","“But when did he advance to the level of Formation Saint?”","Everyone was exclaiming in shock. From a certain aspect, Formation Saints were even more awesome than Saints.","A Saint like you would only be able to match one or two Saints of the same cultivation level, at most, but Formation Saints only had to lay out formations, and they could even trap and kill ten Saints.","This was an unexpected turn of events!"]},{"number":4613,"title":"Chapter 4613: Shocking Change","paragraphs":["Chapter 4613: Shocking Change","One person, one formation, this combination was too powerful.","Ling Han unleashed all of his ultimate moves at the first instant. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, the Destructive Energy, the four pinnacle pillars, and he used all the powerful moves that he could use. Just how terrifying was this power?","Even Lu Xun couldn’t withstand it.","Primarily, it was because this formation was too frightening. Its destructive power was superior to even Ling Han, so he had to split out a large portion of his energy to resist it. This made it difficult for him to take care of both front and back. It should be known that though Ling Han’s battle prowess was inferior to his, who could underestimate the attacks of Saints?","In just nine moves, Lu Xun was forced to flee in a sorry state, and had no choice but to withdraw from the battle.","Saints were hard to kill, and this was based on the prerequisite that they would flee if they were unable to defeat their opponent. If one were to truly battle to the death and not retreat, they would still die very quickly.","True enough, within ten moves.","At this moment, everyone was rendered speechless.","Ling Han wasn’t boasting. He had genuinely defeated Lu Xun in 10 exchanges.","Had he used external power?","Hehe, who made it a rule that Formation Masters couldn’t use formations in battle?","Ling Han’s victory wasn’t due to his full battle prowess, but it was also due to his own strength.","Lu Xun had been defeated!","At this time, even Wu Xingtong didn’t say that she would be fighting. With the cooperation of person and formation, Ling Han was completely capable of sweeping aside all Saints below Five Stars.","Hence, even if she went, it would be pointless. She would only be gifting an additional ten galaxies to the other side.","“Thank you. There are a total of 27 galaxies. Please cooperate with us, and quickly evacuate the troops,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Humph, how could we go back on our word!” Wu Xingtong humphed, turned around, tore a rip into the Void, and left.","What was the point of staying here? To be laughed at by others?","With her departure, Yang Yihuan and the others also left one after another, all of them looking livid.","Only Feng Miaoling was an exception. She gave Ling Han a look of admiration, causing Ling Han to shiver.","Once these people left, whether it was those in the surroundings, the Heavenly Mother Planet below, or the Galaxy Network, they were all cheering.","Who would have thought that the young king tiers representing the Netherworld would come aggressively, and when the Golden Generation elites were completely defeated, a hero would turn the tide?","At this moment, Ling Han’s status rose endlessly, and he was praised to the height of a hero that saved the world.","Everyone believed that as long as Ling Han became a Saint, he could even resolve the crisis of the invasion of the Netherworld all by himself.","Thus, the public opinion on Galaxy Network became even more intense, requesting the various Imperial Clans to fulfill their promises as soon as possible, and quickly take out their cultivation resources, so that Ling Han could break through to Saint Tier as soon as possible.","Yan Anming and the other Imperial Sons still had to reluctantly ask Ling Han to enter the city. They still had to keep up appearances.","Ling Han didn’t enter the city.","There was a seven-star or even eight-star Saint in there. If he shamelessly ambushed him, it was really possible that he would suffer.","He couldn’t be careless. He was only a three-star Venerate, and his battle prowess was at most comparable to a two-star Saint. Moreover, the Ancestral King City was filled with the aura of a Great Emperor, so Saint Tier-level formations were completely useless.","He didn’t want himself, Brother Monkey, and the others to fall together.","Ling Han didn’t want to enter the city, so Han Yun and the others couldn’t force him either. After exchanging some words, they all took their leave and returned to the Ancestral King City.","Now, in a battle of equal cultivation levels, no one had any extravagant hopes of defeating Ling Han.","Thus, if one wanted to become Emperor, he could only grasp a chance, and that was while Ling Han was still a Venerate Tier.","If one wanted to become Great Emperor, they would have to first advance from Venerate Tier to Saint Tier, then from Saint Tier to Pseudo-Emperor, and from Pseudo-Emperor to become the invincible Great Emperor.","Thus, as long as he managed to become a Pseudo-Emperor first, and complete that final leap, then, no matter how heaven-defying Ling Han was, so what?","In an era, the heaven and earth would only allow one person to become Emperor.","Especially after this battle, the Imperial Sons were even more motivated, and they all went back to cultivating earnestly.","Meanwhile, Ling Han roamed around the vicinity of the Ancestral King City, experiencing the aura of the Great Emperor. This was still of some help to him.","After staying for two days, Ding Shu arrived.","He was very rueful, and said that he had missed the chance to spar with Yang Yihuan and the others, causing Ling Han to be in the limelight all by himself.","Not long after, Jing Haoran, Shui Qingchang, and the others all arrived. The Ancestral King City was still worth a trip.","When Origin also arrived, he suggested that Genesis World leaders like them gather.","This quickly gained everyone’s agreement. After some discussion, they decided to gather outside the Ancestral King City in three days’ time, drink wine and have a nice chat.","Next, it was time for the cruel competition for the throne. Even if Ling Han was peerless in freakishness, becoming Emperor had never been a matter of who was the strongest having the last laugh. The right time, the right place, the right person, none of these variables could be lacking.","It could be said that the seven of them were the most powerful contenders for the throne.","Three days later, Ling Han, Chi Menghan, Brother Monkey, the large black dog, and little azure dragon went to the meeting together.","He wasn’t the first to arrive, but he wasn’t the last either. The people who arrived first were already conversing, discussing cultivation.","Ling Han also joined in. Since they had come first, they could chat first.","Not long after, Heaven Crushing arrived.","This time, six of the seven Genesis World’s Masters had come, and Shui Qingchang was the only one missing.","However, Shui Qingchang wasn’t late either. She arrived at the appointed time, not one second earlier or one second later.","“Haha, how long has it been since we last met?”","“Come, come, come. Don’t say anything. Let’s drink first!”","Everyone raised their cups. As rulers of Genesis Worlds, there was an indescribable intimacy between them.","“Cheers!”","Just as he was about to drink it all in one gulp, Ling Han shockingly discovered that his body was glowing.","Peng, peng, peng! Multiple columns of light shot into the sky, one after another, coming from him, Ding Shu and the others.","Every Genesis World’s ruler was uncontrollably glowing!","This stunned them all. What were elites most afraid of?","Losing control!","Why had their body suddenly lit up?","What did this signify?","“Yi?” “En?” “Ya?”","They all exclaimed in surprise. Seven pillars of light intertwined, as if connecting their bodies together, allowing them to vaguely glimpse the Genesis World of the others.","The seven of them had a feeling that they were definitely not isolated existences.","It was as if... all the Genesis Worlds were originally one, yet they were forcefully split apart.","Yi, it was not that they had not been together before, but why had they never experienced such a change?","Was it because their strength had advanced into Saint Tier?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! One after another, Saints rapidly appeared in the Ancestral King City.","They naturally saw the intertwining pillars of light, and out of curiosity, came out to check on the situation.","When they saw that this light source was actually Ling Han and his group, they were all confused.","Dignified Saints were actually playing such a childish trick?","Boom!","Right at this moment, the seven pillars of light suddenly fused into one. After soaring into the sky, they then descended vertically, blasting towards the Heavenly Mother Planet.","A shocking scene appeared. It was as if the earth was slowly shedding its outer clothing, and a layer of the earth’s crust was forcibly pushed back, revealing a wall.","And when the earth’s crust had retreated to a certain extent, an entrance was revealed.","This time, everyone was dumbfounded.","What was going on?","There was actually a Mystery Realm on the Heavenly Mother Planet?"]},{"number":4614,"title":"Chapter 4614: Imperial Treasury?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4614: Imperial Treasury?","Ling Han and the others were also very confused.","All of this had exceeded their control.","The pillars of light had appeared on their own volition, and they hadn’t taken the initiative to cause them. Moreover, they hadn’t imagined that the intertwining of the pillars of light would actually open up a Mystery Realm on the Heavenly Mother Planet!","When that passageway appeared, the pillars of light on Ling Han and the others also dimmed, and finally stopped glowing.","This caused the seven of them to be even more dumbfounded. Why could they open this passageway?","There was... a connection between them, but what did it have to do with this place?","“Yi, there’s actually a Mystery Realm here!”","“I didn’t discover it before!”","The Imperial Sons all exclaimed in shock. They had chosen the location of the Ancestral King City here, so they had definitely done an extremely detailed survey before building the city. It could be guaranteed that there was definitely no wall here.","Yet, it had appeared now.","What kind of power was protecting this, that it could actually deceive them?","Even Saints couldn’t see through this power!","“Could it be that it is?” someone exclaimed in shock.","“That Great Emperor!” even more people exclaimed in unison.","There was a legend on the Heavenly Mother Planet that said that a Great Emperor had once appeared here, but as for which one it was, it was already impossible to determine. They had long since been annihilated in the long passage of history.","But now, a mysterious wall had suddenly appeared, so how could they not let their imaginations run wild?","That was because this had managed to deceive even Saints.","All of a sudden, everyone was rubbing their fists in anticipation.","If the inheritance of the Great Emperor was really here, then obtaining it would have too much significance.","Firstly, it was destiny, and secondly, the inheritance of the Great Emperor was too valuable. Who knows, it may be able to change a person’s destiny.","There was no corresponding Imperial Clan to pass down to, which meant that... there was an Imperial Scroll that could be learnt.","The Imperial Scroll was the summary of a Great Emperor’s comprehension of the great dao. It was passed down in a gradual manner, allowing one to begin cultivating from the moment they set foot on the Celestial Path.","It was said that if one could read all the Imperial Scrolls in the world, then even if he did not become Emperor, he would still be able to become the strongest Saint, and sweep aside all opposition in the world.","Furthermore, what if there was an Imperial Weapon?","An ownerless Imperial Weapon! Just the thought of it was enough to make one’s heart beat wildly.","At this moment, no one was curious about how Ling Han and the others had managed to open this Mystery Realm. Their attention had already been completely attracted by the Imperial Scroll and Imperial Weapon.","“Let’s go!” Their eyes were burning.","Setting the Ancestral King City on the Heavenly Mother Planet, and now opening such a Mystery Realm, didn’t that mean that they had gained the favour of the heavens, and even decisions made subconsciously would have be bestowed such great fortune?","Everyone started to walk toward the passageway.","Meanwhile, Ling Han looked at Ding Shu and the others, and said, “Everyone, perhaps we can discover our true origins today.”","“En.” Ding Shu and the others all nodded.","They had come from the Genesis World, and the Genesis World corresponded to a Divine Stone, but where exactly had the Divine Stone come from?","Nurtured by heaven and earth?","In the beginning, Ling Han had indeed thought so. That was until now, that the seven of them resonated, and actually opened the historical site that was suspected to be the site of a Great Emperor. This was strange.","They were definitely related to this Great Emperor.","However, what exactly was this?","They had to go in and take a look.","The seven of them set off, and Brother Monkey and the others followed suit. This was very likely the treasure trove of a Great Emperor. Who could remain calm?","The group entered. This passage was very long, but the speed of Saints were extremely fast. Very soon, they had arrived at the end of the passage, and saw that a flight of stairs had appeared ahead of them, leading underground.","They walked down the stairs.","They had not taken too many steps, when the stairs turned, and they turned with it, continuing downwards.","Continuously turning in this manner, and endlessly descending, after a whole half an hour, there were finally no more stairs ahead of them. Instead, there was an empty plaza.","They raised their heads. Because they were underground, it was naturally impossible to see stars above them, but the top was at least three thousand meters above the ground.","After all, they had walked downwards for a very long time.","The people who had entered earlier were all here. Aside from Saints, there was also a small number of Venerates and Sect Masters. Any one of these people could be called an elite in the outside world, but in this place, everyone had to be very careful.","If this had really been set up by a Great Emperor, then so what if it was Saints? They would still be easily killed.","They advanced cautiously, and when they arrived at the end of the plaza, they saw that there was actually a great tree there. It had grown to the top, and the crown of the tree was stretched out, enough to cover an area of several thousand meters.","If it was only big, no one would take it to heart. There were many plants that were larger than this tree outside.","However, this great tree was covered with spots of light. Though none of them were very bright, in such a dark place, it was enough to become a torch-like existence.","What kind of tree was this? They had never seen it before.","Everyone slowly approached. If this really was an Imperial Treasury, then how could the tree that could be planted here be an ordinary one?","When they got closer, those spots of light suddenly flickered, as if they had become shooting stars, that shot towards them.","So fast!","The Saints were still able to react in time, and managed to set up a shield of Regulations in time, but the Venerates and Sect Masters were not able to react so quickly. They were hit by a great many spots of light, which then passed through their bodies.","After these spots of light danced in a circle, they returned to the tree, and adorned this towering tree.","Pa, pa, pa, pa, pa! Those who had been pierced by the specks of light all crashed onto the ground, completely lifeless.","What!","Everyone was stunned. What the hell were these specks of light? Why had they pierced through the body, and they were already dead?","Ling Han activated his eye technique and looked over, only to see that the specks of light were actually insects.","What a powerful insect, to actually be able to insta-kill Venerates.","Just now, there had been insects charging towards him, but they were unable to break through his defenses. Clearly, these insects were indeed powerful, but they had not broken through the threshold of Saint Tier.","So, these insects were Half-Saint-level?","One or two was naturally nothing, but with so many of them... this was terrifying.","At a rough glance, there were at least 10,000 or so of them. These Half Saint-level insects were attacking in groups, and even a Nine-Star Saint would have to turn around and flee, right?","That’s not right!","Ling Han immediately shook his head. If these insects were all Half-Saint-level, that would be too inconceivable.","There was no force in the world that could nurture so many Half-Saints.","With just a single tree?","Hehe, no matter how awesome a Celestial Tree was, it was impossible.","Shua, the specks of light danced again, and the insects launched the second wave of attack.","Ling Han pressed down with his palm. Boom! Destructive Energy boiled.","Instantly, wherever the palm strike passed, the spots of light would be instantly extinguished.","These insects were completely no match for Ling Han.","Everyone exclaimed in shock. Then, realization dawned on them. Though these insects had astonishing destructive power, they were not genuine Half-Saints. Otherwise, even if Ling Han possessed the battle prowess of a Two-Star Saint, he could not possibly kill so many Half-Saints with a single strike.","It could only be said that these insects possessed a unique ability that had incredibly shocking penetrating power, and that was why they could insta-kill Venerates.","However, they themselves were quite fragile.","Thinking of this, everyone shook their heads. These Venerates and Sect Masters that had died had really died for nothing."]},{"number":4615,"title":"Chapter 4615: Holy Flame Insects","paragraphs":["Chapter 4615: Holy Flame Insects","When they knew that these insects only had extremely strong offensive power, but their defenses were overwhelmingly weak, everyone moved.","With the Saint-level power wreaking havoc, these insects were naturally destroyed in an instant.","What was surprising was that these insects died all over the ground, but not one of them was shattered into dust.","“Actually, their outer shell is tough enough, and even Saint-level power would find it very difficult to destroy them. However, their defenses are extremely low, and the power of the shockwave is enough to crush their fragile physical bodies.”","Everyone had discovered some clues.","This kind of insect was practically the embodiment of all kinds of extremes — super-strong attack power, super-fast speed, super-thick outer shell, yet it had an incredibly fragile physical body. It would die with just a slight shock.","“Yi, I remember now. This is a type of insect that only exists in legends.” An old Saint suddenly clapped his hands, “These are Holy Flame Insects!”","This name was quite appropriate. It possessed the destructive power of a Half-Saint, and would glow like fireflies.","“Hiss!” Being reminded by this old Saint, a considerable number of old Saints similarly looked shocked. They all scrambled out, and were actually collecting the insect corpses.","Everyone faltered upon hearing this. However, since this insect corpse was capable of causing Saints to lose their composure, it was clear that it was extremely valuable.","Thus, without caring about anything else, everyone scrambled out, and joined the gathering team.","However, though there were many of the Holy Flame Insects, they were only so large. A single scoop would be able to gather a whole bunch of them, so how could they hold up to being divided among these Saints? Very soon, not a single one could be seen.","“What exactly is the use of this?” Finally, someone asked.","That’s right, what was the use?","“You profligate brats!” an old Saint said with emotion. He was the Water Moon Saint from the Jade Drop Imperial Clan, and he was already a four-star Saint. “The flames burning in this Holy Flame Insect... is the Holy Flame!”","“Though there is only a sliver, if it is refined, it would still be of great help to us,” the Qiantian Saint of the Blood Flames Imperial Clan also said.","Though there was only a sliver of the holy flame, it was really, really too difficult for a Saint to take another step forwards. Thus, even a sliver of the holy flame was incredibly valuable.","In any case, there had been over 10,000 Holy Flame Insects in the first place. If they were all obtained by one person, it would probably be enough to help a Saint advance to the next minor level of cultivation.","“Oh no, after the insect died, the holy flame was extinguished, and no longer has any effect.” Han Yun looked at the insect corpse in his hand, and couldn’t help but exclaim in frustration.","Everyone also checked their gains one after another. Could they sense a sliver of the power of the holy flame?","Sigh, theyhad been excited for nothing.","However, Ling Han didn’t pay much heed to this. Firstly, he wasn’t a Saint yet, so he didn’t have such a pressing request for the holy flame. Secondly, he was filled with confidence in himself. Even without external help, he could still improve rapidly among Saints.","Thus, he merely stared at that great tree.","Why did the Holy Flame Insects reside on this large tree?","Additionally, how had the Holy Flame Insects matured?","Though the Holy Flame Insects could not really be considered Saint-level living beings, and could not even be considered a Half-Saint, to possess the destructive power of a Half-Saint, and also have a sliver of the holy flame, this was no ordinary matter what.","How had they grown?","It was impossible for it to appear out of thin air and grow up out of thin air.","Thus, there was definitely something special about this tree.","Ling Han sized up the tree trunk and leaves, but couldn’t perceive anything.","Being able to become a Saint, which one of them was not a smart person? They all circled around the great tree, trying their best to recall the information they had read before, and compare it with this.","However, after a long time, no one spoke.","The group of people studied it for a long time, and there were even some who deliberately went out to connect to the Galaxy Network, inviting people from all over the universe to join in on the research.","Ling Han and the others were also discussing.","“If the Holy Flame Insects depend on this great tree to grow, they would either eat the leaves of the great tree, or absorb the sap of the tree.”","“Thus, there must be nutrients that are necessary for their growth inside the great tree.”","“Then—”","Ling Han, Ding Shu and the others all had burning gazes. They moved, and plucked a small branch, which had a few leaves on it.","Though everyone was still studying it, dissatisfied with the way Ling Han and the others had destroyed it, firstly, Ling Han and the others had only plucked a small branch, and secondly, Ling Han and the others were too strong. Even the Golden Generation was unwilling to trifle with them.","Thus, only some people cast a few more glances at them, but no one spoke.","Ling Han and the others first plucked a leaf and studied it carefully, but did not find anything. Looking at the tree branch again, there didn’t seem to be anything special about it.","“Huh? Is our research heading in the wrong direction?” Heaven Crushing asked with a frown.","With a thought from Ling Han, he used his intent as fire to ignite this branch.","With a boom, the branch immediately began to burn.","“These flames!” Ding Shu, Brother Monkey, the large black dog and the others immediately revealed shocked expressions. There was actually saintly power contained within these flames!","F***, this was the holy flame.","How was this possible?","Only Saints could burn the holy flame. Was this a Saint Tree?","That was impossible. Though the Celestial medicine was precious, there was not too little of it either. Which one of them could burn the holy flame?","Have you cultivated to the point of gaining consciousness?","Shui Qingchang hurriedly blew out a breath of air and extinguished the fire.","This was their discovery, and could not be known to others. Otherwise, if they wanted to snatch this great tree again, they would definitely be met with desperate resistance from the masses.","This holy flame could help them increase their cultivation level!","It should be known that the door to becoming Emperor had already been opened. Who could become Emperor was not just a matter of natural talent, but also a matter of who would be able to charge ahead.","Thus, whoever could monopolize this great tree and harvest all of the holy flame might be able to leave others behind on the path of becoming Emperor.","They quietly advanced. With their strength, as long as they felled the great tree and stowed it away, who would be able to stop them from leaving?","At this moment, Ling Han and the others all had a tacit understanding, forming an alliance without saying anything.","—When they seized this great tree, how they would divide it among themselves would be a matter for the future.","Slowly, they had already arrived beneath the great tree.","However, before they could make a move, a person suddenly ran in, and said loudly, “I just received news that an old nine-star Saint has recognized this great tree. This is the Holy Flame Tree, and burning its trunk can form the holy flame!”","With a shua, all the Saints stood up. Then, their eyes focused on Ling Han and the others.","Sigh, could this be considered as having been caught red-handed?","“Hehe!” Since the others also understood the preciousness of this large tree, what need was there for them to be polite? Ding Shu was the first to move, and shot towards the large tree like an arrow, planning to uproot it.","“How dare you!” Instantly, the other Saints all moved, and charged towards Ding Shu.","Ling Han, Brother Monkey, Origin, and the others all moved to intercept.","There was no need to speak of their tacit understanding. Ding Shu would snatch the treasure, and they would intercept the others. When the time came, they would divide the spoils among themselves.","—If they fought internally at this time, it would only decrease their profits, and there might not even be any profit at all.","Boom!","Immediately, a great battle broke out. These were all Saints, and that was boundlessly terrifying."]},{"number":4616,"title":"Chapter 4616: Burning the Tree","paragraphs":["Chapter 4616: Burning the Tree","Shockingly, this place was also chillingly sturdy. No matter how much Saint-level power blasted at it, it did not move in the slightest.","This made everyone believe that this was definitely the power of a Great Emperor.","Originally, they had thought that they had entered into a Great Emperor Mystery Realm, but they still lacked proof, but now, they were sure of it.","Hiss, this Holy Flame Tree had appeared right at the beginning. Then, just how astonishing would the real treasures hidden by the Great Emperor be?","Everyone came to blows. This was for their own benefit, and everyone was going all out, wanting to take the Holy Flame Tree for their own.","In fact, there was even an eight-star Saint among them!","Eight stars, that was definitely awesome and dazzling, close to being invincible in this world.","If this was any other time, everyone would have to give face to this kind of existence, but now, no one would give way modestly.","Why should they give in to him?","Moreover, no matter how awesome you were, how could you possibly suppress so many Saints at the same time?","Theoretically speaking, three to four Saints would be able to compensate for the difference of one star in battle prowess. In other words, an eight-star Saint would be blocked by at least three seven-star Saints, while it would take nine six-star Saints, and it would take 27 five-star Saints...","Thus, even though the Xuan Huo Saint had a cultivation level of eight stars, he couldn’t suppress everyone here by himself.","Moreover, there was something that could affect the outcome of the battle.","Saint Tool!","With the appearance of the Saint Tool, the strength of each Saint increased, and this further narrowed the gap in battle prowess between them and the Xuan Huo Saint.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Saint-level power wreaked havoc, and Regulations bloomed like fireworks, embellishing this pitch-black space to an incredibly beautiful extent.","Ling Han and the others joined forces, and their abilities were outstanding.","However, whoever was closest to the Holy Flame Tree would become public enemy number one. Even if Ling Han and the others were freaks, the highest cultivation level among them was only One-Star Saint, so how could they withstand the mad barrage of attacks from a large group of Three-Star and Four-Star Saints?","The battle royale was incredibly intense. There were too many Saints. If they did not clear the area first, who knew how long this kind of battle would continue for.","However, the various Imperial Clan elites were all unconcerned. This was because they had already sent out a message asking the Saints of their clans to act.","When a Nine-Star Saint arrived, and if necessary, he would even bring out the Imperial Weapon. What could he not suppress?","At that time, everyone would quiet down and slowly discuss how to distribute this Holy Flame Tree.","Of course, it would be even better if they could obtain it now, as they could enjoy it alone.","“If this continues, we might be kicked out of the game,” Ling Han communicated through divine sense.","“That’s right, what do we do?” The little azure dragon grimaced.","Though he was also the son of a Great Emperor, his old man had long since died, and there was no Imperial Weapon passed down through the generations, nor was there any powerful force for him to use. If it was a competition of backgrounds, he was at a great disadvantage.","“Little Han, use the Strange Shadow Steps to sneak over and steal it,” the large black dog suggested.","Ling Han instantly rolled his eyes, and said, “Steal my a*s! The shockwaves from the battle are so intense right now, so any one of them can easily send me flying.”","Er, this wouldn’t work again.","Brother Monkey didn’t say anything. He was only responsible for battle. When it came to such a tiring job as thinking, it was better to leave it to others.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head, and he said, “Why don’t we burn it down? All of you can go and absorb the holy flame, however much there is.”","Though this way, everyone would be able to obtain the holy flame, it was still better than having the nine-star Saints from the Imperial Clans arrive, in which case, they would not be able to gain the slightest bit, right?","Moreover, this was only the beginning. How many more treasures would there be after this?","Once they were kicked out, they would have no chance at all.","“But you haven’t reached the Saint Tier yet, brat, so you won’t be able to absorb the holy flame,” the large black dog immediately said.","This was a great disadvantage, because Ling Han couldn’t get the slightest bit of benefit.","“It’s fine.” Ling Han smiled confidently.","Before the large black dog and the others could persuade him further, Ling Han had already activated his divine sense to ignite the large tree.","Previously, it was easy to ignite a branch, but in the case of a great tree... it was too colossal, and required exponential amounts of divine sense.","Ling Han’s divine sense had long since reached perfection, majestic and vast, but now, it was also incredibly straining, unable to ignite the great tree even after a long time.","That was because he was not a true Saint. Otherwise, with the help of the holy flame, it would be much simpler for him to ignite the great tree.","“Burn!” Ling Han roared. Boom! His Spiritual Power transformed into blades that scraped against the Holy Flame Tree at an astonishing speed.","100, 1000... When there was enough Spiritual Power, the Holy Flame Tree finally burst into flames and started to burn.","“What!”","“Why is the Holy Flame Tree burning?”","All the Saints were shocked, but they immediately stopped fighting. They all sat down in cross-legged positions, absorbing the holy flame.","That was because once this great tree started to burn, it was like a wildfire starting at the prairie. Its speed was astonishingly fast, and in an instant, it was burning from top to bottom. It was completely impossible to extinguish the flames.","Thus, the only thing they could do now was absorb as much of the holy flame as possible, and use it for themselves.","Brother Monkey, Chi Menghan, the large black dog, and the others were all prepared. They immediately sat down to extract the power of the holy flame.","All of a sudden, no one was standing — aside from Ling Han.","Ling Han was still a Venerate. The holy flame was completely useless to him, and aside from him, the other Sect Masters and Venerates had all been killed by the Holy Flame Insects.","He did not waste time waiting foolishly. Instead, he arrived at the end of the plaza. There was another passage here.","I’ll take my leave first.","Ling Han smiled. He couldn’t obtain the benefits of the holy flame, but being able to be in the lead could also be considered a benefit.","He strode forwards, and entered into the passage.","This passage was very dark, and also very long. As he walked in, the light sound of his footsteps was also very loud, echoing in Ling Han’s ears.","After walking for a long time, the path ahead suddenly became clear again.","There was another plaza. However, this time, there weren’t any large trees in the plaza. Instead, there was a palace standing at the end of the plaza.","Was this where the Great Emperor had lived when he was alive?","Ling Han walked over, only to see that the doors were tightly shut.","He stretched out his hand to push, and as all the power surged out, the great doors also slowly opened. Zhi, as if sealed history was about to reappear in the world, the sound of the doors opening was incredibly loud.","Low-key, low-key.","Ling Han thought to himself, and strode into the palace.","Yi?","Ling Han raised his head, and saw that a large hole had been blasted into the top of the palace.","This was inconceivable to him.","A hole had actually been blasted into the residence of a Great Emperor?","Who was so bold, and also so powerful?","Even if the Great Emperor’s palace wasn’t protected by Great Emperor-level formations, after being bathed in the aura of the Great Emperor for so long, what power could break through it?","“Could it be that some Imperial Clan brought an Imperial Weapon with them?” Ling Han guessed. If it weren’t for the Imperial Weapon, this couldn’t have possibly been done.","“But which Imperial Clan is so outrageously bold?”","Ling Han withdrew his gaze, and continued onwards.","However, this place was filled with traces of battle, which caused extremely serious damage.","Ling Han tried to launch an attack as well, but he only knocked down a wall."]},{"number":4617,"title":"Chapter 4617: Imperial Statue","paragraphs":["Chapter 4617: Imperial Statue","“As expected, the structures here are extremely sturdy. Furthermore, after so many years, the aura of the Great Emperor must have subsided considerably. Thus, this palace hall must have been even sturdier in the past.”","“These traces of battle... should have been left behind by Saints.”","“Could it be that some Imperial Clan brought an Imperial Weapon with them and sent out all the Saints of their clan to attack this place when this Great Emperor wasn’t here?”","Ling Han thought as he walked. This was perhaps the most astonishing discovery in history. There was actually a force that dared to attack the residence of the Great Emperor!","No one would believe this, right?","Even if they took advantage of the fact that the Great Emperor was not here, and forcibly conquered this place, wouldn’t they be afraid that the Great Emperor would call them to account afterwards?","Or perhaps it was only after the death of that Great Emperor that forces had invaded?","En, it should be the latter possibility that was more likely. Otherwise, it would be too inconceivable.","Ling Han searched around in the palace, but the damage here was too severe. Only the frame of the palace was still there. As for other things, it was really difficult to find anything complete that could be used to prove the identity of that Great Emperor.","After exiting the palace, he saw another plaza ahead of him. However, this plaza wasn’t empty anymore. Instead, there was a stone statue erected there, but it was incomplete. The part above the head and neck was gone.","This stone statue was extremely tall, measuring around 300 meters in height. It was clearly male, and it could be clearly seen that he was wearing a long robe. Even though it was only a statue, it still displayed his ethereal and otherworldly aura.","Was it that Great Emperor of the past?","Ling Han raised his head to look. Unfortunately, the sculpture didn’t have a head, so there was still no comparison.","“The other parts of the statue are all here, yet the head is missing. I can’t help but suspect that this is deliberate.” Ling Han withdrew his gaze, and murmured, “Does this mean that no one can guess the identity of that Great Emperor, or do they hate this Great Emperor so much that they could not even bear to see his stone statue?”","He walked to the foot of the statue, and stretched out a hand to touch it. Suddenly, images rushed towards his mind.","This was a scene of worship from all living beings.","In the past, countless believers had come here, and worshipped this stone statue on this plaza. The power of faith of all living beings condensed, transmigrating through millions and millions of years without dying.","“Power of belief.”","Ling Han nodded. What depressed him was the fact that these believers were too devout. They did not dare to raise their heads, and lowered their gazes. Thus, Ling Han was still unable to find out the appearance of that Great Emperor through these images.","“Are you trying to drive me to my death with anxiety?”","Ling Han retracted his hand. This was also his first time experiencing the power of belief, which made him sigh in realization.","“Yi?” He was surprised, because when he withdrew his hand, he discovered that the power of belief had not dispersed, but was rather adhering to his hand.","Strange.","The power of belief could only be used by Saints. No matter how freakish Ling Han was, his cultivation level was still low, so how could he channel it?","It was just like using your hand to scoop up water. No matter how big your palm was, the water would still flow through your fingers, and would not be able to stay in your grasp at all.","But now, Ling Han could sense that his connection with the power of belief had not been severed. In fact... he could use it.","He would give it a try.","Ling Han delivered a palm strike. Boom, the power of belief of all living beings was boosted. Aside from launching 30 Seven Star Regulations, there was actually another Eight Star Regulation that appeared.","In other words, with the help of the power of belief, he had actually increased his battle prowess by one star.","“Tsk!”","“No wonder the Saints collect the power of belief. Even if they can ignite the holy flame themselves, they still have to nurture believers.”","“This is indeed a great boost to battle prowess.”","“However, it’s clear that only Saints who possess Regulations can wield the power of belief, so why can I do the same?”","Ling Han stimulated the dimensions in his body. He was the Genesis World’s leader, and with a single thought, he immediately attracted the worship of millions of people. That was the incredibly devout power of belief.","However, Ling Han discovered that this was not the slightest bit helpful to his battle prowess.","Even though it was only a wisp.","Thus, he was still unable to channel the power of belief.","“The reason why I was able to unleash my might just now was because of this stone statue.” Ling Han placed his hand on the stone statue again. With a thought, he waved his hand, and as expected, an eight-star Regulation appeared.","And after this time, he discovered that he had actually established a very weak relationship with the stone statue. It was as if there was a bridge between the two of them that connected them.","It was also because of this that he was still able to channel the power of belief after taking a few steps back.","“I can now confirm that there is definitely a connection between me and this Great Emperor.”","“But what exactly is it?”","“Not just me, but also Ding Shu and the other Genesis World Masters!”","Ling Han felt a headache coming on. Just what kind of connection was this?","After thinking for a while, he continued onwards. There was another building at the end of the plaza, but compared to the palace, this was much more shabby. It was only a very ordinary small courtyard.","The front of the courtyard was surrounded by a bamboo fence. First, there was a small vegetable garden, followed by three single-storey houses.","Now, the vegetable garden had long since been abandoned. There weren’t even any weeds growing, and all that was left was desolate land.","Ling Han pushed open the bamboo fence, passed through the vegetable garden, and walked into those three single-storey houses.","This was really too ordinary. Everything was ordinary.","Ling Han circled around, and discovered that there was another backyard.","He walked in, and discovered that a small training ground had been built in this backyard. There was a very large sandpit.","“Yi?”","Ling Han faltered for a moment. This was because he suddenly saw the figure of a child walking past him.","This gave him a scare.","He had to be seeing things!","Just how powerful was he now? Saint-level!","But even so, he did not even know when a person had appeared by his side. How could this not be frightening?","However, Ling Han immediately came to a realization. This wasn’t a person, but rather an illusion.","The child walked into the sandpit and began to practice martial arts.","He practiced for several hours, and only when the sun had risen into the sky did he hear a voice call out, “Taiyu, it’s time for lunch.”","The child immediately retracted his fists and feet, then returned to his room.","When he passed by Ling Han, the child suddenly paused, and glanced at where Ling Han was. A suspicious expression appeared on his face, and he then walked back in.","‘F*ck! He didn’t see me, did he?’","However, this was an illusion from who knew how many years ago. Everyone in the scene was clearly an existence in a memory, so how could he have discovered him?","A thought involuntarily flashed through his mind.","A Great Emperor!","Only a Great Emperor would possess such Mystical Powers that ordinary people could not even imagine.","An extremely ordinary small courtyard had appeared here, so how could it not be strange?","However, if this was where the Great Emperor had lived since childhood, then it could be explained.","Ling Han couldn’t help but shuffle his feet and enter the room.","This time, he shockingly discovered that the appearance of the room had completely changed.","Er, the house was still the same, but the furnishings and furniture had become considerably newer. Furthermore, at a table, there was presently an older person and younger person seated, eating, exuding vitality.","The younger one was naturally the child who had been practicing martial arts just now, while the older one was a pretty woman who looked to be less than thirty years old. Occasionally, she would carry food for the child, her eyes filled with gentleness.","“Mother, can we treat this Big Brother to a meal?” At this moment, the child suddenly asked."]},{"number":4618,"title":"Chapter 4618: The childhood of a Great Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 4618: The childhood of a Great Emperor","Ling Han was given a fright. Had he been discovered?","The woman was surprised, and asked, “Taiyu, what are you talking about?”","“There’s a Big Brother standing over there,” the child said, pointing at Ling Han.","Er!","Ling Han sighed. A Great Emperor was a Great Emperor, after all. Even if this was a memory image left behind from countless years ago, it was actually capable of reacting to him, a spectator.","You are awesome.","“There’s no Big Brother Just eat obediently,” the woman said gently. “When your father comes back, I’ll cook some meat stew for you.”","“En!” The child nodded vigorously, appearing to be very happy.","After the meal, the child went back to practicing martial arts. He obviously could still see Ling Han, but did not say anything else.","Time passed very quickly. When it was close to evening, a man stumbled over. The moment he entered, peng, he collapsed loudly onto the ground.","“Mingtong!” The woman hurriedly rushed over and helped the man up.","Ling Han saw very clearly that there was a very deep wound on the man’s chest.","This was a memory image, and Ling Han was also unable to sense the aura of this man. Though he was also unable to determine the latter’s cultivation level, from every move he made, he should not have stepped onto the Celestial Path yet.","If mortals suffered such severe injuries, their only fate would be death.","“The Zhang Clan discovered me, and I ledt them to circle around in the mountains, temporarily breaking away from them. Hurry up and take Taiyu away!” the man said darkly.","“No, let’s go together!” the woman hurriedly said.","“Father!” The child also heard the commotion. He stopped practicing martial arts and ran over.","“I will only be a burden to you. Don’t worry about me!” The man said harshly, “For Taiyu’s sake, you must leave!”","“Mingtong!” The woman’s tears fell like rain.","Though the child did not know what had happened, the present scene also made him feel that things were not good, and he was so anxious that he was breaking out in a cold sweat.","Right at this moment, a commotion was heard from afar.","Ling Han looked into the distance, only to see a group of people rushing over.","“It’s too late!” the man said through gritted teeth. He pushed himself up with all his might, and said, “I’ll fight them to the death!”","Yet the woman gritted her teeth, and said to the child, “Xuan Taiyu, promise Mother, immediately hide under the bed. No matter what happens, you can’t come out!”","“Mother—”","“Agree to Mother!”","“All right.” The child nodded, wiped away his tears, and hid under the bed.","The man looked at the woman, his expression filled with reluctance, as well as a resoluteness to go all out.","“Die!”","The two of them charged out, immediately attracting the attention of that group of people, who set off in pursuit of them.","It wasn’t long before the couple were caught up to and killed in battle.","However, this group of people did not leave. Instead, they turned back, and searched the room. Very soon, they found the child.","“Haha, there’s also a little b@stard!” The man leading them smirked coldly, “That couple fought to the death, unwilling to be captured, and we thought that we wouldn’t be able to complete our mission. I didn’t expect that there would be another little bAstard, and it just so happened that we could bring him back.”","“Retreat.”","This group of people left, and tied the child onto the back of a horse.","“Father, Mother!” the child cried, as he waved at Ling Han, as if asking for his help.","This was only an image, so Ling Han naturally couldn’t help him. He could only watch him leave.","Sigh, this Great Emperor seemed to have had a very tragic childhood.","It was unknown how he had managed to escape from his enemy, and cultivated all the way to become a Great Emperor, invincible in his generation.","However, his childhood was still a painful memory that had left behind traces that could not be erased. That was why after he became Emperor, he deliberately built a small courtyard that was the same as his childhood, and plucked out this memory.","Sigh, this was also the limit of what the Great Emperor could do. There was no way he could return to the past to save his parents.","That was because his childhood experience was an indispensable trajectory in his life to becoming Emperor. Otherwise, he would have to walk a completely different path of life, and naturally could not possibly become Emperor.","Since that was the case, how could he change the past?","This was the pattern of karma, and even the Great Emperor could not change this.","“This Great Emperor’s name is Xuan Taiyu!”","Ling Han nodded. It was easy now that he knew the name. He would look for information after he left, and there would definitely be some clues.","He had to leave.","He was just about to leave, when his heart skipped a beat. It was as if he had developed some kind of indescribable connection with this room.","Yi?","He discovered that a rock had suddenly appeared on the table.","Rocks again?","He gritted his teeth. The Genesis World was inside the Divine Stone, and the Genesis World definitely had a deep connection with Xuan Taiyu, and now a rock had popped out. No matter how he thought about it, it had to be related, right?","Why was he fixated on rocks?","Ling Han walked over and examined it carefully.","This stone looked ordinary, and it was extremely ordinary. However, Ling Han could guarantee that this table had definitely been clean before. This stone hadn’t existed.","It could be said that this was a gift from the Great Emperor.","How could a gift from a Great Emperor be ordinary?","But could it be that he wanted to gift him a second Genesis World?","Ling Han looked at it for a while, then stretched out his hand.","The moment his hand touched the rock, boom, instantly, images rushed towards him.","That was a terrifying battle scene, but the scene was flashing too quickly. He could not capture the exact details of the battle at all. He could only confirm that both sides of the battle were incomparably powerful beings.","Was Xuan Taiyu battling with his opponent?","It wasn’t long before the speed of the images slowed down. However, Ling Han also missed the images from before. He couldn’t figure out what the message was.","After watching for a while, Ling Han discovered that this scene was actually reversed. It should have started from the end of Xuan Taiyu’s life.","Right now, Xuan Taiyu was still at the Great Emperor Tier. He shuttled through space, and it was as if he were searching for something.","The Great Emperor was too fast. With a single step, the great golden path could instantly reach any corner of the universe. Even if it was at the edge of the universe, it was still very easy.","Ling Han saw that Xuan Taiyu had once been to the edge of the universe. There was a massive dark abyss there, and its depth was unknown. However, just as Xuan Taiyu was about to enter, a streak of light flew out, so fast that even the Great Emperor couldn’t stop it in time.","Xuan Taiyu immediately chased after it, but the scene came to an abrupt stop.","Whether he had caught up or not, this was definitely in the previous scene, and naturally could not be seen now.","Next, Xuan Taiyu tore a rip into space and arrived on a platform. A pair of ancient doors stood erect, exuding an incredibly ancient aura.","“Humph, since there is a fourth door in the Celestial Path, yet does not give anyone the possibility of passing through at all, what is the point of setting it up?” Xuan Taiyu said coldly. He shot out a punch at the primitive great doors. Peng, with a single blow, the great doors were shattered.","Xiu, Xuan Taiyu left, and the scene changed again.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel extremely shocked, because the broken primitive stone door was too familiar.","Wasn’t this the fourth door that he had passed when he had leaped over the Celestial Gate?","As it turned out, this had actually been damaged by Xuan Taiyu!","Otherwise, the primitive Celestial Gate wouldn’t have been able to be breached at all.","So awesome! Really awesome!"]},{"number":4619,"title":"Chapter 4619: Hand over the Imperial Scroll and Imperial Weapon","paragraphs":["Chapter 4619: Hand over the Imperial Scroll and Imperial Weapon","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel rueful. The fact that he could cultivate to this height was definitely thanks to Xuan Taiyu.","Firstly, the Genesis World was closely related to Xuan Taiyu.","Without the Genesis World, Ling Han would have a great many limits that he could not break.","Secondly, the primitive stone doors at the first barrier of the Celestial Path was actually broken by Xuan Taiyu.","If this weren’t the case, it was very likely that no one would be able to leap over this kind of stone door. After all, Xuan Taiyu had also said that it was Heavenly Dao that was deliberately making things difficult for him. It was an impossible task.","This had nothing to do with natural talent, determination, and so on. It simply could not be done.","Thus, after Xuan Taiyu became Emperor, he directly destroyed the primitive Celestial Gate.","This was the first step of the Celestial Path, and also the most important step. If they could not establish a strong, solid foundation, how could they talk of breaking through the limits?","There had been so many Great Emperors in the past, yet only Xuan Taiyu alone had done this. Just for this fact alone, Ling Han was impressed!","Going against Heavenly Dao, Xuan Taiyu would definitely suffer a backlash.","Perhaps, now that no one in the world knew of this Great Emperor Xuan Taiyu, it could be related to Heavenly Dao, and they had deliberately buried this Great Emperor’s outstanding reputation.","After all, there was no eternal existence. No matter how glorious the legend was, it could still possibly be erased.","Shua, in his mind, the scene was still changing.","At this time, Xuan Taiyu was no longer a Great Emperor, but had become a Saint.","He competed with many prodigies of the same generation, displaying the demeanor of an invincible king tier.","Yi?","Ling Han suddenly faltered, because he saw a familiar figure.","Ge Qianqiu!","This was a mysterious elite he had encountered on the Island of the Sky. At that time, Ling Han had been attracted by the Natural-born Stone Spirit, and ventured deep underground. In the end, he had met this person.","It was also because of Ge Qianqiu that Ling Han found out about the Primordial Source Clay. It could seal one’s vitality and allow them to awaken after millions and millions of years.","Hiss, this guy was actually in the same generation as Xuan Taiyu!","This time, Ling Han was really shocked. He had not thought that he would actually see Ge Qianqiu in Xuan Taiyu’s memories.","Furthermore, Ge Qianqiu could be considered Xuan Taiyu’s strongest opponent, because in this kind of memory, Xuan Taiyu and Ge Qianqiu exchanged blows the most. In fact, it was not Xuan Taiyu that had always won.","However, in the end, it was Xuan Taiyu who had the last laugh.","“Old Man Ge!” Ling Han murmured in his mind. “If we meet again, I’ll have to ask him which era Great Emperor Xuan Taiyu is from. Why does this Great Emperor have an unclear relationship with me, Ding Shu, and the others?”","Subsequently, the images became slower and slower. The closer he was to the early stage of Xuan Taiyu’s life, the fewer memories there would be.","Very quickly, the scene suddenly disappeared.","Ling Han suddenly opened his eyes.","It was over.","Yi?","On the table, that rock had already turned into ash, but Ling Han had a feeling that something seemed to have fused into his body, causing an indescribable change to take place in his inner world.","However, this change was too subtle. For the moment, Ling Han couldn’t say what it was, but he believed that it was like a seed had been planted. Not long after, it would break out of the ground and bring about an earth-shattering change.","“Also, my connection with this place has become stronger again.” Ling Han waved his hand, and five eight-star Regulations appeared.","Five flashes!","That was because he had a stronger connection with that decapitated stone statue. With a single thought, the power of belief would be endlessly used by him, helping him to unleash astonishing battle prowess.","And this was still because the stone statue had already been destroyed, and had not been replenished with power of belief for who knew how many years. On the other hand, it was only slowly seeping away. Thus, the fact that it could still increase Ling Han’s battle prowess by five stars of Saint-level could be considered incredibly awesome.","“Unfortunately, I didn’t get the Imperial Scroll, nor did I get the Imperial Weapon.” Ling Han shook his head. The previous scenes were too fast, and when he could see clearly, Xuan Taiyu hadn’t experienced any great battles, and had to use the Imperial Weapon.","Moreover, the Great Emperor was invincible in this era, so did he still need the Imperial Weapon to help him in battle?","The existence of the Imperial Weapon was more of an inheritance that could eternally stabilize the fortune of an Imperial Clan.","“No matter what, I seem to have gained something.”","Though he temporarily did not understand what that was.","Ling Han exited the small courtyard. Through the damaged stone statue, he had already completely grasped this place. He could confirm that there was nothing else here.","“If I don’t mind extracting the power of belief from the stone statue in a destructive manner, I can even battle against or even kill a nine-star Saint,” Ling Han murmured. “However, this way, the remaining power of belief in the stone statue will definitely dissipate completely.”","“That doesn’t matter. In any case, I don’t live here.”","He was just about to leave, when he saw a large number of Saints approach him.","It was Brother Monkey, Ding Shu and the Imperial Sons.","Realization dawned on Ling Han. By the looks of it, the Holy Flame Tree had already finished burning, so these people had begun to explore again.","Though the Holy Flame Tree was overwhelmingly awesome, there were really too many Saints here. Thus, after some dividing, everyone would have improved, but not by much.","There was nothing that could be done. There was not enough to go around.","“Ling Han!” When they saw him, everyone exclaimed in shock.","“Humph, where do you think you’re going?” Yan Anming asked coldly.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile, and said slowly to him, “Is this your attitude towards a hero?”","Hero?","Yan Anming was just about to reprimand, but upon further thought, it was true. The Golden Generation had all been defeated in front of Yang Yihuan and the others. One galaxy after another, they had lost, right until Ling Han stepped out, and only then did they manage to turn the tide. Instead, they had won 27 galaxies for the Living Realm.","This kind of merit could be said to shake the heavens.","In comparison, what was he, Yan Anming, worth? He only had the body of a Saint, yet what had he done for the Living Realm?","Yan Anming was rendered speechless. At present, Ling Han was worshipped by everyone in the world, and had risen to the height of a savior. The only one who could compare to him was Buddha Doga.","He resolutely didn’t tangle with Ling Han. It wasn’t like he didn’t know that Ling Han was famous for having a sharp tongue.","“You should have obtained the treasures left behind by the Great Emperor, right?” he asked.","When these words fell, all the Saints’ eyes focused on Ling Han.","So what if they were Saints? Faced with the inheritance of a Great Emperor, their hearts still beat faster.","To say nothing of becoming Emperor, just reading a different Imperial Scroll might be enough to help them advance another level on the path of a Saint.","Ling Han chuckled, and his eyes swept over everyone. Aside from Brother Monkey, the large black dog and the others, there was a sliver of greed in everyone’s expressions.","He shook his head, “If I said no, you guys wouldn’t believe me either, right?”","Of course, this was the residence of the Great Emperor. Whether it was the Imperial Weapon or the Imperial Scroll, they were definitely hidden here, and not only was Ling Han the first to enter, he was clearly planning to leave.","Hence, if it was claimed that Ling Han had not gained anything, who would believe it?","—Without any gains, why would you leave?","“Hand over the Imperial Scroll and the Imperial Weapon!” an old Saint commanded.","Because he was a Four-Star Saint, and had a crushing advantage in terms of abilities, he naturally had the right to speak in this manner."]},{"number":4620,"title":"Chapter 4620: One Against Ten","paragraphs":["Chapter 4620: One Against Ten","Ling Han smiled and said, “Even if I truly obtained the Imperial Scroll and the Imperial Weapon, why would I hand them over?”","“Firstly, this is a crucial period in the resistance against the Netherworld. The Imperial Scroll can increase everyone’s strength, so you shouldn’t be so selfish. You should view things for the benefit of the whole universe,” the old Saint said.","“Secondly, you already have a piece of Origin Gold, so it would be meaningless for you to obtain another Imperial Weapon.”","Even if it was the Great Emperor, he could only unleash the full might of a single Imperial Weapon at one time. Thus, possessing two such weapons couldn’t increase one’s battle prowess. What was the use of being greedy?","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh heartily. “Going by that logic, shouldn’t it be you people who should hand over the Imperial Scroll? Come, you can set everyone an example and benefit the people of the universe!”","The old Saint was instantly enraged.","How could this be compared?","The inheritance of the Great Emperor here was an ownerless object, but what about the Imperial Clan?","That was a whole clan. If they handed over the Imperial Scroll, would the Imperial Clan still be able to stand high and mighty? Furthermore, the one only needed to cultivate the corresponding Imperial Scroll to be able to wield the Imperial Weapon. Then wouldn’t that cause the Imperial Clan to lose the most important foundation?","How could an ownerless object be compared?","“Ling Han, don’t pester endlessly and confuse the concept,” the old Saint chided.","Yi, it was similarly handing over the Imperial Scroll, and if I don’t, I am pestering endlessly?","‘Tsk, tsk, tsk. I haven’t asked you to hand over the Imperial Weapon yet.’","“Ling Han, you are too selfish!” Han Yun also stepped out, “This is the inheritance of the Great Emperor, and should belong to everyone in the universe, yet you are selfishly taking it for yourself. How could you not know that what is important is the good of the universe!”","“That’s right!” Another Imperial Son stepped out, “Ling Han, in the face of great righteousness, you must stand firm!”","“Don’t be blinded by your own selfish desires!” A third Imperial Son also stepped out.","“Tsk!” Brother Monkey couldn’t hold it in any longer. He drew out his metal rod and waved it in the air. Then, he pointed at the Saints from afar, “Old Sun is really disgusted by you hypocritical guys to death. Come, whoever wants Old Sun’s brother’s stuff, just come up. See if Old Sun won’t beat you into mush!”","The large black dog and little azure dragon didn’t speak, but they silently stood by Ling Han’s side, expressing their support through their actions.","Chi Menghan naturally wouldn’t back down. She similarly stood beside Ling Han, and drew a dagger. A saintly might appeared faintly.","However, five Saints were pitifully few in front of so many Saints.","Meanwhile, Ding Shu and the others took a few steps back. This was a statement of their stand. They would not make a move to deal with Ling Han, but they would not help either.","They would sit by and watch, maintaining a neutral stance.","With their identities, being able to maintain neutrality was actually already helping Ling Han. After all, they were all rulers of Genesis Worlds, so even if they weren’t freakish like Ling Han, their abilities were still far superior to the Golden Generation. How could they be underestimated?","“Brother Monkey, Old Black, you guys step back first.” Ling Han turned his head and said to the four people beside him, “Let me go first. When I can’t hold on any longer, you guys go first.”","Yi?","Brother Monkey and the others were all curious. Faced with so many Saints, Ling Han actually still insisted on a battle?","However, they were all very familiar with Ling Han. Since he said so, he must have considerable confidence.","“All right!” Brother Monkey and the others all stepped back slightly.","Ling Han cracked a smile, looked at those Golden Generations, and said calmly, “Anyone not convinced? Come, I’ll beat you until you’re convinced.”","“Ling Han, you are too arrogant!” The members of the Golden Generation were all furious.","In a one-on-one battle, you are indeed freakish, but your battle prowess would only be three or four stars, at most. How could you possibly be able to block the combined forces of a few Saints?","“Humph, everyone attack together!” Han Yun waved his arm and shouted. “This time, it’s for the safety of our Living Realm. We definitely can’t allow this selfish person to take the Imperial Scroll and flee.”","“All right!” Several Imperial Sons nodded.","Ling Han couldn’t help but chuckle, saying, “I’ve never seen anyone as shameless as you people.”","“Charge!” Han Yun took the lead, and seven Imperial Sons had already charged over together.","Boom, boom, boom! Saint-level attacks were far too terrifying. They could obliterate a planet in just a few exchanges. However, this was the Great Emperor Mystery Realm, where the Regulations of the Great Emperor had transformed into defenses. Saint-level power couldn’t penetrate these defenses at all.","Thus, the energy of this sealed off space surged madly. Every power was capable of easily tearing apart a planet, yet was wreaking havoc here.","Fortunately, all of the people here were Saints. Otherwise, they would have definitely been smashed into smithereens by the shockwave.","Ling Han was indeed very strong. With 30 Seven Star Regulations intertwined together, he could match three Eight Star Regulations, which was equivalent to a three-star Saint’s battle prowess. Added with Destructive Energy and the like, his battle prowess could be further boosted, reaching the level of Four Stars.","However, Han Yun and the others weren’t weak either.","Each person could blast out two flashes of eight-star Regulations, and added with the help of the Saint Tool, it was no issue for battle prowess to surge up to three stars. Thus, in a one-on-one battle, they were definitely no match for Ling Han.","If it was seven against one?","Then, sorry.","For Saints, the gap of one star of battle prowess would need three to four Saints to make up for it. Thus, if the seven Saints joined forces, it was equivalent to increasing their battle prowess by two stars of battle prowess.","As a result... Ling Han was at a disadvantage in a battle of five stars against four stars.","Thankfully, Ling Han had also grasped Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. This movement technique was too kickass. Even if he was ganged up on by the seven Saints, he would still be able to easily tear a hole in their siege and escape.","Thus, though Ling Han’s battle prowess was far inferior, there was no danger to his life.","But no matter what, he was still at a disadvantage.","“Phoenix Wings Divine Flight is indeed the number one movement technique in the world!”","“If I can obtain it...”","A great many people looked envious. This was the Imperial Technique of the True Phoenix, and the inheritance had originated from the heaven and earth. It was overwhelmingly awesome.","Otherwise, Ling Han would have definitely been ganged up on and killed long ago.","Saints were extremely difficult to kill, and this was based on the fact that they were hellbent on fleeing.","Ling Han hadn’t summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower yet, because he didn’t need to.","A mere seven Saints were completely not enough to pose a threat to his life, so there was naturally no need for him to use the Pseudo-Imperial Weapon.","“Against this kind of selfish person, there is no need for any rules!” Another Imperial Son declared. Then, shamelessly, he drew out his Saint Tool, and joined the battle.","“That’s right. For the sake of the universe, so what if we bear infamy?” The ninth Golden Generation charged out.","“I believe that future generations will redeem our name!” The tenth Golden Generation also joined the battle.","Ten against one!","This time, even if Ling Han had the world’s number one movement technique, it was still barely enough.","After all, he was only a Venerate, and not a true Saint.","He moved with great difficulty, but the space left for him became smaller and smaller.","Han Yun and the others sealed off the space with Regulations, continuously compressing Ling Han’s space of movement.","When Ling Han no longer had any space to dodge, he could only face the Imperial Sons head-on, and fight the ten Saints all by himself. Was there any need to speak of the result?","Chi Menghan couldn’t help but feel worried. Her fists were already clenched tightly.","“Sister-in-law, don’t worry,” the large black dog said with a smile. “Little Han has never fought a battle that he’s not confident in, so don’t worry.”","Actually, Chi Menghan also believed in Ling Han, but seeing how intense the battle was, she couldn’t help but worry.","More importantly, how was Ling Han going to turn the tables?"]},{"number":4621,"title":"Chapter 4621: Destroy you all","paragraphs":["Chapter 4621: Destroy you all","It had to be admitted that Ling Han had created too many miracles.","When he was only a Sect Master, he was already capable of defeating all Venerates. After becoming a Venerate, he possessed strength that could match Saints. He was a freak.","Thus, even if Ling Han was at a disadvantage right now, and no one could imagine that he had any chance of turning the tables, as long as he hadn’t admitted defeat or been defeated, everyone would still feel uncertain.","Perhaps... he was going to perform another miracle.","However, he really should not have any more trump cards left.","This was a Great Emperor Mystery Realm, so it was impossible to use the ley lines. In other words, this crippled Ling Han’s strongest ability in formations.","Thus, everyone wracked their brains, but still could not think of any possibility for Ling Han to turn the tables.","This time, he should really be at his wit’s end.","The ten Saints continued to increase pressure, wanting to deal with Ling Han as soon as possible.","Firstly, it was for the sake of obtaining the treasure trove of the Great Emperor as soon as possible, and secondly, these 10 Saints had actually failed to take down a Venerate after so long. How humiliating!","“Ling Han, you had best admit defeat obediently!” Han Yun said with a smile. At this moment, he finally felt like everything was under control.","Who knows, he might even be able to take advantage of the opening to kill Ling Han.","Thinking of this tempting possibility, he couldn’t help but help but feel a killing intent rise up in his heart.","Ling Han shook his head with a smile, “Do you guys think that this is my full battle prowess?”","He channelled the four pinnacle pillars, and instantly, a space under his absolute control was created.","Within the range covered by the four pinnacle pillars, he was the ruler of everything.","Weng!","To his surprise, he discovered that the dimensions in his body were actually cooperating with the four pinnacle pillars. Endless power of life surged out, further increasing the might of the four pinnacle pillars.","This had not happened before.","Could it be that this was the effect of the Divine Stone that he had absorbed?","After he absorbed it, there was not the slightest bit of change. He could barely sense any changes, but at this moment, Ling Han was certain that this was the effect of that stone.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The attacks shot over, yet were unable to break through the space that the four pinnacle pillars had stretched out.","All the Saints were rendered speechless with shock.","They had all come up from the Fourth Extreme, so they naturally knew that the four pinnacle pillars could hold up the sky, and could boost battle prowess or defense. However, Ling Han was too terrifying. He had directly set up an absolute domain that even the power of Saints could not break through. This was something that they could not imagine at all.","To say nothing of them, even Ling Han hadn’t expected this.","However, he naturally could only be happy about this.","“Bunch of trash, I’ll crush you all!” Ling Han laughed loudly, and charged towards the ten Saints with the four pinnacle pillars.","Boom!","The attacks of the 10 Saints were completely useless against the space created by the four pinnacle pillars.","Of course, Ling Han also felt that the life force in his body was rapidly being consumed. The price of showing off like this was exorbitant.","But others did not know. They only saw that Ling Han had completely ignored the attacks of the ten Saints, causing their scalps to go numb, and they really wanted to grab their heads and exclaim in shock.","With a thought from Ling Han, he opened a hole in the space created by the four pinnacle pillars, and instantly, Han Yun had entered inside.","It was impossible for him to defeat all 10 Saints in one go. Thus, since he had an absolute defense, he naturally had to defeat them one by one.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","On the outside, the attacks of the nine Saints continued, but they were all blocked by the four pinnacle pillars. And within, Ling Han and Han Yun were fighting one-on-one.","“Come, I’ll give you a chance to defeat me,” Ling Han said calmly. He was calculating in his mind. The power of living beings in the dimensions could still be maintained for about three minutes.","Thus, he could still act cool for three minutes. He had to defeat Han Yun within this time limit.","It was no big deal.","Meanwhile, Han Yun was dumbfounded. How had the situation become like this?","How could he possibly win against Ling Han alone?","It was clear that he was surrounded by companions, yet he felt incredibly lonely.","“Useless trash!” Ling Han sneered, and charged over.","Peng!","What kind of battle prowess did he have? In the first place, he was already superior to Han Yun, and at this moment, Han Yun had completely lost his fighting spirit, so he was naturally even more outmatched.","In just a few dozen moves, Han Yun was completely unable to fight back. If the battle continued, he would definitely die.","That was because he was completely unable to break through the blockade formed by the four pinnacle pillars.","This caused a chill to rise up in the hearts of all the Saints.","It should be known that Saints were very difficult to kill. This was a publicly acknowledged fact. Thus, if one could not kill a Saint, it was best not to offend him too deeply. Otherwise, if he was targeted by a Saint every day, that would really be extremely terrible.","But now?","Ling Han was actually capable of trapping a Saint!","He was only a Venerate. If this guy became a Saint, then wouldn’t he be able to kill any Saint he wanted?","How could the Saints not feel a chill in their hearts?","Saints were transcendent beings, and even One Star Saints didn’t need to fear nine-star Saints at all. Even if they couldn’t defeat them, they could still flee. They had a wide path of retreat.","Hiss!","“Humph, selfish person, you still dare to commit violence?” The Qiantian Saint humphed coldly, brandishing his Saint Tool as he charged over.","Boom!","With a loud bang, the four pinnacle pillars instantly crumbled.","Though this was awesome, its might was not without limits. After all, Ling Han was only a Three Star Venerate.","Han Yun could be said to have escaped from the clutches of death, and hurriedly slipped back into the ranks of the Imperial Clan elites. Now, he did not dare to battle Ling Han again.","Ling Han frowned and said, “Old geezer, do you still have any shame?”","“Insignificant brat, you actually dare to insult me!” The Qiantian Saint brandished his Saint Tool, and struck out at Ling Han.","A Four-Star Saint added with a Saint Tool, his battle prowess was at least five stars.","Boom!","With this strike, Ling Han was instantly sent flying. He was completely outmatched.","It could not be helped. In terms of power, he was far too inferior.","If a Saint was shameless, he was invincible in this world!","The Qiantian Saint attacked madly with an advantage of at least two stars of battle prowess. Though Ling Han tried his best to parry, there was nothing he could do.","The four pinnacle pillars were also useless. The gulf between their battle prowess was far too great, and they were completely unable to block a single strike from the Qiantian Saint.","This time, Ling Han should have lost all hope.","No one could think of any other trump card that Ling Han could have up his sleeve. He was really at the end of his rope.","“Old b@stard!” Ling Han’s eyes were cold. Previously, he had always been targeted by the Imperial Clans. This time, he had even helped the Living Realm obtain 27 galaxies, which could be considered a great merit.","But how had the Imperial Clans treated him?","Since you guys are so shameless, then I will kill all of you and turn the world upside down!","With a thought from Ling Han, he stimulated the power of belief on the stone statue, allowing it to enter his body.","“Scram!” he shouted loudly, and shot out a fist, directly facing the Qiantian Saint.","F***, where did you get such courage from?","Everyone was stunned. A Saint was difficult to kill, and that was not how you were supposed to do it.","If they were so determined to seek death, Saints could also die very quickly.","Meanwhile, the Qiantian Saint smirked coldly. As he brandished the Saint Tool, it ruthlessly smashed towards Ling Han.","Since Ling Han was so determined to seek death, he didn’t mind sending him on his way.","Peng!","The two of them clashed head-on. However, a scene that caused everyone’s eyes to pop out appeared, and they saw that the attack that the Qiantian Saint had shot out had actually shattered like a mirror.","What!","Ling Han penetrated deeply, and as his fist blasted out, thirty seven-star Regulations were entwined around it... as well as five eight-star Regulations!","Gods.","How was this possible?"]},{"number":4622,"title":"Chapter 4622: Kill All","paragraphs":["Chapter 4622: Kill All","Eight-star Regulations!","Ling Han could actually channel eight stars Regulations?","Hold on, he had become a Saint?","That’s not right. Just now, he had clearly shot out four pinnacle pillars, which clearly meant that he was still a Venerate.","Moreover, after becoming a Saint, when the holy flame burned, no matter what, there would still be a sliver of aura surging, but on Ling Han, there really was not the slightest bit of Saint-level aura.","If it was claimed that Ling Han was a Saint, no one would believe it.","However, since he wasn’t a Saint, how could he use eight-star Regulations? Moreover, it wasn’t just one, but five!","Boom! With a single strike, the Qiantian Saint was instantly sent flying, his Saintly blood spraying through the air.","This was a Four-Star Saint! Now, even he was no match for Ling Han?","Ling Han took advantage of his victory to follow up with a barrage of punches.","Kill, kill, kill, these hypocrites, what was the point of them living?","The present him was equivalent to being able to unleash eight flashes of eight-star Regulations, which was far superior to the Qiantian Saint. Even if the latter had a Saint Tool in his hands, he was still no match, and in Ling Han’s hands, he was like a toy.","This rendered Ding Shu and the others speechless. One had to realize that when Ling Han had battled Yang Yihuan and the others, he clearly hadn’t possessed such battle prowess.","Only a few days had passed, so how could Ling Han’s strength have increased so explosively?","“Enough!” The Xuan Huo Saint moved. He raised a palm and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","He was an eight-star Saint, and he had mastered as many as 12 eight-star Regulations. Thus, just how terrifying was the power of his casual attack?","Ling Han didn’t dare to face it head-on, and hurriedly dodged. Otherwise, it would really be a suicidal action.","Boom!","This strike was like a river, forcibly splitting the underground space into two.","Ling Han stood on one side, while the Qiantian Saint stood on the other.","The might of a single strike was actually so terrifying.","The Qiantian Saint was utterly humiliated. He was a Saint of the older generation, and had lived for hundreds of thousands of years. Yet, he had almost been beaten to burst by a Venerate that had yet to become a Saint. How could he accept this?","Everyone sighed ruefully. Could it be that the level of Ling Han’s counterattack had already leaped from the level of the Golden Generation to the level of the Saints of the older generation?","It should be known that after the Qiantian Saint, it was Xuan Huo Saint and the other eight or nine-star Saints’ turn. These were also the supreme elites that the various Imperial Clans had.","“You want a beating too?” Ling Han stared at Xuan Huo Saint, his eyes filled with killing intent.","At this moment, he didn’t want to feign civility with the Imperial Clans anymore.","He was too displeased. He just wanted to kill someone.","The Xuan Huo Saint couldn’t help but shiver in anger. He was an eight-star Saint, so how long had he been alive for?","700,000 years!","To say nothing of newly advanced Saints like the Golden Generations and the others, even the Qiantian Saint would have to pay his respects when he saw him.","Now that Ling Han was treating him with such disdain, he was naturally filled with killing intent.","“You’re seeking death!” he humphed, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han.","This place was a cage, and it was the best opportunity to kill Ling Han.","—If this young prodigy was not eliminated, would the Golden Generation have any chance of becoming Emperor?","“Old b@stard, I will beat out all your teeth!” Ling Han humphed lightly. Who cares!","‘Come!’","He extracted the power of belief from the damaged stone statue at all costs. After this, the stone statue would be completely destroyed, and could no longer be used. However, being boosted by such a majestic power of belief, Ling Han’s battle prowess would also reach a terrifying level.","Weng, multiple streaks of golden light appeared, enshrouding Ling Han. They intertwined to form what looked like Battle Armor, and there were seals flickering within the golden light, densely packed together.","“F***!”","“Power of belief!”","“Heavens, how could there be such pure, dense power of belief?”","“A Saint would definitely not be able to condense this kind of power of belief!”","Everyone exclaimed in shock, as if they had seen a ghost.","“I understand!”","“I understand as well!”","A considerable number of people immediately nodded repeatedly, realization dawning on their faces.","“No wonder Ling Han can use the eight-star Regulations, because he has the blessing of the power of belief.”","“But the problem is, without becoming a Saint, how can one use the power of belief?”","“This is probably his freakishness.”","“No, no, no. Previously, when he was fighting Yang Yihuan and the others, it was obvious that he was still unable to use the power of belief. Furthermore, this power of belief is too dense and too pure. It is not something that a Saint can condense at all!”","“It’s the Great Emperor!”","“This guy has really obtained the inheritance of the Great Emperor!”","Everyone no longer had any doubts. Ling Han must have obtained the treasures left behind by the Great Emperor. Otherwise, how could he suddenly be able to use the power of belief?","Peng!","The Xuan Huo Saint’s attack landed on Ling Han’s golden armor, yet it was completely ineffective. It was as if it had been absorbed.","Ling Han threw another punch. It was clearly still very far away, but a golden streak shot out, as if it was a God Tool, slashing towards the Xuan Huo Saint.","Gods!","Everyone could clearly see that this whip was actually formed from nineteen streaks of eight-star Regulations.","His lifespan was nearing its end; how was he supposed to block this?","The Xuan Huo Saint also paled in fright. After becoming a Saint for so many years, this was definitely the greatest danger he had ever encountered.","Nineteen flashes of eight-star Regulations were enough to kill any Saint.","He hurriedly fled, not daring to face it head-on.","“Old b@stard, where do you think you’re going!” Ling Han chased after him. He didn’t care about anything else, and started a massacre.","You guys want to kill me? Fine, I’ll send you on your way first!","“So what if it is the Imperial Clans?”","“Die!”","The Xuan Huo Saint ran as fast as he could, yet there were far too many Imperial Sons here. Which of them was faster than Ling Han?","Boom, the golden ribbon swept past. This was a web of nineteen eight-star Regulations, which was indescribably terrifying.","Pa! Pa! Pa!","In this Great Emperor Mystery Realm, even Saints were unable to tear a rip into space and flee. They were trapped, and instantly, a considerable number of Imperial Sons were killed.","“That’s right. So what if you’re a member of the Imperial Clan? You think your d*ck is larger?” the large black dog shouted.","This!","As the Saints fled for their lives, they were also muttering in their minds. This dog was truly despicable. He was far too crude and vulgar.","Ling Han almost laughed out loud in anger. F***, he was just killing in all directions, so don’t suddenly ruin the atmosphere at this time.","But in the next instant, he once again turned into a god of death, and began a mad massacre.","With the blessing of the power of belief, he was completely invincible.","“Ling Han, you’ve gone crazy!”","“We are all the main force of resistance against the Yin souls. If you massacre us like this, you will push the Living Realm into an abyss of no return!”","“Stop!”","The Saints all shouted loudly, wanting to use righteousness to force Ling Han to stop.","Meanwhile, Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “How laughable! Speaking of resisting the invasion of the Netherworld, how can your combined merits compare to mine? In terms of future potential, you people aren’t even worthy of being mentioned in the same breath as me!”","“When you guys were fighting just now, why didn’t you mention the Netherworld?”","“Bunch of selfish people, what’s the point of living?”","“All of you, die!”","Ling Han attacked mercilessly.","How many Yin souls had he killed?","With the boost of Destructive Energy, aside from Ding Shu and the others, who else was qualified to compare to him?","And as long as he became a Saint, he would definitely be able to possess the power of Pseudo-Emperor. At that time, when all the Saints were added together, would they be as useful as him alone?","‘So, since you people want to kill me regardless of the big picture, why should I be trapped and helpless?’"]},{"number":4623,"title":"Chapter 4623: The Saints’ Death Day","paragraphs":["Chapter 4623: The Saints’ Death Day","This day could be called the Saints’ Death Day.","A large number of Saints were mercilessly killed by Ling Han. Practically all the Golden Generation Saints were killed, and only a limited few managed to escape.","“Ling Han, you will be punished by the heavens!” the Xuan Huo Saint shouted.","“Humph, what right do you have to represent the Heavenly Dao?” Ling Han charged out from underground, the power of belief continuously surging into his body. He had a shield of power of belief, and even an eight-star Saint would not be able to break through it.","Moreover, he could unleash 19 eight-star Regulations with a single strike. So what if he was a nine-star Saint? Would he be able to withstand such an attack?","At this moment, Ling Han was absolutely invincible among Saints.","If the Pseudo-Emperor didn’t appear, who could compete with him?","Right until they charged out of the outermost wall, did the power of belief finally separate from Ling Han.","He couldn’t borrow any more power.","Ling Han remained calm and collected. There was still a remnant golden shield on him, and it was completely capable of scaring people.","All the Saints were already terrified by him, so who else dared to step forward?","“Let’s go,” Ling Han whispered.","The large black dog understood his meaning. Ling Han was already putting on a strong front, and now he was just bluffing.","“Brats, not one of you can fight. Grandpa Dog won’t play with you guys anymore.” It tore open space, and everyone prepared to retreat.","Hu!","Seeing that they were about to leave, the remaining Saints all gasped for breath.","Thankfully, they were still alive.","However, only an instant later, realization dawned on them.","F***, with Ling Han’s personality, in a situation when he had the absolute advantage, would he just run like that?","Thus, there was only one possibility.","That was, Ling Han was already spent, and it was impossible for his battle prowess to recover.","However, there was already a rip torn in the Void, and Ling Han and the others could leave with a single step. It was already too late to stop them.","F***!","This was the Ancestral King City, yet Ling Han had unleashed a massacre. In a single battle, more than thirty Saints had died, and the majority of them were Golden Generation Saints.","What kind of concept was this?","The Golden Generation were the most talented clansmen of the Imperial Clans. Even though they were only One Star Saints at this moment, as long as they were given enough time, they could basically reach the height of eight or nine stars in the future.","But now?","Ling Han had almost massacred all of them, and there were practically not many left.","This was really a life-or-death enmity!","However, they could only watch helplessly as Ling Han left. This was really enough to drive them crazy.","“Little friend, please wait for a moment.” A voice suddenly rang out.","Yi?","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. He immediately stopped in his tracks.","Ge Qianqiu!","“Senior Ge?” Ling Han looked towards the sidelines, and saw the Void ripped open, and an old man walked out.","Who else could it be but Ge Qianqiu?","“Hehe, that’s me.” Ge Qianqiu was dressed in coarse hemp clothing, and looked extremely plain and ordinary.","“Ling Han!” the large black dog urged. To say nothing of the fact that a Nine-Star Saint could appear at any moment, they were no match even for the remaining Saints here.","Ling Han smiled, “It’s fine.”","F***, who was Ge Qianqiu? In the past, he was someone that could contend with a Great Emperor. Even if he had not become Great Emperor in the end, he must still be astonishingly strong. At least, he was sure to be a Nine Star Saint.","Thus, the old man had called him back, so how could he just watch helplessly as he was ganged up on by everyone?","Hearing Ling Han say this, Brother Monkey and the others also stopped.","They believed in Ling Han.","Ling Han looked towards Ge Qianqiu, and took the initiative to ask, “Senior Ge, have you come for Xuan Taiyu, the Great Emperor Xuan?”","He didn’t know Xuan Taiyu’s title, so he could only address him by surname.","Ge Qianqiu revealed a smile, “You have indeed obtained Xuan Taiyu’s inheritance!”","“Actually, it’s nothing much,” Ling Han said honestly. It was just a single rock, though it had strengthened his inner world, and caused it to have some kind of indescribable resonance with the four pinnacle pillars. Besides that, it was only some historical information.","However, the latter was not beneficial for increasing his strength.","Ge Qianqiu sighed, “I know that it would be abnormal if you could obtain some kind of treasure.”","Yi, it sounded like this old man seemed to know about what had happened back then.","“Senior, may I know what era the Great Emperor Cuan belonged to?” Ling Han asked curiously, because this was also closely related to him.","“How dare you, Ling Han!” At this moment, the Xuan Huo Saint suddenly spoke up.","Wasn’t this underestimating the Imperial Clans?","If you directly ran, then there was nothing that could be done. However, now, they were actually having a casual chat here. Wasn’t this just another slap to the faces of the Imperial Clans?","Fine, since you’re not leaving, then don’t leave.","“Surrender your life!” The Xuan Huo Saint moved, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Since they had left the Great Emperor Mystery Realm, Ling Han was still that Ling Han. He only possessed a battle prowess of four stars, and even if he could use Saint-level formations, it was still completely impossible for him to match an eight-star Saint like him.","Ge Qianqiu?","Hehe, this was an unknown Saint, so what need was there for him to take him to heart?","Ge Qianqiu sighed, “Why is there always someone who doesn’t know what’s good for them, and insists on forcing this old man to make a move?”","He also unleashed a palm strike. Peng! Xuan Huo Saint was instantly sent stumbling back.","Gods!","Instantly, everyone felt their scalps go numb. A dignified eight-star Saint was actually no match for this mysterious old man?","This... was a nine-star Saint!","Who would have thought that this old geezer that had randomly popped out would actually be the practically greatest level of strength in the world, a nine-star Saint?","The Xuan Huo Saint also gritted his teeth. He had been no match for this attack, but he hadn’t suffered any injuries either. However, how could he be so unlucky? He had actually encountered a nine-star Saint!","It should be known that not every Imperial Clan possessed such an existence. Added together, there would not be more than the sum of the fingers on two hands.","There was no need to think about the Holy Lands, unless it was something like the Nine Suns Saint, an existence that had been able to contend with the Great Emperor in the past. Otherwise, without the help of the Imperial Scroll, how could one possibly cultivate to nine stars?","Thus, Xuan Huo Saint was extremely astonished when he discovered that Ge Qianqiu was actually a nine-star Saint.","However, he did not lose his temper. Instead, a cold smirk appeared at the corners of his lips.","This was because the eight-star and nine-star Saints from the Imperial Clans were rushing over.","—Even if the nine-star Saint did not arrive, four to five eight-star Saints working together would be enough to stand against a nine-star Saint.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Space was continuously torn apart, and multiple white-haired Saints walked out.","These were really the old Saints. All of them had lived for at least 700,000 years, and were close to the end of their lives.","However, even if they still had 10,000 years to live, that was still an incredibly long time. It was enough time for them to render fear in others.","“Friend, you can leave now,” a nine-star Saint said.","He was an old Saint of the Baili Clan, and his title was Three Waters.","Ge Qianqiu couldn’t help but smile, “If I want to leave, I will. If I want to stay, I will. Who needs approval?”","How domineering!","Everyone sighed internally. A nine-star Saint was indeed awesome. Even in the face of so many high-level Saints, he was still completely unfazed.","Meanwhile, Ling Han knew this better than anyone else. This person had competed with the Great Emperor before, so how could he not be domineering?","It could be said that the fact that Ge Qianqiu hadn’t become Emperor was perhaps not because his natural talent was inferior, but rather because he had been slightly unlucky.","The Three Waters Saint couldn’t help but raise his white brows. If time had been reversed by two to three hundred years, at that time, Buddha Doga, the Master of Yin River, and the others had not appeared, nine-star Saints were definitely the strongest in the world.","And now, he had encountered provocation.","“You’re seeking death!” He moved, and grabbed out at Ge Qianqiu. His demonic palm blotted out the skies, enshrouding Ling Han, the large black dog and the others."]},{"number":4624,"title":"Chapter 4624: Pseudo-Emperor Ge Qianqiu","paragraphs":["Chapter 4624: Pseudo-Emperor Ge Qianqiu","Just how terrifying was the attack of a Nine-Star Saint?","In an era when there was no Emperor in the world, this was practically the strongest battle prowess in the universe. With a single palm strike, it was guaranteed that he would be able to directly shatter a star.","Who could stop him?","All the Imperial Clans smirked coldly. Previously, they had not been able to do anything to Ling Han, because Ling Han already possessed the power of a Saint. If he wanted to flee, he could. Even a Nine-Star Saint would not be able to stop him.","But this time, Ling Han was actually so stupid as to stay behind.","Hehe, did he think that old geezer would be able to block a nine-star Saint?","Even if he could, so what? How many nine-star Saints and eight-star Saints were there here?","The combined efforts of these supreme elites of the current era had already sealed off the space. There was absolutely no way that Ling Han could tear a rip into the Void and flee.","Thus, this group of people were now trapped.","Just wait for death.","Ge Qianqiu shook his head, and casually waved his palm, saying, “Get lost!”","His words were equivalent to law!","Peng! The Three Waters Saint was sent flying with a single strike, and he instantly disappeared into space, becoming a tiny dot in the distance.","‘Holy f*ck!’","In an instant, everyone was dumbfounded.","What was going on here?","What kind of battle prowess was this?","‘F*ck!’","Even Ling Han hadn’t expected this. At first, he was stunned, then realization dawned on him.","This old man was a Pseudo-Emperor!","Otherwise, Old Man Ge’s natural talent in cultivation would be extremely awesome, just like Ling Han, possessing Pseudo-Emperor-level battle prowess when he was only a Saint. Otherwise, how could he have sent a nine-star Saint flying with a single palm strike?","As a kickass big shot that could compete with Xuan Taiyu, there didn’t seem to be any problem for him to become a Pseudo-Emperor, right?","Just like how Buddha Doga had fought with the Ancestral Buddha for the throne. In the end, he had also become the Pseudo-Emperor, and had even lived a second life.","At this moment, the entire universe was completely silent.","Pseudo-Emperor!","When there was no Emperor in the world, this was the true supreme elite.","The Imperial Clans?","Hehe, even with the protection of the Imperial Formation and the Imperial Weapon, they would probably only be able to just barely hide in the ancestral grounds, living in a state of anxiety, right?","With the word ‘Emperor’, it meant invincibility.","“Greetings, Lord Pseudo-Emperor!” Soon, one after another, people paid their respects to Ge Qianqiu.","In the cultivation world, respect for strength was the most important. So what if he was a Saint? In front of a Pseudo-Emperor, he was trash.","Just think about Buddha Doga. Just how many Saints had he killed?","In front of the Pseudo-Emperors, Saints didn’t even have the chance to escape.","More and more people bowed their heads and paid their respects to Ge Qianqiu, though none of them knew the exact origins of this old man. Only those who had participated in the trip to the Island of the Sky would have some slight information about this old man.","Ge Qianqiu waved them off casually, “Step down. This old man wants to discuss some matters with young friend Ling.”","He was still as calm as always, not putting on any airs at all, but since he had already shown the battle prowess of a Pseudo-Emperor, then his words were like law decrees that everyone had to obey strictly?","Did he really think that a Pseudo-Emperor was all that amicable?","Which person who could cultivate to this cultivation level was not resolute and decisive?","All the Saints retreated, especially those eight-star and nine-star Saints from the Imperial Clans. They had come excitedly, yet left with their tails between their legs. This was really a slap to their faces.","They all sighed ruefully. Was Ling Han that hard to kill?","Previously, when Saints and even Venerates couldn’t even be bothered to look directly at Ling Han, Buddha Doga showed his concern for Ling Han, and even helped him resolve a few dangerous situations.","It should be known that if it was not for the fact that they were wary of Buddha Doga, they would have long since sent elites to kill Ling Han.","But now?","Another Ge Qianqiu appeared, and he was also extremely friendly towards Ling Han.","At this moment, would the Imperial Clans still dare to attack Ling Han?","At the very least, it was impossible that high-level Saints would be mobilized to bully the weak. Otherwise, if Ge Qianqiu was angered... hoho, if a Pseudo-Emperor had killing intent, just how terrifying would that be?","Could even the Imperial Formation block the Pseudo-Emperor?","No one knew.","Firstly, there were really too few Pseudo-Emperors, and secondly, no Imperial Clan would be so foolish to really offend a Pseudo-Emperor, so no one knew how long the Imperial Formation could block a Pseudo-Emperor for.","It could be one year or ten years, or it could be endless, or it could only be one day or half a day.","“Are we just going to allow this boy to grow just like that?”","“He killed the most outstanding Imperial Sons of our clans!”","“But... what can be done?”","All the Saints were also helpless. There was no one in this world that would just suffer a beating without fighting back. However, even if they fought back, they still had to abide by the rules. If they bullied the weak with their superior strength, they would definitely become a topic of gossip. Most importantly, there were even two Pseudo-Emperors keeping an eye on them!","Though neither Buddha Doga nor Ge Qianqiu had said anything about whether or not they were allowed to make a move on Ling Han, but just based on the attitude that they showed towards Ling Han, what Imperial Clan would dare to mess around?","The problem was that Ling Han was too freakish. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, who could be a match for him?","In fact, even lower level Saints could only be swept aside.","If it was a fair battle, and Ling Han was severely wounded or even killed in fact, then it was guaranteed that Buddha Doga and Ge Qianqiu would have nothing to say. And if it was a fair battle, then there were two indicators. The first was that their cultivation levels were equal. This was naturally a fair battle.","And there was another... that was of the same age.","Could they find someone like that?","All the Saints shook their heads. Ling Han was invincible among his peers, and had even swept aside all king tiers under 10,000 years old. Finding an opponent that could fight him fairly was really as difficult as ascending the heavens.","“Er... are we still going to give him the resources that we agreed on?” a Saint asked.","When these words fell, the Saints were naturally even more vexed.","F***, this was a moral kidnapping, causing them to promise Ling Han cultivation resources, but this guy had just gone on a killing spree, killing a great many Imperial Sons, and they still had to “reward” this enemy with cultivation resources?","Wouldn’t they go crazy from anger?","Initially, they naturally ignored this matter. Who asked them to be the victims?","However, with the addition of Ge Qianqiu... they were stuck in a dilemma.","Pseudo-Emperor!","“We wil!” an old Saint said, pinching his nose.","“We’ve already said it. It’s impossible that we won’t give them, but try to give as little as possible.”","“That’s the only way.”","All the Saints looked livid. They were Imperial Clan elites, and it had always been them that would be bullying others. When had they ever suffered such a vexation?","It couldn’t be helped. Who asked Ling Han to have Pseudo-Emperors on his side?","...","On Ling Han’s side, Old Man Ge casually strolled around the Heavenly Mother Planet. Ling Han followed behind him. Meanwhile, Brother Monkey, the large black dog, and the others tactfully didn’t follow.","“Do you have a lot of questions?” the old man suddenly asked.","Ling Han nodded honestly and without reservations. He did indeed have too many questions.","“Ask away. I’ll tell you everything I know,” Ge Qianqiu said with a nod.","That’s nice; he could finally solve too many unsolved mysteries.","However, Ling Han faltered for a moment. Because he had too many questions, he didn’t know where to begin at this moment.","After a long while, he asked, “Why has Senior not made a move all this while?”","If a Pseudo-Emperor made a move, what was the Skeleton Saint Tool worth?","Ge Qianqiu sighed, “That’s because of the balance.”","“Because of those existences in the Yin River, Blood Sea, and other danger zones?” Ling Han asked."]},{"number":4625,"title":"Chapter 4625: Twelve Lands of Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 4625: Twelve Lands of Death","“That’s right.” Ge Qianqiu nodded, “If we don’t make a move, they won’t either. This is a fragile balance, but for the moment, it won’t be broken.”","Ling Han nodded in understanding. These rulers of danger zones pushed for the Yin souls to invade, so they definitely couldn’t sit by and watch. It was just that it wasn’t time for them to enter the arena yet.","At that time, it would definitely be a terrifying battle. It was unknown whether the Living Realm would be able to continue existing.","“Who exactly are these rulers of these lands of death?” Ling Han asked.","Ge Qianqiu pondered for a moment before replying, “Actually, I’m not sure either. This is because I’m not qualified to participate in such battles. When the ruler of the sea of blood and the others invaded, I was only a Saint. Only Xuan Taiyu faced them alone.”","Hold on!","Ling Han faltered for a moment before asking, “The rulers of these lands invaded a long time ago?”","“That’s right.” Ge Qianqiu nodded.","Ling Han was slightly confused, and he asked, “Even the Great Emperor is unable to kill them?”","The invasion had definitely been pacified. Otherwise, the Living Realm would have long since ceased to exist. However, the problem was that even the Great Emperor was unable to kill these rulers of these lands of peril. F***, these guys were really too awesome, weren’t they?","The appearance of the Great Emperor was synonymous with invincibility. He would be able to suppress an era, right until he died of old age.","Ge Qianqiu shook his head, “When these rulers of the Lands of Death battle, they have the support of the Land of Death behind them. No matter how heavy their injuries are, they can immediately heal. Furthermore, though I had not witnessed it at that time, I am sure that they are all Pseudo-Emperors. In fact, they are just a sliver away from becoming Emperor.”","“There are a total of 12 such rulers of the Twelve Lands of Death, and together with countless Yin Saints, they ganged up on Xuan Taiyu.”","“Although Xuan Taiyu finally pacified the invasion, he also suffered serious injuries. To say nothing of not being able to live a second life, in fact, not long after the battle ended, he couldn’t control his injuries and forcibly collapsed.”","Although the old man’s words were simple, incomparably tragic scenes appeared in Ling Han’s mind.","Xuan Taiyu, this Great Emperor... could practically be said to have died in battle!","The invincible Great Emperor had actually died in battle?","How could this be believed?","How could anyone accept this?","Pseudo-Emperors, no matter how awesome they were, they still had the word “Pseudo” in it. Could twelve Pseudo-Emperors compensate for the gap in power? Even if they were practically immortal existences.","Furthermore, twelve?","Ling Han counted, and there seemed to be only six danger zones that had appeared now, right? Did that mean that there were still six danger zones that had yet to appear?","Hold on, Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, and the others all corresponded to a particular Land of Death, right?","So, now, there were actually seven danger zones that had already appeared?","“Senior, could these rulers of the Lands of Death be the sons of Great Emperors?” Ling Han asked. That was because he was certain that those like Di Wuji and Tong Ming were definitely the sons of Great Emperors.","Ge Qianqiu nodded, “This old geezer also has that deduction, but also can’t quite figure it out. The Demon Wolf Imperial Clan and Black Sunflower Imperial Clan clearly already exist in this world, so why would there suddenly appear an inheritance from a Land of Death?”","Moreover, they had actually caused serious damage to Pseudo-Emperors or even a Great Emperor, and even the Great Emperor was unable to kill them?","Ling Han still felt like he was in a dream.","Could it be that Xuan Taiyu hadn’t stabilized his cultivation level of Great Emperor at that time, and his cultivation level hadn’t reached the level of a true Great Emperor?","“Senior, which era did the Great Emperor Xuan belong to?” Ling Han asked.","Ge Qianqiu smiled, and said slowly, “The one closest to the present generation.”","What!","Ling Han suddenly recalled that a great battle had once erupted in tens of millions of years, causing a lapse in history.","Could it be?","“At that time, Xuan Taiyu had just become Emperor, and he hadn’t even forged an Imperial Weapon yet, much less created an Imperial Scroll, when the rulers of the Twelve Lands of Death started a great war,” Ge Qianqiu said.","“I believe that if Xuan Taiyu was given a few hundred years’ time, the outcome of the battle would be completely different.”","The old man sighed, appearing very regretful.","He and Xuan Taiyu could be considered lifelong rivals, but at the same time, they were also friends who appreciated each other’s talent.","No wonder.","At least, it could just barely explain Xuan Taiyu’s death in the end. This Great Emperor didn’t even leave behind an inheritance.","“Young friend Ling, in this generation, it will be up to you.” Ge Qianqiu looked at Ling Han smilingly, “The rulers of the Lands of Death are restless again. I guess that in the battle with Xuan Taiyu, they too suffered a massive blow, and have been recuperating all this while. And now, they are about to recover completely.”","“When that time comes, that scene from tens of millions of years ago will repeat itself.”","The pressure was huge.","Ling Han smiled, and said, “Senior is already a Pseudo-Emperor, so your hopes of becoming Emperor should be far above mine.”","Yet Ge Qianqiu shook his head, “I have already fought for it once. Without good fortune on my side, no matter how many times I try, there is no way I can become Emperor.”","Going by that theory, Buddha Doga couldn’t possibly become Emperor, right?","They only had two Pseudo-Emperors on their side, while the Netherworld had twelve on their side. What kind of gaping gulf was this?","Ling Han nodded. He had to become Emperor!","Although Ge Qianqiu was a Pseudo-Emperor, he had already lost the possibility of taking one step further. The only thing he could do now was impede the Lords of the Lands of Death, preventing them from making a move on Ling Han, giving Ling Han time and space to grow.","“Go on,” Ge Qianqiu said. “This old geezer wants to reminisce about my old friend.”","“All right.”","Ling Han returned to meet up with Brother Monkey and the others. He first returned to Nine Suns Holy Land.","When he returned, he related his conversation with Ge Qianqiu. Everyone was stunned, and similarly felt a mountain of pressure.","Pseudo-Emperor ... as many as twelve! In fact, these Pseudo-Emperors were strong to the point of being able to take down a Great Emperor.","“So the weakening of the North Heavenly Realm is actually due to the great war between Xuan Taiyu and these rulers of the Lands of Death!” Realization dawned on all of them.","The overall level of cultivation of the North Heavenly Realm was lower than other Heavenly Realms. It was said that this had begun tens of millions of years ago. Now that they made a comparion, the answer to this mystery was naturally clear.","Because of the invasion of the Yin souls, it greatly affected the fortune of the North Heavenly Realm. It was despised by Heavenly Realm, so the world of cultivation naturally did not prosper.","“We have to hurry up and cultivate.”","The situation was too tense. Once the Lords of the Twelve Lands of Death recovered from their injuries, and launched an all-out invasion, how would they be able to stop it?","In the past, they had been blocked because a Great Emperor had sacrificed himself. Now, there was no Great Emperor in this world, so how could they be blocked with just two Pseudo-Emperors?","Afterward, there was still good news, because the cultivation resources of the various Imperial Clans were gradually delivered.","However, there was naturally no holy flame inside, so it was impossible for Brother Monkey and the others to benefit.","Moreover, this was originally meant to be gifted to Ling Han — though the members of the various Imperial Clans were all very reluctant.","Ling Han began to refine these resources, and there was still a question in his mind.","That was the Divine Stone.","After the other Great Emperors died, they wouldn’t leave behind any Divine Stone or whatnot, that could actually form an inner world.","Moreover, taking into account Ding Shu and the others, there were a total of seven Genesis Worlds.","This was too strange.","Ling Han didn’t tell Ge Qianqiu, nor did he ask him about it, because the latter definitely wouldn’t know either."]},{"number":4626,"title":"Chapter 4626: Empress","paragraphs":["Chapter 4626: Empress","Ling Han suddenly recalled that in Xuan Taiyu’s memories, he had seen him go to the edge of the universe. In that large fissure, a streak of light had once flown out at an incredibly fast speed.","It was clear that Xuan Taiyu had set off in pursuit, but it was unclear whether he had managed to catch up or not. That was because that was a scene that had flashed past even earlier. It was too fast, and even he had not managed to glimpse it.","So, was this possibly related to the Divine Stone?","Ling Han felt that there was still a need for him to make a trip to the edge of the universe.","Of course, he couldn’t do that now. He had already tried it out with Brother Monkey, but the speed of Saints was still too slow.","However, if he became a Saint, that might not be the case.","If they went to the edge of the universe, firstly, they would have to explore the secrets of that place, and secondly, what if the Battle Saint Emperor and the others had not died, but were merely trapped? Then, if they helped them escape, wouldn’t pacifying the chaos caused by the rulers of the Twelve Lands of Death be a piece of cake?","Even if only the Ancestral King Lingtian and the Battle Saint Emperor appeared, wouldn’t they be able to deal with them?","Ling Han nodded. This was at least a sliver of hope.","He focused on concocting alchemical pills, and ingesting them.","A great volume of Celestial Qi was consumed, and his cultivation level finally began to grow rapidly.","After the limit of three stars, the door to four stars was pushed open without any difficulty. He continued to advance triumphantly, right until he reached the peak stage of four stars, and then took another step, reaching the level of five stars.","However, by this time, he had also used up all his cultivation resources.","After all, only the Donglin Imperial Clan had spared no expense, sending over an ocean’s worth of cultivation resources. However, the other Imperial Clans were only doing this for show.","Sigh, after all was said and done, the Imperial Clans were still selfish.","Ling Han was actually thinking that if some Imperial Clan fully supported him on this matter, even if he wouldn’t repay evil with kindness, he would at least give them face in future and not seek them out for an accounting.","However, the Imperial Clans still had their own plans.","—Who said that you, Ling Han, would definitely be able to become Emperor?","What if their Imperial Son could take this step first? To say the least, wasn’t there still Ding Shu, Origin and the other supreme prodigies? Though they couldn’t compare to Ling Han, they were still very awesome.","So, why did they have to help their enemy grow?","Ling Han nodded. Those Imperial Clans who had completely lost all hope of becoming Emperor should now begin investing in Ding Shu and the others.","He could feel the pressure of time.","Ding Shu and the others were also the Genesis World’s leaders, and their freakish talent was only slightly inferior to his. It was completely possible for them to become Emperor.","Thus, he had to hurry.","The problem was that the cultivation of a Venerate definitely needed Celestial Qi, and something like Celestial Qi really couldn’t be rushed.","Although the Donglin Imperial Clan had promised that they would definitely give Celestial Qi to Ling Han as long as they obtained it, this would still need time.","Three years, five years, or ten years?","It should be known that Ding Shu and the others also had the Genesis World, and possessed an endless supply of power of belief. Furthermore, they themselves had heaven-defying aptitude, so their improvement in Saint Tier was definitely astonishingly fast.","Ling Han started to run all over the universe.","He was looking for a suitable planet to set up a great formation to hook the Celestial Qi.","The more such formations were, the more Celestial Qi they could obtain.","Heaven does not disappoint those who work hard. He had really found some, and laid out multiple super great formations, communicating with the high-level dimensional space to extract Celestial Qi.","However, without an Imperial Weapon as the formation eye, the efficiency wasn’t high. Moreover, they couldn’t extract high-quality Celestial Qi.","It was better than nothing. Furthermore, Ling Han could also concoct the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, which could elevate Celestial Qi by one grade.","All of a sudden, another fifty years passed.","Yang Yihuan and the others had not gone back on their word. They had long since handed over the 27 galaxies. However, only a few years had passed, and these galaxies were once again conquered by the Netherworld. Wherever the Skeleton Saint Tool passed, there was practically no one that could match it.","And now, yet another large area of the Living Realm had fallen.","Some Imperial Clans were even planning ahead, using their great power to move the ancestral planet, heading towards the edge of the universe.","In any case, space was astonishingly large, and there were too many depths.","Unfortunately, even the power of Saints had a limit. At most, they could only move a single planet. Otherwise, with how big the universe was, they were completely capable of playing hide and seek with the Netherworld.","Ling Han cultivated to the end of the fifth minor level of the Fourth Extreme. Very easily, he charged up to six stars.","Good news came one after another. The empress and Hu Niu had respectively become Saints!","This made Ling Han overjoyed, and his only regret was that he was actually still a Venerate. He was falling further and further behind.","However, what could he do? A Venerate relied on the Celestial Qi to cultivate, so he could only take things slowly.","A few days later, the large black dog suddenly came to visit.","“You don’t visit unless there’s something important. Old Black, what’s the matter this time?” Ling Han asked.","“Hehe, that’s a good thing!” the large black dog said. He deliberately kept Ling Han in suspense, and didn’t say it immediately.","“Oh, what good thing?” Ling Han played along.","Only then did the large black dog say, “Recently, a huge piece of news has exploded. An ancient treasure trove of a Great Emperor has appeared.”","Ling Han was unmoved. Hadn’t he gone to Xuan Taiyu’s ancestral site before?","“Little Han, how could this be the same?” The large black dog immediately said, “There is no treasure at all at the place of the Great Emperor Xuan. However, this ancient treasure trove of a Great Emperor is different. It is deliberately left behind by a Great Emperor to their descendants.”","“Then tell me,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“This Great Emperor’s title is Qingzhu!” the large black dog said. “It’s rumored that this Great Emperor ascended Dao from an ordinary bamboo stalk. Moreover, this is an Empress! At that time, her bamboo sword swept through the world, and no one could rival her. She ascended to the throne with her greatest talent.”","“Empress Qingzhu has never been married before, so she naturally didn’t have any descendants.”","“In Empress Qingzhu’s last years, she no longer appeared in public. Thus, after she died, no one knew where she placed her inheritance. In fact, no one knew if it had actually been passed down to the next generation.”","“However, according to a maid by Empress Qingzhu’s side, the Empress glimpsed a terrifying future in her later years, and that was why she didn’t appear in public anymore. She was making arrangements to deal with that terrifying future.”","“Say, isn’t this targeting the invasion from the rulers of the Lands of Death?”","“It is said that this ancient trove has the weapon of the Empress, that bamboo sword that has fought all over the universe!”","“That was created by the Empress from a part of her body. Even among Imperial Weapons, it is still an incredibly powerful existence.”","The large black dog rubbed his hands together, “This must be the Imperial Weapon that was prepared for Grandpa Dog!”","Ling Han smiled. There was already no shortage of Saints in the Nine Suns Holy Land. In fact, they even had anImperial Scroll as their inheritance. If there was any shortcoming, it was that they were missing an Imperial Weapon.","With the Imperial Weapon standing guard, that was the strongest force in the world, capable of both attack and defense.","“Alright, then let’s try our luck,” he said. In any case, extracting Celestial Qi would be fine as long as one left behind a spiritual body.","“Then hurry up. Grandpa Dog heard that many people have already left,” the large black dog urged.","This time, Ling Han naturally brought the empress and Hu Niu with him. However, in the case of Song Lan, she was still very far from reaching Saint Tier. In fact, it was possible that she would never reach Saint Tier in this lifetime, so she naturally stayed behind to guard home.","Just how quick was the speed of a Saint?","However, what surprised Ling Han was that the ancient treasure trove of the Empress was actually not within the four Heavenly Realms. Instead, it was leaning towards the edge of the universe."]},{"number":4627,"title":"Chapter 4627: Liu Xinhe","paragraphs":["Chapter 4627: Liu Xinhe","Of course, the ancient treasure trove of the Empress was far from reaching the edge of the universe. Ling Han and the others had only travelled for half a month, and they had already arrived here.","There should have been no planets here for a long time, but now, a extinguished sun had suddenly appeared there.","On this dimmed sun, a large bamboo forest soared into the sky. Every single one of them was thirty thousand meters tall. One was purple-gold in colour, one was dark green in colour, and one was crimson in colour... they were all of different colours, and had an unusual kind of beauty to them.","Although it was a little strange for a bamboo forest to grow on a sun, it seemed reasonable to think that this was the inheritance of Empress Qingzhu.","“Let’s go.”","Everyone descended, arriving on this extinguished sun.","Instantly, they felt a colossal pressure.","This was Imperial Might!","Everyone could feel that their strength had been suppressed. In fact, they couldn’t even tear open space.","In front of the Great Emperor, so what if he was a Saint? Could he act so wantonly?","Everyone walked slowly. They did not know where the Empress’s treasure trove was. In any case, they had no sense of direction, so they would just walk around casually.","The bamboo forest filled the skies, each of them exuding a faint light, interweaving with this pitch-black universe.","As they walked, everyone discovered that they had actually lost their way.","They were Saints, yet they had actually lost their way. Wasn’t this the biggest joke in the world?","But in truth, this had indeed happened.","It must be the doing of a Great Emperor. Only a Great Emperor would be able to easily play around with a Saint.","They flew up, and arrived in space.","This was not difficult at all. A bamboo forest that was brightly coloured was right in front of their eyes.","They descended again. Then, as they walked, they once again lost their sense of direction.","Everyone decided to move separately.","This place was too big, and it was difficult to determine the direction. There was no need for so many people to gather together. It was completely a huge waste of manpower.","However, the empress, Hu Niu, and Chi Menghan didn’t separate from Ling Han. Instead, they moved together.","The four of them strolled in the bamboo forest. Occasionally, there would be bamboo leaves floating down. It was actually quite romantic.","“Niu wants to eat meat!” After walking for a while, Hu Niu quit.","She refused to leave, determined to eat.","Towards this beautiful wife that was still like a child, Ling Han naturally would not reprimand her. He too sat down, drew out some food, and began to cook.","Not long after, an alluring fragrance wafted out.","Ling Han presently possessed Saint-level battle prowess, so the ingredients he had gotten were naturally top-notch as well. The meat was Holy Beast meat, and there was also tens of millions of years old ginseng on top of it. Not only was the fragrance tempting, it could also spread to very far places.","Hu Niu’s eyes lit up as she stared at the food. It was as if she were about to drool.","No matter how strong she was, no matter whether she was a mother or a great-grandmother, the habit of loving food would never be changed.","“So fragrant, so fragrant!” At this moment, a figure walked out of the bamboo forest. He was tall and slender, and his jet-black hair was unbound. It fluttered lightly in the breeze, and he had an indescribable elegance.","“I have fine wine here. Can we share a meal?”","Hu Niu immediately defended her food, “This is Niu’s, you guys are not allowed to fight over it!”","She glared at the uninvited guest, looking like she was ready to make a move at any moment.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. Cultivators fought for treasures, and only Hu Niu fought for food.","In her eyes, how could the allure of treasure be as great as food?","It was precisely because of this that Hu Niu was so cute.","Ling Han looked towards that person. This was a Saint, but looked to be only in his twenties. His flame of life was also incredibly vigorous. At most, it had been burning for over ten thousand years. For a Saint, this was really too young.","“It’s fine as long as there’s wine. Please sit!” he said with a smile.","Hu Niu was instantly displeased. He was snatching Niu’s food!","However, Ling Han took out raw meat and seasonings again, and began to cook again, causing Hu Niu’s displeasure to immediately disappear.","Ling Han knew Niu well!","That young Saint was also very surprised. He had not thought that Ling Han would take out another portion of ingredients to cook in order to take care of Hu Niu’s emotions.","Interesting.","He smiled slightly, “I am Liu Xinhe.”","Ling Han looked at him. This young man actually gave him a feeling of danger, and through his eye technique, he could clearly see that this was a Three Star Saint.","A Three Star Saint was actually capable of making him feel such a strong sense of danger?","“I am Ling Han,” he nodded.","“Oh, so you are Ling Han?” Liu Xinhe looked slightly surprised, then laughed in spite of herself, “Haha, they have long since given me the information, but I have always forgotten to read it.”","‘Them?’","A thought suddenly occurred to Ling Han, “Brother Liu is from an Imperial Clan?”","“The Seven Luminaries Imperial Clan,” Liu Xinhe didn’t hide the fact.","Yi?","Wasn’t the Golden Generation of the Seven Luminaries Imperial Clan called Liu Yuan?","Moreover, Liu Xinhe was around 10,000 years old. He definitely couldn’t be the Golden Generation. The gulf between them was far too great.","Moreover, even if Liu Yuan had reached the level of Three Star Saint, he could not possibly give Ling Han such a strong feeling of danger.","Thus, Liu Yuan was definitely inferior to this person.","And here was the problem.","The Golden Generation was one of the most outstanding members of the Imperial Clan in history, yet now, an even more talented person had appeared. How could Ling Han not find this strange?","However, Ling Han didn’t ask. This might involve the secret of the Liu Clan, and even if he asked, he might not tell him.","“Yi, isn’t the strongest successor of your Liu Clan Liu Yuan?” Hu Niu was not the scheming type, and asked as she ate.","Alright, Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh.","As Liu Xinhe drew out a wine pot and wine cup, pouring some for Ling Han, she said slowly, “I don’t know about that either. He probably bestowed that title on himself, right?”","This was equivalent to no answer.","Not long after, new food was also prepared.","Ling Han cut open the dried meat, and shared it with Liu Xinhe, the empress and the others. They all began to eat.","“Good wine!” Ling Han took a sip of wine, and couldn’t help but praise in spite of himself.","He already possessed Saint-level abilities, and there was already no wine that could make him taste the alcohol. All of it was too light, but this wine was incredibly fragrant, and with a single sip, it penetrated straight into his bones.","He had a feeling that if he drank to his heart’s content, he would even become drunk.","This was really inconceivable.","As they ate meat, they continued to drink wine, chatting with each other about various topics.","After eating for half an hour, the fine wine and delicacies were all gone.","Liu Xinhe took out tea leaves, and took out a teapot. He began boiling on the spot.","After a while, the water boiled. He steeped some tea for everyone, one after another, and threw in a few tea leaves. There was pitifully little, but the fragrance of the tea assailed their noses, intoxicating them.","Even Hu Niu, who didn’t like to drink tea, sniffed, feeling great craving.","“What tea is this?” Ling Han asked.","“I plucked it from a Saint Tree. There should only be one in this world, right?” Liu Xinhe said casually.","This was precious.","Ling Han and the others all tasted it. As expected, the tea’s fragrance was strong, lingering in their mouths for a long time.","After another long while, the five of them finished their tea.","“Alright, it’s time to get down to business.” Liu Xinhe smiled.","“Come battle.” Ling Han stood up."]},{"number":4628,"title":"Chapter 4628: Contending for a great opportunity","paragraphs":["Chapter 4628: Contending for a great opportunity","The empress and Chi Menghan were both astonished. Hadn’t these two been exchanging toasts and being polite just then? Why had they suddenly come to blows?","However, Ling Han knew that Liu Xinhe represented the Seven Luminaries Imperial Clan. Although he and the Seven Luminaries Imperial Clan weren’t mortal enemies, there was still some animosity between them. Thus, this battle was inevitable.","The empress and the others retreated, leaving enough space for Ling Han and Liu Xinhe.","They knew their man well. Since he said he was going to battle, this battle definitely had to happen.","This was a sun that had been extinguished, and there were no living beings here at all. Thus, there was no need to worry that Saints would start a battle, and destroy the heavens and earth. Furthermore, this was the treasure trove of a Great Emperor, so even if Saints wanted to destroy it, they would have to have the strength.","Liu Xinhe moved, and attacked Ling Han. As he delivered his attack, seven streaks of eight-star Regulations surged.","This was a three-star Saint, and he was actually able to unleash seven flashes of eight-star Regulations with a single strike. This guy was truly powerful, and this might not even be his ultimate battle prowess.","However, Ling Han was now a six-star Venerate.","He could unleash 45 Seven Star Regulations with a single strike, and as they intertwined, they could just barely be considered as five Eight Star Regulations.","Though he was still a whole three Regulations behind, he still had a great many ultimate moves.","The four pinnacle pillars spread out, and Ling Han instantly formed an absolute domain.","As long as the four pinnacle pillars didn’t break, he wouldn’t be injured.","Boom!","The attack landed, and Ling Han was completely unscathed. Instead, he charged forwards with his fists raised, launching an explosive attack at Liu Xinhe.","“Yi, there is actually such four pinnacle pillars?” Liu Xinhe looked surprised. Though he knew that the four pinnacle pillars possessed the ability to defend and attack, he had never heard of such absolute defense.","“However, I don’t believe that there is an invincible defense in this world!” He humphed coldly, and delivered another attack.","A terrifying scene appeared. He actually shot out nine eight-star Regulations.","What!","To say nothing of the empress and the others, even Ling Han was slightly astonished. He hadn’t expected Liu Xinhe to be this powerful.","This kind of talent was not inferior to Lu Xun and the others!","It should be known that Lu Xun and the others were the sons of Great Emperors, and were definitely not weaklings like the so-called Golden Generation.","Boom! With a single strike, cracks instantly appeared on the four pinnacle pillars.","With a thought from Ling Han, a powerful Spiritual Power surged out, and those cracks immediately disappeared.","He already had a guess, and said, “You are not from this era!”","Liu Xinhe smiled slightly, but did not deny it, “That’s right.”","“You’re... the son of the Seven Luminaries Ancestral King!” Ling Han continued.","‘What?’","This surprised the empress and the others. If it was not a Pseudo-Emperor, no one could seal themselves, because they could not make the Primordial Source Clay take effect.","Thus, they had never imagined that Liu Xinhe could actually be the son of a Great Emperor!","Liu Xinhe was also startled. He had not thought that Ling Han would be so bold in guessing, but he immediately smiled, “That’s right. I am the fourth son of Seven Luminaries Ancestral King, and also the youngest son.”","Looks like he was the only one favoured. Otherwise, why was he the only one sealed by the Primordial Source Clay?","Hold on!","“It can’t be that your family still has siblings waiting to come out into the world, right?” Ling Han asked.","Liu Xinhe laughed loudly, then shook his head, “I am the only one who has been arranged to live in this lifetime, and take a gamble on that great fated opportunity. As for the others... Sigh, they have long since disappeared in the long passage of history.”","Even the Great Emperor was not immortal, what more mortals.","Yet Ling Han’s heart skipped a beat, “Fighting for what great opportunity?”","He had always wondered why Lu Xun, Yang Yihuan, and the other ancient king tiers, sons of Great Emperors had to appear in this era. Moreover, they had all come out at the same time. What exactly was the reason for this?","Now, he guessed that this was the “great opportunity” that Liu Xinhe had spoken of. However, what was this great opportunity?","Liu Xinhe smiled slightly, “As for that, it is best to keep it a secret for the moment.”","F***!","Ling Han gave a loud shout, and Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was unleashed. He used all kinds of ultimate moves.","Peng, peng, peng! Energy spread out in all directions, but when it landed on the bamboo forest in the surroundings, whether it was the barrage of power or the Regulations, they were all easily absorbed by the bamboo. At most, it would only make the bamboo stalks brighter. As for the rest... there was no change at all.","As expected of something set up by a Great Emperor.","Liu Xinhe attacked aggressively, using his full power. He was an existence that could deliver nine eight-star Regulations with a single strike. Just how terrifying was that?","Crushing!","However, Ling Han’s toughness was really too good. Though he was at a disadvantage, he kept seizing the chance to counterattack, and was not completely on the back foot.","Unfortunately, formations couldn’t be used here, causing Ling Han to lose a trump card.","After battling for half a day, Liu Xinhe suddenly stopped.","“Why aren’t you fighting anymore?” Ling Han asked. “I haven’t lost yet!”","Liu Xinhe shook his head, “My family begged me for a long time, and only then did I agree to make a move. However, that was all. I did not say that it had to be a life-and-death battle.” He broke into a smile, “Now that we have fought, I have also fulfilled their request.”","Beg?","This was really a good use of the word. Though this guy looked young, and had indeed only lived for about ten thousand years, he was a true king tier from ancient times. No matter which member of the Liu Clan, they would have to address him as Fourth Elder.","However, Ling Han kept feeling that these words were filled with a pretentious air.","“How many ancient Imperial Sons like you are there?” Ling Han asked.","Liu Xinhe stroked his chin, “There should be quite a number. For the sake of this era, there would definitely be a great many Great Emperors that would make arrangements, and leave behind one or two of their most outstanding descendants to appear in this era, so that they could compete.”","See, this guy was showing off, wasn’t he? “Most outstanding descendant”, wasn’t that just praising himself?","Ling Han didn’t expose him. Showing off wasn’t a crime, as long as one had abilities.","“Then, shall we meet again?” Ling Han asked.","“We’ll meet again.” Liu Xinhe nodded, then turned and left.","“What a strange guy,” Hu Niu walked over and said as she looked at where Liu Xinhe had already disappeared. At the same time, she didn’t forget to replenish herself with snacks.","“That’s right, what a strange guy!” Ling Han nodded, his eyes filled with fighting spirit.","In this life, it was destined to be filled with fierce competition.","To say nothing of the Genesis World’s Masters, the descendants of Great Emperors had all popped up now. They all had outstanding natural talent, and had a chance of becoming Great Emperor.","With so many people competing for the only position of Great Emperor, just how intense would it be?","Furthermore, they could contend for the throne in every era, so why did they have to emerge in this lifetime?","Thus, the position of Great Emperor in this lifetime was definitely different from before.","However, the Great Emperor was already invincible in the world, so how could he be any different from the rest?","“Immortality?” This word suddenly skipped through Ling Han’s mind.","Aside from immortality, how else could the Great Emperor of this era be different from the rest?","If he had not guessed wrongly, then it could be explained why so many sons and daughters of Great Emperors had awakened in this lifetime.","Immortality meant being unaging, eternally illuminating history!","That could be called the Number One Emperor of All Eternity, not suppressing an era, but suppressing the whole Timestream.","The empress, Hu Niu, and Chi Menghan were all given a fright. If news of this got out, it would definitely shake the world."]},{"number":4629,"title":"Chapter 4629: Baili Haojie","paragraphs":["Chapter 4629: Baili Haojie","Immortality.","From the moment one was born, who would not pursue immortality?","However, immortality was contrary to the Heavenly Dao. Even the invincible Great Emperor would disappear in the passage of time. There was no existence in this world that could be immortal.","But if that was not the case, what kind of great opportunity would be even greater than becoming Emperor?","—If it was becoming an ordinary Emperor, it was possible for one to become Emperor in any era.","It could be imagined that if it was not for the fact that the Great Emperor could not seal themselves away, it was believed that there would be a great many Great Emperors appearing in this era, fighting over the fated opportunity to attain immortality.","“I don’t know if being born in this era is a blessing or a curse!” Ling Han exclaimed.","In this era, there may be heaven-defying fated opportunities for immortality, but this kind of fated opportunity was destined to only belong to a small number of people. In fact, there was only one person. To the people of the world, they would only be experiencing the storm of intense competition among elites that would amount to nothing.","For example, Ling Han suspected that the invasion of the Netherworld had something to do with immortality.","Otherwise, he really couldn’t think of any reason for Yin souls to interfere.","“No matter what, I have to increase my strength first!” Ling Han immediately strengthened his resolve. At this time, it was useless no matter how hard he thought about it.","Only strength was the true way to go.","The four of them continued onwards, but this bamboo forest seemed to have no end. No matter how they walked, they could not reach the end, or discover the ancient treasure trove of the Empress.","Was this a test from the Great Emperor for future generations?","Ling Han no longer walked casually, but rather observed more closely.","Since the Empress had left behind her inheritance, it was definitely not something that could not be resolved.","Was it the vein-like patterns on the bamboo?","Ling Han looked closely. Every bamboo had veined patterns on them, but they were all different.","However, after studying it for a long time, he came up empty.","Had he gone in the wrong direction?","He observed the planting locations of each bamboo stalk again, trying to find a pattern. However, after more than ten days, he still had no choice but to give up.","—He couldn’t even finish walking through this bamboo forest, so how could he summarize the pattern?","Ling Han racked his brains, but there were too many possibilities. Where exactly should he start?","Hua, the wind blew, and the leaves moved. There was a mysterious rhythm to it.","Yi?","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. Could it be this?","He looked up, capturing the movement of the bamboo leaves. That seemed to conform to some kind of logic, and was incredibly mysterious.","He couldn’t help but begin to simulate the rhythm, and instantly discovered that this was actually a formation technique!","“En?” Before he could study it in depth, he sensed that someone was approaching.","He looked to his left and saw a man in a crimson robe striding over.","This man was very young, and looked to be only in his twenties. However, there was a holy flame flickering in his mind, and it was green in colour at that.","A Five-Star Saint!","However, this person was at most 10,000 years old.","What a young king tier!","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind. The son of a Great Emperor!","Here was another one. Previously, it was Liu Xinhe. Who was it this time?","“Ling Han?” The other spoke first. Though there was a questioning tone in his voice, there was more certainty, as well as a pride that came from deep within his bones.","He was like a True Dragon that roamed the Nine Heavens, and would occasionally look down on the ants on the ground.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “I am Ling Han, and who are you?”","“Me?” A haughty expression appeared on the man’s face, and he said, “I’m Baili Haojie, Great Emperor Ziwei’s eldest son!”","Sure enough, he was the son of a Great Emperor!","This era was really lively. King tiers from various eras appeared one after another.","Ling Han looked at him coldly. This was a member of the Baili Clan, and the enmity between him and the Baili Clan was the deepest. Looks like this could not be resolved peacefully.","“Oh, do you want a battle?” Ling Han smiled faintly.","Meanwhile, Baili Haojie shook his head proudly, “You are unworthy!”","He was the son of the Great Emperor, and he was also a Five Star Saint. In the past, he had also been an existence that no one could match, even if everyone in the whole world fought him. Now, the gap in their cultivation levels was so wide, so he naturally had a very high opinion of himself, and did not take Ling Han seriously at all.","Ling Han wasn’t angered, and he simply shook his head, saying, “You’ve slept for too long, haven’t you? You’re already unable to keep up with the trends!”","“No matter what, you are still a mere Venerate!” Baili Haojie smirked coldly, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han.","He was a Five-Star Saint, and his battle prowess was even more terrifying. His power took the form of a giant hand, which was entwined by ten eight-star Regulations, exuding an endlessly terrifying aura.","In fact, this was only a casual attack from him, but the gap in cultivation level was too wide. This kind of casual attack also possessed the might to crush Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t take it head-on. With a tap of his foot, he rapidly retreated.","“To dare humiliate our Baili Clan, who gave you the courage?” Baili Haojie took advantage of his victory to follow up with another strike. Boom, a terrifying storm was created in the bamboo forest, sweeping towards Ling Han.","The gap in battle prowess was really too wide. Even if Ling Han used the four pinnacle pillars, he still wouldn’t be able to match the other. It would only cause the four pinnacle pillars to shatter at the first instant.","Thus, the only option now was to dodge.","“Don’t you claim to be the number one prodigy in the universe?” Baili Haojie sneered. “What is it? You don’t even dare to take a single strike from me?”","“I am 9783 years old now, and can completely be considered to be of the same age level as you, so I can’t be considered to be bullying the weak!”","“Is that all the courage you have?”","He mocked Ling Han to the extreme, as if he wanted to provoke Ling Han into a bout of youthful rashness, and couldn’t hold himself back from confronting him head-on.","But how could Ling Han possibly fall for it?","Baili Haojie was a Five Star Saint, and this was already terrifying enough. Merely in terms of cultivation level, there were pitifully few people in the world that were superior to him, what more when his natural talent was outstanding, and his battle prowess had surpassed ten stars. Just how terrifying was that?","Ling Han wasn’t stupid.","He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and began to roam around in battle with Baili Haojie, neither too fast nor too slow.","This Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was indeed worthy of being the number one movement technique in the world. Though Ling Han’s strength was far inferior, he already possessed a battle prowess of Saint-level, and with his use, his fiery wings flapped, easily and calmly.","Baili Haojie was indeed strong, but if every attack did not hit its target, what was the use?","“Ling Han, do you only know how to run?” Baili Haojie began to mock him again.","“Aren’t you known as the strongest prodigy?”","“Come, let me see how much strength you actually have.”","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “If you would suppress your own cultivation level and battle me at the same cultivation level, see if I won’t push you to the ground and make you call me grandpa!”","Baili Haojie flew into a rage.","If he was told to call him grandpa, then wouldn’t that mean that even Great Emperor Ziwei would have to call him father?","“How dare you! You actually dare to look down on a Great Emperor!” he said balefully.","Ling Han scoffed, “You are the son of a Great Emperor, and your cultivation level is so much higher than mine. Don’t you find it embarrassing?”","“Humph, I am the same age as you, so what is there to be embarrassed about?” Baili Haojie asked calmly.","“Haha, you are an ancient person from who knows how many years ago. You should have long since turned into dust, and ran into this era to snatch the great fortune from the later generations. Who knows how thick-skinned you can be!” Ling Han scoffed.","“Detestable!” Baili Haojie roared, his black locks billowing in the wind. He was truly enraged.","As the son of a Great Emperor, when had he ever been scolded like this?","He increased the intensity of his attacks, and began to use the eight-star Regulations to restrict space.","No matter how awesome your movement technique is, I will completely seal off space with the eight-star Regulations, and let’s see how much more you can do.","This was an attempt to cut off Ling Han’s path of retreat."]},{"number":4630,"title":"Chapter 4630: Ambush","paragraphs":["Chapter 4630: Ambush","If this were any other place, Baili Haojie would have been able to seal off the entire planet with eight-star Regulations with a few casual moves.","However, was just any other place?","This bamboo forest was the handiwork of a Great Emperor. The Eight Star Regulations would be greatly suppressed here. Thus, the space that Baili Haojie could control was also very limited.","—No matter how prodigious you were, how could a Saint compare to a Great Emperor?","Thus, it was extremely easy for Ling Han to deal with it.","He only had to retreat, and get out of this area.","Baili Haojie followed, but he had to channel the eight stars Regulations to control the new area. What harm would it do to Ling Han?","One pursued, while the other fled. Though Baili Haojie had the complete advantage in the situation, he was completely unable to turn it into a victory.","Saints were hard to kill, and this was not just empty words. Even ordinary Saints were like this, what more Ling Han, who had grasped the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","In fact, he wasn’t even worried about the empress and the others. These three women were also Saints, and they had also mastered the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. So, what did they have to fear?","“Ling Han, do you really not have the courage to fight?” Baili Haojie shouted angrily. Though he was completely on the upper hand, this kind of battle made him feel very repressed, and too awkward.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Baili brat, do you dare to fight me at the same cultivation level? I can give you a handicap of two hands.”","F***, if it was two hands, would you still have a third hand?","Baili Haojie was enraged. This was really an incomparable contempt for him.","“Humph! I’m a Five-Star Saint, so why should I lower myself and suppress my cultivation level to battle you?” He naturally wouldn’t agree to this.","“If you don’t dare, then don’t say it in such a nice way!” Ling Han said with a smile. It was just a verbal battle; who would be afraid of who?","Of the two of them, one wanted the other to turn around and fight, while the other demanded a battle of equal cultivation levels, and it was impossible for either of them to satisfy the other, so there was naturally no conclusion to this battle.","Weng!","Right at this moment, a sheet of golden light materialized, transforming into a gigantic golden cauldron that ruthlessly smashed toward Ling Han.","This just happened to block Ling Han’s path!","Ambush.","At this moment, it was already too late for Ling Han to dodge. Even if he had Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, it was useless. After all, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was only the fastest in the world, but no matter how fast it was, there had to be a limit.","He immediately unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to protect his entire body.","Peng!","The golden cauldron crashed into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, sending it flying. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower crashed into a bamboo stalk, but the bamboo stalk’s body was incredibly tough, and it sent the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower flying back.","In this way, after shooting between the bamboo stalks dozens of times, this power was finally exhausted. Only then did the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower stop.","Ling Han stood still, and with a ‘wa’, he threw up blood madly.","Even if the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was indestructible, the power of the shockwaves still couldn’t dissipate, making him feel extremely uncomfortable. It was as if all his organs had been knocked over.","Looking again, there were small pieces in the blood. They were clearly pieces of his internal organs.","The timing of the ambusher’s attack was too good. Furthermore, his strength was also strong enough. Otherwise, it would still be insufficient to force Ling Han to this extent.","After making his move, the ambusher also slowly walked out.","This was another young king tier. He was dressed in a golden robe, and exuded an aura of might and dignity.","“And who are you?” Ling Han asked, as he channeled Ten Cultivation Technique, trying his best to heal his injuries.","Even Baili Haojie was slightly surprised, but he thought for a moment, “Golden Cauldron Technique? Are you from the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan?”","In the era of the Great Emperor Ziwei, he had traveled the world and challenged prodigies from all walks of life. Among them was the Imperial Son of the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan.","This Golden Cauldron Technique was their signature move. However, the Imperial Son of the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan was no match for this person in terms of mastery of this Imperial Technique Technique.","“Shi Tianlu,” the golden-robed young man replied calmly.","He didn’t deny his origins of the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan, so that naturally meant tacit agreement.","Moreover, the Golden Cauldron Technique was their signboard. Since he had used it, there was no way he could deny it even if he wanted to.","“Brother Shi isn’t from this era, right?” Baili Haojie continued to attack Ling Han as he conversed with Shi Tianlu.","With his strength, he was completely capable of multitasking, because he didn’t need to use his full strength against Ling Han. It was just that Ling Han’s speed was too fast, and he couldn’t catch up to him.","“Same to you! Same to you!” Shi Tianlu was expressionless.","Clearly, they had all guessed each other’s identities. They were both the sons of Great Emperors, and had been personally sealed by the Great Emperors, so that they could revive in this era.","Thus, Ling Han was their common enemy. However, removing the factor of Ling Han, they were also competitors. The opportunity of this era could only be obtained by one person.","This great opportunity was too great. They would definitely fight tooth and nail for it. In fact, they would not regret even if they died in battle.","There was no way they could become friends!","“Ling Han, where else can you run off to?” Baili Haojie was clearly much more talkative. As he pursued Ling Han, he used words to disturb Ling Han, “With two sons of Great Emperors hunting you down, you can actually die a worthy death.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Why don’t you stick out your dog’s head, and allow me to cut it off? It should be known that the person who kills you is a future Great Emperor, so you can also die a worthy death!”","Tit for tat.","Baili Haojie’s expression was slightly ugly. If there were no outsiders, he would not have been so angry either. However, Shi Tianlu was just beside him, and had heard him clearly, which made him feel slightly embarrassed and angry.","“Stubborn tongue!” he humphed coldly, and then did not say anything else. He merely attacked fiercely.","He finally realized that in terms of bickering, he was no match for Ling Han.","This was really strange. This guy was at most three to four hundred years old, but why was his ability to curse and battle so strong?","Even if he had to curse in every battle since birth, there was no way he could have cultivated such a sharp tongue, right?","It was naturally impossible for him to know that Ling Han actually came from the Genesis World. In that world, how many years had he lived for?","With a depraved friend like the large black dog, how could his verbal attacks not be awesome?","Shi Tianlu was completely unconcerned about identity, and joined forces with Baili Haojie, their attacks swift and fierce.","True, he had even done the matter of an ambush, so what did he have to be afraid of?","However, faced with Ling Han, who would only flee and not fight, to say nothing of two people hunting him down, even if it was two million, it would be the same.","—If you can’t catch up, no matter how strong you are, or how many people you have, what use would it be?","Ling Han circled around, and with the thickness and expansiveness of this bamboo forest, successfully shook off the two Imperial Sons.","He healed his injuries at the first instant.","Previously, he had been hunted down, and he could only focus on fleeing. There was no time for him to recover at all.","“How shameless!” he muttered. His injuries this time were still quite heavy. After all, he had been struck by the sons of Great Emperors.","Thankfully, Shi Tianlu’s cultivation level was inferior to Baili Haojie, and was a Four-Star Saint. Otherwise, his injuries would have been even more severe, and it was not impossible that he would have even been killed.","Ten Cultivation Technique channelled over and over again, and his injuries finally began to slowly recover.","“You two b@stards, when I become a Saint, I will also let you have a taste of being hunted down.”"]},{"number":4631,"title":"Chapter 4631: Purple Bamboo Forest","paragraphs":["Chapter 4631: Purple Bamboo Forest","After spending a whole two months’ time, Ling Han finally recovered from his injuries.","Though he had lost contact with the empress, the large black dog, and the others, Ling Han was not the slightest bit worried.","If a Saint wanted to flee, who could stop him?","Moreover, they had all cultivated the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, so they wouldn’t need to be afraid even if they came across a nine-star Saint.","And in these two months’ time, Ling Han had not been idle either.","As he healed his injuries, he was also observing the movement of the bamboo leaves. There was a special rhythm to them. Previously, he had sensed it, but was interrupted by Baili Hao.","In these two months, he had let go of his worries, and observed carefully. His gains were extremely great.","“How strange. When I was injured, I actually managed to capture at least three times more Celestial Qi than usual.” Ling Han gritted his teeth, “What kind of trait of mine is this?”","If the large black dog was here, he would definitely point out without reservation that this trait was “cheap”!","Only if he was injured would a certain ability be activated.","“However, this may also be because of this bamboo forest.”","Ling Han pondered for a moment. This bamboo forest was extremely strange. Thus, it was possible that it could attract Celestial Qi over. This had been set up by a Great Emperor.","“Looking from the sky, in terms of color, there are a total of ten areas of bamboo forest.”","“However, after going around in circles, I still only saw nine areas of bamboo forest. I haven’t been able to set foot in that purple-gold area.”","“Furthermore, even if one aims accurately from the skies to land there, they would not be able to land in that area.”","“Hence, my target should be there.”","Ling Han revealed a confident smile. In these two months, he had observed the movement of the bamboo leaves. There was a rhythm to it, allowing him to understand a sliver of the profound secrets of the bamboo forest.","This was a formation.","He began to advance. Occasionally, he would turn left, and sometimes, he would turn right. There was actually a sliver of charm in his movements.","“Follow the wind, follow the movements of the leaves.”","Ling Han roamed freely in this bamboo forest. The color of the bamboo forest kept changing. It was azure green, light silver, and dark blue. Finally, a purple-gold color appeared.","He entered into this area that he had never set foot in before.","Instantly, a completely different feeling rose up in Ling Han, as if this bamboo forest did not belong to the world from before.","“Celestial Qi!” A look of pleasant surprise appeared on his face. He had just entered here, and he had actually captured a Celestial Qi.","Xiu, in the blink of an eye, he had caught another.","He looked around in surprise, and saw that there were multiple streaks of Celestial Qi entwined around the purple bamboo.","Heavens, just how much Celestial Qi was there here?","Ling Han’s heart involuntarily thumped. He was rich, he was rich!","Realization dawned on him. How could the Imperial Clans be able to extract Celestial Qi so easily?","Wasn’t it because of the Imperial Weapon?","The Imperial Weapon contained the Nine Star Regulations. For Celestial Qi, this was extremely attractive.","Thus, it was completely effortless for the Imperial Weapon to obtain Celestial Qi. After millions and millions of years, their wealth was incredibly deep.","It should be known that it was not that Empress Qingzhu did not have an Imperial Weapon.","According to legends, she extracted a section of her own bamboo body and used it to forge the supreme Imperial Weapon, to pass down to her descendants.","With the Imperial Weapon standing guard here, how much Celestial Qi could it accumulate after countless years?","They were all here.","No wonder it had become much easier to capture Celestial Qi previously. This was the reason.","Ling Han raised his hand and continuously absorbed the Celestial Qi, stuffing it all into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","This was a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon, so it was naturally no issue for it to preserve Celestial Qi.","This was a great harvest.","Ling Han was overjoyed. How many minor levels could this help him advance?","Three, five?","A nine-star Venerate... was assured!","Ling Han broke into a grin. Previously, he had still been wondering when he would be able to thrash Baili Haojie and Shi Tianlu. Now, a great amount of Celestial Qi was delivered to his doorstep, for him to reap the harvest.","He walked around here and collected all the Celestial Qi.","However, he did not discover anything else.","In the inheritance of the Empress, was there only some Celestial Qi?","Ling Han did not believe it. Though this was an astonishing amount of cultivation resources, any Imperial Clan would have this kind of wealth, or even surpass it. Hence, if it was claimed that Empress Qingzhu had laid out her plans millions and millions of years ago, and only left behind a great amount of Celestial Qi, that could not be justified, right?","“Perhaps I still have to wait a little longer.”","“I’ll cultivate while concocting alchemical pills.”","“As long as one’s abilities have improved, what can’t be resolved?”","This place was extremely safe, and for the moment, it was likely that no one would be entering this place.","Ling Han calmly concocted alchemical pills. Every time he concocted a Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, he would consume one. At the first instant, he would turn his resources into cultivation.","In this manner, three months later, he had cultivated to the limit of six stars.","Ling Han broke through to seven stars without any hesitation. Two days later, a seventh seal appeared on each of the four pinnacle pillars, which meant that he had become a Seven Star Venerate.","At this time, others finally came in.","There were quite a few of them. There was Ding Shu and the other Genesis World rulers, as well as Baili Haojie and the other sons of Great Emperors. In fact, even Yang Yihuan and the others, who represented the sons of fallen Great Emperors, had appeared.","They had also grasped the pattern of the bamboo leaves and entered here. However, because the Celestial Qi had all been taken away by Ling Han, they naturally couldn’t discover anything unusual. They were all very curious.","—It was not easy for them to come here, but why was this place no different from the other regions?","They searched carefully, not missing even a single leaf. Perhaps Empress Qingzhu had left a clue on one of the leaves?","Ling Han didn’t participate. There were so many people now, and they were all gathered together. No matter who deciphered the secret, they definitely wouldn’t be able to enjoy it alone.","Hence, he could just wait, and reap the fruits of their labour.","Most importantly, he had also tried before, and had indeed not discovered anything special.","He continued to concoct alchemical pills. Though there was a lot of Celestial Qi, Ling Han still felt that it could not be wasted.","After a few days, he shockingly discovered that this bamboo forest had actually enlarged.","It was not just a feeling, but rather real.","It was not just him. The others had also noticed, and were all discussing spiritedly.","Now, everyone could confirm that if there really was an ancient treasure of the Empress, it must be in this bamboo forest.","However, it hadn’t manifested yet, so it might need time.","Then they’ll just wait.","For Ling Han, this was something that he could not ask for more. It was just right for him to concoct alchemical pills and increase his cultivation level.","This bamboo forest was constantly expanding at a very fast speed, and Ling Han’s cultivation level was also steadily and rapidly increasing as a large amount of Celestial Qi was refined.","Four months had passed, and the Purple Bamboo Forest had completely conquered this extinguished sun. Looking down from space, this was a purple-gold world.","Ling Han also woke up from his seclusion. He had taken another step forward.","Eight-star Venerate!","He was getting closer and closer to igniting the holy flame and becoming a Saint.","“Little Han, save me!” Right at this moment, an extremely tragic voice rang out.","The large black dog?","Anger instantly appeared on Ling Han’s face. Who was hunting the large black dog?","He immediately dashed out, following the sound.","“Little Han!” Very soon, the cry rang out again.","Ling Han let out a battle cry in response. Then, he continued to charge towards the source of the sound.","In a short while, he saw a large black dog rushing towards him.","“Hurry up and save Grandpa Dog!”"]},{"number":4632,"title":"Chapter 4632: Continuing the path ahead","paragraphs":["Chapter 4632: Continuing the path ahead","Just as the large black dog was about to reach him, Ling Han suddenly stopped in his tracks. Not only did he retreat, but he even launched a palm strike. Boom! Destructive Energy blazed.","Peng!","The large black dog was instantly hit. A hole appeared on the left side of its chest, and it went right through to the other side of its body.","However, the large black dog didn’t look shocked or furious. He simply looked at the wound, and said slowly, “How did you see through it?”","This wasn’t the large black dog at all!","Ling Han smiled faintly. The large black dog had grasped Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, so if he really encountered danger, how could he not use it?","However, in the eyes of others, with such a precious movement technique like the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, who wouldn’t keep it for themselves if they mastered it? Would they teach it to outsiders?","Thus, though this person had copied the large black dog’s appearance very well, he had overlooked an extremely important factor.","No one could be blamed for this. Who would be as generous as Ling Han?","How could his friendship with Brother Monkey, the large black dog, and the others be imagined by others?","“Are you Baili Haojie, or Shi Tianlu?” he asked instead of answering.","His figure swayed, and turned into a young man, but he was neither Shi Tianlu nor Baili Hao. Instead, he was a complete stranger.","“I am Tao Kan!” This young man declared proudly.","Meanwhile, Ling Han shook his head, saying, “Instead of being a human, you insist on pretending to be a dog. I think the kinds of activity you are up to are also the activities of dogs and thieves.”","Tao Kan was instantly enraged, and brandished his palm to attack. Boom, the might of the holy flame surged out. Shockingly, he was also a Five Star Saint, and as many as thirteen Eight Star Regulations appeared.","“I am the son of the Red Lotus Holy Emperor, and you actually dare insult me?”","Sure enough, this was the son of another Great Emperor.","At first, he had thought that after the Golden Generation was completely humiliated, the Imperial Clans would withdraw from the competition for the position of new Emperor. He had not thought that they would actually still have such a trump card and an ancient Imperial Son would be able to appear.","The true Imperial Son was indeed awesome, completely not inferior to Yang Yihuan, Lu Xun and the others.","Moreover, these Imperial Sons were extremely shameless.","Baili Haojie was a Five-Star Saint, but he insisted that he was in the same age range as Ling Han. Meanwhile, Shi Tianlu was even more sinister. He had actually ambushed Ling Han half-way.","This Tao Kan was not much better either. He pretended to be the large black dog to lure him out.","These Imperial Sons were completely unaffected by their status. In order to achieve their goals, they were willing to resort to any means.","“Since you’ve chosen to become a b*tch, don’t even think about establishing a plaque of chastity!” Ling Han laughed loudly, leaping out to dodge.","It was true that he was shameless, but it was also true that he was powerful, and had a crushing advantage.","Tao Kan was even more enraged, and chased after Ling Han to attack him.","However, no matter how strong his battle prowess was, in terms of movement technique, it was useless no matter how strong he was.","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was number one in the world.","Ling Han didn’t engage in battle. The gulf between their battle prowess was far too great, so what was the point of engaging in a battle where there was absolutely no chance of victory?","He activated his movement technique and left.","“Since you like to pretend to be a dog so much, I will take you in as my pet dog in future, so that you can wag your tail and beg for mercy by my side.”","He left, but his voice remained, lingering endlessly.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Tao Kan was so infuriated that he blasted the surrounding bamboos madly, but this was set up by a Great Emperor. Not only had he not been able to break a single bamboo, he had instead caused these bamboos to light up one after another, and begin their counterattack.","Even if Tao Kan was the son of a Great Emperor and a Five Star Saint, so what? In an instant, his body was pierced through by several streaks of light.","Thankfully, his abilities were strong enough, after all. This was not enough to kill him. After resting for ten days to half a month, he would still be able to recover completely.","...","After Ling Han fled, he once again settled down and focused on concocting alchemical pills.","He was freakish, and was even in fact heaven-defying. However, in the end, he was still limited by his cultivation level.","Right now, the mainstream level of the younger generation had already reached the level of Saint Tier. Meanwhile, he was still at the Venerate Tier. Although he possessed the battle prowess of a Saint, he was still no match for an ancient Imperial Son.","If he wanted to stand against them, or even in fact kill these people, he would have to break through to Saint Tier.","Thus, the first thing he had to do was reach the nine-star Venerate Tier.","Ling Han continued to refine the Celestial Qi. There was nothing much to say about the Fourth Extreme. There was no such thing as enlightenment, and his cultivation level suddenly soaring several levels.","What he needed was the Celestial Qi, which could be used to construct the four pinnacle pillars, and prop up his celestial body. Only then would he be qualified to light the holy flame.","The Celestial Qi in the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was decreasing, while Ling Han’s cultivation was steadily increasing.","Another half year passed, and Ling Han finally reached the end of the eight-star Venerate Tier.","After only three days, he had already shot up to nine stars, and stood at the highest peak of Fourth Extreme.","If he advanced another step further, he would be able to ignite the holy flame.","The number of Celestial Qi began to decrease sharply again. When there was only one fifth left, Ling Han’s Celestial Qi finally reached the limit of nine stars.","Now, he could ignite the holy flame and attempt to break through to Saint Tier.","However, Ling Han hesitated.","This was because he discovered that he still had room for improvement. He didn’t feel the pressure that the limit of his cultivation level exerted on him at all.","If he were to ignite the holy flame now, perhaps it would be harmful instead, because his Fourth Extreme had not matured to the true limit.","Then let’s just wait for a while longer.","Ling Han said to himself. What he pursued was actually not cultivation level, but strength.","Since he could continue to increase his strength, why did he have to rush to become a Saint?","His target was to be the strongest.","He clearly knew that there was still room for improvement, yet did not make the attempt. This naturally was not in line with his path.","However, he didn’t know how many minor levels he would have to break through this time.","Sect Master-level was fifteen stars, then Venerate Tier-level wouldn’t be fifteen stars as well, right?","“I feel that this should be related to the number of Regulations I have grasped.”","“The limit of Regulations should only be 99.”","“Thus, if I could grasp 99 Seven Star Regulations, I would definitely be at the true end of Fourth Extreme.”","“No matter what, since I haven’t reached perfection, I definitely can’t break through so easily.”","Ling Han attempted to break through to ten stars.","Here was the problem.","How was he supposed to break through to ten stars?","When he was at the level of Sect Master,, he had been trapped by the shackles of heaven and earth. This, on the other hand, gave him a beacon of guidance, and all he had to do was resist the shackles with all his might.","Moreover, no matter how hard he tried, it was impossible for him to break through to the pinnacle level of the Fourth Extreme, so he could be at ease and make a bold attempt.","But now, he was not being targeted by heaven and earth, and could completely attempt to light up the holy flame. This was an even easier path to take.","Ling Han felt that as long as he was the slightest bit careless, it was possible that his attempt to break through to 10 Stars would become the act of lighting up the holy flame.","What could he do?","He calmed down for a moment, and thought clearly in his heart.","If one wanted to break through to the 10 Stars, they would have to know what kind of cultivation level 10 Stars was.","“The symbol of the Fourth Extreme is the seal on the four pinnacle pillars. Every additional one represents the advancement of a step of a minor level.”","“However, the seal is only a form of manifestation. It’s not that this seal has appeared, and that’s why one has ascended to a higher level. Instead, it’s only after one has ascended to a higher level that a seal has manifested.”","“Now, I have reached nine stars, and have absolutely no idea what ten stars means. How am I supposed to continue onwards?”","“Then, let’s change our way of thinking.”","“If I forcefully inscribe the tenth seal on the pinnacle pillar, will it stimulate a change in my cultivation level?”","Ling Han felt that this idea was feasible.","Most importantly, this was a cultivation level that no one had ever set foot in. He could only cross the river by feeling the stones, and try it out step by step."]},{"number":4633,"title":"Chapter 4633: Tenth Seal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4633: Tenth Seal","Now that he had an idea, Ling Han could begin his attempt.","He first had to inscribe seals on the four pinnacle pillars, thereby boosting the advancement of his cultivation level.","However, what seal would he have to inscribe on the four pinnacle pillars?","This was a problem.","Just mess around?","Of course not. This was trying to break through his limits.","“After all is said and done, Regulations is the highest.”","“I will inscribe the Regulations!”","He began to extract the seven-star Regulations, then marked the four pinnacle pillars. Of course, he would definitely only choose one of the four pinnacle pillars at this moment. He wouldn’t have such a big appetite to mark all four pillars at the same time.","However, the four pinnacle pillars were like Origin Gold, and he was unable to inscribe any mark on them at all.","Then what could he do?","This was a line of thought that Ling Han had come up with with with great difficulty. Aside from this, he could think of no better idea.","“If one Regulation is not enough, then two, or three!”","“I have intertwined Regulations, which is comparable to Eight Star Regulations, and theoretically speaking, the level of Eight Star Regulations is higher than the level of the four pinnacle pillars. It should be able to leave behind marks.”","At present, Ling Han could channel 60 Seven Star Regulations. He unleashed them all at once, intertwining to form a Divine Sword, which began to move around on the four pinnacle pillars.","However, it was useless.","The four pinnacle pillars were extremely hard, and even the sword of Regulations couldn’t damage them.","It should be known that when Ling Han had set out the four pinnacle pillars, this absolute domain was not something that could be penetrated by Saints of the same strength at all. This also meant... that even he himself would not be able to damage it.","This... formed an unsolvable cycle.","With the increase of his strength, the defenses of the four pinnacle pillars would also rise accordingly. Thus, he would never be able to damage his own four pinnacle pillars.","F***!","Then wouldn’t I only be able to cultivate to nine stars?","Ling Han scratched his head. This was a little awkward. He clearly felt that he still had room for improvement. He was unwilling to advance into Saint Tier just like that.","“Let’s try Destructive Energy!”","Ling Han steeled his heart. Destructive Energy was already in its complete state. He was certain that even a Pseudo-Emperor could not hold up to being blasted by him. Even the Pseudo-Emperor would die with grudges.","With the destructive power of the Destructive Energy, what need was there for him to fear that he would not be able to inscribe marks on the four pinnacle pillars?","The question was, would it cause too much damage, and break the four pinnacle pillars?","Then he would have really gone too far.","Ling Han carefully channeled the Destructive Energy, which turned into something like a needle. Then, he stabbed it towards the four pinnacle pillars.","He had to be extremely cautious. The destructive power of this kind of high-level energy was really too great.","Weng!","When the Destructive Energy touched the four pinnacle pillars, the four pinnacle pillars also burst out with astonishing light, facing off against the spike of Destructive Energy.","Ling Han had a feeling that if he forcibly used the two to collide, then either the spike of Destructive Energy would be broken, or the pillar would crumble. There was no third possibility.","He stopped. If the spike of Destructive Energy broke, that was fine. In any case, there was no loss, but if the pillar crumbled, that would be a great loss.","What could they do?","Ling Han was dumbfounded. Even the Destructive Energy had been unsuccessful. What other method could he have?","He could only break through to Saint Tier?","Ling Han shook his head. Before trying out all the possibilities, he didn’t want to give up.","Thus, he emptied his mind and lay on the ground, pondering.","Two days later, he thought of the last possibility.","Power of belief.","When one had cultivated to the end of the nine-star Venerate Tier, they would be able to light up the holy flame with the power of Regulations or the power of belief, and become a Saint.","The starting fuel for the holy flame was the four pinnacle pillars. When all the four pinnacle pillars were burnt to nothing, the holy flame would blaze fiercely, signifying that one had truly advanced into Saint Tier.","Then, what if he used the power of belief as a pen to mark the pillar?","Was this possible?","‘Come, let’s give it a try.’","With a thought from Ling Han, the living beings in the millions and millions of dimensions in his body immediately responded, sending a weak power of belief to him. However, countless weak streaks of power of belief fused together, forming a powerful force.","However, if he did not become a Saint, this could not be called the power of belief, which could not help Ling Han increase his battle prowess.","However, Ling Han didn’t want to use it to battle either.","He turned this power into a sharp blade, and using Regulations as a blueprint, began to carve on the pillar.","With a single slash, a light mark immediately appeared on the pillar.","It was possible!","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel overjoyed. Even if he had really branded a seal, it did not mean that he would definitely be able to advance into 10 Stars. However, at least, he now had a direction to work towards, and had also improved.","Continue.","The power of belief blade continued to carve, and the mark on the pinnacle pillar gradually became deeper and more complicated.","One Regulation, two Regulations, three Regulations... Ling Han inscribed all 60 Regulations that he had grasped on the pinnacle pillar. This took a total of 17 days.","However, when he put away the “pen”, he did not sense anything strange.","Was it not the right path?","Ling Han’s heart did not waver. Immediately, he calmed his heart and spirit, and branded the mark on the second pinnacle pillar.","This time, it was faster, because he had experience.","Only fourteen days later, he was done.","However, there was still no unusual movement.","Again.","Another 13 days passed, and the third pinnacle pillar had also been branded.","Again, nothing happened.","Ling Han took a deep breath. It was time to look at the last one.","Begin.","He was completely focused, and did not have the slightest bit of negative emotion.","Another twelve days later, the last pinnacle pillar had also been marked completely.","He was still missing the last stroke.","Ling Han hesitated slightly, then swiped the blade of power of belief.","Success!","Weng, all of a sudden, the four pinnacle pillars began to tremble violently. Then, the tenth mark on the pillars immediately shone brightly. Boom, four beams of majestic light shot out from the top of Ling Han’s head.","One was directed towards the sky, one towards the ground, one towards the front, and one towards the back.","Heaven, earth, future, and past.","In this moment, Ling Han’s mind was filled with innumerable enlightenment. It was as if he was overseeing the universe, the center of time, and could reach all corners of the universe with a single hand. The past and future were all within his grasp.","Boom, his aura began to boil. The breakthrough of his cultivation level had begun!","He couldn’t help but look pleasantly surprised. As expected, his train of thought wasn’t wrong. Branding a new mark on the four pinnacle pillars could lead to the improvement of his cultivation level.","Hong long long, heaven and earth also responded immediately, and countless tribulation clouds gathered densely, gathering over in a dark mass.","The heaven’s calamity was coming.","In these millions and millions of years, had anyone ever broken through the limit of the Fourth Extreme?","This was an epoch-making feat, and even the heaven and earth were moved.","He was too strong, that even the heaven and earth would have to slay him.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple figures shot over. The commotion caused by Ling Han was too great, so it naturally attracted those close and far away.","—Most importantly, everyone had nothing else to do now.","“Ling Han!”","“He has broken through?”","“Hiss, this guy is about to become a Saint?”","“That’s not right. Becoming a Saint could not possibly attract the heaven’s calamity, either. It would only be an internal demon.”","Everyone was astounded. Becoming a Saint would indeed have a test from heaven and earth, but that was only a test by an internal demon, and now it was a test from the heaven’s calamity.","What evil deeds have you committed, to actually draw the fury of heaven and earth?"]},{"number":4634,"title":"Chapter 4634: Four Great Emperors","paragraphs":["Chapter 4634: Four Great Emperors","There were a total of two possibilities for triggering a heaven’s calamity.","Firstly, he had committed a heinous crime, and even the heaven and earth could no longer bear to watch, and wanted to erase him with the heaven’s calamity. Secondly, he was too strong, and had surpassed the limit of the corresponding cultivation level. He had broken the balance, and the heaven and earth would also send down the heaven’s calamity.","But the two were different.","In the case of the former, no matter how strong the victim of the tribulation was, it would be useless. That was because the heaven’s calamity would get stronger and stronger, and would only stop when the victim of the tribulation had been killed.","In this world, who could be stronger than Heavenly Dao?","Even the Great Emperor couldn’t. Otherwise, the Great Emperor wouldn’t have died of old age.","If it was the latter, however, there was still a chance of survival.","As long as he could survive a wave of heaven’s calamity, the heaven and earth would “admit” that he indeed had the right to be this strong, and would no longer target him.","Ling Han... probably didn’t commit any heinous crimes, right?","On the other hand, he had fought against the Netherworld, and killed who knew how many Yin souls. It was only possible that he had great merits.","Thus, the only possibility now was the latter.","Hiss, what kind of limit had this guy broken through, to actually be able to attract a heaven’s calamity?","It should be known that not everyone was qualified to be struck by the heaven’s calamity.","In truth, those that could attract the heaven’s calamity were all prodigies among prodigies, and there were not many that could be found in a whole era.","How could the Saints not be stunned? That was because as long as Ling Han could survive the heaven’s calamity without dying, he would become much stronger. This was something that was self-explanatory.","“Die!”","“We definitely cannot allow him to succeed.”","“En, this boy is already freakish enough. If he was allowed to successfully break a certain limit, just how strong would he be then?”","The Imperial Sons all looked at each other, and charged out. There were the few remaining Golden Generations, as well as the ancient Imperial Sons, and they were completely unconcerned about bullying the weak with numbers.","Boom!","All of a sudden, one attack after another was as dazzling as fireworks, blasting towards Ling Han.","Even a Nine-Star Saint would frown upon seeing such an attack, and retreat quickly.","“How dare you!” Brother Monkey, the large black dog, the empress, and the others all moved to intercept them.","However, firstly, how many of them were there? Secondly, none of them had advanced into Two Stars, so how could they possibly block the attacks of Baili Haojie, Shi Tianlu and the other ancient Imperial Sons?","Fortunately, it wasn’t that Ling Han didn’t have any reaction. With a battle cry, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was unleashed and he rapidly left.","“You won’t be able to escape!” The Saints from the Imperial Clans all charged over to attack Ling Han.","Kuang, at this moment, the heaven’s calamity also joined in on the excitement, delivering an attack towards Ling Han.","Weng, weng, weng, weng! Four bolts of lightning descended, turning into four young people respectively.","“Fa-Father!” The few ancient Imperial Sons were immediately stunned, and called out to the four youngsters, almost falling to their knees.","This was clearly their father, the ancient Great Emperor!","Shouldn’t they have died long ago?","No!","Everyone immediately saw clearly that these four Great Emperors were not their true selves, but rather formed from lightning.","Shua, shua, shua! The four Great Emperors formed of lightning immediately charged towards Ling Han.","Peng!","With a single punch, Ling Han was sent flying.","Hiss, these four Great Emperors were shockingly One Star Saints.","Ordinary One Star Saints were completely no match for Ling Han. However, it was a different story for Great Emperors, even if they were only formed by Heavenly Dao out of lightning.","The Great Emperors’ souls would return to the heavens, their spirits fusing with the heaven and earth. Thus, the Heavenly Dao was completely capable of perfectly manifesting the Great Emperors.","This was not the Great Emperors when they were young, but rather the Great Emperors that had lowered their cultivation level from their imperial position. The two were completely incomparable.","When it was Great Emperors when they were young, even Ge Qianqiu and the Nine Suns Saint could stand shoulder to shoulder with them. There were wins and losses, but for those who had lowered their own cultivation level from the position of Emperor, Ge Qianqiu and the Nine Suns Saint couldn’t compare at all.","Even if they could only unleash a sliver of Imperial Might, that was still superior to the whole universe.","Furthermore, these Lightning Great Emperors had an advantage in terms of cultivation level. They were One Star Saints.","Furthermore, there were four of them!","How was he supposed to block this kind of heaven’s calamity?","The speed of the four Great Emperors of Lightning was astonishingly fast. After one of them shot out a punch, the other three used movement techniques to give chase.","So what if Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was the number one movement technique in the world? Ling Han was facing a Great Emperor!","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Three golden paths spread out, and the three Great Emperors arrived in front of Ling Han in a single stride, their attacks slashing out successively.","It was too fast!","Ling Han hurriedly unleashed his four pinnacle pillars. He could only take this attack head-on.","Peng, peng, peng! The attacks arrived, and cracks immediately appeared on the four pinnacle pillars. Then, they shattered with a bang.","The remaining power swept past, and Ling Han was once again sent flying.","In front of the four Great Emperors of Lightning, Ling Han actually couldn’t even fight back.","Everyone was watching dumbfounded. The Heavenly Dao would actually send down such a tribulation. This, who in this world could withstand it?","Unless it was also a Great Emperor that had severed his own cultivation level, only then would he be able to match this.","However, they would only be able to match this. It was impossible for them to win.","An Imperial Son still wanted to take advantage of this, and moved to attack. However, he saw another bolt of lightning strike down, turning into a Great Emperor that was attacking him.","This time, it was not a One Star Saint, but rather a Nine Star Saint!","How could the Imperial Son withstand this? In a few moves, he exploded, turning into a shower of blood.","Thankfully, a Saint could be revived with a drop of blood, and the heaven’s calamity didn’t kill him completely. It stopped after beating him to burst. Otherwise, this Imperial Son would definitely have been killed by the heaven’s calamity.","In this way, no one dared to move.","The Heavenly Dao was issuing a punishment, and no one could interfere?","—You want to stand shoulder to shoulder with the Heavenly Dao? This was naturally a great disrespect.","“Red Lotus Holy Emperor!”","“Golden Cauldron Ancestral King!”","“Jade Drop Ancestral King!”","“The Thousand Spirit Great Emperor!”","Everyone was whispering the names of the four Great Emperors, their voices filled with reverence and respect.","Every single Great Emperor was an elite that had suppressed an era, and was definitely deserving of respect.","Now, though the four Great Emperors only had the cultivation level of a One Star Saint, they were still superior to Ling Han in terms of power and Regulations. Furthermore, there were four of them. How was Ling Han supposed to block this?","“He’s dead for sure!”","“Haha, to actually have such a heaven’s calamity, no one would be able to survive.”","“How could the limits of heaven and earth be so easily broken!”","All the Saints smirked coldly. They had not thought that Ling Han, whom they could not kill no matter what, would ultimately die in the hands of the heaven’s calamity.","Thinking about it, it was indeed ironic. Why would Ling Han be targeted by the Heavenly Dao?","Because he was too freakish.","Ling Han’s freakish talent was the reason why the members of the Imperial Clans saw him as a thorn in their side. Because if he didn’t die, the chances of others becoming Emperor would be pitifully small, but also because he was too freakish, he was actually going to be killed by the Heavenly Dao.","How could this not be ironic?","However, everyone couldn’t help but feel admiration in their hearts. This kind of freak was really terrifying. Not only had no one achieved such feats that he had before, perhaps it would never happen again.","“What do we do? What do we do now?” The large black dog couldn’t maintain his composure any longer, and he couldn’t help but tug at his beard.","In the past, no matter what, it had always been filled with confidence in Ling Han.","However, this time was different.","Four Great Emperors!","For those that could become Emperor, which one of them was not the strongest of their generation?","Now that four invincible beings had joined forces to attack Ling Han alone, how could Ling Han block them?","Who would still have the confidence?","The empress, Hu Niu, and Chi Menghan were even more anxious. They held hands, and if it wasn’t for the fact that no one could help in the case of the heaven’s calamity, they would have definitely rushed forwards.","What could they do?"]},{"number":4635,"title":"Chapter 4635: Defeating the heaven’s calamity","paragraphs":["Chapter 4635: Defeating the heaven’s calamity","If anyone still had any confidence in Ling Han, it would definitely be himself.","He had the heart to become a Great Emperor, so how could he think that he was inferior to the previous Great Emperors?","What a joke!","In truth, the accomplishments that he had achieved all the way here, even the Great Emperors of the past could not compare.","If it was not for the fact that these four Lightning Great Emperors in front of him possessed a sliver of Imperial Might, so what if they were One Star Saints? Ling Han was completely capable of killing them.","“Do you really think that I’m afraid of you guys?” Ling Han shouted loudly, and began his counterattack.","Right now, he was a nine-star Venerate, and he could unleash 60 seven-star Regulations with a single strike. Combined together, this was equivalent to six eight-star Regulations. Just how astonishing was this?","Previously, someone had speculated that when he had reached the nine-star Venerate Tier, he would be able to match a four-star or five-star Saint. In truth, this was still underestimating him. Going by the calculation of the lowest battle prowess, he could even match a six-star Saint.","Of course, there were still the sons of Great Emperors like Lu Xun and Shi Tianlu. Their battle prowess far surpassed their peers, and that was a different story.","Could there be a second Venerate like this in the world?","Ling Han channeled the Destructive Energy, and confronted the four Great Emperors head-on.","Peng!","He was sent flying by the Red Lotus Holy Emperor, but under the violent punch, the Red Lotus Holy Emperor’s figure actually dimmed slightly.","Destructive Energy was something that could destroy anything!","So what if you are the manifestation of the Heavenly Dao? I will still destroy you.","However, it was only slightly weaker. If he were really to be completely destroyed, he would have to throw at least a few hundred or a few thousand punches.","“Wa!” Ling Han also threw up blood madly. This was a head-on confrontation with a Great Emperor.","Possessing a sliver of Imperial Might, this was too terrifying.","Cracks appeared on Ling Han’s tough physique, and blood gushed out.","This was a completely unfair battle. Just how powerful was the Great Emperor? There was no one in this world that could match him.","Ling Han had no choice but to summon the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Even the four pinnacle pillars couldn’t block the mad barrage of attacks from the four Great Emperors.","He took a look. Thankfully, the activation of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower didn’t draw the heaven’s calamity to increase its might.","It was very simple. Ling Han had nurtured the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower from beginning to end, and no one else had participated. This could be considered a part of Ling Han. Thus, taking it out and using it did not break the rules of the heaven’s calamity.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","However, it was useless even if he summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. The Great Emperors were too powerful, blocking the Origin Gold with their bare hands, blasting the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower madly, and due to the rebound, Ling Han was also very injured, though it wasn’t as tragic as being directly hit.","Ling Han wasn’t just taking a beating. He was still successful.","Under the influence of Destructive Energy, even the Great Emperor would be wounded!","He focused his attacks on the Red Lotus Holy Emperor. Rather than wounding his fingers, it would be better to sever one of his fingers!","“Wa!” He threw up blood madly, his whole body covered with blood. His injuries were extraordinarily severe, but correspondingly, the figure of the Red Lotus Holy Emperor was also becoming dimmer and dimmer.","“No!” Imperial Son Tao Kan’s face was filled with disbelief.","His “father” was actually going to be defeated by Ling Han, even if it was only a human figure formed from lightning.","However, the Great Emperor should have been invincible under all circumstances.","To him, it was as if the heaven and earth were about to collapse.","However, what use was it no matter how loud he shouted?","After exchanging several hundred blows, the Red Lotus Holy Emperor was already so dim that he could barely be seen. He sent out another palm strike, and his whole person disappeared on its own.","Everyone nodded. These Great Emperors were all formed from lightning, and the source of their power was also lightning. Every attack they delivered would consume some of their power. Actually, there was no need for Ling Han to counterattack. As they fought, they would eventually die by themselves.","Going by that theory, Ling Han didn’t need to counterattack at all. He only needed to defend himself, and wait for these Great Emperors of Lightning to dissipate on their own.","When this thought arose, everyone shook their heads.","If he merely defended and did not attack, he would only be beaten to death!","Just how powerful was the attack of the Great Emperor? Merely defending and not attacking? Heh, what a joke.","After dealing with the Red Lotus Holy Emperor, Ling Han’s pressure instantly lessened.","He started to target Golden Cauldron Ancestral King, trading injury for injury.","If his opponent was really a manifestation of the Great Emperor, Ling Han wouldn’t have been able to do this. This was because the attacks of true Great Emperors would be more variable, and they would also heal their injuries. Thus, there was no need for them to worry about expending all of their power.","But now? Hehe.","After paying the price of having one of his arms destroyed, the Ancestral King Golden Cauldron was also shattered.","Shi Tianlu’s expression was dark. F***, though this was not his real father, in everyone’s hearts, they probably thought that Ling Han had defeated the Ancestral King Golden Cauldron who had lowered his level to a One Star Saint.","The Great Emperor had been invincible all his life, yet now, Ling Han had actually left a stain on his reputation?","Shi Tianlu could not tolerate this.","However, the heaven’s calamity couldn’t be interefered with, and he could only sit by and watch.","Ling Han attacked the Jade Drop Ancestral King again.","With one less Great Emperor, the pressure on him was lighter, but this did not mean that the battle would not be intense. On the contrary, Ling Han paid the price of losing another leg, and finally, the Jade Drop Ancestral King was ground to death.","The Saints of the Han Clan naturally all looked livid. Their Great Emperor had also been “slain”, which made them feel that the Jade Drop Imperial Clan’s fortune had been weakened by a layer.","Finally, it was the Thousand Spirit Great Emperor.","Ling Han used all his remaining power, exchanging blows with the Thousand Spirit Great Emperor.","He couldn’t delay it any longer, as his injuries were too severe.","After only 100 exchanges, the Thousand Spirit Great Emperor’s body also started to shudder.","His energy was also about to be exhausted, and would return to heaven and earth.","Ling Han continued to press his advantage, attacking aggressively, killing the Thousand Spirit Great Emperor as well.","The Saints of the Cheng Clan were naturally extremely unhappy, their expressions extremely dark.","In the skies, the thunderclouds gradually dissipated.","The heaven’s calamity had passed.","All the Saints were stunned and filled with killing intent. This kind of heaven’s calamity was still unable to kill Ling Han?","He was too freakish.","“Die!”","All the Saints charged out. Taking advantage of this opening, it was a great opportunity to kill Ling Han.","“Don’t attack!” Ling Han sent a mental message to Brother Monkey and the others through divine sense, while he directly used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to flee.","If the empress and the others made a move, they would only be seeking death.","Even if he was only left with one leg now, when the fiery wings spread out, it was not restricted by his body, so his speed was still extraordinarily fast.","The Saints chased for a while, yet had no choice but to stop.","They couldn’t catch up.","Ling Han, who possessed Saint-level power, was no longer someone that they could gang up on and kill.","Otherwise, during the re-establishment of the Nine Suns Holy Land, would these Imperial Clan elites sit by and watch?","Wasn’t it because Ling Han was already extremely, extremely difficult to kill, so they had no choice but to endure?","After Ling Han broke free from the Saints, he hurriedly descended, and began to heal his injuries.","This time, his injuries were truly severe.","In order to kill the lightning figures of the four Great Emperors, he had paid the price of two arms and one leg. Though he had the Saintly medicine in his possession, which could regrow his severed limbs, with such heavy injuries, it was still a massive blow to his life force.","“Fortunately, I killed countless Yin souls previously, and the heaven and earth essence replenished some life force for me. Otherwise, this injury would really be difficult to heal.”","Ling Han channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique, and together with the Great Herbs, he hoped to recover as soon as possible.","He buried himself into the ground. The aura of the Empress permeated the air here, so it was impossible for Saints to release their divine sense here. Thus, unless these Saints dug into the ground to search, he would be absolutely safe."]},{"number":4636,"title":"Chapter 4636: The Imperial Weapon appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4636: The Imperial Weapon appears","Three years passed.","Ling Han’s injuries were really too severe. He had forcibly lost three limbs, and being able to recover in three years was already an incredibly fast speed.","Peng, he broke out of the ground.","The newly grown arms and left leg were both bare, and the skin was like top grade jade, possessing a warm hue.","“Now, I’m a true 10-star Venerate!”","Ling Han waved his arm. Boom! A terrifying power reverberated, and 70 Seven Star Regulations surged.","The present him had finally reached the level of a One Star Saint in terms of power. There was no longer any need for him to clearly have the advantage in battle prowess, but still be blasted off his feet in a fight with a One Star Saint.","Of course, compared to a Two Star or Three Star Saint, his power was still inferior.","However, this didn’t matter. Power was only secondary to Saints, and Regulations was the true power.","“I wonder how the situation is now.”","Ling Han murmured. His figure moved, and he began to search this extinguished sun, wanting to know the latest situation.","After circling around, he discovered that this star was still the same. Nothing special had happened.","Was the time not up yet?","But this was just right. Ling Han continued to concoct alchemical pills. He still had some Celestial Qi that he had yet to refine.","All of a sudden, another year had passed. Ling Han had already concocted all the Celestial Qi into alchemical pills, and ingested and refined all of them. However, his cultivation level had only reached the late stage of 10 Stars, and was still a bit away from the peak stage.","“It’s truly as difficult as ascending the heavens to advance another level.”","Ling Han sighed ruefully. Thankfully, it was much easier to obtain Celestial Qi here. He would not waste any time staying here, and in the boundless distance, Song Lan was still collecting Celestial Qi for him. Though there was not much, it was better than nothing.","He quietly found the empress and the others, and they all reunited. When their conversation came to the topic of the heaven’s calamity, everyone still felt lingering fear.","Time passed easily, and another half year’s time had passed, and change had finally taken place.","The Purple Bamboo Forest began to recede.","Previously, it had expanded to cover the entire planet, but now, it was shrinking towards an area.","Once the bamboo forest retreated, everyone naturally appeared.","“Yi!” They discovered that Yang Yihuan, Lu Xun, and the other fallen Imperial Sons had also arrived here at some unknown time.","“What are you all here for?” Baili Haojie spoke up, his voice booming, carrying an interrogative tone.","Only the son of a Great Emperor like him would dare to do so. Otherwise, even the Golden Generations would not be worthy in front of Lu Xun and the others.","“The ancient treasure trove of the Empress is obtained by those who are fated,” Lu Xun said calmly. In front of Baili Haojie, his bearing did not weaken in the slightest.","“Are you even worthy?” Shi Tianlu scoffed, not giving them any face at all.","Among the sons of Great Emperors, which one of them wasn’t a supremely proud person?","“Hehe, we are all sons of Great Emperors, so what is there for you to be so proud of?” A black-robed young man stepped out, a red flame pattern engraved on his robes.","“Who are you?” Shi Tianlu asked calmly.","“The son of Ancestral King Fire Clouds, Lin Dong,” the black-robed young man said calmly.","What!","Everyone was shocked. The Fire Cloud Imperial Clan?","Wasn’t the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan already passed down? Why was there another fallen Imperial Son now?","After the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan and the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan, a third Imperial Clan with two heirs appeared.","If one delved deeper, one could sense there was something off.","Because whether it was the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan or the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan, or the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan, none of them had an ancient Imperial Son that had revived, because they did not exist at all!","—They had long since fallen, and collaborated with the Netherworld.","Thus, while Imperial Sons from Imperial Clans such as Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan and Ziwei Imperial Clan and so on were all killed or crippled but once the ancient Imperial Son appeared, he immediately turned the tides. At least for now, these Imperial Sons all belonged to the highest grade.","Ling Han, Ding Shu and the others were all no match!","However, the Imperial Clans that had a Fallen Imperial Son were in trouble. The ancient Imperial Son was standing on the opposing side, and now faced with this, how could they bear it?","“Come battle!” Shi Tianlu immediately charged out, battling fiercely with Lin Dong.","After a short period of probing, the two Imperial Sons immediately unleashed their full battle prowess, both wanting to defeat the other.","The difference was too great.","Aside from the most ancient period when the heaven and earth was first created, and there were a great many Divine Beasts standing side by side, after that, there would only be one Great Emperor in each era.","As the saying went, Great Emperors would never have a chance to meet another.","The Great Emperor was like this, and so was the Imperial Son. Theoretically speaking, there was no chance for them to exchange blows.","However, the appearance of the Primordial Source Clay made the impossible possible.","Now, the two sons of Great Emperors were exchanging blows, and from a certain aspect, it could also be considered as the battle between the two Great Emperors.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","However, for the descendants of these Great Emperors to all be sealed, so which one of them wasn’t a supreme prodigy?","Thus, in the intense battle between Imperial Sons, neither was weaker than the other, and it was difficult to decide who was stronger.","At the same time, the bamboo forest was still shrinking. Finally, it turned into a thin bamboo stalk that was no more than two feet long, dark green in colour.","Boom, a frightening might reverberated out, causing both Shi Tianlu and Lin Dong to stop.","This was Imperial Might!","Everyone couldn’t help but turn their gazes to the only thin bamboo stalk.","According to legends, Empress Qingzhu extracted a portion of her own body and forged it into an Imperial Weapon. Could it be that it was this bamboo stalk?","Imperial Weapon!","Even if most of the people here were Imperial Clan elites, and there was no shortage of children of Great Emperors, when they saw the Imperial Weapon, they all looked excited.","This was a weapon that belonged solely to the Great Emperor.","Even if every Imperial Clan had an Imperial Weapon, that belonged to the whole clan, not a particular individual.","Now, this was the inheritance of the Empress. It was an ownerless item, and whoever obtained it would own it!","An Imperial Weapon that could be enjoyed by oneself. What difference did this have with a Great Emperor?","Thus, obtaining the Imperial Weapon not only allowed one’s abilities to skyrocket, but also represented that one was destined and blessed by fortune.","Immediately, powerful Saints rushed forwards. There were Nine Star Saints, as well as the sons of Great Emperors like Baili Haojie. However, they had just taken a few steps forwards, when Imperial Might diffused into the surroundings, causing their skin to crack, and blood to gush out.","Their figures slowed down, but in front of the Imperial Weapon, who would be willing to give up? They were still advancing with great difficulty.","However, no matter how strong a Saint was, he could only take a few steps forwards, and then his feet would not be able to move.","The Imperial Might permeated through the air. It was too terrifying. If one advanced another step further, his body would definitely explode.","So what if you were a Saint, no matter how strong you were, in front of Imperial Might, you were nothing but trash.","“No!”","“We can’t retrieve it like this at all!”","“Return to the clan and ask for the Imperial Weapon!”","At present, the Imperial Weapon couldn’t be brought alongside with them, because the invasion of Yin souls was completely supported by the Imperial Weapon. Otherwise, what could stop the progress of the Skeleton Saint Tool?","Thus, the Imperial Weapon was naturally at the front lines. However, in order to obtain a new Imperial Weapon, any clan would be willing to temporarily transfer the Imperial Weapon over.","This was the most precious treasure in the world.","Immediately, a few Saints tore a rip into the Void and left. If they went back and returned, it would only take a month’s time, at most.","Meanwhile, Ling Han’s mind whirred.","Was the Imperial Weapon set up by the Empress?","Impossible!","What Great Emperor did not have an Imperial Weapon?","Thus, if it was said that leaving behind an Imperial Weapon would solve the great crisis of this lifetime, that was impossible."]},{"number":4637,"title":"Chapter 4637: Stone door","paragraphs":["Chapter 4637: Stone door","Ling Han didn’t attempt it.","It was very obvious that the Imperial Weapon was already showing its might. Though it was only exuding a slight bit of Imperial Might, this was still not something that any Saint could match.","He roamed around on this extinguished sun, wanting to discover something, but he did not find anything.","About a month later, the Saints that had gone to ask for the Imperial Weapon returned.","The first to return was the Blood Flame Imperial Clan, who summoned a blood-red heavenly saber. That was the Imperial Weapon that the Blood Flame Ancestral King had used years ago. Boom, it was activated by a Saint, and instantly, Imperial Might blazed.","Ling Han and the others hurriedly retreated. If this Blood Flame Imperial Clan took advantage of the opening to attack them, then when the Imperial Might arrived, who could block it?","One had to guard against despicable people.","However, after the Blood Flame Saber revived, that emerald green bamboo also glowed, exuding a similarly mighty imperial might.","The Blood Flame Imperial Clan’s Saint used the Imperial Weapon as protection, and headed towards the green bamboo.","However, he could only advance halfway, and there was no way for him to continue.","The might of the Imperial Weapon was too strong, and he could not take another step further.","This caused everyone to frown. He had actually mobilized the Imperial Weapon, yet was still unable to retrieve it?","Then what could be done?","Less than half a day later, another Saint brought an Imperial Weapon with him.","This was the Demon Ox Imperial Clan.","The two Imperial Clans that had Imperial Weapons discussed for a while, and decided to work together to obtain the inheritance of the Empress.","They would retrieve it first, and as for how it would be distributed afterwards, that was a matter for later. They had to get hold of the treasure first, before they could discuss the future.","They both revived the Imperial Weapon before continuing to advance.","The green bamboo immediately revived on its own, similarly emanating Imperial Might, resisting the two great Imperial Weapons.","In a battle of two against one, the green bamboo would definitely be at a disadvantage. However, the revived Imperial Weapon was like a Great Emperor. As long as the Imperial Weapon was not destroyed, how could it be retrieved by a Saint?","This made everyone feel exasperated.","At first, they had thought that if they used two Imperial Weapons to grind down on it, they would definitely be able to exhaust all the energy in the green bamboo. Then, it would be much easier to collect it.","However, the energy in the green bamboo seemed to be endless, and could not be exhausted no matter what.","Everyone couldn’t help but admire the strength of the Great Emperor. Even the arrangements made millions and millions of years ago were so awesome.","More and more Saints returned with the Imperial Weapon, but the situation was still the same. The revived Imperial Weapon was too terrifying. It was not something that any Saint could obtain.","However, the Imperial Weapons couldn’t stay here forever. Without the Imperial Weapons to suppress the front lines, the Skeleton Saint Tool would truly have no opposition.","Thus, since it was useless even if they brought the Imperial Weapons, the Saints could only send the Imperial Weapons back.","With the inheritance of the Empress before them, no one was willing to give it up.","How exactly were they supposed to retrieve it?","Another few days later, a massive tremor suddenly took place on this extinguished sun. Then, a massive stone door appeared in the distance.","Yi?","Everyone looked at the Imperial Weapon here, then looked at the stone door in the distance. For a moment, they didn’t know what to choose.","After the change, perhaps it would be very easy to obtain the Imperial Weapon, but it was also possible that the stone door ahead was the key?","Yet Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest. He communicated a message through divine sense to Brother Monkey, the empress and the others, and was already the first to move.","If the Empress was willing to easily gift the Imperial Weapon, then one of them would have long since obtained it.","It was obviously impossible.","Thus, the key was definitely that stone door that had just appeared.","There were many people who had the same thoughts as him, and they all rushed over.","With how fast a Saint was, even if they were suppressed by the Imperial Might here, and could not unleash their full speed, it was only a matter of one or two steps, and they had all arrived in front of the stone door.","The massive stone doors didn’t connect heaven and earth, but they were still 300 meters tall. They were simple and unadorned, exuding a primitive aura.","The stone door was tightly shut. From both sides, it looked the same. The door was completely flat, and there were no designs engraved on it. It appeared very plain.","Immediately, an Imperial Son walked out, arrived in front of the stone door, and stretched out a hand to push it open.","‘Hmm?’","With a push from him, the stone door actually did not move in the slightest.","This stunned everyone. This was a Golden Generation. Though his natural talent in martial arts could no longer be considered the strongest, he still belonged to the top tier. He actually did not manage to push open the stone door. This was a little exaggerated.","Could it be that they would have to send out a Great Emperor?","That Golden Generation roared loudly, and suddenly channelled his full power. Hong long long, the stone door instantly let out a loud bang, and was pushed open bit by bit.","When he pushed it open to a certain extent, they saw that the Golden Generation’s entire body had suddenly disappeared, and he had fallen in headfirst. Then, he could no longer be seen.","The stone door was still tightly shut, as if nothing had happened.","Was this a blessing or a curse?","Perhaps, one would be able to obtain the inheritance of the Empress after entering, but perhaps, supreme killing intent was hidden within, and those who trespassed would die.","“Let’s go,” Ling Han said. He didn’t believe that the Empress had spent so much effort to set soemthing up just to kill them millions and millions of years later.","Brother Monkey, the empress and the others followed behind.","Ling Han went to push open the doors first. Boom, a powerful force surged out, but the doors did not move in the slightest.","That was awkward.","Ling Han channeled Regulations again. This time, the stone door finally released a cracking sound, and then slowly opened.","He breathed a sigh of relief. As it turned out, he needed to use Regulations. Merely Saint-level power was not enough.","When he pushed open the stone doors to a certain extent, he felt a force pulling him in. It was incredibly huge, and immediately pulled him through the stone doors.","Yi, he had entered into a passage that was exuding a green halo, but he did not see that Golden Generation from before ahead of him.","He looked back, but did not see the stone door.","He understood now. Pushing open the stone doors, he had entered into another world.","So, was this where the true inheritance of the Empress lay?","Ling Han waited for a moment, yet he didn’t see the empress, Brother Monkey, or anyone else enter.","Logically speaking, the empress and the others wouldn’t hesitate at all. They would definitely follow him at the first instant.","Thus, Ling Han was also certain that the path that each person entered was independent of the rest.","This was the Empress’ test.","Thinking of this, Ling Han no longer hesitated, and strode forwards.","Weng, he had just advanced one step, when he saw light and shadow sway ahead of him, which then condensed into a human body.","This person’s appearance could not be seen at all, but he immediately charged towards Ling Han.","Boom!","His fist shot over aggressively.","However, Ling Han did not take it to heart at all. That was because it was only a Venerate, but he had delivered twenty Seven Star Regulations in a single strike, so he could be considered powerful among Venerates.","However, the person this shadowy figure was facing was Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t make a move at all. With a single thought, he slashed out a wisp of Spiritual Power. Pa, this figure was sliced into two, and then exploded.","He continued onwards. Xiu, another human figure appeared. It was still Venerate Tier-level, but it could fire out 30 Seven Star Regulations with a single strike.","Without intertwining Regulations, one would not be able to unleash battle prowess that surpassed cultivation level. Thus, so what if there were 30 Regulations? They were easily shattered by Ling Han again.","Advancing further, a third human figure appeared. This time, it could fire out 40 flashes of Regulations with a single strike.","However, it was useless.","Ling Han didn’t stop. As long as one had Venerate Tier-level battle prowess, no matter how strong they were, there was no need for him to make a move at all. He could suppress them with a single thought."]},{"number":4638,"title":"Chapter 4638: Driven Away","paragraphs":["Chapter 4638: Driven Away","The situation finally changed when the attack of the light figure reached 99 Seven Star Regulations.","This had reached the battle prowess of a One Star Saint.","The quality was inferior, but quantity would make up for it.","However, Ling Han’s 10 low-level Regulations would be equivalent to one high-level Regulations, but without the intertwining of Regulations, he would need about 100.","A One Star Saint!","It was still insufficient in front of Ling Han, but for a Venerate, to say nothing of a One Star Saint, even the power of a Half-Saint would be unstoppable. How many people in this world would be able to pass this stage?","Ling Han snapped his fingers, and pa, this shadowy figure of light immediately crumbled.","It was still very easy.","He took another step forward. Weng! Light and shadow took form. This time, it wasn’t Venerate Tier-level anymore. Instead, it was a genuine Saint.","Two-star level.","So what?","Ling Han casually blasted it aside, not stopping in his tracks.","But the strength of the shadowy figure was also becoming stronger and stronger, from Two Stars to Three Stars, Three Stars to Four Stars. With every one that was destroyed, it would become slightly stronger.","When a Seven Star Saint appeared, Ling Han would also have to face him seriously.","On the level of Regulations, his opponent was no longer inferior to him.","However, Ling Han still had Destructive Energy, four pinnacle pillars, murderous aura attacks, and even a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon. How many stars could this increase his battle prowess by?","At most, he would only have to expend a little more effort, and Ling Han would still sweep aside all opposition, advancing aggressively.","An eight-star Saint would still be killed!","Next, a Nine-Star Saint appeared.","Of course, this kind of Nine-Star Saint was too weak. In reality, which one of those that could charge up to become a Nine-Star Saint would only have mastered nine Eight Star Regulations?","This was the manifestation of the power of the Great Emperor, gradually increasing its strength. It was understandable.","Faced with a nine-star Saint, Ling Han appeared to be struggling.","This was the suppression of a gap of two Regulations.","Moreover, Ling Han wasn’t a true Saint after all, so he was naturally at a disadvantage.","He had no choice but to unleash the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to grind his opponent to death.","Next... was the 10-star Saint.","No, no, no, there was no overall level of cultivation like this. This was still a nine-star Saint, but the number of Regulations it could use had increased from nine to ten.","There was only a slight difference of Regulations, but his battle prowess had increased explosively.","Ling Han was extremely strained. He fought with all his might, and after paying the price of being riddled with wounds, he finally killed his opponent.","He breathed a sigh of relief and sat down on the spot, using the Ten Cultivation Technique to heal his injuries.","He sat there for two days.","Thankfully, as long as he did not move, no new shadowy figures of light would appear.","He stood up, his fighting spirit blazing.","Again!","He took a step forwards, and as expected, a new shadowy figure of light appeared. With a single strike, eleven eight-star Regulations shone brilliantly.","Ling Han faced it head-on, but this time, the gap was really too wide. Under the crushing pressure of raw strength, even he could do nothing.","He had no choice but to retreat. Instantly, the shadowy figure of light disappeared.","After recovering for a while, Ling Han walked forwards again, and the shadowy figure of light reappeared.","He was no match for him.","Ling Han could only retreat again.","Time and time again, this shadowy figure with eleven stars of battle prowess had become Ling Han’s blockade, continuously hindering his progress, unable to break through.","Ling Han didn’t try again. Before his strength increased, there was no possibility of him being a match at all.","Thus, he could only stop here.","Had he failed this challenge?","Otherwise, shouldn’t there have been some voice that would say something to him?","But here, there was only silence.","What was going on here?","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han noticed that the brightness of the passageway was slightly dimmer than before.","This was not an illusion. Another day later, the passage had clearly darkened again.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Could this be a kind of countdown?","Before the passageway was completely destroyed, this would be considered as the time to pass the test, and the results would definitely depend on how far one had advanced.","This would depend on one’s ability to battle above one’s cultivation level, and as for Ling Han... he was definitely number one in the world. Even if a Great Emperor revived, he would have to step aside.","“Then, I’ll definitely get first place.”","“Since the Empress has foreseen a terrifying future, it should be the present invasion of the Netherworld. Thus, to resolve this, an invincible king tier must be nurtured.”","“My tier surpassing ability is number one, which means that no matter what cultivation level I am in, I can sweep aside all my peers.”","“Going by that deduction, I should be the one to obtain the ancient treasure trove.”","“It’s just that I don’t know what kind of plan the Empress has prepared.”","Ling Han was extremely curious, but all he could do now was wait.","With every passing day, the passageway would dim slightly. When the fourteenth day arrived, practically thw whole passage had dimmed.","Another day passed, and Ling Han suddenly felt his eyes light up. He had already returned to that extinguished sun, and in front of him was the Emerald Bamboo Imperial Weapon.","Beside him was the Golden Generation that had entered first.","Upon seeing him, the Golden Generation revealed an awkward expression. He nodded at Ling Han, and a smile appeared on his face.","Ling Han also smiled. This was the Imperial Son of the Saintly Heaven Imperial Clan. Previously, there had not been any animosity between them. Thus, though he would not be warm towards him, it was not to the extent that he would turn hostile, or even actually make a move to cause injury.","A while later, Brother Monkey, the empress and the others appeared, one after another.","As expected, everyone’s challenge time was the same, and the order of entry was also the order of exit.","As more and more Imperial Sons appeared, many people’s eyes were focused on Ling Han.","By now, everyone naturally knew what the test behind the stone door was, and in terms of tier surpassing battle prowess, who could compare to Ling Han?","Then, the inheritance of the Empress was going to be taken by Ling Han?","It should be known that Empress Qingzhu had deliberately made arrangements for this. Thus, her inheritance was definitely not limited to something like the Imperial Weapon, Imperial Scroll, and so on. There must be other treasures. Otherwise, how could the great calamity that would befall all eternity be resolved?","These treasures all belonged to Ling Han alone?","F***!","This guy was already freakish enough, and he was going to become even stronger?","Then what was the point of letting others continue?","“Kill him!”","“At the very least, we have to chase him away.”","The Imperial Sons exchanged looks. Even a fallen Imperial Son like Yang Yihuan revealed a baleful expression, focusing his gaze on Ling Han.","The two sides that should have been completely hostile were now showing signs of joining forces because of Ling Han.","—Before the great temptation of becoming Emperor, one could let go of all grievances.","Xiu!","Right at this moment, the ground suddenly split apart, and a pillar of light shot into the sky.","What was going on?","Hiss, the inheritance of the Empress was about to appear!","Everyone understood. They all shouted loudly, and charged towards Ling Han.","There was no time. They had to kill Ling Han or chase him away.","There was no shortage of Five Star Saints like Baili Haojie among them. One-on-one, they were enough to suppress Ling Han, what more when there were so many of them working together?","What could Ling Han do?","He could only flee.","He used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. He traversed everywhere, but he only flew in this area and did not leave.","The inheritance of the Empress was about to appear, so how could he possibly leave?","“You’re not leaving? Then die!”","All the Imperial Sons smirked coldly. They had used Regulations to seal off space, and Ling Han’s space of movement would be further and further compressed. If he still continued to battle, his only fate would be death."]},{"number":4639,"title":"Chapter 4639: Seed of the Holy Flame","paragraphs":["Chapter 4639: Seed of the Holy Flame","Ling Han could do nothing, so he could only expand the range of his movements.","Brother Monkey and the others couldn’t help much either. They were all One Star Saints, and even if their natural talent wasn’t inferior to the ancient Imperial Sons, there was still a huge gap of so many minor levels between them. Thus, they were naturally overwhelmed.","Xiu, the pillar of light soared into the sky, but very soon, as if it had spat out all its energy, it began to withdraw.","The inheritance of the Empress was about to appear?","All the Saints kept Ling Han out, while preparing themselves to make a move to snatch it at any time.","The pillar of light instantly dimmed. Then, a purple dot of light suddenly rushed out from where the pillar of light had disappeared, turning into a shooting star. Its speed was indescribable.","Was this the inheritance of the Empress?","No matter what it was, they had to grab hold of it first.","All the Saints hurriedly moved, but the purple light spot was incredibly agile, and its speed was also very fast. None of the Saints managed to succeed in their attack.","However, the Saints used the Regulations as a net, and forcibly restricted space, causing the speed of the purple speck of light to finally slow down.","At this moment, the Saints could also clearly see that this purple dot of light was actually a seed!","Yi?","Seed? Could this be a supreme treasure?","After this thought flashed through their minds, the Saints showed no signs of stopping.","They would snatch it first. Even if it was trash, they would have to obtain it first.","“Haha, this is mine now!” Baili Haojie stretched out a hand, and grabbed hold of the purple seed.","Firstly, he was lucky. When the seed’s speed slowed down, it just happened to be by his side. Secondly, he was strong enough, because there were actually others beside him. It was just that they could not snatch it ahead of him.","He was extremely pleased with himself. This was clearly destiny.","“No!” he suddenly roared loudly, and a streak of purple light actually shot out from the top of his head.","What else could it be but that purple seed?","Who would have thought that a great Saint would actually be unable to detain a seed?","Xiu, this time, the purple seed had a clear target.","Ling Han!","It continued to speed up, heading towards Ling Han.","If it’s not yours, you can’t keep it no matter what. If it’s yours, even if you don’t want it, it will still deliver itself to your doorstep.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and stretched out a hand to grab it.","Xiu, the purple dot of light sank into his palm, then quickly came to his mind, and settled down.","Images spread out in Ling Han’s mind. This was about the origins of this seed.","Ling Han saw a supreme Empress standing proudly in space. There was an emerald green halo around her, which made her appear both mighty and heroic, as well as indescribably beautiful.","And in front of her, there was a massive crack.","F***, this was the great fissure at the edge of the universe!","Ling Han had seen this large crack in Xuan Taiyu’s vision before, and now, he saw it in Empress Qingzhu’s memories.","By the looks of it, the ancient Great Emperors had all ventured to the edge of the universe before. However, the Battle Saint Emperor, the Ancestral King Lingtian, and the others had all entered this place in their later years, never to appear again.","Subsequently, Ling Han saw Empress Qingzhu enter into this large fissure, but the image was extremely blurry. He could not see clearly at all, and the image was still flickering. After a while, Ling Han finally caught a blurry image.","—In Empress Qingzhu’s hand, there was a purple seed.","It was the one in his mind.","As it turned out... this seed actually originated from the edge of the universe.","This was incredible!","It should be known that even the Great Emperors had gone to the edge of the universe to search for a way to achieve immortality, and clearly, the so-called edge of the universe was only a general term. The true destination of the Great Emperors was this spatial fissure!","In this scene, Ling Han could even see that the Empress was riddled with wounds, and the right side of her chest had even been pierced through!","That was the Empress, the strongest existence in the universe, and she was actually injured?","Furthermore, her injuries were so severe!","Hiss, it could be seen just how great a price the Empress had paid for this purple seed.","No wonder the Great Emperors only came here to adventure in their old age, seeking the path to immortality.","It was too dangerous. Even the Great Emperors could possibly die.","At this moment, the scene dimmed, and a thought was transmitted into Ling Han’s mind.","“This is the Seed of the Holy Flame, and it has existed since the creation of heaven and earth.”","“Using this to burn the holy flame, and ultimately become Great Emperor, one would be qualified to become the strongest Great Emperor in history!”","“I have foreseen a great catastrophe that would occur millions and millions of years later. Though I have planned ahead, the future is filled with variables, so there is only so much I can do.”","“Thou shalt work hard, and strengthen thyself.”","Then, Ling Han received a secret technique that was used to control the Imperial Weapon.","The Clear Bamboo Sword, the Imperial Weapon used by Empress Qingzhu!","In Empress Qingzhu’s blurry memories, Ling Han saw that after this Empress journeyed to the edge of the universe, she passed away not long after, and returned to the heavens as a green bamboo.","It was clear that she had been severely wounded during her journey to the edge of the universe. In fact, she had even wounded her foundations as a Great Emperor. Otherwise, with her power as a Great Emperor, it wouldn’t have been a problem for her to live a second life as long as she could find supreme treasures.","This Empress had never married, nor had she left behind any descendants. In fact, she hadn’t even created the Imperial Scroll.","Because the Imperial Scroll was only taught to future generations, did a Great Emperor himself need the Imperial Scroll?","He was capable of all that he had learnt!","Thus, the Empress only passed down her method of controlling the Imperial Weapon, and did not teach him her own Imperial Technique.","Ling Han knew that the Empress had other considerations.","—If one wanted to become a Great Emperor, he would have to walk his own path, and to imitate others, no matter how strong he was, there was no way he could become a Great Emperor.","Thus, the Empress hoped that Ling Han could walk his own path without being affected, and did not pass on the slightest bit of her own path.","Such a great person was worthy of admiration.","As the saying went, when one passed, their name would be left behind. Without an immortal life, leaving behind one’s inheritance would naturally be the best choice.","Yet the Empress was disdainful of this.","This was the generosity of a Great Emperor.","Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open.","These words took a long time to say, but in truth, they had all streaked through Ling Han’s mind, and only less than a second had passed.","“Hand it over!” The Imperial Sons all attacked Ling Han as if they had gone mad.","Putting everything else aside, merely looking at how the purple seed could actually run out of Baili Hao’s body on its own, it was clear how amazing this thing was.","How could the inheritance left behind by the Empress be ordinary?","Boom, boom, boom! As the Saints attacked, they spread out, surrounding Ling Han and the others.","Flee?","Impossible!","So what if Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was fast? It couldn’t penetrate the Regulations.","“Hand over the seed, or die!” an old Saint said. He humphed, and drew out a jade vial. Weng, a frightening might overflowed, and even the heaven and earth paled in comparison.","Imperial Might!","Gods, this was actually an Imperial Weapon!","Who would have thought that after the failed attempt to seize the green bamboo, the Imperial Weapon would be returned, and continue to resist the Skeleton Saint Tool, that there was actually an Imperial Clan that kept the Imperial Weapon by their side secretly.","This was the Treasure Vial Imperial Clan.","Obviously, they had long since made up their minds. No matter who obtained the inheritance of the Empress, they would seize it by force with the Imperial Weapon.","The Imperial Weapon had already awakened and enveloped the entire planet. If anyone dared to act rashly, they would immediately suffer a head-on attack from the Imperial Weapon!","How were they supposed to resolve this dilemma?"]},{"number":4640,"title":"Chapter 4640: Come on!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4640: Come on!","The Imperial Weapon locked onto him, and even the Nine-Star Saints broke out in a cold sweat.","Who would have thought that the Treasured Vial Imperial Clan would actually have a trump card up their sleeve? Moreover, they had secretly activated the Imperial Weapon while the Saints were attacking Ling Han.","Now, wherever the Imperial Weapon pointed, who wouldn’t feel apprehensive?","“Hand over the inheritance of the Empress, or your only fate would be death!” the Saint from the Treasure Vial Imperial Clan shouted. He believed that the inheritance of Empress Qingzhu was definitely hidden in that purple seed.","Thus, he was only threatening Ling Han. That was because under the barrage of attacks from the Imperial Weapon, Ling Han’s form and spirit would definitely be destroyed. It was guaranteed that not a single scrap would be left behind, and the inheritance of the Empress would definitely be gone as well.","What could they do?","Brother Monkey, the empress, and the others all looked at Ling Han. Tearing a rip into space to leave required time. Though it was short, it was enough time for the Imperial Weapon to strike down and erase everything.","Could it be that they really had to hand over the inheritance of the Empress?","The problem was, would the Treasure Vial Imperial Clan keep their promise?","At present, it was only coercion, and they could make the Treasure Vial Imperial Clan hold back due to wariness, but once the inheritance was handed over, would the Treasure Vial Imperial Clan still have any qualms?","It should be known that Ling Han had always been a thorn in the side of the Imperial Clans. If he did not die, what Imperial Son would dare say that he could become emperor?","Yet Ling Han smiled, and said calmly, “I don’t believe you!”","‘You don’t believe me?’","What right do you have not to believe me?","The might of the Imperial Weapon could obliterate all matter, and even a nine-star Saint would have to die in resentment. Where did you get such courage from?","“Ling Han, don’t think that just because you have the inheritance of the Empress, I don’t dare to make a move!” the old Saint from the Treasure Vial Imperial Clan said balefully. He was an eight-star Saint with the title of Bright Minister. Even if he didn’t use the Imperial Weapon, he could still suppress Ling Han.","However, Saint against Saint, even if Ling Han wanted to flee, he wouldn’t be able to stop him. He wouldn’t be able to kill him with a single strike.","However, the Imperial Weapon was different. Once it revived, as long as it locked onto its target, aside from the Pseudo-Emperor, who could escape?","In other words, unless a Pseudo-Emperor arrived, no one would be able to save Ling Han.","Why was Ling Han so certain?","“Come on then!” Ling Han crooked a finger at him, looking like he was provoking someone.","F***, had this guy gone mad?","The Imperial Weapon was pointing at you, and you still dare to act arrogant and provoke it?","“Humph! Worse come to worst, no one can obtain the inheritance of the Empress!” the Bright Minister Saint said coldly. Even if he destroyed the inheritance of the Empress, that would still be better than falling into Ling Han’s hands. Otherwise, who would be able to compete with him for the imperial throne?","“Die!”","He gave a loud shout. Boom, the treasure bottle suddenly exploded with an endless burst of Imperial Might. A pillar of light shot out from the bottle’s mouth, charging towards Ling Han.","The awakening of the Imperial Weapon was equivalent to the reincarnation of a Great Emperor. Who could stop it?","There was none!","Even a Pseudo-Emperor couldn’t do it.","Everyone shook their heads. Ling Han was definitely done for.","This was good too. Though the inheritance of the Empress was also gone, but with this as the price, it was not too much of a loss to erase a competitor that had the highest chance of becoming Emperor.","The light of the treasure bottle assailed, capable of crushing everything.","Peng, light exploded, endlessly dazzling.","However, everyone shockingly discovered that the treasure bottle’s light had actually been blocked.","What!","This caused everyone’s scalps to go numb. Ling Han was going to defy the heavens! He could even withstand the might of the Imperial Weapon!","However, after only an instant, everyone discovered that this wasn’t because Ling Han was heaven-defyingly powerful, but rather because there was a dark green bamboo floating above his head. It was only two feet long, yet it was exuding a terrifying imperial might.","This was Empress Qingzhu’s Imperial Weapon!","—Previously, Ling Han had been arguing verbally with the Bright Minister Saint, but his true motive was actually to drag out time, so he could grasp the technique to control the Clear Bamboo Sword.","Though he only had a slight grasp of it now, it was enough for him to awaken the Imperial Weapon, and there was no need for him to be very proficient.","Now, when an Imperial Weapon faced another Imperial Weapon, what did Ling Han have to fear?","“Come on then!” Ling Han smiled calmly.","‘Holy f*ck!’","At this moment, everyone was speechless.","With the Imperial Weapon in hand, the world belonged to him!","Unless the Great Emperor revived, who would still be able to face Ling Han head-on?","Even if it was a Pseudo-Emperor, he would still have to exhaust Ling Han’s power first, so that he would no longer be able to awaken the Imperial Weapon. Only then would he be able to make a move on Ling Han. Otherwise, even a Pseudo-Emperor would also have to die!","The strongest trait of the Imperial Clan was that they had the Imperial Weapon on standby, but now?","Ling Han also had an Imperial Weapon. The real Imperial Weapon, and not a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon like the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","The Bright Minister Saint was also rendered speechless. Though his own battle prowess was superior to Ling Han’s, in front of Great Emperor-level power, his measly abilities were completely negligible.","Thus, as long as Ling Han could awaken the Imperial Weapon, there would be no solution.","Ling Han turned his gaze to Lu Xun and the other fallen Imperial Sons, then looked at Baili Haojie and the other ancient Imperial Sons, his killing intent brimming.","“Retreat! Retreat! Retreat!”","Cold sweat broke out on the backs of these Imperial Sons. The Imperial Weapon had shown its might. No matter how prodigious they were, so what? They would be blasted into smithereens with a single strike.","They all tore a rip into space and fled.","What was the point of staying any longer? The inheritance of the Empress had already been obtained by Ling Han.","The Bright Minister Saint was also rendered speechless. He had the Imperial Weapon, and so did Ling Han. This was the strongest Spirit Tool in the universe. It was also because of this that the individual battle prowess gap between the wielders to become negligible.","He was an eight-star Saint, so what did it matter that his abilities were superior to Ling Han?","There was absolutely no chance for him to show off, all right?","He glared hatefully at Ling Han. He had really not thought that Ling Han had obtained the inheritance of the Empress, and even the Imperial Weapon was under his control!","It didn’t make sense. The Imperial Weapon wasn’t left for the clansmen, and it was actually passed on to an outsider. Had this Empress lost her mind?","“Let’s go!” He made a prompt decision. After tearing a rip into space, he left with the other Saints of the clan.","In this way, only Ling Han, the empress, Brother Monkey, and a few others were left here.","“Haha!” They all laughed loudly. In terms of strength, which one of those like the Bright Minister Saint and the others was not stronger than them?","In fact, they only had to mobilize Baili Haojie, or Lin Dong, and that would be enough to sweep aside all opposition, but now? It was the Imperial Sons that were fleeing in disarray.","This was naturally a massive victory.","“We should also leave.”","Ling Han and the others returned to the Four Directions Planet. After settling down, he told them about the purple seed.","“Seed of the Holy Flame!”","“The most powerful Great Emperor!”","Everyone exclaimed in shock. This was something that the Empress had obtained from the edge of the universe. In fact, in fact, for the sake of this seed, the Empress had suffered severe injuries, and very soon, died, and did not live a second life.","Thus, just how astonishing was the value of this seed?","Meanwhile, Brother Monkey’s expression was solemn. Empress Qingzhu had been severely injured for the sake of this seed, so what about the Battle Saint Emperor?","Could it be that he had long since encountered a mishap?","Unfortunately, with the power of a Saint, he was completely unable to fly across the vast universe. At present, he could only feel anxious.","At the very least, one had to become a Pseudo-Emperor to qualify to approach the edge of the universe.","Brother Monkey had a target again, but advancing one step further in Saint Tier was really too difficult. Even if he was very motivated, he still had to take it one step at a time, and take things slowly.","Everyone went to cultivate, and as their cultivation level became higher and higher, this sense of urgency also became stronger and stronger. Now, it was up to who would be the first to become a Pseudo-Emperor, and they would be able to seize the first opportunity, squeezing into the true sequence of becoming Emperor.","Ling Han also began to cultivate in seclusion. However, his goal was to study the Seed of the Holy Flame.","However, his consciousness couldn’t enter the seed at all. After studying it for a while, he could only give up."]},{"number":4641,"title":"Chapter 4641: A great ocean in space","paragraphs":["Chapter 4641: A great ocean in space","This seed was profound and unfathomable.","Though it was only the size of a soybean, if it was magnified 10,000 times, one could clearly see the mysterious veined patterns on it, as if the secrets of the universe was engraved on it.","Ling Han didn’t dare to nurture this seed either. Once it sprouted, wouldn’t he become a Saint?","Right now, he didn’t want to become a Saint.","His target was the pinnacle of Fourth Extreme.","Ling Han returned to harvest a batch of Celestial Qi. Then, using the Clear Bamboo Sword as the formation eye, he continued to collect them.","This efficiency was completely different.","This was an Imperial Weapon, and it contained the Nine Star Regulations. It had an indescribable absorption effect on Celestial Qi, making them very easy to grasp.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. This could increase his efficiency tenfold.","Originally, he would have to wait about a hundred years to be able to fully cultivate a minor level, but now, he only needed a short ten years!","Calculating, he was presently a 10-star Venerate, and if it was like when he was a Sect Master, 15 Stars was the pinnacle level, then he still needed to increase his cultivation level by five minor levels. In total, he would need... 50 years!","Fifty years, he only needed fifty years.","For Venerate Tier, being able to increase cultivation level by one minor level in a few hundred years was already considered fast. Being able to increase cultivation level by five minor levels in these fifty years, how astonishingly fast was that?","Ling Han nodded in understanding. No wonder the Imperial Son’s cultivation had advanced so quickly. He had the support of the Imperial Clan behind him, and as long as his comprehension ability was enough, it was truly easy for him to increase his cultivation level.","He was filled with anticipation. Fifty years later, he would be able to cultivate to the end of the Venerate Tier, and then accelerate the growth of the first Seed of the Holy Flame in history. Then, just how far would his battle prowess soar?","Was this kind of Saint strong enough to insta-kill anything and everything?","Though Ling Han had obtained the inheritance of Empress Qingzhu, and seemed to have obtained some kind of super great opportunity, after all, even Saints could not detain the Seed of the Holy Flame, and this was something that the Saints had witnessed with their own eyes.","However, the members of the Imperial Clans actually held back, and did not send anyone to threaten Ling Han to hand over the Seed of the Holy Flame.","It was not that they did not want to, but rather that they did not dare.","What did the Imperial Clan rely on the most? The Imperial Weapon!","Now, however, Ling Han also possessed an Imperial Weapon.","Thus, what did it matter that the Imperial Clan sent a Saint over with an Imperial Weapon?","What did Ling Han have to fear?","Imperial Weapon against Imperial Weapon, it would only result in both sides coming off damaged at most.","You see, was there a time when the Imperial Clans would become hostile and fight one another to the death?","There was none!","Because they all had Imperial Weapons that restricted each other, they naturally wouldn’t engage in battles that would damage foundations.","The present Nine Suns Holy Land had an Imperial Weapon, Imperial Scroll and Saints. Aside from being slightly lacking in formations, there was actually no difference between them and an Imperial Clan.","And in terms of the number of Saints, hoho, the Nine Suns Holy Land would be able to completely surpass any Imperial Clan.","Of course, the cultivation levels of the Saints were still a little low, and they were all One Star Saints.","However, given enough time, with the natural talent of Brother Monkey, the empress and the others, it would not be difficult for them to cultivate to seven, eight, or even nine-star Saints.","Their difficulty should be the barrier of Pseudo-Emperor Tier.","“Yi?”","On this day, Ling Han was concocting an alchemical pill when he suddenly saw a large sea floating over from the sky.","This!","Even if Ling Han was knowledgeable and experienced, he was still quite shocked.","This great ocean was incredibly far away from him, and was still in space. However, because it was too big, Ling Han was still able to catch sight of it even though they were so far apart.","There was actually a great ocean floating in space; this was too inconceivable, wasn’t it?","Could it be that some Mystery Realm had appeared?","However, this speed was so fast!","In merely the blink of an eye, this great ocean had enlarged a bit more, which showed how much distance had been closed in between them.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Brother Monkey, the empress and the others also saw it, and leaped over.","“Which Mystery Realm has appeared?” the large black dog asked curiously.","“Let’s go and take a look!” Ling Han said. Then, with a step, he had already arrived outside the Four Origin Planet.","The empress and the others all came over, and from here, they could see that this great ocean was even more boundless.","Gods, if the Four Origin Planet was thrown in, it would only be a small island, at most.","Everyone was stunned. This was really shocking.","In the great ocean, waves crashed into the skies, but there was clearly no land blocking the edges, yet not a single drop of seawater seeped out. No matter how the waves crashed into the skies, every drop would ultimately return to the great ocean.","“What kind of Mystery Realm is this? Sea Mystery Realm?” the large black dog mocked from the sidelines.","Of course, this sea had also been discovered by others, and they broadcasted it live on the Galaxy Network.","Instantly, a great many Imperial Clan elites moved out.","Perhaps there would be a supreme great opportunity!","As for why this great opportunity had taken the initiative to seek out Ling Han, they did not care.","In short, Ling Han had already obtained enough opportunities. He couldn’t continue to become stronger.","However, no matter how fast a Saint was, they would still need time. Right now, only Ling Han and the others were facing the rapidly approaching sea.","In just the time for a few breaths, this great ocean had appeared in the galaxy where the Four Origin Planet was located, and with how wide this great ocean was, it instantly drowned a great many nearby galaxies, and they could no longer be seen.","Hiss!","There were so many galaxies, and just how many living beings were in them, and they had all died just like that?","It was soundless and had no prior signs. At most, only a limited number of people managed to escape using the Transfer Formation. The others were all swallowed by the seawater along with the Transfer Formation.","Ling Han and the others exchanged looks, and a chill rose up in their hearts. Moreover, Four Origin Planet lay behind them.","However, the sea finally stopped, just thirty thousand meters in front of Ling Han and the others, as if it had a life of its own.","In an instant, a figure dashed out of the sea and appeared in front of Ling Han and the others.","This was a tall, slender man. He was dressed in a tight-fitting black outfit, and there was an octopus painted on his chest. However, it was golden, and actually gave off a sacred feeling.","“Greetings, everyone.” This man looked to be in his early twenties, at most. The flame of life had only been burning for over ten thousand years, but he was shockingly a Four-Star Saint!","F***, was it an ancient Imperial Son?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Ge Qianqiu had said before that there were a total of Twelve Lands of Death and their masters in this world, so could it be that this was one of them?","He looked at this black-robed young man, and asked darkly, “Who are you?”","“Me?” The black-robed young man smiled slightly, “My surname is Zhang, and my name is Zhang Yu.”","“Octopus!” Hu Niu couldn’t help but pout. “Can’t be eaten, so what is the point of being named after seafood!1”","Everyone’s expressions became awkward. The tense atmosphere just now seemed to have been instantly reversed.","“Which Imperial Clan are you from?” Ling Han asked.","“My father is the Sea Emperor!” Zhang Yu smiled slightly.","Sea Emperor?","Was this also a Great Emperor?","Emperors and Ancestral King. Those whose name had these words within were all of the same level, and though there were also those who bit off more than they could chew and called themselves “Sword Emperor”, “Saber Emperor” and so on, they would basically be beaten to death very soon.","This was a taboo.","“Brother Zhang, why have you come so aggressively?” Ling Han asked coldly. The other had steered such a great ocean here, swallowing who knew how many galaxies along the way, so how could he possibly have a good expression?","Moreover, if he belonged to one of the Twelve Lands of Death, he would be a force from the Netherworld, so there was even less need for him to be reserved."]},{"number":4642,"title":"Chapter 4642: Demanding","paragraphs":["Chapter 4642: Demanding","In space, multiple figures tore a rip into space and appeared. Every single one of them was exuding a frightening aura, like they were Demon Gods.","The Saints had arrived.","There were those from the Imperial Clans, and there were also those from the Holy Lands. They had all seen the live broadcast on the Galaxy Network, and rushed over at the first instant.","These were those that were the closest to them. It was sure that there would be other Saints appearing, one after another, and there would be even more of them.","They all thought that this great ocean was some kind of Mystery Realm.","Strictly speaking, the Land of Death could also be considered a Mystery Realm, but in this place, there were basically no great opportunities, only death.","When these Saints saw Zhang Yu, they were all stunned.","Where had he popped out from?","Previously, they had been completely focused on their journey, and had not had the time to pay attention to Galaxy Network’s live broadcast.","However, as long as they connected to the Galaxy Network again, they would soon be able to find out the reason — it was not everyone in the Imperial Clans did not use the connection device, but among the core members, there was definitely none.","It didn’t matter. It was fine as long as one person connected it. He turned on the projection function, and then replayed it. Everything became clear.","Yi, this man actually walked out of the great ocean?","All the Saints were surprised. What the hell was this great ocean? Why was it floating in space?","Though he was surrounded by the Saints, Zhang Yu did not take it to heart at all. He looked calm and composed. He looked at Ling Han, and said with a smile, “I heard that Brother Ling has obtained a seed, and would like to ask Brother Ling Ling to part with it.”","Ling Han’s heart jolted.","For the sake of this seed, Empress Qingzhu had barged into the great crack at the edge of the universe by herself, and paid the price of being severely injured and unable to live a second life.","And why had she done that?","Because this Empress had foreseen a frightening future, she had made arrangements, wanting to create an invincible Great Emperor in this era, capable of sweeping aside all opposition in the world, and resolve the crisis.","From the look of things now, this crisis was the invasion of the Netherworld on the surface, but in truth, the mastermind behind it was the Masters of the Twelve Lands of Death.","No matter how one looked at it, this Zhang Yu, as well as this great sea, was a matching description for a Land of Death.","Thus, the rulers of the Twelve Lands of Death was also very wary of Empress Qingzhu’s trump card, and deliberately mobilized a Land of Death, wanting to snatch this seed.","In this way, the threat to them was naturally eliminated.","Ling Han shook his head, “Why should I part with it?”","Zhang Yu smiled, “As long as Brother Ling is willing to hand over that seed, I can satisfy whatever request you have.”","“For example, Imperial Scroll, if one scroll is not enough, you can have two scrolls, or even three or four scrolls.”","“Imperial Weapon is fine too!”","“Or perhaps, an exquisite beauty!”","What!","When the Saints in the surroundings heard this, they all trembled in excitement.","He was offering even an Imperial Scroll? Furthermore, it was not just one or two, but he was actually offering three or even four just like that?","‘F*ck! Just how many Imperial Clans have you robbed?’","After a moment of excitement, the Saints’ first reaction was that this person was boasting. What force would be able to grasp more than one Imperial Scroll?","Ling Han thought for a moment, then said, “All right. As long as you can satisfy one condition of mine, it is not impossible for me to part with it.”","“Please speak, Brother Ling.” Zhang Yu smiled calmly.","“Tell the masters of the Twelve Lands of Death to commit suicide, and I’ll hand that seed over to you,” Ling Han said.","This was obviously something that could not be accepted. Thus, Zhang Yu’s expression that had been smiling all this while finally changed.","He withdrew his smile, revealing a baleful and arrogant expression.","“Brother Ling, up until now, I have been speaking nicely,” he said calmly.","“Yi, you speak as if I have scolded you.” Ling Han shrugged his shoulders.","“This person has persecutory delusions, right?” the large black dog asked from the sidelines.","“You’re sick, you have to be treated!” the little azure dragon continued.","“Ang!” The perverted pig was exasperated. Uncle Pig had been throwing himself into a pile of women, and what was the meaning of you guys dragging Uncle Pig up here?","What a bunch of b@stards.","Zhang Yu instantly looked furious. How could these guys in front of him be so despicable? With just a few words, they had provoked him to the point of fuming.","“You guys, don’t be shameless!” He raised his voice.","All around them, the Saints all felt sympathy.","Ling Han, the large black dog, and the others were the type to drive others to die out of fury from their insults.","‘You should have long since prepared yourself. When it’s time to make a move, don’t waste words. There’s only one word for it: do it!’","However, this guy was actually also a Fallen Imperial Son like Yang Yihuan, He Luo, and the others. This naturally caused all the Saints to feel a sense of unity against a common enemy.","—Aside from a minority that was completely disregarding the bigger picture, even the Imperials knew that the conflict between them and Ling Han was an internal affair, while the conflict with the Netherworld was irreconcilable.","“Face is earned, not given by anyone,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Who do you think you are? Do you want us to give you face?” the large black dog scoffed.","“F*ck!” The little azure dragon gave him the middle finger.","Zhang Yu could no longer hold back, and moved directly, charging towards Ling Han and the others.","Boom! A devastating might surged into the surroundings. He was a Four-Star Saint, and he was more so the son of a Great Emperor. Thus, his natural talent in cultivation was astonishingly powerful. With a single strike, 12 eight-star Regulations surged into the surroundings.","Even Ling Han wouldn’t be able to withstand it. They all used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to rapidly retreat.","“I gave you face, yet you refuse. All of you, die!” Zhang Yu chased after them.","“Humph, this is the Living Realm!” A Saint stepped out, greeting Zhang Yu’s attack.","Boom!","He had actually blocked Zhang Yu, and was not at a disadvantage at all.","This stunned everyone. This person was clearly only a Four-Star Saint, yet was actually so strong!","“Luo Yang, son of the Great Emperor of the Saintly Heaven Imperial Clan!” It wasn’t long before someone revealed the identity of this Saint.","So that was the case.","Everyone nodded. They were both the sons of Great Emperors, so who would be weaker than the other?","The two Imperial Sons were locked in an intense battle. At this moment, to say nothing of deciding the victor, it was impossible to determine who had the upper hand.","All the Saints smirked coldly. A mere Imperial Son actually dared to boast shamelessly?","Did he really think that the people of the Living Realm were made of paper?","“How incredibly foolish!” Zhang Yu smirked coldly, and waved his hand, “Come!”","Weng, weng, weng! A terrifying scene appeared. Multiple figures flew out of the sea, densely packed together.","Saintly corpses!","Heavens, what kind of number was this?","Why was it this move again?","The sea of blood, the Yin River... their main method of attack was the corpses of Saints.","But even though this move was old-fashioned, it had been tested time and time again.","Just ask, who in the world could match the sea of corpses of Saints?","Aside from Great Emperors, only Pseudo-Emperors would be capable.","Instantly, all the Saints retreated.","They couldn’t face this head-on, or they would definitely die!","Even Luo Yang didn’t step forward to battle anymore. With his battle prowess, he wouldn’t be afraid of the corpses of Saints even if it were one-on-one or one-on-ten. However, how could it be just one-on-ten now?","One against a hundred, one against a thousand, ten thousand... no matter how strong his battle prowess was, he was no match.","Zhang Yu looked coldly at Ling Han, “You refuse a toast, and insist on drinking a forfeit! Hand over the seed, or I will destroy this planet below!”","Even if they were members of the Imperial Clans, they would not threaten others like this, because they were not all alone either. If they were targeted by a Saint, they would only be able to cower. Who would dare to run out of the protection of the Imperial Formation?","However, those who had come from desperate straits were unafraid.","Firstly, they were all Saints, and their abilities were astonishingly strong, and even if they were no match, how easy would it be for a Saint to escape?","Secondly, who would dare charge into a Land of Death?","Thus, Zhang Yu could threaten Ling Han like this."]},{"number":4643,"title":"Chapter 4643: Sea Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 4643: Sea Emperor","What could they do?","This was an incredibly realistic threat.","If Ling Han didn’t hand over the seed, the sea of corpses of Saints would be mobilized. It was guaranteed that Four Origin Planet wouldn’t even be left with scraps.","Imperial Weapon?","The Imperial Weapon could indeed block the sea of corpses of Saints, but the problem was, how long could it last?","Otherwise, Tong Ming wouldn’t have been able to kill so many Saints back then.","Ling Han also frowned. Though he had set up a Saint-level formation, how long could it last under the barrage of the sea of corpses of Saints?","However, the Seed of the Holy Flame had already fused with him, so it was impossible for him to take it out.","To say the least, even if it could be taken out, what kind of terrifying chain reaction would it cause if it was handed over?","The Empress had died because of this, which showed just how important this matter was. How could he surrender it to the ruler of a Land of Death?","Then what exactly should he do?","If only Buddha Doga and Ge Qianqiu could make it here.","“If you’re hoping for Buddha Doga and Ge Qianqiu, then don’t have any hopes.” Zhang Yu gave Ling Han another blow. “These two have already been invited for tea by the other two Lords. It’s impossible for them to arrive.”","In other words, the other rulers of the Lands of Death had made their move!","Now, was there still hope?","“I’ll count to three. At that time, I’ll wave my hand and urge these Saint corpses to attack,” Zhang Yu said calmly.","As the Imperial Son, he was actually going to do such threatening words, which made him very displeased.","However, it couldn’t be helped. That seed was too important.","“No, we definitely can’t hand over the seed!” An Imperial Clan Saint stepped out, and it was still Luo Yang.","“That’s right. We definitely can’t!” Another Saint stepped out, and it was still the son of a Great Emperor.","As expected, the sons of Great Emperors had their focus on the bigger picture. At this time, they definitely could not just sit by and watch.","Though they did not know what use this so-called seed could have, with how serious the Netherworld was, it must be of great importance.","With how incompatible the Living Realm and Netherworld were now, they definitely couldn’t allow the seed to fall into the hands of the rulers of the Lands of Death. Otherwise... the world would truly be in danger.","One after another, the sons of Great Emperors stepped out. At this time, others could just be concerned about themselves and not interfere, but the sons of Great Emperors could not.","Their vision went further than that.","Zhang Yu couldn’t help but sneer, “Since you guys are so stubborn, then die!”","He waved his hand, and instantly, the Saint corpses moved, surging like a tide.","This was too terrifying.","The battle prowess of Saint corpses was limited. The majority were One Star or Two Stars, and occasionally, there would be Three Stars or Four Stars. Five Stars belonged to the category of rare, but an abundance of ants could bite an elephant to death!","Moreover, how could these be mere ants? They were clearly fierce wolves.","The sea of corpses moved, and the Saints instantly entered into a tough battle.","It was too difficult. There were too many corpses in the sea, and what was the most despairing thing? After these corpses were shattered, they only had to be thrown back into that great ocean, and very soon, they would be able to reform their bodies, and become a “healthy man” again. There was absolutely no need for a long time to recover.","This was an endless battle; who could withstand it?","“Quick, organize a retreat.” Ling Han made arrangements.","Obviously, the Four Origin Planet couldn’t possibly be saved. Thus, the only thing they could do now was to evacuate all the living creatures on the Four Origin Planet and abandon this planet.","The Transfer Formation was activated, and people left in waves. However, the number of living beings on a planet was astonishing, and the Transfer Formation could only send a very limited number of people away every time. To completely empty a planet, it wouldn’t be possible without several hundred or several thousand years.","Meanwhile, the Saints were continuously retreating. How could they block the surging sea of corpses?","Ling Han had already activated the Imperial Weapon, and the Saint-level formation was also channeling, killing the Saint corpses and reducing the pressure on the Saints.","“Hehe, do you think that you are the only one with an Imperial Weapon?” Zhang Yu smirked coldly. He too drew out a purple hammer, and struck out at Ling Han. Kuang, a bolt of lightning immediately struck over.","Nine-star Regulations!","Among Imperial Weapons, which one would be weaker than another?","The Clear Bamboo Sword was immediately restrained by this purple hammer, and no longer had the time to attack the Saint corpses.","Right now, he could only rely on the Saint-level formation to unleash its might. More importantly, there were many nearby planets that had been engulfed by the sea, so they could no longer provide power for the Saint-level formation. As a result, its might was greatly reduced, and the threat it posed to the Saint-level sea of corpses was limited.","“You are already at the end of your rope, and you still want to resist stubbornly?” Zhang Yu smirked coldly.","At this point, he still wanted to turn the tables?","“Hehe, young friend seems to have encountered some difficulty!” Right at this moment, an old voice rang out.","Shua, another person had appeared in the galaxy at some unknown time.","This was an old man. He was dressed in coarse hemp clothing, and his attire was extremely plain.","“Yi!” Ling Han swept a glance over, and couldn’t help but be startled.","This was the person who had given him the Time Wine on the Imperial Path.","The old man who guarded the tomb!","He had actually exited the Imperial Path—uh, this wasn’t strange, but he would actually appear at this time?","“Who are you?” Zhang Yu was startled. How could this old geezer appear and disappear so mysteriously? Even he did not know how he had suddenly appeared here.","However, the tomb-keeper completely ignored Zhang Yu. It was as if the latter was just some random person, and he couldn’t even be bothered to give him a second look.","He looked towards that great ocean, and said calmly, “It’s time to stop!”","He was talking to... the ruler of the Land of Death!","Hiss, this meant that Zhang Yu was not qualified to converse with him.","“Damn it!” Zhang Yu’s expression was dark. He was the son of a Great Emperor. When the Sea Emperor ruled the world, he was the Second in the World. When had he ever been ignored like this?","With a wave of his hand, a large number of Saint corpses instantly charged toward the old man who had guarded the tomb.","The tomb-keeper merely waved his hand lightly, and instantly, masses of Saint corpses collapsed, directly exploding into dust.","Gods!","Seeing this scene, all the Saints felt their scalps go numb.","This person... could it be that he was a Great Emperor?","With a light wave of his hand, all 100 Saints were annihilated!","No, no, no, this couldn’t possibly be a Great Emperor. If a new Great Emperor appeared, the heaven and earth would be filled with strange phenomena, so how could it be that there would be no reaction at all?","If it had to be said that it was the Great Emperor from the last era or the era before last?","That was even more impossible. No Great Emperor could live for so long.","Hence—","“Pseudo-Emperor!” All the Saints exclaimed in shock.","The Nine-Star Saint wasn’t this strong, and it was also impossible for a Great Emperor to appear. Thus, this Lord could only be a Pseudo-Emperor.","Setting aside the rulers of the Lands of Death, this was the third Pseudo-Emperor from the Living Realm.","The appearance of the Pseudo-Emperor naturally increased everyone’s confidence greatly.","There was hope, there was finally hope.","The tomb-keeper waved his hand a few times, clearing the sea of corpses of Saints in the surroundings. He crossed his arms behind his back, and still did not cast a second look at Zhang Yu. Instead, his eyes were focused on the great sea, “Sea Emperor, you can stop now.”","W-what?","Hearing the tomb-keeper’s words, all the Saints felt their limbs go cold.","Sea Emperor?","A Great Emperor!","How was this possible!","The sea surged, and waves rose even though there was no wind, setting off shocking waves. Endless seawater soared into the sky, turning into a massive human face.","“Qian Yanghao, are you still not dead?” A voice filled with authority rang out. It actually came from that human face that was formed from seawater.","A smile appeared on the elder’s face, and his expression was filled with age. “You’re not dead yet, so how can I dare to die?”"]},{"number":4644,"title":"Chapter 4644: Truth!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4644: Truth!","Sea Emperor? Sea Emperor!","The minds of all the Saints were buzzing, and there was nothing they could hear or feel.","Was there anything more terrifying than this?","The ruler of this great ocean was actually a Great Emperor!","‘Is this fake?’","How was this possible!","The tomb-keeper, Qian Yanghao, was definitely a Pseudo-Emperor. This battle prowess could not possibly be faked. Thus, even a Pseudo-Emperor had said so, so how could it possibly be faked?","But... this was a Great Emperor!","How could everyone not feel despair?","It was publicly acknowledged that a Great Emperor was invincible in the world. What did a living Great Emperor signify?","Who could match him?","So what if it was a Pseudo-Emperor? In front of a true Great Emperor, that was only a slightly stronger ant.","Then what was the point of fighting? In front of a Great Emperor, no matter how much effort they put in, it would all be in vain.","Hold on!","Everyone suddenly recalled that wasn’t it allowed to become Emperor in this era? Any sign was proof of this.","But it should be known that there was Great Emperors would never see another Great Emperor. Since there was a Great Emperor alive, how could there possibly be another Great Emperor alive?","So, this Sea Emperor wasn’t a true Great Emperor?","Had he severed his cultivation level?","Otherwise, firstly, it was impossible that there had been signs of a Great Emperor appearing in the world, and secondly, since the Great Emperor alone was capable of sweeping aside all opposition in the world, what need was there for the Netherworld to mobilize some Skeleton Saint Tool?","Moreover, in front of a Great Emperor, what was a Pseudo-Emperor worth?","Thinking of this, everyone finally felt slightly at ease. Perhaps, the situation was not so hopeless.","“I will definitely protect this boy!” Qian Yanghao stated calmly, but his tone was incredibly firm, “If you make a move now, just how much battle prowess would you have?”","“It’s more than enough to kill you,” the face said. Its tone was calm, but it seemed to carry the willpower of the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths, convincing others.","“The Great Emperor has mastered the Regulations of Karma, and his words are law!” All the Saints’ hearts were throbbing madly. Even if that Sea Emperor had not appeared, every word and action he spoke made them think of a Great Emperor.","Yet Qian Yanghao was incredibly calm, “If you want to kill me, you would have to pay a huge price as well, so let me ask if you dare!”","The Sea Emperor was silent. After a while, the face suddenly turned into seawater, and fell back into the great ocean.","“Let’s go!” With a wave of Zhang Yu’s hand, the sea of Saint corpses instantly returned.","Then, that great ocean began to traverse the universe again, heading towards an endless distance.","The crisis had finally been resolved.","“Senior!” Ling Han looked towards Qian Yanghao, his heart filled with tumultuous waves, as well as countless questions.","Qian Yanghao nodded, and grabbed Ling Han. Xiu, a great golden path spread out beneath his feet, and he instantly disappeared with Ling Han in tow.","This speed was really too fast, and even the Saints could only stare in dumbfounded shock. There was absolutely no way they could catch up to him.","Far away, Qian Yanghao stopped, bringing Ling Han with him as they landed on a barren star.","“You have many questions,” Qian Yanghao said.","“That’s right.” Ling Han nodded. There were too many, all right?","“Ask away,” Qian Yanghao said very casually.","“The masters of the Twelve Lands of Death... are all Great Emperors?” Ling Han asked. When he said this, his heart was also tense.","Qian Yanghao smiled, and looked at Ling Han, “If I said yes, would you run away in fear?”","Ling Han thought for a moment, and a smile also appeared at the corners of his lips, “No!”","His fighting spirit would only soar!","So what if they were Great Emperors? As long as he became Great Emperor, he would be the strongest Great Emperor in history.","This was his confidence.","Qian Yanghao laughed loudly, and clapped a hand on Ling Han’s shoulder, “Brave boy, it was not in vain that I moved to save you! Fine, the answer is yes.”","F***!","Though Ling Han had long since prepared himself, he still mocked internally.","These were the 12 Great Emperors! How was he supposed to block them?","Yi, no wonder Xuan Taiyu had died, being ganged up on by twelve Great Emperors. They weren’t Pseudo-Emperors.","It was no wonder that the Empress Qingzhu was willing to sacrifice herself to set up these arrangements. If it was mere Pseudo-Emperors, what need was there for her to go so far?","“Senior, which era are you from?” Ling Han asked. It was obvious that this person had been here since much earlier than Ge Qianqiu.","Qian Yanghao thought for a moment, then replied, “A very, very long time ago.”","This was equivalent to not saying anything, but even if it was an era that belonged to a Great Emperor, or an era that was sandwiched between two Great Emperors, so what? It did not have much meaning.","“The masters of the Twelve Lands of Death. Do they want immortality?” Ling Han asked. Aside from this, he couldn’t think of any other possibility.","Qian Yanghao nodded, “Immortality must be part of it, but they are still chasing after something, and this is something that I do not know either.”","“But the Great Emperors can only live a second life, at most. Once he dies, his soul will merge with the heaven and earth, so how could they possibly live until now?” Ling Han asked. This was something that he couldn’t figure out no matter what.","Similarly, there was no one that could connect the rulers of the Lands of Death with Great Emperors, and that was also because this was theoretically impossible.","Qian Yanghao’s eyes were focused on the universe, looking at that incredibly far place.","After a while, he said, “These Great Emperors should have obtained some kind of secret technique from the great fissure at the edge of the universe.”","It was the edge of the universe again!","“Senior, why is there a large crack there?” Ling Han asked.","Meanwhile, Qian Yanghao said slowly, “This would have to begin with the birth of the universe.”","And it involved something so long ago?","“According to legends, our universe was only a sphere when it was first born. It was incredibly tiny, but it was also extraordinarily heavy.”","“One day, a small crack appeared on this sphere. Then, endless matter gushed out of it, expanding endlessly. Hence, you can see the current universe.”","“And that large fissure at the edge of the universe is that fissure on the sphere.”","Ling Han was dumbfounded. This was the truth behind the birth of the universe?","If it weren’t for the fact that this was said by a Pseudo-Emperor, he definitely wouldn’t believe it.","“The universe has already stabilized by now. However, the secret of the birth of the universe is hidden in that crack, and there are still heaven-defying treasures hidden there,” Qian Yanghao said. “Thus, it is not impossible to obtain the technique of ‘immortality’ from within.”","“However, the art of immortality that the Great Emperors in those Lands of Death obtained is really too strange.”","“According to this old man’s deductions, this secret technique involves the Netherworld. Moreover, although it can allow them to struggle at death’s door until now, it has a huge effect on their battle prowess.”","Ling Han nodded in understanding. If this weren’t the case, how could Xuan Taiyu have been able to resolve the perilous situation with his own power?","Who would be weaker than the other among those who could become Emperors?","When it came to specific details, even Qian Yanghao was unclear. In his era, though there was no Emperor in the world, because the old Emperor had just died, the heaven and earth did not allow a new Emperor to appear.","Thus, he could only cultivate to the level of Pseudo-Emperor, and could not take another step further.","But in his later years, he encountered the emergence of a ruler of a Land of Death, who had massacred innumerable living beings. He battled fiercely with him, and confirmed that the latter’s identity as a Great Emperor of the past.","Though the strength of this ruler of the Land of Death had declined greatly, he was still stronger than him. In the end, it ended with Qian Yanghao being outmatched and fleeing.","After that, Qian Yanghao began to gather information about the rulers of the Lands of Death. In the end, he found out part of the truth.","In order to battle with these rulers of the Lands of Death again, Qian Yanghao resolutely buried himself in the Imperial Path, and reappeared in this era."]},{"number":4645,"title":"Chapter 4645: Betrayal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4645: Betrayal","Ling Han was deeply impressed by Qian Yanghao.","In his era, he should have been an invincible existence. The rulers of the Land of Death would only truly appear in this era, so Qian Yanghao was completely capable of living freely and proudly.","However, he resolutely sealed himself away, and came to this era.","“In Senior’s era, there was no opportunity for ‘immortality’. Why did the ruler of a Land of Death appear?” Ling Han was curious. This was a suspicious point.","Qian Yanghao nodded, “That is why I say that the technique of immortality that these rulers of the Lands of Death have obtained is strange! According to my observations, when the Sea Emperor appeared, his purpose was to absorb the Qi of life.”","“Thus... the so-called immortality of these rulers of the Lands of Death is based on extracting the Qi of life.”","Ling Han nodded. Since this was the deduction of a Pseudo-Emperor, it should be correct.","“This old man’s path is already severed. Next, it’s all up to you.” Qian Yanghao smiled, and patted Ling Han’s shoulder lightly, “Go on, cultivate well. This old man will help you detin those Lands of Death as much as possible, buying time for your growth.”","“Thank you, Senior.” Regarding this, Ling Han could only accept and thank him.","At present, he was still unable to oppose the Lands of Death. Even Qian Yanghao could only threaten them with “mutual destruction”. In fact, he would die, and the rulers of the Lands of Death would only suffer severe injuries.","After all, they had once been Great Emperors!","Even if they could not easily make a move now because of their immortality, and even if their strength was greatly damaged, that starving camel was still bigger than a horse.","Wasn’t it clear that Xuan Taiyu had died very quickly?","This Great Emperor... was the first in history to destroy the primitive Celestial Gate!","Qian Yanghao left, and Ling Han also returned to the Four Origin Planet.","Although a Pseudo-Emperor would protect him in secret, there were really too many rulers of the Lands of Death.","There were as many as twelve of them!","Thus, Ling Han set up another formation on the Four Origin Planet, continuously extracting the power of the planet and turning it into power, pushing this planet towards the edge of the universe.","Ling Han recounted the origins of the rulers of the Lands of Death, causing everyone to be extremely stunned.","As it turned out, these were actually twelve Great Emperors!","This was really a fact that could drive one to despair. One Great Emperor was enough to suppress the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands; there were a total of 12 of them!","“There’s no need to be so nervous.” Ling Han comforted everyone, “The Heavenly Dao has its limits. Only one Great Emperor can appear in a single era. The fact that these rulers of the Lands of Death can live until now, and exist side by side, only means that their cultivation level must have been weakened.”","Everyone nodded. This was very logical.","However, no matter how weak it was, it would at least be Pseudo-Emperor-level, and would be stronger than normal Pseudo-Emperor-level, infinitely close to the level of a real Great Emperor. Otherwise, Xuan Taiyu would not have died at that time.","Hold on, in the era of Xuan Taiyu, there was no opportunity for immortality, so why did the Masters of the Twelve Lands of Death appear?","Could it be!","Ling Han thought of himself, Ding Shu as well as the other Genesis World rulers. They were different from the rest, and furthermore, they were inextricably linked to Xuan Taiyu.","He then recalled that Xuan Taiyu had gone to the great crack at the edge of the universe, and was chasing after something.","That had to do with Genesis World. Additionally, the rulers of the Twelve Lands of Death were also looking for this item, and that was why they had fought Xuan Taiyu to the death?","The clues had long since been cut off, and Ling Han had no way to prove it, so he could only make such a deduction.","“It’s still more important to increase my strength.”","“As long as I possess enough strength, what else can I not know?”","“Cultivate!”","He continued to capture Celestial Qi, concoct alchemical pills, and refine Celestial Qi. His days were extremely monotonous and repetitive, but his cultivation level was steadily improving.","In the next few days, a great change suddenly took place in the universe.","During an invasion by the Netherworld, the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan suddenly defected. The Demon Wolf Imperial Clan Saint revived his Imperial Weapon, and actually attacked his allies.","Who would have thought that such a change would happen?","Thus, this dealt a huge blow to the Living Realm. Eleven Saints were killed with a single strike, and there were also a considerable number of Saints that were wounded when the might of the Imperial Weapon scraped past them. Though they immediately fled, they were caught up by the Skeleton Saint Tool, and were still unable to survive.","When the news spread out, the whole world was shocked.","What was going on?","Had the Demon Wolf Imperial Clan gone mad?","However, this was only the beginning. Subsequently, the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan also put on a good show of stabbing their allies in the back, causing a massive blow to the Living Realm’s allied troops.","Immediately afterward, the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan also embarked on this path, falling out with the Living Realm and killing a great many Saints in one go.","This caused the Living Realm Alliance Army to feel anxious, and they were filled with suspicion towards each other. No one knew if another Imperial Clan would betray them, and they themselves would not become a victim.","In this way, the alliance was practically useless.","The Netherworld army penetrated deeply, and encountered almost no decent resistance.","If it had to be said that the betrayal of these three Imperial Clans had caused a massive blow to the higher-ups of the Living Realm, then what happened next would have even more far-reaching consequences.","The Buddhist Race actually declared that defecting to the Netherworld was the right path, telling the believers to drop their weapons and they could immediately become Buddhas.","It should be known that the Buddhist Race’s spiritual control was number one in the world.","Thus, all the galaxies that were affected by the Buddhist Raceall put down the weapons in their hands, welcoming the invasion of the Netherworld with open arms.","If there was any force that had the greatest influence, it would definitely be the Buddhist Race. The Buddhist Race existed in the four Heavenly Realms, and they spared no effort in spreading their teachings and nurturing their believers.","Now that the Buddhist Race had reaped the fruits of their labour, it was a fruitful harvest.","And for the Living Realm, this loss was much, much too great.","How many territories had been lost, and how many people had been killed?","Because this shocking news came one after another, even Ling Han couldn’t sit still and went to find out the situation.","Ji Wuming brought the connection device with him, and projected all the information he had seen on the Galaxy Network. Ling Han, Brother Monkey, the empress, and the others were all there. As they understood the situation, they were frowning deeply.","“Previously, I forgot to ask Old Master Qian who these rulers of the Twelve Lands of Death are.”","“By the looks of it now, there’s at least the Buddhist Race’s Great Emperor, Demon Wolf Emperor, Ancestral King Fire Clouds, Sea Emperor, and Black Sunflower Demon Emperor.”","The Buddhist Race, the Wolf Tribe, the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan and the Black Sunflower Imperial Clan had just betrayed them, which was equivalent to admitting their identity. And why did these four Imperial Clans rebel... the reason was too simple. The clan’s Great Emperor had not died, so would the juniors dare to disobey orders?","As for the Sea Emperor, his identity was called out by Qian Yanghao.","“There’s also the Golden Crow Emperor,” Ling Han said. This was Lu Xun’s father, and he continued, “There’s also the Void Emperor. This is the backer of the Battle God Palace.”","“Additionally, He Luo, Feng Miaoling, and Yang Yihuan should also have a ruler of a Land of Death behind them. It’s just that we can’t match them yet. Which Great Emperor is it?”","The large black dog counted with his fingers, “There are a total of ten rulers of the Lands of Death ow.”","There were still two missing!","In other words, if these two Great Emperors had also left behind a base in the Living Realm, that meant that there were still two landmines that had not been detonated.","“Ah!” Ji Wuming suddenly screamed, blood seeping from all his apertures."]},{"number":4646,"title":"Chapter 4646: Collapse of the Living Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 4646: Collapse of the Living Realm","What was going on?","Ji Wuming was also a Spirit Transformation True Lord now. Although he couldn’t be regarded as an elite, he definitely wasn’t weak either.","Bleeding from all seven apertures for no reason?","He was not cultivating, so how could he possibly go mad?","At this moment, no one knew what to do.","Ji Wuming screamed endlessly, as if he was enduring indescribable pain. Then, as if he had gone mad, he began to attack Ling Han and the others.","Boom, he unleashed his full battle prowess, holding nothing back.","Ling Han frowned. He stretched out a hand and pressed down, suppressing Ji Wuming.","But even so, the mystical power in his body was still surging endlessly, as if his whole body was about to explode.","What was going on? Why had it suddenly become like this?","At the same time, tragic cries rose and fell, coming from various places. At the same time, there were also sounds of battle. Hong long long long, the entire planet suddenly became incredibly lively.","Ling Han didn’t need to go out. His powerful divine sense was enough to enshroud the entire Four Origin Planet. He could “see” very clearly. There were too many people who screamed as if they had seen a ghost like Ji Wuming, bleeding from all their apertures.","It was as if they had all gone mad, and attacked those around them at all costs, as if they were great enemies.","Ling Han was suddenly shocked. Hadn’t they just said that out of the Twelve Lands of Death, there were still two clans that they had yet to find the corresponding Great Emperor?","He then recalled that there was an unwritten rule in the Imperial Clans, and that was they would not use the Galaxy Network connection device.","Why didn’t they use such a convenient thing?","Previously, Ling Han hadn’t understood, but now, after linking all the clues together, he suddenly came to a realization.","Hiss... could it be that the Great Emperor of the Chang Clan was also one of the masters of the Twelve Lands of Death?","Thinking of this, Ling Han suddenly moved, and plucked the Galaxy Network connection device that Ji Wuming was wearing.","Instantly, Ji Wuming wilted. Though he was no longer screaming or making a fuss, it could be seen that it was as if his vitality had been severed, and his injuries were extremely, extremely severe.","And this was still because Ling Han had discovered it in the nick of time, and taken away the Galaxy Network connection device that he was wearing. Otherwise, Ji Wuming might have been directly killed.","“This is—” The large black dog and the others were also shocked. This problem actually came from the Galaxy Network connection device?","Who would have thought!","“The Great Emperor of the Chang Clan is actually also one of the rulers of the Twelve Lands of Death!” However, with how smart they were, they immediately came to a realization.","“Hurry!”","Ling Han and the others moved separately, either plucking the Galaxy Network connection devices of those crazy people, or directly shattering them.","Pa, pa, pa! One after another, those who had gone mad collapsed. Ling Han and the others all had battle prowess of Saint-level, so how could they be matched by these disciples of Holy Lands or ordinary people?","Thankfully, because of Ling Han’s insistence, the people who had come out of Genesis World didn’t wear the Galaxy Network connection device. Even if they did, they would usually put it aside and only use it occasionally.","However, even if Ling Han and the others reacted fast enough and moved fast enough, one-tenth of the disciples had died, and there were countless who were severely injured.","Losses, heavy losses!","And this was only a single Four Origin Planet.","What about the entire universe?","It could be said that aside from the Imperial Clans, the majority of forces had suffered heavy blows, and their losses were incredibly great.","Who would’ve thought that the Galaxy Network connection device would have such destructive power?","As for the details of the matter, they would have to wait until Ji Wuming woke up to ask.","Now, the Galaxy Network definitely could no longer be connected. This meant that everyone had become blind and deaf, completely losing their understanding of the universe outside their own planet.","This was because everyone usually relied too much on the Galaxy Network. Now that a problem had arisen with the Galaxy Network, everyone was at a loss.","What could they do?","Without the connection with the Galaxy Network, the entire Living Realm was instantly in a state of disunity.","What on earth was going on?","Why had this happened to the Galaxy Network connection device?","Where was the Netherworld? Where had their armies reached?","All of this unknown.","And the unknown was a kind of fear in the first place. Presently, everyone in every corner of the universe was in a state of anxiety. Everyone was wondering if their planet was the only place that had not been conquered by the Netherworld.","In a precarious state of mind, it also caused some people to lose control of their emotions, and begin to cause great damage.","This attack from the Chang Clan could be considered fatal. In an instant, it had pushed the level of civilization of the universe down a dozen over levels. It was as if they had returned to the primitive ages, where everyone worried for their own safety.","On the Four Origin Planet. Ling Han and the others were discussing a strategy.","“This attack from the Chang Clan is really too fatal.”","“Everyone is too reliant on the Galaxy Network, and once it’s broken, they’re like headless flies.”","“We don’t know what’s going on in the universe right now, so everyone’s afraid for themselves.”","“Can Netherworld’s invasion still be stopped?”","Everyone exchanged looks, unable to come up with any countermeasures.","How many years had the Chang Clan operated for?","After millions and millions of years, the Galaxy Network was already deeply ingrained in people’s hearts. As long as one stepped onto the Celestial Path, who wouldn’t have a connection device?","Now, these people had basically all gone mad and died.","How many living beings had the entire universe lost all of a sudden?","“As expected of the Great Emperor’s handiwork!” Though everyone was defiant and furious, they could not help but feel impressed.","Empress Qingzhu had started to lay out her plans a very, very long time ago, and how could the Lords of Death not have done the same?","Now that they made a move, it was a move to slit the throat in a single strike.","The Galaxy Network and Buddhist Race were the two most influential and far-reaching beings. In the end, they were both the doings of the Lords of Death.","This was the power of Great Emperors!","Two days later, Ji Wuming woke up, and was also completely conscious.","Ling Han and the others asked what had happened on that day, and Ji Wuming said that he had suddenly been invaded by an incredibly powerful willpower. He felt that all he could see was the most terrifying enemy, and that he had to fight to the death at all costs.","Ling Han immediately recalled that the “Tool Spirit” existed on the Galaxy Network.","Was this... the willpower left behind by the Great Emperor?","Hence, when this kind of willpower invaded, no one would be spared.","Sigh!","Faced with the Great Emperor’s millions and millions of years of schemes, Ling Han could only admit defeat.","Just like how the arrangements that Empress Qingzhu had set up were not something that other Great Emperors could damage, the methods of these Lords of Death were also the same.","Thus, even if the generations of Great Emperors had seen some clues, they only told their descendants not to use the Galaxy Network connection device.","“Now... it’s getting more and more urgent.”","Ling Han set everything aside, and began to concentrate on capturing Celestial Qi and concocting alchemical pills. Strength, what was important was strength!","Several years later, he reached the peak stage of 10 Stars.","Fine, he would aim for Eleven Stars.","Similarly, Ling Han inscribed the eleventh seal on the pinnacle pillar with the power of belief as pen, and seventy seven-star Regulations as ink.","Boom!","After he completed the fourth seal, a change took place.","Turbulent waves rose up in his body, and his cultivation level soared explosively.","However, this time, there was no heaven’s calamity descending.","Eleven Stars!","Ling Han came out of seclusion. There was no time for him to waste now. He didn’t even want to celebrate.","He began to capture Celestial Qi and concoct alchemical pills again, and was very busy.","As for the situation of the entire Living Realm... it was extremely terrible.","The Galaxy Network had already been severed, so it was impossible for them to receive any more information. Fortunately, Saints were fast enough, and Brother Monkey and the others took turns to investigate the current situation."]},{"number":4647,"title":"Chapter 4647: Ambush","paragraphs":["Chapter 4647: Ambush","The few Imperial Clans had defected, and added with the fact that the Galaxy Network had been broken, the entire Living Realm had become a pile of scattered sand. Thus, they were completely unable to form a decent resistance.","Now, wherever the Netherworld’s blade pointed, that place could only fall.","The Imperial Clans and Holy Lands had already moved their whole planets to relocate. However, moving a planet would require at least Saint-level power. This meant that 99% of the planets could only remain where they were, resist with all their might, and then fall.","The entire Living Realm was already a scene of doomsday. Endless Yin Qi seeped out, covering heaven and earth, turning the Living Realm into a purgatory.","What was even more terrifying was the fact that the Regulations of the Living Realm and Netherworld were different, and a fierce conflict had taken place, causing the entire universe to be in an extremely unstable state.","If this continued, it was very likely that there would come a day when a great storm would sweep through the entire universe, destroying everything.","Though Ling Han was anxious, he couldn’t do anything about it.","At present, he only had the battle prowess of 10 Stars of Saint-level. At most, he only had the battle prowess of 11 Stars. There was no need for a Lord of Death to move at all. Merely the boundless ocean of Saintly corpses would be enough to engulf him.","Saintly corpses weren’t like Yin souls, which were completely restrained by Destructive Energy.","Yi, had the Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy been obtained by Xuan Taiyu from the edge of the universe?","Though they very much wanted to change the current situation, the only thing Ling Han and the others could do now, aside from increasing their cultivation level, was to set up formations for the various planets, and push these planets towards the edge of the universe.","Though the Netherworld’s battle prowess was invincible, the invasion of the Yin souls would be limited by the speed of assimilating the Living Realm, which meant that it would be easy for them to conquer a galaxy, but to transform this galaxy into the environment of the Netherworld, they would need a considerable amount of time.","Without the environment of the Netherworld, Yin souls were too fragile. Those with a lower cultivation level couldn’t even stand direct sunlight.","Hence, with the formations activating, though the movement speed of the planets was slow, it was still enough to surpass the rate of expansion of the Netherworld.","This left a spark of hope in the Living Realm. One day, when all the planets returned, they could still rebuild their home, and prosper again.","However, Ling Han was all alone, after all. No matter how busy he was, setting up formations and creating formation foundations would still need time. Though the number of planets he could help was astonishing, with how vast the universe was, this could only be considered a drop in the ocean.","However, Ling Han’s kindness won him the hearts of the people.","—If he had already become a Saint at this moment, he would definitely be able to sense that the power of belief had become slightly stronger.","Saving people in times of danger naturally reaped the purest of belief.","Ling Han didn’t think too much about it. He simply wanted to help others.","If one could not do afford to, the best thing he could do was take care of himself. If one could afford it, he should lend a helping hand to others.","Within the range of his abilities, he did not mind making sacrifices for the world.","Ling Han would also battle against Yin souls. At present, the Netherworld army was powerful, and was practically unstoppable. However, as the battle lines were seriously drawn out, it also meant that their defenses were weak.","—There were only so many Skeleton Saint Tools, so how could they guard every single place?","Ling Han and the other Saints led teams respectively, leading Ji Wuming, Ling Xi and the others into battle. If they killed Yin souls, they would be able to receive rewards from heaven and earth.","It should be known that now that a large number of planets had fallen, natural treasures were naturally hard to find. Thus, if one wanted to rapidly increase his cultivation level, killing Yin souls to obtain the treasures from heaven and earth was an extremely good way.","They definitely wouldn’t linger in battle, switching locations with every strike. Moreover, they attacked randomly, so the Netherworld didn’t know how to stop them at all.","All of a sudden, another forty years passed.","In this period of time, Ling Han’s cultivation level had also rushed from Eleven Stars to Twelve Stars, surpassing Thirteen Stars, and arrived at Fourteen Stars.","The Seven Star Regulations Regulations that he had grasped had already reached as many as 96.","It could be imagined that when he stepped into 15 Stars, that would be the true end.","99 Regulations, the limit.","On this day, Ling Han led a team and continued to kill Yin souls.","Although this wasn’t a huge blow to the Netherworld, it was still better than doing nothing.","They arrived at the Qi Imperial Planet. This had once belonged to a Holy Land, but now, all the living creatures had been possessed by Yin souls, turning into walking corpses.","Every body possessed by a Yin soul would exude slivers of Yin Qi. Once there was too much Yin Qi, it would have an effect on the heaven and earth, causing the Living Realm to transform into the Netherworld.","Thus, Ling Han and the others killing these walking corpses was actually quite meaningful.","However, when they tore a rip into space and arrived here, Ling Han felt a sense of unease.","“There’s an ambush!” He immediately sensed that there was a powerful Saint-level aura here.","“Ling Han, I’ve finally caught you!” A young man appeared with a large number of Saintly corpses. It was Lu Xun of the Golden Crow Imperial Clan!","Ling Han frowned, tore a rip into space again, and said, “You guys go first, I’ll bring up the rear!”","“In your dreams!” Lu Xun immediately charged over.","Ling Han didn’t bring the Imperial Weapon and left it on the Four Origin Planet. He had already taught the Nine Mountains Saint how to control it, and the old man was in charge of overseeing the headquarters. He didn’t want it that when they came out to hunt, their home base was destroyed.","However, aside from the Clear Bamboo Sword, he also had the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","The Pseudo-Imperial Weapon was unleashed, continuously enlarging, enveloping Ling Han and the others.","Boom!","The attacks shot over, but they only caused the tower to tremble greatly, and were unable to blast their way in.","Of course, due to the powerful tremors, the inside of the tower was also surging with energy.","But what cultivation level was Ling Han at now?","Fourteen-star Venerate Tier!","His battle prowess had already surpassed ten stars of Saint-level, and was astonishingly powerful.","He moved to disperse it, eliminating all the energy turbulence in the tower, to ensure the stability of the torn space and ensure everyone’s safety.","When the last person also entered, Ling Han revealed a smile, and turned around.","He was in no rush to leave.","As long as the Lord of Death didn’t unleash his power, he wouldn’t need to be afraid of even the Skeleton Saint Tool. If he couldn’t defeat it, he could simply flee.","Now, let him go on a killing spree.","Xiu, he put away the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","“En?” Seeing that Ling Han had no intention of leaving, Lu Xun couldn’t help but reveal a hint of surprise.","“I have to say, your courage is outstanding.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “Do I need to be concerned about you country bumpkins?”","Lu Xunxun couldn’t help but look furious. This was looking down on him too much.","“Ling Han, where is your confidence coming from?” he asked calmly. “Look at this world. Is there still any place for you in this world?”","Ling Han looked down arrogantly at the skies, and said, “I’m standing right here now. Let’s see if I can still stand?”","“Haha!” Lu Xun sneered, then charged over.","Boom! With a single strike, 12 eight-star Regulations appeared.","He was now a Four-Star Saint.","Ling Han was unafraid, and greeted the attack with a raised fist.","“You’re courting death!” Lu Xun said in disdain, launching an explosive attack.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and endless Regulations exploded, actually sending the Saintly corpses that were rushing over from behind them flying. Cracks even appeared on the foremost corpses.","“What?!” Lu Xun exclaimed in disbelief.","He was a Four-Star Saint, and his battle prowess was as high as 12 stars. Yet, Ling Han was actually capable of matching him?","Hiss!"]},{"number":4648,"title":"Chapter 4648: Jealousy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4648: Jealousy","Ling Han’s whole person seemed to be a miracle.","Thus, he continued to create one after another impossibilities. If it was anyone else, being able to create one of these miracles was already a rare feat in history, but it was just the norm for Ling Han.","A mere Venerate, yet possessed battle prowess of twelve stars of Saint Tier.","Hehe, would anyone believe him if he told them?","What happened to the barrier to the cultivation level?","It was said that the higher one’s cultivation level, the more terrifying the suppression of cultivation level would be. Why was it the other way around when it came to Ling Han?","As Venerate, he was completely capable of being treated as a Saint, and it was a high-level Saint at that.","“That seed!” Lu Xun gritted his teeth. He was certain that the reason why Ling Han was so freakish was definitely because of that seed.","It should be known that that had come from the Primitive Abyss!","—This was what the Lords of Death called the great fissure at the edge of the universe.","That place contained rare treasures that were rarely seen in the world, because this involved the secrets of heaven and earth!","The entire universe had been born from there. Though cosmic matter was no longer gushing out, just how awesome was it to be able to nurture a universe?","Thus, the reason why Ling Han was so freakish was definitely because of that seed.","“Hand it over!” he shouted loudly.","Of course, he didn’t think that Ling Han would submit. Thus, there was only one way to seize it.","Kill Ling Han.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He unleashed his full battle prowess, and innumerable Saintly corpses also rushed over like a tidal wave. The black mass practically blotted out the sky and covered the earth.","Ling Han was completely unafraid.","“Come!” His fighting spirit surged like a tide, and he used the Han Fists. The 96 Seven Star Regulations intertwined, endlessly increasing his battle prowess.","The two of them battled fiercely, and the aftermath reverberated, sending Saintly corpses flying one after another.","However, there were far too many Saint corpses here, and even though a large number of them had been sent flying, there were even more that had pounced over.","Ling Han activated Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and spread his flaming wings. He easily broke free from the encirclement, and as the flaming wings flapped, the corpses of the Saints were also sent flying.","At this moment, Ling Han displayed a demeanor of near-invincibility.","He was clearly a Venerate, yet was practically capable of sweeping aside all Saints.","“Damn it!” Seeing how fierce Ling Han was, Lu Xunxun was incredibly jealous.","He was the son of a Great Emperor, so logically speaking, what could he not obtain? Who did he need to be jealous of?","There was only one, and that was the treasure that had been obtained from the Primitive Abyss.","To say nothing of him, even Great Emperors would be envious.","Just think, for the sake of this seed, Empress Qingzhu had even died from severe wounds, unable to live a second life.","From this, it could be seen just how terrifying the Primitive Abyss was. Even a Great Emperor could possibly die if he entered.","“Give it to me! Give it to me! Give it to me!” Lu Xun hurriedly chased after him. His figure swayed, and he actually turned into a three-legged golden crow!","He was not a human, but rather a member of the Demon Race.","The Golden Crow Great Emperor!","That’s right, he was from the Golden Crow Race.","This golden crow was truly massive. Its wingspan was as long as 30,000 meters, and its speed was also extraordinarily fast. It was actually just that little bit inferior to Ling Han.","After all, this was also a bird race, what more when the Golden Crow Race had once produced a Great Emperor. Even if it was inferior to the Divine Beasts that were favoured by heaven and earth, it was definitely not much inferior either.","Most importantly, Ling Han wasn’t a phoenix, so he definitely couldn’t unleash the full might of Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","Endless Saintly corpses sealed off the surroundings. Even if they were no match for Ling Han, the might of Saintly power could still hinder Ling Han’s advance.","Thus, Lu Xun was approaching.","Shua, he made his move.","A claw stretched out, flickering with endless metallic luster, comparable to Saintly Material!","Ling Han smirked coldly, and also enlarged his body, turning into a giant that was as tall as 30,000 meters. His Dao Manifestation supported the skies, and then shot out a punch at Lu Xun. Destructive Energy wrapped around his fist, spreading out an aura that would make even Saints shiver.","“En?” Lu Xun was shocked, and instinctively felt wary. He hurriedly withdrew his claws.","Ling Han’s furious fists continued to attack until the end. Boom, the Destructive Energy turned into a streak of light that continued to charge towards Lu Xun.","This was too fast!","Lu Xun was instantly hit. There was nothing that Destructive Energy could not destroy, and even Saint-level power could not completely disperse it. Instantly, he screamed in pain, and his figure shrank drastically.","He returned to human form, and saw that the fingers on his left hand were slowly disappearing!","Lu Xun made a prompt decision. Using his right palm like a saber, he slashed down on his left hand, forcefully slicing off three fingers. Only then did he manage to stop the spreading of Destructive Energy.","He looked at Ling Han in shock. What kind of freakish high-level energy was this?","Saints could regrow severed limbs, and this was completely no problem for him as long as he expended a bit of his life force.","However, even though his severed fingers had grown out, Lu Xunxun was still filled with wariness.","Just now, he had already retreated in time, but he had still not managed to dodge that attack.","What was even more terrifying was the fact that he had clearly formed a shield with Regulations, but it had little effect on that mysterious high-level energy.","—He could disperse a portion of it, but the effects were too poor.","He didn’t dare to take any more risks. With a wave of his hand, the Saintly corpses behind him surged out like floodwaters.","As for Saintly corpses? In any case, they were already completely dead. Furthermore, even if they were shattered into bits, as long as they were placed back into the Land of Death, and pieced together, they could still be taken out and used again.","Come on then!","Ling Han’s heroic spirit soared, with Destructive Energy entwined around his fists. He began to cause great destruction.","He refused to believe that the Saintly corpses that had been destroyed by Destructive Energy could be reformed, because Destructive Energy caused complete destruction.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Ling Han was like a divine dragon, wreaking havoc among the Saintly corpses. A piece of the Saintly Corpse that he had struck would be completely missing, or the whole corpse would disappear.","If it were any other Saint, they would only be able to shatter the Saintly corpse. After all, this was the corpse of a Saint. It was too powerful, and was not much inferior to Saintly Material.","It could be damaged, or even shattered, but it definitely could not be completely destroyed.","The exception was Destructive Energy!","Ling Han attacked madly. Every time he destroyed a Saintly corpse, he would be able to decrease the battle prowess of the Netherworld by one Saint.","However, there were really too many Saintly corpses here, and his power was not without limits.","Under such a high-intensity battle, his spiritual power was especially expended, and gradually, he could no longer bear the burden of the channelling of Destructive Energy.","It was about time to leave.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and Phoenix Wings Divine Flight unleashed. He began to break out of the siege.","“You still want to flee?” Lu Xun said in a baleful voice. If he left so calmly after causing so much damage, what face would he have left?","Did the Imperial Son not care about his pride?","He didn’t hesitate to use the holy flame, transforming it into an arrow that shot toward Ling Han.","The holy flame would decrease with every use, and could not be recovered.","However, its might was also great. Boom, when the arrow shot over, even a planet could be easily destroyed.","It was too fast. Even Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was no match for it, what more when Ling Han was still surrounded by Saintly corpses.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and with a thought, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower appeared in front of him.","Peng! The arrow of holy flame struck the tower, yet it only caused the tower to shudder slightly.","‘Holy f*ck!’","Lu Xun almost spat out a mouthful of blood. He had not hesitated to expend the holy flame. At first, he could at least detain Ling Han, and grind him to death with the Saintly corpses. He had not thought that it would be so easily dispersed.","How could he not throw up blood?"]},{"number":4649,"title":"Chapter 4649: Pinnacle of Fourth Extreme","paragraphs":["Chapter 4649: Pinnacle of Fourth Extreme","Ling Han smiled and said, “Should we continue this battle?”","Lu Xun glared angrily at Ling Han. He was clearly facing a Venerate, yet he felt a strong sense of helplessness.","If they fought, he would not be able to win. If he pursued, he would not be able to catch up.","He had still been too arrogant. He had predicted that Ling Han would possibly appear here, but had not brought any helpers with him. In the end, even though Ling Han had been caught, he was completely unable to capture or kill him.","—Why did he not invite others? He naturally had his own motives.","That was the seed from the Primitive Abyss. If he killed Ling Han together with others, then who would this seed belong to?","“You’re not playing anymore? Then I won’t accompany you.” Ling Han waved his hand, planning to tear a rip into space and leave.","“Ling Han!” Lu Xu shouted loudly. When Ling Han paused, he continued, “You can escape this time, and perhaps you can escape the next time, but in the end, you won’t be able to escape your destined fate!”","“Oh?” Ling Han smiled faintly, “There is a saying of ‘destiny’?”","“Humph, in the face of an irresistible situation, your fate has long since been decided!” Lu Xun declared proudly.","Indeed, there was a Great Emperor standing behind him, and there were a total of 12 Lords of Death behind him. At that time, they had even killed a true Great Emperor, what more when it was a mere Venerate.","Even if Ling Han became a Saint, so what? Even if he advanced to become Pseudo-Emperor, so what?","Without becoming a Great Emperor, how could he be qualified to challenge Great Emperors?","Moreover, there were 12 of them.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “To those who want to improve themselves endlessly, fate is in their own hands. Only people like you would think that fate is destined.”","“Humph, Qian Yanghao should have told you what kind of hopeless existence you have to face, right?” Lu Xun called out again.","“That’s why it’s so much more fun!” Ling Han laughed loudly. It was said that the Great Emperor was invincible, but because Great Emperors would never have the chance to encounter another, aside from in the ancient times, no one knew the gap in strength between different Great Emperors.","Now, he would be fortunate enough to exchange blows with twelve supreme elites that had each ruled over an era. To him, that was not despair, but excitement, and anticipation.","F*ck, what kind of monster was this?","Lu Xun was rendered speechless. He already knew that the opponents he had to face were 12 Great Emperors, yet he could still smile with such confidence. This was truly rendering him speechless.","Ling Han smiled, and took a step forwards. Instantly, his figure disappeared into the Void.","Lu Xun didn’t give chase. He could come and go as he pleased in the Living Realm, but Yin souls could not. In fact, even the Saintly corpses would be restricted to a certain extent.","“In the end, you are just a clown.”","“The wheel of time has already begun. If you try to stop it like a mantis trying to stop a chariot, you will only be crushed into dust.”","Lu Xun said coldly. Was there anyone stronger than a Great Emperor in this world?","There was none!","Thus, the combined forces of the 12 Lords of Death were invincible. It was definitely not something that any one could stand against.","...","Stars passed, and Ling Han returned to Four Origin Planet.","He harvested Celestial Qi every day, and concocted alchemical pills. He was already getting closer and closer to the peak stage of Fourteen Stars.","Brother Monkey and the others kept bringing back news.","Ling Han and the others weren’t the only ones fighting against the Yin souls. Ding Shu and the other Genesis World rulers, Baili Haojie and the sons of Great Emperors were also mobilized to attack the Yin souls.","Though they were pitifully few in number, a single spark was enough to start a prairie fire, what more when all of them were Saints. Each of them had the strength to destroy planets, so their destructive power against Yin souls was naturally great.","Thus, with this kind of impediment, the progress of the Netherworld was naturally halted.","Three years ago, Baili Haojie and Shi Gang battled fiercely, destroying seven galaxies!","Shi Gang was the personal disciple of the Buddhist Race’s Great Emperor, and just like those ancient prodigies, he had been sealed by the Primordial Source Clay. After millions and millions of years, he had come to this era.","A year and a half ago, Luo Yang and Wu Xingtong battled in space.","Seven months ago, Heaven Crushing battled Feng Miaoling and destroyed a sun, forming a black hole in the Void that devoured who knew how many Yin souls.","The ancient Imperial Sons and the Genesis World’s masters were all exuding their own brilliance, each of them showing the potential to become Emperor.","The competition for the position of Great Emperor in this era was undoubtedly the most intense in history. If the heaven and earth could release their restrictions, it was very possible that they would usher in a golden age like the ancient times — multiple Great Emperors would appear in the universe at the same time.","Ling Han was not idle either. He continued to attack. He encountered Di Wuji, Yang Yihuan and the others respectively, and began a great battle. However, after reaching Saint Tier, it was really too difficult to kill his opponents.","Thus, though the battle had been decided, neither side would be able to kill the other.","To kill a Saint if a Pseudo-Emperor did not appear?","It was practically impossible.","Ling Han quickly charged up to 15 Stars. This was extremely difficult, because there were already 14 seals on the four pinnacle pillars, forming a powerful resistance to prevent the formation of the 15th seal.","He had failed a total of 81 times, and this time, he had finally succeeded, advancing into Fifteen Stars.","Thankfully, he had killed enough Yin souls over these years. With the rewards of heaven and earth, his life force had been strengthened to a certain extent. Otherwise, with so many failures, he may have destroyed even his own foundations.","However, he was finally a fifteen-star Venerate.","Then, if he cultivated this cultivation level to the end, he would truly have reached the consummate level of this cultivation level. He would be able to light up the holy flame, and become a Saint.","Once he became a Saint... hehe!","Ling Han continued to capture Celestial Qi and concoct alchemical pills, and continued to kill Yin souls to increase his strength.","The universe was bustling with noise and excitement. All the prodigies displayed their graceful bearing to their heart’s content, establishing their outstanding reputations.","However, they were not invincible.","The son of the Great Emperor of the Crimson Rainbow Imperial Clan was ambushed. Twelve Skeleton Saint Tools sealed off the space, causing this ancient Imperial Son to battle to the last drop of his blood. Helplessly, he died with grudges.","When the news spread out, the whole world was shocked.","A Saint-level being, and the son of a Great Emperor at that, had died!","This was undoubtedly a massive blow. Was the strength of the Netherworld truly unstoppable?","Ding Shu, Shi Tianlu, and the others had clearly become more cautious in their attacks. Furthermore, the frequency of their attacks had also decreased considerably. They were all people who had hopes of becoming Emperor, so they naturally did not want all their efforts to go to waste at this moment.","After all, as long as they cultivated normally, it was only a matter of time before they reached the level of Nine-Star Saint.","And once they became Pseudo-Emperor, they would be able to move unhindered in the universe as long as a Great Emperor did not appear.","Now, everyone was aiming for the position of Pseudo-Emperor. Whoever was the first to beocme Pseudo-Emperor, that was undoubtedly taking the lead in the path to becoming Emperor.","In the battle for Pseudo-Emperor, everyone excluded Ling Han.","—Though Ling Han was strong, his cultivation level was too low, and he was not just a little bit weaker than the king tiers of the younger generation.","But at this time, Ling Han had also successfully cultivated to the peak stage of Fifteen Stars.","Consummate level of Fourth Extreme!","He could ignite the holy flame and attempt to break through to Saint Tier.","Ling Han immediately began his seclusion, making the final preparations.","After all, this was becoming a Saint.","A whole half year later, he finally began to let that seed sprout, to ignite the holy flame."]},{"number":4650,"title":"Chapter 4650: Great appetite","paragraphs":["Chapter 4650: Great appetite","It was very, very simple to light up the holy flame.","That was to capture the eight-star Regulation, turn it into a spark, and then ignite the four pinnacle pillars. After they were burnt to nothing, the holy flame would no longer be extinguished.","However, a Venerate could only channel Seven Star Regulations. If he didn’t become a Saint, how would he be able to capture the Eight Star Regulations?","Thus, only a very limited number of prodigies could ignite the holy flame with their own power. As for others, they could only rely on the power of belief to transform this power into the eight-star Regulation and ignite the holy flame.","Using one’s own power to ignite the holy flame was naturally much stronger, because the holy flame had been ignited with genuine eight-star Regulations.","However, Ling Han’s situation was different.","He had obtained the Seed of the Holy Flame. This was something that Empress Qingzhu had paid a heavy price for. She had obtained it from the large fissure at the edge of the universe, and he could become the strongest Great Emperor!","“The problem is, the Empress didn’t tell me how to let this seed germinate!”","Ling Han grumbled in his mind. After all, it had been a long time since he last complained. He couldn’t help himself.","Of course... it was none other than Regulations and power.","Ling Han channeled Regulations first, but did not dare to use too much force, fearing that he would damage this seed. That would really be too much of a gamble.","Let’s try one.","Ling Han pressed a Seven Star Regulation onto it, but the Seed of the Holy Flame did not react at all.","Alright, two flashes... there was still no reaction.","Three, four, five!","Ling Han continuously increased the number of Regulations, but there was no reaction.","After reaching 30 streaks, he didn’t increase them one by one. Instead, he increased them ten by ten. However, even after reaching 90 streaks, the Seed of the Holy Flame still didn’t react at all.","“Just how big is your appetite?”","Ling Han used all the Seven Star Regulations. This time, the Seed of the Holy Flame finally reacted, glowing slightly.","There was a chance!","Meanwhile, Ling Han gritted his teeth. This was 99 Seven Star Regulations. Though he did not have Regulations intertwined together, close to a hundred of them was comparable to an Eight Star Regulation.","As it turned out, the Seed of the Holy Flame needed eight-star Regulations to sprout?","That was awesome enough.","Ling Han didn’t find this strange. After all, the powerful Saints all used their grasp of Regulations to ignite the holy flame. In other words, these people had more or less grasped some eight-star Regulations when they had reached the end of Fourth Extreme.","It could be a sliver, or two slivers. Thus, since the Seed of the Holy Flame could allow one to become the strongest Emperor, it was absolutely normal that it would need the Eight Star Regulations to sprout.","Furthermore... the 99 streaks of Seven Star Regulations could only cause it to glow slightly, and it was still unable to truly sprout.","“You’re awesome!”","“Let’s try this.”","Ling Han intertwined Regulations, and this was terrifying. Ten Seven Star Regulations could match an Eight Star Regulation.","The ten streaks pressed down, and the Seed of the Holy Flame lit up a bit more, but it was still very weak.","“Amazing!”","Ling Han intertwined 20 Seven Star Regulations. As expected, the Seed of the Holy Flame lit up a little more, but it still appeared dim.","“Again!”","“Again!”","“Again!”","Ling Han continued to increase the stakes, and the Seed of the Holy Flame also became brighter and brighter, as if it was about to burn.","F***, could it be that he would not be accelerating the germination of the Seed of the Holy Flame, and was directly igniting it?","This was actually a fire seed, and not something like a tree seed as he understood it?","Forget it, add, add, add, add.","When Ling Han intertwined all 99 Seven Star Regulations, the Seed of the Holy Flame also reached its brightness limit. It was practically blinding.","However, it neither burned, nor sprouted.","Yi, what was going on here?","Ling Han attempted to inject mystical power into it. Instantly, he felt a terrifying suction force, continuously sucking away his mystical power.","It really was a glutton. Merely Regulations were not enough to satisfy it. Mystical power could not be lacking either.","Good.","Ling Han released the restrictions, and allowed the Seed of the Holy Flame to absorb his mystical power.","However, though this seed was small, it was like a bottomless pit. Mystical power continued to fill it up, but it was never satiated.","This speed was too fast. Three days had passed, and the mystical power in Ling Han’s body was completely exhausted.","This was something that had never happened before.","When Ling Han battled with others, even if his opponent was stronger than him, he could still rely on his powerful defense and heaven-defying mystical power reserves to exhaust his opponent to death.","Why was it the other way around here?","Ling Han also activated the power of the living beings in the dimensions in his body. However, it was still useless. The Seed of the Holy Flame accepted all of them. It didn’t matter whether they were Regulations, mystical power, or power of belief.","However, it neither burned nor sprouted. It was just playing dead.","Another day later, Ling Han was at his wit’s end.","He was just a tiny bit away from being sucked dry.","He could not continue, or he would definitely die first.","Ling Han sat down and started to recover his power. However, his reserves of mystical power were astonishing, so it would naturally take a long time for him to recover completely. He wouldn’t be able to recover without two months.","Ordinarily, the fact that he could grasp the equivalent of twelve eight-star Regulations at Fourth Extreme was already an extremely awesome feat, because there were even some weaker nine-star Saints that had only grasped this number of eight-star Regulations.","Thus, Ling Han definitely wouldn’t believe that there weren’t enough Regulations.","Then, the problem lay in power.","Ling Han tried to probe that seed with his soul.","Yi, at first, this seed was tightly wrapped, and there was no way to spy on the secrets within at all, but now, the doors were wide open for him.","Ling Han saw that the seed was glowing, and the seed wall was covered with vein-like patterns of Regulations.","This also proved that the number of Regulations that the Seed of the Holy Flame needed was already enough.","Looking inside the seed again, the mystical power he had injected into it had turned into liquid, and sank at the bottom of the seed. There was only a small puddle.","Hiss!","Ling Han inhaled sharply. Then, how many times would it take to fill up the entire seed?","At least 10,000 times.","Calculating again, it would take about two months to replenish mystical power once, so ten thousand times would be twenty thousand months, which was as long as over a thousand and six hundred years.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. It actually took so long?","“Can it be sped up?”","He tried to get Brother Monkey, the empress and the others to input mystical power into him, but it was ineffective. The seed rejected this.","He tried other methods, and discovered that the energy naturally formed by heaven and earth was not repelled by the seed.","In theory, this could be sped up.","The problem was that Ling Han was already a fifteen-star Venerate, and his power had even advanced into Saint Tier. What heaven and earth power could compare to his reserves of mystical power?","“Where can I find such a massive amount of energy?”","Ling Han was troubled. Perhaps there was in the great fissure at the edge of the universe, but with his present strength, it was possible that he would not be able to make it there in ten thousand years. In that case, he might as well slowly cultivate here.","At this moment, there was nothing else he could do. He could only cultivate while thinking of another way.","Gathering their thoughts together, everyone began to think of a solution for Ling Han.","Two months later, Brother Monkey returned and told Ling Han a very useful piece of information.","In the Buddhist Land outside the 33 Heavens, there was a Pond of Life. This was where the Buddhist Race had gathered the power of faith of all life for so many years."]},{"number":4651,"title":"Chapter 4651: Buddhist Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 4651: Buddhist Land","Pond of Life!","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind. The power of will of all living beings was naturally also a type of power. Furthermore, after being processed, it could be considered the purest kind of power.","In the whole universe, what force had gathered the most power of belief?","If the Buddhist Race claimed to be second, no one would dare claim to be first.","Moreover, even if the power of will gathered by all the forces ranked from second to 100th were added together, they probably wouldn’t be able to compare to the Buddhist Race. In fact, they might not even be able to compare to a fraction of the power of will gathered by the Buddhist Race.","Just look at the universe in its heyday. How many people were believers of the Buddhist Race?","Thus, the power of belief in this Pond of Life would definitely be extremely terrifying.","Ling Han believed that as long as he could enter the Pond of Life once, he would definitely be able to satisfy the appetite of the Seed of the Holy Flame.","“If I want to become a Saint as soon as possible, there is only one way, and that is to sneak into the Buddhist Land!”","In the past, this would have been impossible.","Why?","That was because they had absolutely no idea where the Buddhist Land was.","Without even knowing where it was, how could he sneak in?","It could be said that though the Buddhist Race was the most renowned force in the universe, with no equal, in terms of the mystery of their ancestral grounds, the Buddhist Race was completely comparable to the Battle God Palace.","But now, the Buddhist Race had revealed their identities. They were one of the Twelve Lands of Death, and a large number of elites had come out of the Buddhist Race to participate in this great war.","Thus, the location of Buddhist Land was naturally exposed.","Ling Han was skilled and courageous. He was already a fifteen-star Venerate, and his battle prowess had already reached thirteen or fourteen stars of Saint Tier. What did he have to fear?","Even if he was discovered, he could still leave calmly.","More importantly, it was not that all of the Buddhist Race were of the same bloodline as their Great Emperor, which gave him the chance to sneak in.","Ling Han informed everyone, and then set out on his journey alone.","This was the ancestral grounds of the Buddhist Race. In fact, it was possible that even Ah Han, the Ancestral Buddha, was hidden there.","Though these ancient Great Emperors had all sorts of reservations, and would definitely not make a move unless absolutely necessary, they only had to revive the Imperial Weapon, then even a Pseudo-Emperor would have to turn around and run.","Thus, it was more appropriate for Ling Han to go alone. Once the Seed of the Holy Flame absorbed enough energy, he would immediately run.","“As a thief, I have to keep a low profile.”","Ling Han entered into the Void and activated the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. His speed was astonishingly fast, and after a long while, he reappeared in the Void. This place was already filled with a sinister air, and he could barely sense the Regulations of the Living Realm.","He hadn’t become a Saint yet, so he was unable to absorb Regulations. Thus, his battle prowess would fall drastically in this place.","Thankfully, his spiritual power was strong enough, and he could completely use this as a weapon to unleash astonishing destructive power.","Moreover, he could also use Destructive Energy, which was still a deadly weapon.","“However, now that I’m here, I really have to keep a low profile.”","It was very fast for him to come out of here. In just a few days, the Buddhist Land appeared in front of him.","This was really a piece of land, floating directly in space.","However, this piece of land was extraordinarily huge, several times larger than the surface area of many planets.","There was a layer of light enshrouding this piece of land, forming a shield of light. In the darkness of space, it appeared very striking.","Ling Han walked over, carefully created an opening, and then entered.","The defenses of this shield of light were very strong, but Ling Han was already at the strength of a top-notch Saint by now. Thus, no one naturally noticed that he had created a small opening to sneak in. He then repaired it.","Then, with a leap, Ling Han landed on the ground.","Yi?","He shockingly discovered that the Regulations here had once again become richer.","It could be said that though this mainland was presently in the environment of the Netherworld, it was still detached from the outside world.","“The Lords of the Twelve Lands of Death, commanding the Netherworld to create chaos, what exactly are they planning?”","“Will letting the Netherworld invade allow them to attain immortality?”","Ling Han found this inconceivable. He couldn’t figure it out no matter what.","No matter how he looked at it, this would lead to only one conclusion, and that was the destruction of the Living Realm.","But the problem was, weren’t those ancient Imperial Sons all living beings? Oh, burying countless eras to come to this era, all for the sake of becoming Yin souls?","That was impossible.","“This is something that only those Lords of Death know.”","Ling Han hid himself, because a village had appeared ahead of him.","There was a large area of farmland around the village, and it could be seen that there were farmers working in the fields. Upon a closer look, these rice grains were not ordinary rice grains, but rather as tall as a man, and the stalks they bore were also astonishingly large.","Yi, this was Celestial Rice.","Ling Han nodded. If one ingested the Celestial Rice for a long period of time, it would be much more beneficial for cultivators. It could allow their meridians to be unobstructed, and their physical body to develop spiritual power. Cultivating would naturally be half the work, but double the effect.","Looking at these farmers again, they were all mortals, but there was no shortage of Meridian Opening and Blood Transformation Tiers.","By the looks of it, though these farmers weren’t the main people enjoying the benefits of the Celestial Rice, they would definitely be able to eat a little. That was why they could reach Meridian Opening and Blood Transformation Tier without even cultivating.","He observed this village for three days, and had already gained a considerable understanding of it.","In this place, the villagers did indeed farm for a living, but there was also a chance that they could stand out among others.","That was to practice martial arts.","A good seedling would be taken in as a disciple by the Martial Hall of the city. Once he took this step, it would mean a change in his fate. From now onwards, he would be able to cast off his identity as a farmer, become a landlord, or even become a noble.","All right, he had an idea.","Ling Han set his sights on a person called Zhang Hanjun.","This person was an orphan. Both his parents had died when he was young, and he did not have any other relatives. Thus, Ling Han moved, and knocked this person out. Then, he sealed off his vital signs, and buried him deep underground.","Although Zhang Hanjun was a Buddhist, he was clearly an innocent person. Ling Han naturally couldn’t kill him directly.","No matter how strong his abilities were, Ling Han still had a bottom line that he wouldn’t cross.","Otherwise, what difference would there be between him and the Lords of Death, those fallen Great Emperors?","Then, Ling Han became Zhang Hanjun.","After a few more days, the Martial Hall would send someone over to recruit disciples. Ling Han had his sights set on this opportunity.","First Martial Hall, then advance all the way, then enter the Pond of Life, satisfy the Seed of the Holy Flame, and leave.","En, it was that simple.","Ling Han took his place. Every day, he would practice martial arts in his room, and did not go to farm, which attracted the pointing fingers of the villagers.","There was no other reason for this. This was because Zhang Hanjun was already 17 years old this year. He had already participated in the recruitment test for the Martial Hall two years ago, but he had never been chosen.","Thus, in the eyes of the villagers, he should have given up long ago. He should have been working hard on farming, and should not have fantasized about something that was completely impossible.","Four days later, someone came from the Martial Hall.","On this day, a great many villagers deliberately stopped their farm work, and brought their sons and daughters to the open space at the village entrance.","This was the key to changing the fate of their children. They were also filled with anticipation.","Only Ling Han was alone. The majority of people looked at him not with sympathy, but with mockery and disdain.","As expected, this person was really biting off more than he could chew. He was completely unrealistic.","You are already seventeen years old, and that is your last chance to enroll in the Martial Hall, but having failed twice, is that not enough to make you give up?","Do you have to crash into a wall before you could turn around?"]},{"number":4652,"title":"Chapter 4652: Test","paragraphs":["Chapter 4652: Test","“Zhang Hanjun, you are really thick-skinned!” A young man declared coldly. He directly pointed at Ling Han’s nose, “I have already told you, Yuanyuan is not someone that you are worthy of at all!”","Yi, this involved romantic relations as well?","Ling Han was surprised. Because he had not searched Zhang Hanjun’s memories, he did not know much about this either.","Thus, he only smiled faintly, expressing his disdain in a soundless reply.","“Looks like you won’t turn back until you’ve crashed into a wall!” the youth continued to mock.","“Who are you?” Ling Han asked.","Pu, that young man almost died from fury. He actually dared to pretend that he did not know him?","He naturally didn’t know that Ling Han was telling the truth. He genuinely didn’t know him.","“I’m Zhao Jian!” the youth roared. “This time, I’ll enter the Martial Hall, and from now on, I’ll rise above everyone else. My future isn’t something you can imagine!”","“Oh,” Ling Han replied with a nod.","With his status, would he care about the provocation of a young man? Moreover, the one whom he was provoking was Zhang Hanjun, not him.","Faced with Ling Han’s attitude, it was as if Zhao Jian had encountered a porcupine. He had absolutely no idea where to attack, and could only glare angrily.","Forget it. As long as he entered the Martial Hall, Zhang Hanjun would only be able to look up to him, so what need was there for him to be concerned?","He was destined to become a mighty figure in the future. It was completely meaningless to lower himself to the level of this kind of trash.","On the other side, the people from the Martial Hall also began their test.","This was a middle-aged man with an arrogant expression. He took out a rock and had the young men and women here place their hands on it.","If one’s natural talent in martial arts was high, the stone would light up. The higher one’s natural talent, the more intense the light would be.","However, up until now, there had not been a single person that could make the stone glow.","This village wasn’t large, and there were only a total of 17 young men and women who had come to undergo the test. By now, there were already 14 people who had completed the test, and all of them looked gloomy.","Their parents, meanwhile, comforted them. Natural talent in martial arts did not always show at fifteen years old. Some people would be later, reaching sixteen or even seventeen years old. That was why the Martial Hall had given them a time limit of three years.","If they couldn’t do it today, then they would do it next year. If they couldn’t do it next year, then there was still the year after next!","“I’ll go!” Zhao Jian walked up.","He had been clever and quick-witted since childhood. Though he was only fifteen now, he had already cultivated to the Blood Transformation Tier, far surpassing his peers.","Hence, he was incredibly confident.","He walked in front of the middle-aged man from the Martial Hall and stretched out his hand, placing it on the stone that the latter was holding.","The stone instantly lit up, and it was extremely bright at that.","“A-grade prodigy!” The eyes of the middle-aged man from the Martial Hall immediately lit up, revealing an excited expression.","For someone like him who had come out to enroll students, though there was no necessary quota he had to fulfill, if he enrolled prodigies B grade and above, he would also be able to receive rewards.","And an A-grade prodigy... it would be difficult to pick even one out of 10,000 qualified prodigies.","He was rich!","He was extremely excited. Now that he had discovered an A-grade prodigy, the rewards he would receive would also be incredibly generous.","“Cough, what’s your name?” the middle-aged man from the Martial Hall asked, trying his best to suppress the excitement in his heart.","An A-grade prodigy! In the future, he would at least be able to become an elite of the True Self Tier. If they could form a good relationship now, he would naturally become a powerful backer in the future.","Though Zhao Jian was young, he was a smart man. He could tell from the slight changes in the other’s expression.","He couldn’t help but break into a smile, and said somewhat proudly, “My name is Zhao Jian.”","“My name is Li Yun, and you can call me Big Brother Li,” the middle-aged man from the Martial Hall said. “In the future, when you enter the Martial Hall, you can look for me if you encounter any problems.”","“Thank you, Big Brother Li.” Zhao Jian nodded. At present, he was still very weak, so he had to give Li Yun some face. As for the future? Hehe.","“Big Brother Li!” With a thought, he pointed at Ling Han and whispered, “Can you help me deal with this brat?”","“No problem,” Li Yun promised.","It wasn’t like he didn’t know Ling Han. He had already participated in two consecutive tests, and had not passed either time.","Although some people awakened their natural talent in martial arts later, if most of them didn’t succeed once or twice, it was impossible for them to awaken it in the future.","Thus, Li Yun naturally assigned Ling Han to the majority.","For the sake of an A-grade prodigy, he was naturally willing to mess around with someone who did not have natural talent in cultivation.","This was a favor.","Another person stepped forward to take the test. This was the second last person, and in the end, they still couldn’t light up the stone.","Only Ling Han was left.","“Hehe, I remember you. You’re Zhang Hanjun, right?” Li Yun asked with a smile.","Ling Han nodded earnestly, “I am.”","“You’ve already failed twice, yet you’re still unwilling to give up?” Li Yun said, mercilessly attacking Ling Han. “If courage can be used to cultivate, you have a good chance of becoming a prodigy.”","Yi, this mouth of his was not too bad.","Ling Han didn’t immediately speak. Instead, he stared at Li Yun for a while, and said, “You didn’t wash your face when you woke up this morning, so it’s a little dirty.”","F***!","Li Yun’s mouth almost twisted in anger. ‘What kind of thought process is going on in your head? Why is the focus of your attention so different from the norm?’","At first, he had wanted to strike a blow on Ling Han, but now, he was no longer in the mood. He pointed at the rock in his palm, and urged, “Begin quickly! Humph, in any case, it is only a waste of time.”","Ling Han smiled, and placed his hand on it.","Just as everyone thought, there was no movement from the rock at all.","But just as Zhao Jian was about to begin mocking him, a majestic light burst forth.","It was incredibly dazzling.","This!","Everyone was stunned. In fact, this light was even more dazzling than what Zhao Jian had unleashed previously.","The brighter it was, the higher one’s natural talent in cultivation would be. This was something that everyone knew.","Hiss, Zhao Jian was already an A-grade prodigy, then what about Ling Han?","There were even higher grade prodigies above A-grade?","Zhao Jian was also dumbfounded. From Li Yun’s reaction, he knew just how awesome an A-grade prodigy was, but now, the aptitude of “Zhang Hanjun” was actually superior to his?","This was something that he could not accept!","The most awkward person was definitely Li Yun.","He saw that Zhao Jian’s natural talent was astonishing, and immediately wanted to form good relations with him. For this reason, he deliberately targeted Ling Han.","He had never thought that his face would be slapped so quickly.","“Earth Grade aptitude!” he exclaimed as if he had seen a ghost. Heavens, in his lifetime, he would actually encounter such a super seed!","Above A-grade was Earth Grade aptitude aptitude. As long as there weren’t too many problems, that kind of prodigy could definitely charge up to Spirit Transformation Tier.","...He didn’t know that if Ling Han didn’t control it, he would see Heaven Grade aptitude, or perhaps even higher.","Ling Han nodded, “Notify me when we set out.”","After saying this, he turned around and left.","He was calm and composed.","Though his natural talent in cultivation was even more awesome than Zhao Jian, but look, he was really too calm.","Show off!","A considerable number of villagers were cursing internally, but Ling Han’s future prospects were boundless now. Who would dare say such words to his face?","Only Zhao Jian clenched his fists, his expression twisted.","Ling Han actually ignored him!","Previously, he had mocked Ling Han so much, but after Ling Han had gained the upper hand, he actually ignored him completely.","He was being completely ignored!","This was even more humiliating than being reprimanded to his face."]},{"number":4653,"title":"Chapter 4653: Currying favor","paragraphs":["Chapter 4653: Currying favor","Zhang Hanjun was actually a prodigy!","This explosive piece of news instantly spread throughout the small village, and became a topic of idle gossip, and before this, Zhao Jian, who was also a prodigy, was only occasionally mentioned.","This naturally made Zhao Jian want to commit murder. However, if he wanted to deal with Ling Han now, Li Yun would be the first to stop him.","He could only swallow his anger for the moment, and told himself that his aptitude was not too bad either. As long as he worked hard on cultivation after entering into the Martial Hall, he could still trample “Zhang Hanjun” beneath his feet.","He and Ling Han each had a night’s time to prepare. Early the next morning, they were going to follow Li Yun into the city to enter the Martial Hall.","And that night, in Ling Han’s extremely dilapidated straw hut, there were many visitors.","None of them were idiots. Ling Han was definitely going to make a name for himself in the future. If they didn’t take advantage of this opportunity to curry his favor, would they still have a chance in the future?","“Hanjun, I can tell that you’re no ordinary person. One day, you’ll detach from the mortal world and become a dragon!”","“This is what it means to be silent for three years, and amaze the world with a single feat.”","“Come, this is Aunty Liu’s knitted clothing. Take it with you. After a while, the weather will turn cold.”","These neighbors were all asking about his well-being, wanting nothing more than to take him as their godson.","Ling Han merely smiled faintly. If these people found out in future that he was not Zhang Hanjun at all, what kind of expressions would they have?","“Out of the way! Out of the way!” At this moment, a middle-aged man in his forties came through the crowd. He was also dragging a young girl with him. By the looks of it, she should be his daughter. Otherwise, it would be inappropriate for a man and a woman to have bodily contact.","“It’s Ma Yunlai.”","“Tsk, tsk, tsk, he has a good daughter!”","The people around them immediately began discussing in low voices. This Ma Yunlai was a well-known layabout in the village, but good bamboo shoots sprouted from bad seeds1. Though the daughter he had was only fourteen years old, she had already revealed her beauty. What young man in the village would not think of her?","Zhang Hanjun was one of them, and Zhao Jian was also completely captivated by her. This was the “Yuanyuan” that he had spoken of.","Arriving in front of Ling Han, Ma Yunlai rubbed his hands together, and said, “Hanjun, you’re not young anymore. Furthermore, both your parents have passed away. Today, Uncle will make a decision for you, and betroth you and Yuanyuan.”","If he could turn “Zhang Hanjun” into his son-in-law, then no matter how successful the latter would become in future, he could also stick to him. No matter what, he would not be missing out on this kind of benefit.","Thus, though he was lazy, he was not the slightest bit stupid.","Ling Han swept an eye over the father and daughter duo. They were both extremely thin, and it was clear that they didn’t eat much.","This young girl did indeed have a bit of beauty. Of course, this was because there were too few people in the village. Among the masses that were not outstanding in appearance, she stood out.","In the eyes of the people in the city, they would probably despise her for being too much of a village girl.","Ling Han smiled. Since the main character liked this girl so much, and he was borrowing his identity, then he would treat this little girl better. He brought over the roast chicken and rice cakes that his neighbors had given him, and handed them over to the young girl.","“Eat,” he said softly.","The young girl was shy, and did not reach out to take it, but how could her father be polite? He took the food in one go, and wolfed it down himself first. Then, he reprimanded his daughter, “Whatever Hanjun has given you, just take it. We are a family, so what are you afraid of!”","Hearing these words, the young girl couldn’t help but blush, but she also seemed to feel uncomfortable from hunger. She reached out to pick up a rice cake, and began to eat it in small bites.","Ling Han didn’t mind this. As long as it didn’t affect his plans, he didn’t mind helping these people. It could be considered as doing a good deed for Zhang Hanjun.","Though Ling Han was not very cordial, his words also implied that when he became a mighty figure in future, he would give back to his fellow villagers. Thus, everyone was very pleased. When night fell, they all took their leave.","“Yuanyuan, you can sleep here today.” When Ma Yunlai walked out of the thatched cottage, he turned around and blocked his daughter inside.","The young girl’s face instantly flushed bright red again. She was incredibly embarrassed, but did not dare to oppose her father, and only looked at him pleadingly.","But since Ma Yunlai had already said so, how could he possibly change his mind?","He roughly pushed his daughter into the house, then closed the door behind him, looking like a pimp.","Hehe, as long as “Zhang Hanjun” slept with his daughter, then everything would be over. There was no way he could renege on this.","The young girl was at a loss for what to do, and lowered her head to play with the hem of her clothes.","A young girl in her prime, pure and ignorant, was extremely alluring.","However, in Ling Han’s eyes, there was already no difference among all the living beings in the world. Men and women were merely different manifestations of lige.","There was not much difference between this young girl and a lamb outside the house.","“Do you want to practice martial arts?” Ling Han asked.","The young girl had not thought that Ling Han would suddenly ask such a question. After being stunned for a moment, she nodded, “Yes.”","“I’ll teach you,” Ling Han said with a smile. He had nothing to do anyway.","Rather than relying on others to help them after they achieved meteoric success, it would be better to rely on one’s own efforts to achieve meteoric success.","The young girl couldn’t help but look curious, “Can I also practice martial arts?”","Cultivating martial arts consumed a lot of energy, and needed to be accompanied by medicinal baths. It was very hard for poor families to afford it. Usually, the boys in the family would be the ones to cultivate martial arts, because girls would have to get married in future, after all.","Since they were considered water that would be poured out of the family in future, why waste money?","Ling Han smiled, “Sure.”","He taught a cultivation technique to the young girl. This was directly harvesting the energy of heaven and earth, and not completing Meridian Opening Tier through the method of Body Arts.","The young girl was stunned. This was a legendary cultivation technique!","It was said that this was a supreme bible that only the noble masters of the city could grasp. She had not thought that “Zhang Hanjun” would actually have it as well.","No wonder his natural talent was so high.","Ling Han wasn’t afraid of revealing the secret. In any case, he could say that he had obtained it by chance in the mountains.","He would “bloom” his talent as soon as possible, and only then would he be able to charge into the core area of the Buddhist Land in a short amount of time, and sneak into the Pond of Life. Thus, his cultivation level had to soar like he had a cheat code.","Thus, passing on a cultivation technique to the young girl was no big deal.","He slept with his clothes on, and after the young girl mulled over the cultivation technique for a while, she too fell asleep in a daze.","If there was anyone who could not sleep at this time, it would definitely be Zhao Jian.","He had lost to “Zhang Hanjun” in the day, and at night, even the woman he liked stayed in “Zhang Hanjun’s” thatched cottage. Just thinking about it, he knew what this beast, “Zhang Hanjun”, would do.","“We are irreconcilable!” He lay on the ground, swearing to the moon outside the window, clenching his fists tightly.","The night passed, and Ling Han and Zhao Jian set out with Li Yun.","Li Yun wasn’t some Saint or Venerate. He couldn’t bring the two of them to tear a rip into space, and he also didn’t have any means of transportation. The three of them had to cross the muddy land one step at a time before crossing mountains and ridges.","They wouldn’t be able to reach the city in a day’s time. At night, they would still have to spend the night in the mountains. Hearing the roars of tigers and the howls of wolves, Zhao Jian and Li Yun were both on tenterhooks."]},{"number":4654,"title":"Chapter 4654: Fortune Dragon City","paragraphs":["Chapter 4654: Fortune Dragon City","There were fierce beasts in the mountains, and this was something that everyone knew. Moreover, Li Yun was only an Enlightenment Tier. What if they encountered a Mystery Realm Tier-level or even Celestial Path-level fierce beast?","The only fate would be death.","Thus, Li Yun didn’t dare to lead the two of them in a straight path at all. Instead, they circled around the mountains, fearing that they would encounter powerful ferocious beasts deep in the mountains, and never return.","This naturally depressed Ling Han. As long as this Li Yun was braver, he was completely capable of releasing the slightest bit of his aura, and have the wild beasts avoid them.","Sigh, then he’ll just take things slowly.","At night, the three of them took turns keeping watch.","Ling Han discovered that when it was Zhao Jian’s turn to keep watch, he had repeatedly revealed killing intent, but the latter was still a fourteen to fifteen year old young man, after all, and could not make up his mind. Thus, he had not made a move all this while.","Ling Han didn’t take it to heart, and pretended not to see it.","After a whole nine days, they finally walked out of the great mountain, and a vast great city appeared ahead of them.","“So this is the Fortune Dragon City?” Zhao Jian murmured. This city stretched over 50 km, and the majestic structures were even more than three hundred meters tall. To a village youth, this was naturally an incredibly shocking scene.","Li Yun couldn’t help but reveal a hint of pride and disdain. What a country bumpkin!","And this was only outside the city. If you entered into the city, and saw that endless golden wall of glory, wouldn’t your eyes pop out in shock?","However, why was only one person shocked?","He looked at Ling Han, and felt that this young man was really incredibly calm, as if he was already used to seeing such things.","Good willpower! Good temperament!","Li Yun’s opinion of Ling Han instantly rose a few notches higher. They had both just arrived, yet Ling Han’s expression was as calm as could be. In comparison, the difference between them was obvious.","He was even more certain of his own judgement. Ling Han’s future was brighter than Zhao Jian’s.","He definitely had to cling to this powerful backer. In future, he would definitely be able to obtain benefits.","The three of them set out, heading towards the city.","There was a city restriction in the Fortune Dragon City. If one was not registered as a resident of the city, they would only be able to obtain a temporary residence permit, and could stay for three days, five days, ten days, and so on, depending on the purpose of entering into the city that was expressed when they had registered their residence permit.","If he didn’t leave the city before the time limit expired, that would be a serious crime. If he was caught, he would be severely punished.","For Ling Han and Zhao Jian, they would first get a temporary residence permit for three days, and after they passed the examination of the Martial Hall, they would change to a long-term residence permit. In fact, it was even possible that they could obtain a citizenship permit.","If he obtained a citizenship permit, he would be a citizen of the city. If this was a village, this would be considered bringing glory to his ancestors. He would be outstanding.","Li Yun registered permits for them, then the three of them entered into the city. On the way, Zhao Jian couldn’t help but exclaim in shock.","Everything in the city widened his horizons, especially when he walked past the brothels. Those scantily clad girls were all making a show of themselves there, which made Zhao Jian, a young man who had just experienced the first awakening of love, extremely excited. He almost spluttered out a nosebleed.","At this moment, the girl that the youth had once adored immediately vanished without a trace.","That had only been the ignorant first love of a young man, and was not unforgettable. Now that he had suffered such a huge impact, it immediately crumbled and crumbled.","As it turned out, there were actually so many beautiful young ladies in this world. As it turned out, women could also be so enchanting and captivating.","He was reluctant to leave, and even his steps slowed.","Li Yun smiled, and pulled the youth along with him.","He knew that as long as this young man worked hard on cultivation, in future, to say nothing of women in this kind of brothel, even the daughters of prestigious clans would throw themselves at him.","Very soon, the three of them arrived at the Martial Hall.","“So big!” Zhao Jian couldn’t help but blurt out. Merely the area encircled by the Martial Hall’s walls was larger than their entire village, and the whitewashed walls were spotless, making him exclaim that there was actually such a clean place in this world.","Led by Li Yun, the three of them entered into the Martial Hall. First, he settled Ling Han and Zhao Jian down. Then, Li Yun went to make his report. Within three days, there would be a second test for Ling Han and Zhao Jian, to ensure that Li Yun had not accepted bribery from the two of them and helped them cheat.","Only two days later, the two of them were brought for another test, and in these two days, Zhao Jian did not even dare to step out of his rooms, fearing that he would break the rules, and be kicked back into the village.","Having just witnessed true prosperity, how could he be willing to return to that backward, poor place?","Ling Han and Zhao Jian weren’t the only ones who were undergoing the test today. There were seven other youths. Naturally, they had just been brought over from a village as well. All of them were extremely careful, not even daring to breathe loudly.","“Don’t be nervous. As long as you can pass the test, you’re a disciple of our Martial Hall,” a middle-aged man walked out and said to the youths with a smile.","This caused the youths to regain their composure. Then, the test began.","Because they knew that there would be a second test like this, the people who went to the villages to conduct the recruitment test naturally did not dare to do anything untoward. Thus, the results of everyone’s test were the same as the first time — except for Ling Han.","As Li Yun watched, he kept having a feeling that this light, tsk, was slightly different in brightness.","It was an illusion, it must be an illusion. How could it possibly be different? Hehe, he was really an idiot.","Among the nine candidates, Ling Han’s aptitude was the highest, followed by Zhao Jian’s. The others were far inferior, and there was not even a single B grade among them.","Thus, Ling Han and Zhao Jian both received extremely good treatment, and were allocated a private room. Furthermore, they would be able to obtain a packet of medicinal bath ingredients every three days.","Another few days later, the recruitment work for the Martial Hall this year ended.","This time, a total of 27 new disciples had been recruited, and only three of them were female, which showed how much this world favored men over women.","At this time, the 27 people were all brought to the basement. There was an underground spring there, which turned into a large pool, and steam was bubbling from within.","“This is Earth Flame Spring Water, which is greatly beneficial for unblocking meridians and improving one’s physique,” a trainer of the Martial Hall said. “You guys only have this one chance to enter the pool to absorb the benefits.”","“There’s no time limit. However, once you come out, you won’t be able to enter again.”","“That’s because you won’t be able to obtain any benefits even if you enter again.”","“Those who maintained the longest record in the pool stayed for a total of one and a half days.”","“Hehe, I wonder if any of you can break records.”","“Go into the water.”","He waved a hand dismissively.","There was another trainer beside him, and he said in a low voice with a smile, “Have you given these brats a motivation talk again? You have to know that the record holder is presently one of the four great War Gods and Guardian Deities of our Buddhist Race!”","“Hehe, giving these brats a goal is what motivates them,” the first trainer said with a smile.","The youths were all young and impetuous, and none of them would submit easily. Immediately, a competitive spirit rose up in them, and they all walked into the hot spring.","Wasn’t it just taking a bath? To say nothing of a day and a half, what was so difficult about taking a bath for ten days or even half a month?","However, when they stepped in, they almost immediately jumped out again.","Gods, it was too hot. Were they going to be cooked alive?","Hiss!","Only now did they know why the longest record was only one and a half days. This was really not a place for humans."]},{"number":4655,"title":"Chapter 4655: Spirit Devouring Physique","paragraphs":["Chapter 4655: Spirit Devouring Physique","However, everyone had heard very clearly that the longer they stayed here, the more benefits they would obtain. Thus, everyone was gritting their teeth and holding on.","Of course, Ling Han was completely unperturbed. As someone who possessed the battle prowess of a high-level Saint, would he take such a small token to heart?","He merely sat quietly.","This was a very good opportunity for him to shine and gain the notice of the Martial Hall, becoming a stepping stone for him to enter into the inner ranks of the Buddhist Race.","Otherwise, how long would it take for him to rise up step by step and gain the notice of the Buddhist Race?","He didn’t have much time. Thus, though rising too quickly would definitely be risky, Ling Han couldn’t care less.","Merely half an hour later, therewas one that could no longer bear it, and crawled out, screaming in pain.","There were already people from the Martial Hall standing guard at the side, and they immediately carried this person out for treatment.","—They would gain benefits here, but they would also be burned by the hot water.","In truth, this was the method to force out the potential of life to improve one’s physique, paving a wide path for one’s future cultivation.","Hence, the length of time one stayed here was not determined by the height of aptitude, but rather the toughness of one’s willpower.","After two hours, there were only nine youths left in the pool.","Three hours later, there were only seven left.","Five hours later, there were only six left.","Six hours later, only Ling Han and Zhao Jian were left.","Aside from his head, Zhao Jian’s whole person was buried in the water. The more area that came into contact with the pool waters, the greater the benefits he would receive. If it was not for the fact that he still had to breathe, and the organs on his face were more important, he would definitely bury his face in as well.","However, after enduring for six hours, his entire body was trembling, and the muscles on his face were also trembling.","He couldn’t hold on any longer.","However, a powerful willpower was supporting him, and that was Ling Han, who was not far away.","He couldn’t lose. He could lose to anyone, but he definitely couldn’t lose to Ling Han!","With this willpower, he actually managed to endure it.","Eight hours, ten hours, fourteen hours... When the two of them had endured until twenty hours, a great many people in the Martial Hall were alerted, and came over to take a look.","“Goodness, twenty hours!”","“Aside from that Lord, there hasn’t been anyone else that could last for more than a day. Could it be that two miracles are going to appear at the same time?”","“Yes, it can’t compare to that Lord. However, being able to last for a day is already extremely shocking.”","Everyone whispered among themselves, discussing in low voices.","Only now did Zhao Jian know what kind of results he had achieved.","This was already incredibly shocking, but how could he lose to “Zhang Hanjun”?","Hold on, he definitely had to hold on.","One hour, another hour, and finally, a day and night had passed.","Zhao Jian was still holding on, which surprised even Ling Han. This should have long since surpassed the other’s limits, but under the belief that he would not admit defeat, this young man actually managed to hold on. It was really not easy.","However, no matter how much he persevered, there was ultimately a limit. Willpower could not last forever.","After a whole day, Zhao Jian soon passed out.","Before passing out, he had even glanced at Ling Han, his eyes filled with resentment.","—Why haven’t you collapsed yet?","Everyone was flustered, and hurriedly carried Zhao Jian out.","And now, Ling Han was the only person left.","One day, another three hours, another five hours, another eight hours.","This time, even the Master of the Martial Hall had arrived. Could it be that this would catch up to the record of that Lord?","One day passed, and eleven hours later.","“Heavens!”","“There is only an hour left, and he would have caught up to that Lord.”","“Hiss, that Lord has cultivated to become a Sect Master!”","Everyone was numb with shock. Even if Ling Han couldn’t hold on any longer and retreated, he was still infinitesimally close to that Lord. His future prospects were boundless.","Another hour passed.","He had caught up!","Everyone was dumbfounded, and felt their minds go completely blank.","Most importantly, Ling Han was still in the pool waters. He didn’t look like he was about to come out at all.","Heavens, was this guy going to surpass the gods?","With a thought from Ling Han, his aura instantly soared explosively.","For him, this was a negligible improvement, but for the Meridian Opening Tier that he seemed to be, it was a super great leap.","Blood Transformation Tier!","“F***!”","“Heavens!”","“He has broken through!”","Everyone was grabbing their heads and exclaiming in shock, all of them looking like they had seen a ghost.","Others could only persevere in the pool waters, but what about Ling Han? He had directly increased his cultivation by a whole cultivation level!","Was there such a freak?","“Hiss, I’ve heard that there’s a kind of physique. It can absorb all kinds of energy and transform it into one’s mystical power.”","“I’ve also heard of it. This is called Spirit Devouring Physique!”","“Before the Spirit Transformation Tier, as long as there is enough energy to support it, this kind of physique would not have any bottleneck in cultivating at all, and would be able to realize the leap in cultivation level in a short period of time.”","“That’s right. If it was not for the fact that one has to start from the Spirit Transformation Tier and comprehend Regulations, this kind of physique would be able to soar all the way to the level of Great Emperor.”","Someone was making wild guesses, causing the others to agree one after another. Their words were very logical.","Ling Han listened carefully. Since they had all helped him come up with a reason, there was no need for him to hide anything.","Come on then!","He absorbed the energy in the pool waters. This couldn’t be converted into cultivation, but it didn’t matter. He only had to make it meet the criteria of “Spirit Devouring Physique”.","“Yi, I can clearly feel that the energy is continuously gathering with him as the core.”","“Why didn’t I sense it before?”","“Idiot, previously, he was a Meridian Opening Tier, and now he’s a Blood Transformation Tier. The intensity of the energy surge has increased!”","“Oh, that’s right.”","These people had found their own “reason”, and there was absolutely no need for Ling Han to give them an explanation.","Very good, then continue.","Ling Han controlled himself, causing his cultivation level to rise steadily.","“Blood and Qi boiling!”","“Condensed Blood Pillar!”","“Condensed Blood Beast!”","“...”","“Blood Qi Condensation Emperor!”","Hong, a powerful fluctuation flashed over Ling Han’s body. He took another step forwards, and stepped into Extreme Bone Tier.","This!","Everyone was extremely envious. This kind of physique was really too awesome. As long as one had enough cultivation resources, he could completely ignore the barrier of cultivation level, and soar all the way to the peak stage of the True Self Tier.","“Humph, if cultivation level advances too quickly, and there is not enough stabilization of cultivation level, even if he reaches the peak stage of the True Self Tier in a short period of time, it would be as difficult as ascending the heavens to take another step forward.” There would always be people who would be jealous, and make cynical remarks.","“Hehe, if I can reach the True Self Tier, even if I can’t advance a single step further for the rest of my life, I’m willing!”","“En!”","Many people nodded in agreement. One had to realize that the strongest elite in the Fortune Dragon City was only True Self Tier.","For them, easily becoming the elites of the highest level, what was there to be dissatisfied about?","Ling Han continued to perform the “miracle”. On the ninth day after entering the pool, he successfully broke through to the Inscription Tier, and then directly reached the Enlightenment Tier. Finally, he stopped.","It couldn’t be helped. The energy in this hot spring had already been exhausted, so Ling Han couldn’t break through for no reason, right?"]},{"number":4656,"title":"Chapter 4656 I want to sleep","paragraphs":["Ling Han reluctantly walked out of the pool.","He very much wanted to rush up to the Celestial Path in one go. In that way, he would be able to enter into the eyes of the higher-ups of the Buddhist Race sooner, and enter into the Pond of Life.","As for now? Seems like he would still have to wait a while longer.","However, the gazes that the members of the Martial Hall directed at him were filled with shock, and at the same time, a great many people were filled with jealousy.","—They had worked hard, and even risked their lives to explore ancient sites, and only then did he manage they manage to cultivate to Enlightenment Tier and Mystery Realm. In the end, this boy only had to swallow a little energy, and he would be able to advance rapidly and catch up to them, or even surpass them.","Who would be willing to accept this?","\"Good, good, good!\" The Master of the Martial Hall was all smiles. \"Hurry up and stabilize your cultivation level. Although your physique is astonishing, you can't neglect the foundations of martial arts.\"","\"Yes.\" Ling Han nodded.","Because he had broken through to the Enlightenment Tier, his treatment was greatly improved all of a sudden. Not only had he been moved to a large courtyard, he was also allowed to have servants.","When Zhao Jian found out, he directly smashed three cups in his fury.","He fought so hard, and suffered so much, just because he was unwilling to lose to Ling Han.","Unexpectedly, it was not that Ling Han's willpower was tougher than his at all. Instead, it was purely due to his unique physique, which allowed him to swallow energy.","How could he accept this?","However, he was only in Blood Transformation Tier now, while Ling Han was an elite of Enlightenment Tier. If he sought Ling Han out to cause trouble, hoho, he would only be asking for a beating.","Furthermore, it was also because of Ling Han that he had managed to hold on for a whole day.","This couldn't compare to that Lord who had become a Sect Master, but he was still the third in the history of the Martial Hall. Add to that his A grade aptitude, and as long as he was given enough time, he would definitely be able to advance into the Spirit Transformation Tier in future.","\"I'm inferior to you now, but I'll definitely surpass you in the future!\" Zhao Jian thought to himself.","There was no way he could compare his cultivation level with Ling Han now. The latter had a Spirit Devouring Physique, and there was no bottleneck before Spirit Transformation Tier in terms of cultivation level. How could he compare?","However, he was sure that Ling Han would definitely be stuck at the peak stage of the True Self Tier if he advanced so quickly, becauseheaven and earth was only fair.","Just how fast had your cultivation speed been previously? You would be stuck at the peak stage of the True Self Tier for an inverse ratio of that amount of time.","...","Ling Han had become a well-known figure in the Martial Hall. When the news spread out, even the Lord City Master was alerted. Though he did not summon Ling Han to meet him, he sent out an old butler to have a chat with Ling Han.","In short, everyone knew that the Martial Hall had recruited a prodigy who possessed the Spirit Devouring Physique and had boundless future prospects.","Ling Han naturally wouldn't take it to heart. He wasn't here to show off.","With Spirit Devouring Physique as his cover, when his cultivation level increased too quickly, there was a reasonable explanation—I've gotten cultivation resources again.","Peng, peng, peng! A knock suddenly sounded on the courtyard doors.","The servant immediately went over to take a look. Not long after, he led a young man in.","This man was only eighteen or nineteen years old, but his cultivation level was \"higher\" than Ling Han's. He had already stepped onto Celestial Path, though he had only just built his Human Dao Foundation.","\"My name is Zhu Yangzhou, and the Master of the Martial Hall is my father,\" this young man said, a hint of pride in his expression.","Before Ling Han, he was the number one prodigy in the Martial Hall, yet now he had lost to Ling Han's physique, which made him extremely displeased. However, in order to maintain the appearance of tolerance as a \"senior brother\", he still came personally.","\"Oh.\" Ling Han nodded.","Yi, just like that, you have no other expression?","Zhu Yangzhou was taken aback, then revealed an expression of displeasure.","He was already displeased to begin with, and now that Ling Han was acting condescending, he was naturally even more displeased.","\"I stepped into Celestial Path four months ago,\" he said calmly, but his tone was filled with the air of showing off.","Impressive, wasn't it? This was the Celestial Path!","No matter how fast you were to reach the Mystery Realm Tier, the barrier of leaping over the Celestial Gate would still be able to stop 99% of cultivators from advancing further.","Those that could become Celestials were as rare as phoenix feathers and unicorn horns.","Ling Han gave another 'oh', \"Congratulations?\"","'F*ck! You're just expressing your congratulations, and you're even asking in a questioning tone? What do you mean?'","Zhu Yangzhou suddenly felt an urge to beat someone up. Though Ling Han did not say a single word to provoke him, nor did he say anything out of line, and in fact, his expression was not very arrogant either, so why did it make him feel extremely uncomfortable?","If the large black dog were here, he would pat his shoulder to express his understanding. After all, Ling Han had learnt the skill of speech from him. Unknowingly, he would incite fury in others. This was the highest level of skill.","\"Junior Brother Zhang, though your physique is astonishingly strong, you should know that the path of martial arts is long, and when it is time to be humble, you should learn humility,\" he warned.","\"All right,\" Ling Han readily accepted. He had not come to cause trouble. As long as he could enter into the Pond of Life, he would immediately return.","Moreover, what sense of accomplishment could he have by stepping on a mere Human Dao Foundation?","Zhu Yangzhou was taken aback. Ling Han's reaction caused him to be unable to flare up no matter how furious he was.","But the other party was clearly very obedient, so why did he keep making him feel displeased?","\"Behave yourself, and you also have to be careful of propriety. Don't get greedy when something doesn't belong to you.\" He left behind these words, and then left.","Was this considered a warning?","Ling Han simply smiled, not taking it to heart at all.","Just as Zhu Yangzhou left, another person came over.","Knock, knock, knock. A knock sounded on the courtyard door. The servant went out to investigate, then led another person back.","This was no longer a man, but rather a woman. She was very young, and also very beautiful. Furthermore, she had an aura that had been formed from being in a high position for a long time.","\"I am Yan Yan,\" the woman introduced herself.","\"Oh?\" Ling Han's expression was still calm. How could he know who Yan Yan was?","\"Young Master Jun, Miss Yan is the beloved daughter of the Lord City Master!\" At the side, the servant hurriedly made an additional introduction to Ling Han.","The City Lord doted on his daughter. Her status was too noble, and if Ling Han offended Yan Yan, as Ling Han's servant, he would definitely be implicated as well. Thus, he immediately gave Ling Han a reminder.","Ling Han remained silent. At this moment, only Ah Han and the Buddhist Race could suppress him.","If the Great Emperor did not appear, and the Buddhist Race Race did not have a Pseudo-Emperor either, so who did he need to take to heart?","This kind of calmness caused Yan Yan to have a slightly higher opinion of him. As the beloved daughter of the City Lord, she was usually courted and pursued by who knew how many men. As time passed, she would naturally feel bored.","Ling Han's cold and indifferent demeanor gave her a sense of novelty, and she felt an urge to make him fall at her feet.","After all, putting aside the identity of the City Lord's beloved daughter, she herself was also an outstanding beauty.","\"Junior Brother Zhang, I'm going into the mountains to hunt tomorrow. Are you willing to go with me?\" she invited Ling Han.","She was brimming with confidence. With her status and beauty, as long as she issued an invitation, it was guaranteed that every man would scramble madly to accept.","\"No,\" Ling Han immediately replied.","Yan Yan almost vomited blood. He actually gave such an answer?","This guy!","She was still hopeful, and asked, \"Does Junior Brother Zhang have other plans?\"","\"En, I want to sleep.\""]},{"number":4657,"title":"Chapter 4657 Change of mind","paragraphs":["I want to sleep!","Yan Yan was dumbfounded.","Firstly, she was completely unprepared to be rejected by Ling Han. Secondly, the reason for her being rejected was actually so casual.","'You want to sleep?'","'You've already slept well, haven't you? Who did not allow you to sleep? But isn't one night enough for you? You still want to sleep in broad daylight?'","Was it because of the Spirit Devouring Physique that this guy didn't have the heart to cultivate? In any case, he only needed to absorb energy to break through.","If that was the case, then this person's future prospects would be limited. He was too narrow-minded, and had short vision.","However, Yan Yan was still a little dissatisfied. She was the number one beauty of Fortune Dragon City, and she was actually rejected like this. How could she swallow her anger?","Moreover, she was certain that Ling Han definitely wasn't putting upn a show of retreating in order to advance, purposely refusing to keep her hanging— that kind of indifference meant he really wasn't interested.","No way!","Once her temper as a young miss rose, she immediately declared, \"I never accept rejection. I will come and pick you up tomorrow morning!\"","After saying this, she turned around and left.","Ling Han scratched his head in confusion. What kind of person was this?","Forget it, let's go back to sleep.","At his cultivation level, cultivating =was already useless. The Seed of the Holy Flame needed a huge amount of energy to \"sprout\". Thus, his only thought was to enter the Pond of Life.","However, he hadn't slept for long when he was woken up by someone.","It was Zhu Yangzhou again.","En, Yan Yan was quite pretty, and was also the daughter of the City Lord. Thus, if he married her, he would definitely be able to save a few hundred years of hard work, or even spend several lifetimes.","\"I remember warning you, don't have any delusions about something that doesn't belong to you.\" When this person appeared in front of Ling Han again, his face bore a baleful expression.","'What do you mean?'","With how smart Ling Han was, he immediately understood after some thought.","It was because of Yan Yan.","En, Yan Yan was quite pretty, and was also the daughter of the City Lord. Thus, if he married her, he would definitely be able to save a few hundred years of hard work, or even spend several lifetimes.","However, why had Zhu Yangzhou suddenly appeared again?","Someone must have gone to tell on him and report the news.","In order to completely conceal his identity, Ling Han did not release his powerful divine sense to enshroud the whole city at all. He was very much like an Enlightenment Tier. Otherwise, in this massive city, no matter what happened, as long as he willed it, he could 'see' everything in his mind.","\"Listen, Yan Yan isn't someone you can hope to attain, so you have to reject her tomorrow. Otherwise, humph!\" Zhu Yangzhou said in a baleful voice. In fact, there was killing intent on his face.","Yan Yan was his exclusive property, and he would definitely not allow anyone to touch her.","He was the Young Master of the Martial Hall, so the servants here were naturally all his people. They knew how much this Young Master cared about Yan Yan, so as soon as Yan Yan left, the servants here immediately went to look for Zhu Yangzhou.","Though Zhu Yangzhou did not think that Yan Yan would be moved by a country bumpkin, even if she was curious, he could not tolerate it.","That was because he was definitely going to marry Yan Yan, and could not allow even the slightest bit of accident.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"I am unmarried, and she is unmarried. Senior Brother Zhu is being too nosy, aren't you?\"","\"You can try!\" Zhu Yangzhou said threateningly, \"Don't forget, this is my territory. If you dare to disobey me, not only will it be difficult for you to take a single step, you may even encounter all kinds of accidents!\"","Ling Han shook his head, \"As far as I know, all the Martial Halls in the world are the property of the Buddhist Race. Your father is only in charge on their behalf. Since when has it become your family's private property? Why don't we go to the city lord's residence and ask him to pass judgement?\"","Zhu Yangzhou's heart was instantly filled with anger, and he wanted nothing more than to smack Ling Han to death.","However, it was easy to smack this country bumpkin to death, but this boy was a Spirit Devouring Physique. Even the Lord City Master paid close attention to him. If this kind of prodigy suddenly disappeared, the Martial Hall probably wouldn't be able to hide it, and someone from the City Lord's Residence would definitely interfere in the investigation.","At that time, even if he was the son of the Master of the Martial Hall, so what? Murdering a prodigy of the Martial Hall was a serious crime.","Thus, he forcefully suppressed his killing intent.","\"Zhang Hanjun, let me give you another warning. Don't seek your own death!\" As he spoke, he turned around and left.","Ling Han shrugged. Was this person an idiot? He had already clearly rejected Yan Yan, yet he still came over to threaten him. He really didn't know what was wrong with his brain.","Oh, did he think that he was deliberately keeping Yan Yan hanging?","Was he that idle?","The night passed, and on the morning of the second day, peng, peng, peng. Ling Han heard a knock on the door, and it was a very loud knock at that.","Who was it, to actually disturb his rest?","Ling Han hadn't woken up yet, when he saw a young girl run in energetically.","\"Why are you still sleeping?\" This young girl chided delicately, her pretty face filled with displeasure.","Of course, it was Yan Yan, Miss Yan.","\"Didn't I tell you? I want to sleep!\" Ling Han said helplessly. This young girl was truly spoiled, daring to barge into a man's bedroom.","\"No, get up!\" Yan Yan rebuked. The temper of a young mistress was already flaring up.","\"Sister Yan, Junior Brother Zhang has been cultivating these few days, and is indeed very tired. You had best let him have a good rest. I have nothing to do anyway, so I'll go hunting with you, all right?\" Zhu Yangzhou's voice rang out.","Yet Yan Yan ignored him, and merely stared at Ling Han who was lying on the bed, \"You won't get up?\"","She drew out the whip that was wrapped around her waist, her expression cold.","If Zhu Yangzhou hadn't said this, Ling Han would have definitely slept to the end. However, with Zhu Yangzhou's interruption, Ling Han couldn't take it anymore.","If he continued to sleep, wouldn't that be equivalent to admitting that he was afraid of Zhu Yangzhou?","\"Cough!\" He suddenly sat up, \"I suddenly changed my mind. Let's go and hunt.\"","\"Ah!\" Yan Yan covered her eyes with both hands, and after a sharp scream, she hurriedly turned around and ran, \"Pervert, you are not wearing any clothes!\"","It wasn't like he wasn't wearing pants.","Ling Han thought to himself, then slowly began to put on his clothes.","On the sidelines, Zhu Yangzhou looked coldly at him.","As expected, this guy used the strategy of playing hard to get, and successfully caused Yan Yan to become interested in him.","This scheming guy deserved to die!","\"Senior Brother, could I trouble you to pass me that coat?\" Ling Han pointed at the coat hanging on the chair on Zhu Yangzhou's left.","Zhu Yangzhou did not speak, and merely coldly grabbed the coat, then tossed it onto the bed.","\"I hope you can come back alive!\" After saying this, he turned around and left.","Humph, since Ling Han was so determined to seek death, then he would oblige him.","Did he really think that just because he was a prodigy, he didn't dare to make a move?","Wrong, for the sake of Yan Yan, he was willing to do anything!","This woman was his!","Ling Han merely smiled, and did not take it to heart at all. He had only concealed his cultivation level, and had not lost his cultivation level.","When it was time to make a move, he would still make a move.","He got off the bed, and after washing up, he came to the courtyard. He saw Yan Yan standing there and waiting, looking very angry, filled with the innocence of a young girl, alluringly beautiful.","When she saw Ling Han, her pretty face involuntarily flushed red, and she cursed softly, \"Shameless!\"","Tsk, she actually dared to barge into a man's bedroom. Why was she still so embarrassed?","\"Let's go,\" Ling Han said calmly, and led the way out.","\"Hey, wait for me, wait for me!\" All of a sudden, Yan Yan had no time to be angry, and hurriedly broke out into a run in pursuit."]},{"number":4658,"title":"Chapter 4658 Chance Encounter with Celestial medicine","paragraphs":["As they left the city and entered the mountains, Ling Han took the chance to ask Yan Yan about Buddhist Land.","Yan Yan only thought that he was a country bumpkin who was ignorant, but she told him everything she knew, filling him in on common knowledge.","Within Buddhist Land, there were countless cities like Fortune Dragon City, and they numbered in the tens of thousands. This was the smallest administrative unit of Buddhist Land, and belonged to the category of ordinary city.","And the smallest number would be a dozen over, and the largest number would be a few dozen ordinary cities, which would form a relatively large administrative area, which would be managed by a single B-level city.","For example, the superior city of Fortune Dragon City was called White River City, and it belonged to one of several thousand B-level cities.","Compared to ordinary cities, a B-level city was only slightly larger, and the overall level of cultivation was slightly higher, and the population was slightly larger.","Above B-level cities, there were also A-level cities, which similarly managed a dozen to a few dozen B-level cities.","This number was much lesser, only a few hundred.","Above A-grade cities were the ten great capitals, which were respectively in charge of these A-grade cities, and above the ten great capitals was the supreme Sacred Buddhist Land.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. He had to fight his way from an ordinary city all the way to a B-grade city, then to an A-grade, a capital, and only then would he be able to enter into the Sacred Land.","The Pond of Life must be in the Sacred Land.","Though he would have to go through multiple layers of selection, there was nothing that could be done. Who asked this to be the Buddhist Land?","The two of them chatted idly all the way, and soon entered into the depths of the great mountain.","Though Yan Yan was only a Mystery Realm Tier-level martial artist, she was very brave, and kept running into the depths of the mountains.","However, Ling Han knew that there was still an \"elite\" following behind them.","An elder in Cauldron Forging Tier.","This was obviously a Dao Protector that the City Lord had assigned to Yan Yan. He would definitely not allow anything to happen to Yan Yan, and that was why this little girl dared to be so unrestrained.","With an \"elite\" of this level following behind them, even if Ling Han didn't deliberately release his divine sense to investigate, he couldn't possibly deceive him.","\"Three-Eyed Snow Leopard!\" Yan Yan exclaimed excitedly, pointing ahead.","She ignored Ling Han, and immediately broke into a run and charged out.","Meanwhile, Ling Han followed behind at a leisurely pace. He suddenly realized that this was a good opportunity to \"raise\" his cultivation level.","He could completely discover a divine pond, a Celestial medicine, and then ingest it. When he returned, he could boldly announce that he had once again set foot into the Mystery Realm Tier, or even Celestial Path.","\"Yes, not bad.\"","He released his divine sense, and began to search the mountains.","Ahead of them, the Three-Eyed Snow Leopard did not flee, but rather approached Yan Yan. Clearly, it thought that this was not a hunter, but rather a prey.","Peng!","The two immediately began a fierce battle. This human and panther were both Mystery Realm Tier-level. However, the snow leopard was a fierce beast, and was battling almost every day. Whether it was in terms of ferocity or battle experience, it was all superior to Yan Yan.","Hence, Yan Yan soon fell into a disadvantage, and was in a perilous situation.","Ling Han immediately joined the battle.","In just a few moves, Yan Yan was pushed out of the battle zone. She was not even qualified to interfere.","Yi?","Yan Yan was very surprised. That was because Ling Han's power was clearly not as strong as hers, but every move and every strike was just right, achieving the effect of defeating a stronger opponent as a weaker opponent.","This was because his use of power had reached perfection. He had not wasted a single bit, and had used it to its fullest.","Heavens, it could be done like this?","He was forcefully using his natural talent in battle to oppose an opponent at a higher cultivation level.","Yan Yan's beautiful eyes shone. This had practically overturned her understanding of martial arts.","As it turned out, his cultivation level was inferior, and his power was far inferior. It could actually be compensated through battle techniques.","No, no, no, this was not battle technique, but rather basic skills, basic skills that could not be any more solid.","Only when he had grasped the basics, would he be able to use such technique.","After a few dozen more moves, the Three-Eyed Snow Leopard didn't dare to fight anymore. It hurriedly turned around and fled.","Though fierce beasts were fierce, they were not idiots either. They knew that they were no match, so what was the point of fighting?","Ling Han leaped out in pursuit, and Yan Yan hurriedly followed behind him.","If Yan Yan had been paying close attention, she would have discovered that the snow leopard's escape routes were extremely irregular. Sometimes it would flee east, and sometimes it would flee south. Unfortunately, she was only focused on chasing, and had not considered this at all.","That was because the snow leopard was under Ling Han's control, but even the Cauldron Forging Tier behind couldn't tell.","\"Celestial medicine!\" Ling Han suddenly called out. His feet paused, and he pointed at the side of the mountain.","Yan Yan faltered for a moment before raising her head to look as well. True enough, there was a dark purple plant growing on the mountain wall. It was like a ganoderma, exuding a faint fragrance.","What kind of luck was this? They had actually discovered the Celestial medicine in pursuit of a fierce beast?","She knew that she had a Dao Protector, but what if her Dao Protector was no match either?","After all, they were already too deep into the mountains. If they were here, it wasn't impossible for vicious beasts of Cauldron Forging Tier or even Core Formation Tier to appear.","This was definitely not a Spiritual Herb. From so far away, she only had to take a single sniff, and it was as if all the pores on her body had opened up, making her feel extremely comfortable.","\"Be careful!\" she hurriedly said. \"Wherever Celestial medicines grow, there will definitely be fierce beasts standing guard!\"","She knew that she had a Dao Protector, but what if her Dao Protector was no match either?","After all, they were already too deep into the mountains. If they were here, it wasn't impossible for vicious beasts of Cauldron Forging Tier or even Core Formation Tier to appear.","\"I'm going to pick the herb!\" Ling Han didn't say another word as he ran out and climbed the mountain side.","\"Zhang Hanjun, come back quickly!\" Yan Yan hurriedly shouted. Who knew if a ferocious beast would suddenly appear?","What they feared really came true. A large snake actually poked out of a cave in the mountain wall. Its body was as wide as a bowl, and with a flick of its tongue, there was actually a black Qi surging.","\"Not good, this is the Black Murderous Snake!\" The Dao Protector immediately dashed out, grabbed Yan Yan, and turned to flee.","This Black Murderous Snake was a Cauldron Forging Tier-level fierce beast, and was one of the strongest of this level at that. The black Qi it spat out was incredibly poisonous. If one did not take the anti-venom in advance, then absorbing even the slightest bit, even a fellow Cauldron Forging Tier would very quickly fall to their knees.","Thus, his only option was to flee with Yan Yan. He didn't dare to battle at all.","In any case, his mission was to ensure Yan Yan's safety. As for others?","No matter how prodigious he was, what did it have to do with him?","Yan Yan faltered for a moment before screaming, \"Hurry up and save Zhang Hanjun!\"","\"I'm sorry, Young Miss. Please forgive me for not being able to obey you.\" The Dao Protector shook his heads, obviously unwilling to turn around. \"If that brat is lucky enough, he might have a chance of survival, but I definitely won't allow Young Miss to take risks.\"","No matter how much Yan Yan screamed, he only acted as if he had not heard anything. He grabbed onto Yan Yan and ran madly.","...","\"Hiss!\" The Black Murderous Snake descended from the mountain wall, its eyes fixed on Ling Han, its viciousness on full display.","\"Sigh!\" Ling Han sighed.","His public image wouldn't be destroyed so quickly, right?","\"Uh, I'll make up a story, and say that at this critical moment, a golden condor suddenly appeared and fought fiercely with the Black Murderous Snake. In the end, both sides were severely wounded, and I took advantage of the opening.\"","\"En, not bad, not bad.\"","Ling Han broke into a grin. It was as if there was some kind of curse; no matter what identity he was pretending to be, it would soon crumble. This time, he had to keep his disguise no matter what.","At this time, the Black Murderous Snake could no longer hold back and began to attack.","'This human is far too arrogant! He's already at death's door, yet he's still mumbling to himself. Fine, I'll eat you!'","The Black Murderous Snake suddenly opened its mouth wide, and charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han's eyes widened slightly, \"What do you want to do?\"","Weng! A terrifying aura surged over.","The Black Murderous Snake's movements paused, and felt like its heart was about to explode.","What a terrifying aura!"]},{"number":4659,"title":"Chapter 4659 Advancing another level","paragraphs":["If snakes could also break out in a cold sweat, then this Black Murderous Snake would definitely be covered in sweat by now.","This was too terrifying. How could there be such a terrifying aura?","It felt that to say nothing of devouring this person, even if it made the slightest move, it would still be crushed into pieces.","Its only bit of intelligence made it want to cry. You're not some freaking Enlightenment Tier at all!","Showing off would cause you to be struck by lightning!","\"Where can I find a golden condor?\" Ling Han released his divine sense. Boom! The entire mountain was enshrouded by his divine sense, and it seemed as if it were boundless.","All of a sudden, the wild beasts all over the mountain trembled, as if they had encountered their natural enemy.","The Black Murderous Snake almost fainted. Being able to set foot on the Celestial Path, it actually already possessed a little intelligence, which made it realize that the man in front of it was so strong that he could practically destroy the heavens and earth.","There were many birds in the mountains, but if they just happened to meet Ling Han's requirements, both a golden condor and in the level of Cauldron Forging Tier, it would be difficult to find them.","\"There actually isn't any!\"","Ling Han gritted his teeth, and sighed, \"I can only settle for the next best thing.\"","He made a grabbing motion behind him, and saw that a small black dot had appeared in the distant skies. Then, it rapidly enlarged, and turned into a giant green vulture that was as long as thirty meters when it spread its wings.","The Black Murderous Snake was about to faint, all right?","Vicious beasts could be considered as wild beasts that had slightly developed intelligence, but were incredibly powerful. They naturally knew of the existence of natural enemies. Eagles devoured snakes, and when they were wild beasts, they were naturally weak. After becoming vicious beasts, those of the same level would still be naturally weaker than their natural enemy.","This was a Green Arrow Vulture, its natural enemy — of course, it was not weak either, and also posed a great threat to the Green Arrow Vulture. Thus, unless it was absolutely necessary, the Green Arrow Vulture would not consider it part of its diet.","However, the two of them had now been forcefully brought together.","It should be said that the Green Arrow Vulture was even more dumbfounded, all right?","Even now, it was still dizzy.","Who am I?","Why am I here?","What the f*ck was going on here?","If this was another time, when natural enemies met, they would definitely have already gotten into a fight. However, because of Ling Han, the snake and vulture were both trembling, not daring to move at all.","\"Yi, you guys aren't going to fight?\" Ling Han asked in surprise, \"If you guys aren't going to fight, how am I supposed to explain my story?\"","The snake and vulture were on the verge of tears. 'You're freaking strong, so why are we fighting?'","Sigh!","Ling Han could only operate it manually. He forcibly pried open the snake's mouth, to take a bite out of the Green Arrow Vulture. Then, he used the claws of the Green Arrow Vulture to scratch a part of the snake's body.","This snake and vulture could be considered overlords in the mountains. When had they ever suffered such injustice?","They were wild beasts, and no matter how wary they were of Ling Han, their vicious nature was still present.","The two enemies actually joined forces, launching an offensive at Ling Han.","What was the point? In front of Saint-level power, this was practically as weak as if it was made of paper.","It wasn't long before the two beasts were both killed.","Ling Han cut off a piece of snake meat, tore off a bird's wing, and placed some Celestial medicine on it. He then began to cook.","Not long after, a fragrant aroma wafted through the air, and he began to eat heartily.","Yi, someone was here?","This little girl had a good conscience, and even went to get reinforcements. However, if Ling Han really had to wait for her to save him, he would have long since entered the snake's stomach by now.","He smiled, and continued eating, pretending not to know.","Ling Han's divine sense told him that there was presently a group of three people rushing over.","It was the little girl, Yan Yan. En, there was also her Dao Protector, and lastly... the Master of the Martial Hall.","This little girl had a good conscience, and even went to get reinforcements. However, if Ling Han really had to wait for her to save him, he would have long since entered the snake's stomach by now.","He smiled, and continued eating, pretending not to know.","Thus, when Yan Yan, the Master of the Martial Hall, and the Dao Protector came over, they saw Ling Han sitting leisurely, eating and drinking to his heart's content.","Yi, wasn't it said that he was in imminent danger?","Are you playing with me?","The Master of the Martial Hall glanced at Yan Yan, and did not speak. However, his heart was probably filled with curse words.","\"Zhang Hanjun, you didn't die?\" Yan Yan was overjoyed.","Meanwhile, Ling Han said in irritation, \"If I were dead, would a ghost be eating here now?\"","\"Why didn't you die?\" After Yan Yan breathed a sigh of relief, she became curious.","Ling Han pointed at the corpse of the snake and vulture on the ground, \"I was lucky. The two of them got into a fight, and ended up perishing together, which I took advantage of.\"","The Master of the Martial Hall and that Dao Protector stepped forwards to investigate. As expected, this Green Arrow Vulture and the Black Murderous Snake had experienced a great battle before their deaths, and the wounds on their bodies were left by their sharp fangs and claws.","\"Your luck is really good!\" The Master of the Martial Hall nodded. At this time, he naturally knew that Yan Yan had not been joking joking, but that Ling Han was really too lucky.","Weng! At this moment, a fluctuation flashed across Ling Han's body.","\"Mystery Realm Tier!\"","\"He has broken through!\"","The Master of the Martial Hall and the Dao Protector both exclaimed in shock. Though they knew that Ling Han was a \"Spirit Devouring Physique\", they were still shocked to see him break through so easily with their own eyes.","In comparison, how difficult had it been for them to break through at that time?","Sigh, comparisons were really infuriating.","Ling Han smiled. This was just right. He would have these two as witnesses. He had eaten Celestial Path-level vicious beast meat, and obtained enough energy, so breaking through was naturally a matter of course.","Since there was no longer any danger, the Master of the Martial Hall naturally returned, while Yan Yan stayed behind. She was too curious about Ling Han.","After eating, the two of them returned to the city. That Dao Protector was still protecting them in secret.","Halfway there, that Dao Protector suddenly appeared. He said that he had suddenly received a notice from the City Lord, and had to bring Yan Yan back immediately.","Thus, Ling Han was left to travel the rest of the way alone.","As he walked, a smile suddenly appeared at the corners of Ling Han's lips.","That was because he discovered that there were currently three people approaching him.","In a short while, xiu, xiu, xiu, three Mystery Realm Tiers appeared, two in front and one blocking his path of retreat.","\"Die obediently, and you can suffer less,\" one of them said.","These three people were all dressed in black, and their faces were also covered with a black cloth.","\"Zhu Yangzhou sent you?\" Ling Han asked calmly.","\"Humph, you're about to die, so what's the point of knowing so much?\" The two people in front of him immediately moved, drawing their sabers and swords to slash at Ling Han.","Ling Han's feet didn't move, and he simply used his hands to casually block the attacks. He had clearly only used the power of Mystery Realm Tier, yet he was always able to neutralize the attacks just right.","\"Zhu Yangzhou doesn't know that I've broken through again, right?\" Ling Han said with a smile. The power he displayed now was at the level of Mystery Realm Tier.","The three of them were taken aback. How could there be such a coincidence?","Originally, for Mystery Realm Tiers to kill an Enlightenment Tier, who furthermore had an advantage in numbers, it was naturally almost certain that they would succeed, so Ling Han wouldn't even have the chance to escape.","But now?","Though they still had an advantage in numbers, if their cultivation levels were equal, then the outcome was hard to say.","\"It can't be helped. I'm a Spirit Devouring Physique. I just happened to eat a meal of Cauldron Forging Tier-level beast meat, and broke through,\" Ling Han kindly explained.","They knew that Ling Han had been attacked, because even the Master of the Martial Hall had been mobilized.","It was also because of this that they had been sent out by Zhu Yangzhou. At first, they had thought that Ling Han had already met with misfortune, but who would have thought that when the Master of the Martial Hall arrived, he discovered that Ling Han was still alive, and that was why they had mobilized again.","This was a monster who could break through just by eating and drinking."]},{"number":4660,"title":"Chapter 4660 I broke through again","paragraphs":["Ling Han was fighting against three opponents all on his own, yet he was firmly on the upper hand.","Since he had nothing else to do, he was tempering his technique.","In a situation when power was completely not on the upper hand, and without even using martial arts techniques, merely relying on his basic skills and meticulous control of power, he easily gained the upper hand.","This was a little like how the Great Emperor had suppressed his cultivation level. Even if his cultivation level had dropped to the Venerate Tier, he would still be able to put up a fight against a Saint.","Ling Han actually gained a sliver of enlightenment. That was because even in a battle on the level of Saints, Regulations was the main force and real power, but it was not that power was completely useless.","Sometimes, it may be this slight difference that would allow him to defeat his opponent.","On the other hand, the three black-robed men became more and more panicked as they fought.","What was going on?","They were clearly Mystery Realm Tiers, and had entered into this cultivation level much earlier than Ling Han, so why were they still at a disadvantage in a three-on-one battle?","What kind of freak was this?","Pu!","Just as they were distracted, a black-robed man had his saber snatched away by Ling Han. He turned it around and swiped out at his neck. Immediately, blood poured out madly. Even if he tried his best to cover the wound on his neck, it was useless.","Ling Han slashed again, and after a few slashes, another person was cut down.","The remaining person was scared to death, and did not have any fighting spirit left. Immediately, he fled in a panic.","Ling Han didn't give chase. This was a good opportunity for him to return and deliver a message to Zhu Yangzhou, scaring that guy.","He slowly returned to the Martial Hall. At this time, the news that he had broken through to the Mystery Realm Tier had already spread out, which naturally caused another commotion.","How many days had it been since he entered the Martial Hall?","It had only been ten days, but what about it? His cultivation level had already soared from the Meridian Opening Tier to the Mystery Realm Tier. Every two days or so, he would advance another cultivation level. Who wouldn't go crazy with jealousy?","—Zhao Jian broke another four cups in outrage.","Yan Yan's interest in Ling Han was growing more and more. She would come to look for him every few days, which naturally caused Zhu Yangzhou to feel even more jealous. However, the fact that he had sent someone to kill Ling Han, but they had failed made him feel uneasy.","Because with Ling Han's present relationship with Yan Yan, he was completely capable of asking the City Lord's Residence to make a move, and begin an investigation.","What made him feel slightly at ease was the fact that the black-clad man who had fled back had already been silenced by him. There would be no witnesses now that he was dead. It was impossible for Ling Han's one-sided story to cement the accusation. After all, he was already a Celestial, and furthermore, the son of the Martial Hall's Master. Without complete proof, even the city lord's residence couldn't do anything to him.","He was like a poisonous snake, searching for the next chance to make a move.","He had to hurry, because Ling Han's \"Spirit Devouring Physique\" was too terrifying. Who knows, after a while, he would step onto the Celestial Path.","Right at this moment, the Martial Hall Competition was about to begin.","Every three years, there would be a disciple competition among the Martial Halls of the various ordinary cities. The victor would be able to represent the B-level city in the high-level competition, and could even charge all the way to the capital.","If he could reach this step, that would be reaching the heavens in a single step.","Every three years, there would be such prodigies and lucky people that would rise above the rest, and soar through the ranks.","This kind of prodigy had appeared in the Fortune Dragon City before. Now, he was already esteemed as one of the four great War God Guardian Deities, and was an elite of Sect Master-level!","Thus, when the time for the tournament drew near, all the disciples rubbed their fists in anticipation.","However, the number of participants was limited, and there were only a mere three spots. Thus, they would definitely only be able to send out the most outstanding disciples.","However, Ling Han definitely wouldn't settle for that.","Wasn't this a good opportunity for him to quickly enter the Pond of Life?","In Fortune Dragon City's Martial Hall, there just happened to be three Celestial Path-level disciples. Thus, there was no need for trouble at all. It was just these three, and there was no need to pick and choose.","—Once one had stepped onto the Celestial Path, that was a completely different level of being. It was not something that the Mystery Realm Tier could aspire to at all.","However, Ling Han definitely wouldn't settle for that.","Wasn't this a good opportunity for him to quickly enter the Pond of Life?","Thus, he immediately went to find the Master of the Martial Hall. Oh, right, the Master's name was Zhu Tai, and he was a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","Because he was a prodigy of the Martial Hall, Zhu Tai also gave him face. When he found out that Ling Han wanted to see him, he very quickly allowed him to come in.","\"I want to participate in the Martial Hall tournament,\" Ling Han said directly.","Zhu Tai immediately shook his head, \"Hehe, though your physique is heaven-defying, you joined too late after all, and haven't stepped into Celestial Path yet. Don't be anxious, three years later, it will be your world.\"","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"I ate a Celestial medicine yesterday, and have just broken through to Foundation Building Tier.\"","\"Pu!\" Zhu Tai immediately spluttered out a mouthful of tea, then coughed uncontrollably.","What kind of joke was this? You broke through again?","Hold on, could advancing in the mortal level compare to setting foot on the Celestial Path?","From mortal to Celestial, how much energy was needed to breach this step?","This was the accumulation of many, many things, and was definitely not something that could be accomplished overnight.","He revealed an expression of displeasure. Even if Ling Han's physique was so awesome, it was still impossible for him to rush up to Celestial Path in just a few days. After all, he knew that Ling Han had just broken through to Mystery Realm Tier a few days ago.","\"Zhang Hanjun, do you know that deceiving an elder is a serious crime!\"","Ling Han looked surprised, \"I have indeed broken through.\"","He released a wisp of aura, which was shockingly Foundation Building Tier-level.","Zhu Tai was instantly dumbfounded, speechless.","He really was a Foundation Building Tier cultivator!","F***.","He didn't know how to react at all. Could it be that this was the terror of the Spirit Devouring Physique?","This was too shocking. From mortal to Celestial, this step was actually so simple.","\"This!\" Aside from being stunned, he was slightly troubled.","In the first place, there were only three Celestial Path-level disciples, so there was no need to choose at all. It was just these three disciples.","But now?","There was now Ling Han added into the equation.","What could they do?","One person had to be eliminated.","\"You can leave first. I will consider for a while.\"","Although Zhu Tai was the Master, the Martial Hall wasn't his private property. Rather, it had been established by the Buddhist Race. Thus, he couldn't do as he liked.","Thus, he convened a meeting, and after a discussion with a few deputy masters, he came up with a solution.","Then let's have a competition.","One out of the four people would be chosen, and the weakest one would be eliminated, which would be fair and just.","When the news spread out, it shook the Martial Hall.","Who would have thought that there would be a person like Ling Han?","As long as there was need, his cultivation level could be increased. It was really too amazing.","When Zhao Jian found out, who knew how many things he had broken.","He knew that Ling Han was a \"Spirit Devouring Physique\", so his cultivation speed was fast, but no matter how fast, it couldn't possibly be so fast, right? He hadn't even advanced half a minor level, and you have already become a Celestial!","Celestials were extremely valuable. If it was in the village, they could definitely be worshipped on a longevity plaque.","Because time was tight, only a day later, the knockout tournament began.","Ling Han and the others stepped out respectively.","Aside from himself and Zhu Yangzhou, the other two Foundation Building Tier disciples were a man and a woman respectively. Their names were Liu Jia and Li Mingyue.","They drew lots first, then battled in pairs. There was no need for the victors to compete again. The two losers would battle again, and the one who lost would be eliminated.","This was still quite fair. As long as one's abilities weren't at the bottom, they would definitely be able to win.","Thus, the four of them drew lots first. The result was Ling Han against Liu Jia, and Zhu Yangzhou against Ling Han.","The two battles began at the same time.","\"Junior Brother Zhang, aren't you a little too arrogant!\" Liu Jia shook his head. \"Though your physique is astonishingly strong, you have only just broken through to the Foundation Building Tier, after all. What battle prowess could you possibly have? You really don't care about the big picture!\"","Meanwhile, Ling Han smiled, \"How do you know that when I go to White River City to participate, I would not have already eaten my way to Cauldron Forging Tier?\"","So logical!","Liu Jia was instantly rendered speechless, and could not refute him."]},{"number":4661,"title":"Chapter 4661 Tournament Begins","paragraphs":["Since he could not convince him otherwise, they could only fight.","Liu Jia stared coldly at Ling Han, his eyes filled with disdain.","He indeed looked down on this opponent, because he felt that the latter had not put in much effort at all. He had completely relied on his physique to advance into Celestial Path.","Was this kind of person worthy of being called a cultivator?","Moreover, to charge up to the Foundation Building Tier in such a way, just how strong could one's battle prowess be?","\"Humph, then we'll have to see who's stronger!\" he shouted lightly, then charged towards Ling Han.","He had just advanced into Celestial Path not too long ago. Of course, it was only Human Dao Foundation, but his cultivation level had already stabilized. With each punch and kick, the aura of a Celestial Path supreme elite was fully displayed.","Ling Han also channeled power on the level of Human Dao Foundation. This was far from being as powerful as he had once been, because he had already been able to battle against the Ultimate Dao Foundation when he had been in Human Dao Foundation. He had been overwhelmingly freakish.","Right now, he didn't have an advantage in terms of power. However, his grasp of power was far too perfect. One portion of his power could be used like it was two, or even three portions. This was simply terrifying.","Very soon, Liu Jia was at a disadvantage. Furthermore, it was the kind of disadvantage that meant he would be completely dominated. No matter how amateur one was, he could still tell with a single glance who was at the upper hand, and who was at a disadvantage.","All around them, the disciples that were watching the battle exclaimed in surprise.","How could they have imagined that not only did this \"Zhang Hanjun\" have a special physique, but his natural talent in battle was also so powerful?","This was practically... enough to drive anyone to despair.","After fighting for around a hundred rounds, Liu Jia had no choice but to admit defeat.","He was really no match.","On the other side, Zhu Yangzhou had also won. Now, Liu Jia and Li Mingyue were going to compete for the last place in the tournament.","This battle was soon carried out, and Ling Han had no interest in watching. He directly left.","Just as he was about to leave the arena, he saw Zhu Yangzhou looking at him coldly, his gaze very complicated.","Perhaps, he was also complaining about why Ling Han's cultivation level would increase so quickly.","It hadn't even been a month, and he had already advanced from Meridian Opening Tier to Celestial Path. Who could have imagined this?","The Spirit Devouring Physique was actually so terrifying.","Ling Han ignored him, and strode off.","When Yan Yan heard about this, she deliberately ran over to see Ling Han, and even dragged him to a restaurant outside, saying that she wanted to give him a proper celebration, which almost drove Zhu Yangzhou mad with fury.","He had pursued Yan Yan for several years, and she had never given him any face at all. However, what about Ling Han?","He didn't flirt with her at all, yet Yan Yan chased after him instead.","Comparisons would drive one crazy.","His killing intent blazed even fiercer. No matter what, he could not give Ling Han any more time to grow. Otherwise, this guy would really surpass him in terms of cultivation level.","At first, he had thought that Ling Han merely had cultivation level but no genuine battle prowess. After all, Ling Han had relied on his physique to improve, but after watching the battle between Ling Han and Liu Jia, he was naturally shocked. As it turned out, Ling Han's natural talent in battle was also astonishingly terrifying.","Thus, the only way to suppress Ling Han was to kill this guy.","Another two days later, the Master of the Martial Hall, Zhu Tai, personally brought Ling Han, Zhu Yangzhou and Liu Jia to White River City to participate in the Martial Halls Tournament.","Yan Yan also approached forcefully, requesting to go with them.","She was the daughter of the City Lord, so Zhu Tai didn't dare to say anything. He could only follow the wishes of this Young Miss.","Due to Zhu Tai's presence, Yan Yan's Dao Protector also appeared boldly and publicly with them. The six of them travelled for five days, crossing mountains and rivers.","It should be known that they had to pass through a great many primitive mountains and forests, and among them, there were a great many fierce beasts that were Celestial Path and above. This was also why Zhu Tai wanted to go with them. Firstly, it was to express his high regard for the tournament of the Martial Halls, and secondly, it was also to ensure the safety of the participating disciples.","What surprised them was that they actually did not encounter any wild beasts along the way.","It should be known that they had to pass through a great many primitive mountains and forests, and among them, there were a great many fierce beasts that were Celestial Path and above. This was also why Zhu Tai wanted to go with them. Firstly, it was to express his high regard for the tournament of the Martial Halls, and secondly, it was also to ensure the safety of the participating disciples.","Strange, the wild beasts seemed to have all gone into hiding.","This was natural. Ling Han didn't want to complicate matters. He had already suppressed the ferocious beasts with his powerful aura, so how could any of them dare to run out?","Five days later, they finally arrived at White River City.","In comparison, the White River City was much larger. It was at least the size of three Fortune Dragon Cities.","And after entering into the city, they would also discover that the streets here were wider, with more people, and the streets were also livelier.","From afar, they could see a tall tower standing erect in the city.","That was the Buddhist Tower.","Visibly, seven-coloured light was entwined around the Buddhist Tower, and there was an indescribable sacredness about it, that others would feel deep veneration.","A light flashed through Ling Han's eyes. That was formed from the power of will of all living beings.","The Fortune Dragon City didn't have any Buddhist Tower, and it seemed like it wasn't high-grade enough. Thus, only B-grade cities were qualified to build Buddhist Towers.","Zhu Tai brought them to the Martial Hall here, and after showing the corresponding credentials, they were arranged to stay.","After arriving here, they could see that there were too many Celestial Path-level and above disciples here. Not only were there Foundation Building Tier disciples, there were even Cauldron Forging Tier disciples.","—If one had cultivated to the Foundation Building Tier in a normal city's Martial Hall, then he would be sent to a B-level city's Martial Hall for further cultivation in three years, at most. Similarly, if he advanced another level, he would be able to enter an A-level city for further cultivation.","Similarly, those further up could go to the Royal Capital.","Ati this level, if he wanted to improve further, it would no longer be a matter of cultivation level. Instead, he would have to possess extremely high natural talent in martial arts, and only then would he be qualified to be chosen to enter into the Sacred Land, and become a true member of the Buddhist Race.","White River City could be considered small for a B-level city, with a total of seventeen ordinary cities under its jurisdiction. Thus, every ordinary city's Martial Hall sent out three disciples to participate, and the total number was only fifty one.","Even if there were ten people from White River City itself, it was still far from 100.","In a few days, all the disciples of the Martial Halls from the ordinary cities had arrived, and the tournament was about to begin.","The rules of the tournament were very simple, and that was to \"kill\" the disciples of the other Martial Halls. Every person that was defeated would be counted as one point, and the loser would immediately be disqualified.","Finally, when there was only one person left, or when the three days' time for the tournament had ended, everyone's score would be counted. The five people with the highest score would be qualified to participate in the advancement tournament of the A-grade city.","The Master of White River City's Martial Hall personally arrived to announce the start of the tournament.","The venue for the competition was arranged in a large mountain. There were still wild beasts inside, and they had not been cleared out. This was also to increase the difficulty and variables of the competition.","The mountains were covered with monitors, so it was very easy to tally the results. None of them would be able to stay in the competition and cause trouble after they were defeated.","With the Martial Hall as the unit of measure, each group would enter into the depths of the mountains. Otherwise, if everyone entered together, it would immediately cause a battle royale, and the tournament would soon end.","This was not just training the battle prowess of the disciples, but also their ability to react to danger. If they only knew how to fight head-on, and did not know how to guard against ambushes or perform ambushes, they would not be of much use even if they were nurtured.","Ling Han and the others were the seventh group to enter the depths of the mountains.","The moment they set off, Zhu Yangzhou led the way, heading towards the depths of the great mountain.","\"Let's find a place to hide first, and let the strongest teams cause damage to one another.\" That was what he said.","Indeed, there were a few teams that were extremely powerful. In fact, there were even \"elites\" that had formed Ultimate Dao Foundations.","That night, not only did they enter deep into the mountains, they also entered into a cave. There were definitely no surveillance devices here.","Tsk!"]},{"number":4662,"title":"Chapter 4662 Resolved","paragraphs":["After a simple dinner, Ling Han and the others began to rest, and took turns standing guard.","At midnight, Ling Han was sleeping, when he suddenly felt an ice-cold sensation on his neck.","He opened his eyes, and saw that there was already a sword held against his neck. No wonder it felt cold.","The sword was held in Zhu Yangzhou's hand, and Liu Jia, who was beside him, merely watched coldly from the sidelines. He had absolutely no intention of stopping him.","\"Senior Brother, what's the meaning of this?\" Ling Han asked, pretending to be confused.","Zhu Yangzhou couldn't help but laugh in spite of himself. \"Zhang Hanjun, are you really stupid or are you doing this on purpose? Can't you tell?\"","After saying this, he shook his head and continued, \"You're truly careless. I've already threatened you several times, and in fact, you even knew that I was the one who sent people to kill you. Yet, you're still sleeping so soundly beside me!\"","Even if he wanted to seek death, that was not the way to do it.","To think that he had deliberately found a cave to avoid all the surveillance devices, planning to join forces with Liu Jia to kill him as quickly as lightning.","He had never imagined that things would progress so smoothly to the point of being unbelievable.","He merely stretched out his sword, and Ling Han's life was in his grasp.","Meanwhile, Ling Han pretended to be furious, \"Senior Brother, I have really misjudged you! You are too despicable. We are all cultivators, so we should have a fair and square battle to the death!\"","\"Who's going to fight you to the death? Are you worthy?\" Zhu Yangzhou scoffed. \"I warned you not to come into contact with Yan Yan, yet you ignored me!\"","Meanwhile, Ling Han cried out in injustice, \"Senior Brother, you only said not to touch anything that doesn't belong to you, but you didn't say that it was Yan Yan.\"","Yi, are you a f****** idiot? Can't you even tell the meaning behind these words?","Zhu Yangzhou instantly felt like he was about to go crazy. It couldn't be that he had become enemies with Ling Han because the latter was too straightforward and didn't understand his words, right?","However, upon further thought, this person had the Spirit Devouring Physique. His cultivation level was advancing too quickly, and if he missed this opportunity, there would be no possibility of killing him in the future.","Moreover, Yan Yan was indeed very interested in him. In fact, she had even deliberately accompanied him here!","Just the thought of it made him feel as if a knife was being twisted in his heart.","\"This day next year will be the day of your death!\" he declared balefully.","\"Hold on.\" Ling Han raised his hand, and said, \"What time is it now? Is it past midnight? Otherwise, if the time is remembered wrongly, then wouldn't the death day be remembered wrongly as well?\"","This!","Zhu Yangzhou and Liu Jia exchanged looks, both wanting to grit their teeth.","Had this guy really become stupid?","\"Don't care about his feigned madness!\" Liu Jia said. \"The longer the delay, the more trouble there will be. Kill him!\"","Zhu Yangzhou nodded in understanding. This person in front of him was indeed terrifying. His cultivation speed was far too quick.","He held the sword forwards, but a strange thing happened. The sword bounced back up, and stabbed into Liu Jia's chest at an incredibly fast speed.","F***!","Liu Jia looked at his chest in disbelief. Blood was already gushing out, and when he looked at Zhu Yangzhou, his eyes were still filled with confusion.","\"W-why?\" he asked in a trembling voice.","If he didn't ask clearly, he would die with remaining grievances.","Zhu Yangzhou was also very flustered. He too wanted to know why.","He was clearly extending his sword forwards, so how had it bounced back up? Furthermore, it was so coincidental that it had actually pierced into Liu Jia's body, and had even pierced through the latter's heart.","Ling Han rubbed his neck, and said with emotion, \"Senior Brother, you've come back to your senses. In the future, you can still be a good person.\"","Liu Jia stared fixedly at Zhu Yangzhou, and took his last breath, \"You b@stard!\"","As he spoke, his neck tilted, and he was completely dead.","The destructive power of this strike was too terrifying, causing him, a Human Dao Foundation cultivator, to practically be killed directly.","'F*ck! This has nothing to do with me!'","Zhu Yangzhou was extremely depressed. He was already dead, so this misunderstanding would naturally never be resolved.","\"You, it's you!\" He suddenly pointed at Ling Han. There were only three of them here.","It was impossible for Liu Jia to seek his own death, and it was not him who had done it either. Thus, the only one left was Ling Han.","This was something that had suddenly occurred to him, and that was why he had blurted it out. However, after the words left his mouth, a layer of coldness suddenly rose up on his body.","How did he do it?","\"You, you, could it be that you have broken through again?\" he asked in a trembling voice.","Yi, his imagination was so rich?","Ling Han couldn't help but smile. He nodded, and said, \"That's right.\" He released his aura slightly, reaching the Heavenly Dao Foundation.","Although Zhu Yangzhou was shocked, his heart calmed down.","Thankfully, he was not inferior to his opponent.","However, when Ling Han's aura fluctuated again, it had reached the level of Ultimate Dao Foundation.","W-what!","Zhu Yangzhou was instantly dumbfounded, his eyes widened.","He had broken through again?","However, this was not the end. Every time Ling Han's aura fluctuated, it would become stronger by another level.","Zhu Yangzhou watched helplessly as Ling Han soared all the way from Human Dao Foundation to Spirit Transformation Tier. He was already completely dumbfounded, and could only gape, completely unable to speak.","\"Fun, right?\" Ling Han smiled as he patted Zhu Yangzhou's shoulder.","\"Impossible! Absolutely impossible!\" Zhu Yangzhou finally came to his senses. \"Even if you're a Spirit Devouring Physique, your cultivation level can't possibly soar like that! That's right, you must have cultivated some kind of mind bewitching technique, and that's why I accidentally killed Liu Jia.\"","\"As long as I stay true to my heart, don't even think of bewitching me!\" he roared loudly, brandishing his sword in a slash towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled, and stretched out two fingers, casually catching the blade of the sword between them.","Zhu Yangzhou forcefully twisted the hilt of his sword. With the sharpness of this sword, it was completely capable of instantly severing Ling Han's fingers.","However, when he exerted force, he heard a 'qiang', and saw that the sword's blade had broken.","'Holy f*ck!'","The sword was broken?","Zhu Yangzhou looked at the broken sword in disbelief. With a 'ding', the tip of the sword fell onto the ground, releasing a crisp sound, but it was as if he had not heard it.","En, he must have brought a fake sword with him when he left. It must be, haha!","\"Die!\" He abandoned his sword and threw a punch at Ling Han.","Ling Han casually brandished the broken sword. Pu! Blood instantly sprayed through the air.","Zhu Yangzhou screamed in agony. He grabbed his severed wrist and retreated, only to see that his right hand had already been severed.","\"How could this be! How could this be!\" he exclaimed in shock, completely unable to believe that he had actually become a cripple.","\"Sigh, I wanted to keep a low profile, so why did you come to provoke me?\" Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"You're seeking death!\"","Keep a low profile my a*s!","In ten days to half a month, you have already advanced from Meridian Opening Tier to Celestial Path, and this is called keeping a low profile?","Did anyone act low-key like that?","\"Who exactly are you!\" Zhu Yangzhou roared.","\"You don't have to know that.\" Ling Han didn't say his name. It was extremely likely that Ah Han was sleeping in this land. That was a Great Emperor, so even if he was sleeping or recuperating from his injuries, Ling Han didn't want to be careless.","He slashed out with his sword. Pu, Zhu Yangzhou was sliced into two, but with a thought from Ling Han, flames burned, burning Zhu Yangzhou into ashes.","He did not touch Liu Jia's corpse. As long as others investigated, they would be able to find out that it was Zhu Yangzhou who had done it. Furthermore, Zhu Yangzhou had disappeared from this moment onwards, so they would conclude he must have fled for fear of punishment.","As for why Zhu Yangzhou wanted to kill Liu Jia, let others think about it. He couldn't be bothered to make up an excuse.","All right, it was time to earn points."]},{"number":4663,"title":"Chapter 4663 Closer and Closer","paragraphs":["Ling Han moved out, and searched all over the mountains and plains.","His divine sense was too powerful. As long as he wanted to know, who could escape his senses?","Not long after, he found the first person.","The other party had not foreseen that Ling Han would suddenly appear, because among the contestants this time round, he belonged to the category with higher ranking abilities. Thus, he should be the one that could strut out and look for targets.","Now that he suddenly saw someone walking towards him, he was slightly shocked.","\"Very good. You have delivered yourself to my doorstep.\" He nodded, then said in a haughty manner, \"Take the initiative to admit defeat.\"","Ling Han smiled, \"Without fighting, how would you know that I am inferior to you?\"","\"Haha!\" That person laughed loudly, \"Do you think that I have not seen the information on the disciples of this tournament? Your name is Zhang Hanjun, and you are merely Human Dao Foundation!\"","And as for him?","Ultimate Dao Foundation!","With a gap of two minor levels, this was an absolutely one-sided suppression.","Ling Han shook his head and said, \"Wrong, I'm currently Heavenly Dao Foundation.\"","\"How could that be!\" That person did not believe him.","\"Huh? Don't you know that I'm a Spirit Devouring Physique?\" Ling Han countered.","The corner of that person's mouth twitched. He had indeed heard that one of the participating disciples this time round was an incredibly rare physique.","However, even if the Spirit Devouring Physique could rely on absorbing energy to break through to the next cultivation level, there had to be a process of absorption, right?","It was just like water overflowing when the vessel was full, but you have to fill up the entire vessel with water first, right?","\"Humph, even if you are Heavenly Dao Foundation, you are still inferior to me by a minor level.\" That person tried his best to maintain his arrogant attitude, \"It would be a piece of cake for me to defeat you.\"","\"Come,\" Ling Han said with a smile. When he had been in Human Dao Foundation, he had already been able to defeat Ultimate Dao Foundation, though he didn't want to put on such an exaggerated performance now.","That person smirked coldly, and raised his palm to deliver a strike at Ling Han.","Boom, power surged, turning into a massive black palm.","Ling Han smiled faintly as he clenched his fist and punched forward.","Peng!","He had clearly only used the power of Heavenly Dao Foundation, and it was a very standard Heavenly Dao Foundation at that, but under the bombardment of a punch, it had achieved the effect of piercing through.","With this strike, the massive palm immediately crumbled.","That person couldn't help but give an 'en'. That was because this punch from Ling Han was really too amazing, and just happened to be the weak point of his power. Thus, with this strike, it had the effect of breaking through a stronger strike with a weaker counter.","There was no perfect attack in this world, so there would definitely be flaws. However, with his overwhelming advantage in cultivation level, this flaw should be very, very hard to catch. How could it be that every attack could be so accurate?","This opponent was not simple!","He launched another attack at Ling Han.","Ling Han activated his movement technique and counterattacked.","The images of the battle between the two of them passed through the monitors, and very soon, attracted the attention of a great many people.","\"Yi, this person should be a Human Dao Foundation. How could he actually manage to exchange blows with an Ultimate Dao Foundation?\"","\"Wrong, wrong, wrong. He has already advanced into Heavenly Dao Foundation.\"","\"Hiss, this is too shocking, isn't it?\"","\"Hehe, you have to know that this guy is a Spirit Devouring Physique. If you knew, you wouldn't be so surprised.\"","\"Oh, so that's the case!\"","This Spirit Devouring Physique was really a good excuse. No matter how fast Ling Han's cultivation level \"improved\", this explanation could easily answer any doubts without making anyone suspicious.","\"However, this guy doesn't just depend on his physique.\"","\"Indeed, his attacks are far too powerful, and he's also far too sensitive about his opponent's weak points. It's as if he didn't even need to think before instinctively throwing a punch to find his opponent's weakest point.\"","\"Too awesome!\"","The spectators all exclaimed in shock. This guy had the ability tier surpassing battle prowess.","\"Will he be able to battle someone one minor level higher than him, or will he be able to defeat someone one minor level higher than him?\"","\"I'm really expectant.\"","Everyone was curious, and could not take their eyes off him.","And they were not disappointed either. The battle between Ling Han and his opponent was incredibly exciting, and in the end, it was Ling Han that had grasped the weakness of his opponent, and defeated him.","The battle ended, and that person left dejectedly. There were surveillance devices here, so he did not dare to break the rules.","Meanwhile, Ling Han smiled faintly. This kind of battle was actually still somewhat useful for him, allowing him to better control the use of power when his battle prowess was limited.","Continue.","He walked all over the mountains and plains, battling with others.","In this place, points could not be earned by defeating one's opponent, but rather by knocking them down.","In comparison, this was much more difficult, because they could run if they couldn't win.","Ling Han didn't mind. In any case, he had three days.","There were some opponents that were relatively strong. In a situation where Ling Han had suppressed his power to Heavenly Dao Foundation, there were three opponents that he could only defeat but not detain.","It could not be helped. He could not use a super strong movement technique to give chase.","In the blink of an eye, three days had passed, and the competition had ended.","When the scores were counted, they discovered that two people had not appeared. Then, when they sent someone to look for them, they actually discovered a corpse!","When the news spread out, everyone was shocked.","It was just a competition, and someone had actually died?","Upon investigation, they discovered that this person was Liu Jia, a disciple of Fortune Dragon City. Meanwhile, the missing person was Zhu Yangzhou.","Upon further examination, the injuries on Liu Jia's body were clearly left by Zhu Yangzhou.","The matter was very obvious. Zhu Yangzhou had fled after committing murder.","Zhu Tai instantly cried out in injustice, and went everywhere to find someone to resolve the matter. His son was not that kind of person.","But the evidence was irrefutable. No matter how eloquent he was, it was useless.","Actually, this really could not be considered as wronging Zhu Yangzhou. That was because he and Liu Jia had indeed wanted to kill Ling Han, but they had not succeeded.","When the scores were counted, Ling Han was ranked first!","Even if he still had three opponents that he had yet to defeat, the number of people that had been eliminated by him was still the highest, so his score was naturally the highest.","Thus, Zhu Tai didn't know whether he should be happy or not. This was because the Fortune Dragon City's Martial Hall had always been weak. Every time it participated, it would only be a minor role. Now, Ling Han actually won first place, allowing the glory of several thousand years ago to reappear. This was naturally a joyous matter.","However, his son had been charged with murder, and the entire world was hunting him down. How could he be happy?","Next, Ling Han and the others who were ranked in the top five would be qualified to participate in the advancement battles of the A-grade city. However, Zhu Tai's trip could only end here. If he still wanted to go to the A-grade city, he could only do so as a visitor.","Yan Yan was naturally the happiest about Ling Han's performance. After the tournament ended, she dragged him around the White River City. It was rare for even her to come here, so she naturally wanted to walk around and take a look.","However, the White River City was too big, and they actually lost their way as they walked. Under Yan Yan's instigation, they climbed over a wall, because this way, they would be able to return to the main path faster.","However, because of this, they walked into a massive garden.","\"Ah!\" Yan Yan suddenly exclaimed in shock. This was because an extremely embarrassing scene had suddenly appeared in front of them—a man and woman were doing something shameful.","And when they discovered that someone had actually interrupted their fun, the couple also cried out in surprise, and hurriedly separated.","\"Who are you two?\" The man was very young, and he immediately shouted at Ling Han and Yan Yan. However, upon seeing Yan Yan's appearance, his lust was immediately aroused."]},{"number":4664,"title":"Chapter 4664 Ripples","paragraphs":["Actually, as long as Ling Han was willing, his divine sense could enshroud the entire city, and easily find the way out for him.","However, the closer he got to the core of the Buddhist Land, the more cautious he became. He definitely wouldn't use his strength easily.","Thus, he didn't care where he went.","However, he was still slightly embarrassed that he had actually witnessed the intimate moment between a man and a woman.","\"You're not from my residence!\" The woman hurriedly pulled on her clothes that were half-removed, and after sweeping a glance over Ling Han and Yan Yan, she immediately exclaimed in shock, \"Shaolin, they're thieves!\"","\"Hehe, what a beautiful villain!\" Yet the young man was not the slightest bit flustered. He merely stared at Yan Yan, desire flickering in his eyes.","He had just been interrupted, and now that he saw an even more beautiful woman, desire naturally rose up in him again.","This was someone that had delivered herself to his doorstep.","Yan Yan covered her face with her hands. This was really too painful to the eyes. She was still a virgin.","\"We're not thieves, we, we just got lost!\" she argued. After all, she was in the wrong.","\"Haha, you barged into my Zhou Manor, and you still say you're not a thief?\" The young man gritted his teeth, \"Hehe, if you don't want me to send you into the government office, then listen to me obediently.\"","En, they had encountered a pervert.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"The two of you are not a married couple. En, looking at her age, she's older than you. Furthermore, the two of you are having a tryst in the depths of the garden. Obviously, the relationship between the two of you is shameful.\"","\"Going by that deduction... this woman can't be your stepmother, right?\"","When these words fell, the expressions of the young man and the woman changed drastically.","F***, his guess was too accurate.","This woman was precisely the seventeenth concubine of the young man's father. Because she was lonely in her room, and this \"son\" was outrageously bold with lust, the two of them became good friends as they spent time together.","It should be known that this kind of thing could never be exposed. Once it was revealed, there would definitely be deaths.","\"Humph, you guys are seeking death!\" The young man's expression changed drastically, filled with killing intent.","Ling Han had to die. As for Yan Yan, he could imprison her, and when he was tired of her, he would decide whether to kill her or throw her into a brothel.","He directly charged over, launching an attack at Ling Han.","Ultimate Dao Foundation.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and directly increased his power to the level of Ultimate Dao Foundation.","He couldn't be bothered to dawdle slowly. In any case, he had won first place in the Martial Hall competition, and he had obtained a Celestial medicine as his reward. He only had to say that he had broken through after consuming it, and that would be fine, right?","He did as he willed, and very soon, he had suppressed that young man, and directly stepped on him.","However, this was a battle on the level of Foundation Building Tier, after all, so the commotion was still very big. Very soon, someone rushed over.","What was going on?","Everyone was slightly stunned. Firstly, who was this unfamiliar man and woman?","Secondly, why would Third Young Master and Seventeenth Concubine appear here?","Would this... cause one's imagination to run wild?","\"Who are you two?\" The elite guards appeared, staring at Ling Han and Yan Yan. \"Let go of Third Young Master first.\"","Ling Han smiled, and said, \"If I let go of him, will you guys immediately rush over and beat me up?\"","Of course they would.","'You guys are trespassing on someone else's property, and as guards, if we don't react at all, that would not be logical, right?'","However, if he had said it so directly, would the other party still let the hostage go?","\"We can talk things over peacefully.\" The elite guard hurriedly appeased Ling Han, \"Do you know that this is the Zhou Clan! Our Old Master Zhou is the father-in-law of the Lord City Master!\"","Yan Yan couldn't help but pale slightly. If the other party was just a member of a small clan, she would be able to deal with him as long as she revealed her identity.","But... the City Lord of a B-level city?","That was naturally a level higher than the City Lord of an ordinary city.","\"Oh.\" Ling Han nodded, \"At this point, we can no longer hide our identities! Actually, we are the investigator that your Old Master Zhou has hired, and that is to find out which wife and concubine is committing adultery outside.\"","\"Sigh, who would've thought that the adulterer wasn't an outsider, but one of our own.\"","\"To be on guard against all kinds of dangers, but those among our own are hard to guard against.\"","Hearing Ling Han's words, everyone gave an \"oh\", and some even nodded.","Previously, they had already been curious as to why Third Young Master and Seventeenth Concubine would appear here. It should be known that there were only flowers and trees here, and there was not even a single chair. This man and woman were all alone here, so what could they be doing here?","Now that they heard Ling Han say this, it naturally confirmed their conjecture.","This... damn shameless guy, he actually dared to cuckold his father.","\"No, don't believe him!\" That Seventeenth Concubine hurriedly explained. However, because she had been in a rush previously, she had only pulled on her clothes and not tidied them up properly. It was obvious that her clothes were disheveled.","Hence, her explanation was naturally pale and powerless.","As for that Third Young Master, he had been stepped on by Ling Han, and could not speak at all.","\"Alright, I'll hand him over to you guys. We'll naturally ask your master for the compensation, so there's no need to send me off.\" Ling Han gave Yan Yan a signal, and the two of them turned to leave.","\"Hehe, since you've already arrived, why are you in a rush to leave? Let's go to the inner courtyard and have a cup of tea.\" The elite guards hurriedly intercepted them. The identities of these two people were unknown, so how could they be trusted just because of mere words?","If he allowed them to escape, he would definitely be in deep trouble.","\"Let's drink again next time.\" Ling Han stretched out a hand, and exchanged a blow with the elite guard, forcing him backwards. Then, he took advantage of the opening to flee.","This elite guard was only in the Ultimate Dao Foundation, so how could he stop Ling Han?","However, he had already memorized the appearance of Ling Han and Yam Yam. After making his report to the City Lord's Residence, the entire city would naturally issue a warrant for their arrest.","After Ling Han and Yan Yan left the Zhou Residence, they finally found the right path and returned to the Martial Hall.","Recalling what she had just experienced, Yan Yan couldn't help but cover her mouth and laugh.","Though the process was a little embarrassing, it was still very fun.","However, not long after, as expected, portraits of them were posted all over the city. The city lord's residence issued a warrant for their arrest.","At this time, that Dao Protector of Yan Yan had no choice but to step out. After he had clarified the situation, he took out the official seal of Fortune Dragon City, and entered into the city lord's residence to explain the situation.","When he came out of the city lord's residence, the warrant for their arrest had also been removed. After all, the city lord of an ordinary city was only one level lower than the city lord of a B-level city. Furthermore, this matter could actually only be considered a misunderstanding.","Ling Han and the others who were ranked in the top five in the Martial Hall tournament rested for a few days before setting off for the A-grade city.","They would form a team with the other five disciples to participate in the advancement competition of the Martial Hall tournament.","There were still five days until departure, and everyone could move freely. After they set out, they would not be able to move freely.","After Ling Han stayed in the Martial Hall for a day, Yan Yan dragged him out to play again.","\"Zhang Hanjun, if you can enter the Sacred Land, will you forget about me?\" This willful young mistress suddenly asked, appearing a little worried and rueful.","After so many days of contact, she realized that Ling Han was becoming more and more mysterious and difficult to understand, making her feel as if she was about to lose him."]},{"number":4665,"title":"Chapter 4665 Extorting a confession","paragraphs":["\"Yes,\" Ling Han replied without hesitation.","To him, Yan Yan was only a stranger, after all, what more when he was still acting as Zhang Hanjun. What Yan Yan saw and understood was not the real him at all.","Moreover, he wasn't here to pick up girls.","Thus, instead of giving her false hope, it would be better to deal with her quickly.","Yan Yan faltered upon hearing this. She hadn't expected that Ling Han would be so direct, and her face instantly became as white as a sheet.","\"Wu!\" She covered her face and left.","Ling Han didn't give chase. This was a good opportunity for him to sever his connection with Yan Yan. After all, he was going to sneak into the Pond of Life.","He stood up, planning to return to the Martial Hall.","Having won first place in the Martial Hall tournament this time, he would naturally be rewarded, and that wa he could enter the Little Pond of Life of White River City and cultivate inside for three days.","White River City had a Buddhist Tower, which could gather the power of will of all living beings, and with the conversion of a certain formation or Spirit Tool, this power of will would turn into incredibly pure energy fluid. If a cultivator cultivated in it, there would be many benefits.","Unfortunately, it was the Little Pond of Life.","Ling Han couldn't help but feel a little regretful. This Little Pond of Life definitely wouldn't be connected to the real Pond of Life. Otherwise, he would be able to absorb to his heart's content in one go, and directly \"accelerate\" the Seed of the Holy Flame, thereby becoming a Saint.","However, this was another chance to allow his cultivation level to soar in broad daylight.","Tomorrow morning, he would enter the Little Pond of Life to cultivate. After he came out, the newly established White River City's \"team\" would set off for Heavenly Prosperity City, an A-grade city to participate in the advancement battles.","\"It's not good to break a woman's heart like this.\" A man's voice was heard from behind him, filled with vigor.","Ling Han turned around, only to see a middle-aged man in embroidered robes walking out from the darkness.","Master of Fortune Dragon City's Martial Hall, Zhu Tai.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"She's not suitable for me.\"","\"If you don't try, how do you know she's not suitable?\" Zhu Tai asked.","Yi, when did you become such a gossip?","\"Why don't you try then, Lord Zhu?\" Ling Han said with a smile.","\"How could I possibly!\" Zhu Tai laughed in spite of himself.","\"If you don't try, how do you know it's not suitable?\" Ling Han said.","These words were a retort.","Zhu Tai showed a hint of displeasure, and said, \"Zhang Hanjun, have you forgotten yourself in your conceit? You actually dare to speak to me like this!\"","Ling Han shook his head, \"Lord Zhu has killing intent on him, so—\"","Zhu Tai was surprised. 'You can even tell that?'","However, since he had been seen through, he no longer put on any pretences, and asked darkly, \"Is the disappearance of Yangzhou related to you?\"","\"Why would Lord Zhu think so?\" Ling Han asked.","\"Hmph, at that time, the three of you entered the depths of the mountains together. Even in the final surveillance image, the three of you did not separate.\" Zhu Tai balefully said, \"But in the end, only you walked out. How could it be that it would not be not suspicious?\"","Ling Han shrugged and said, \"If it's really as Lord Zhu has said, then shouldn't the investigation be conducted by the Martial Hall of White River City?\"","\"Humph, you're a Spirit Devouring Physique. How valuable is this!\" Zhu Tai said through gritted teeth. Precisely because Ling Han was a rare talent, the investigation into Liu Jia's death was very sloppy. In any case, Zhu Tai was the biggest suspect, so they just had to put this person on the wanted list first.","\"Where have you hidden Yangzhou!\" he raised his voice and shouted loudly.","Ling Han smiled, \"Does Lord Zhu want to use force?\"","\"That's right,\" Zhu Tai said coldly. \"I will apprehend you, and under torture, you will definitely tell the truth!\"","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"Since it's torture, can the answers extorted be used as evidence?\"","\"I only need to force out the whereabouts of Yangzhou, and find Yangzhou. When we ask him directly, the truth will naturally come out!\" Zhu Tai said.","Zhu Tai gritted his teeth. If this matter really had nothing to do with Ling Han, then with how he had persecuted a prodigy, he would either have to roam the world from now onwards, or kill him to keep him from leaking the secret. He would just have to gamble and see if he would be able to get through it by luck.","Ling Han clapped his hands, \"Your logic is accpetable, but firstly, what if I really have nothing to do with it? Then what does Lord Zhu plan to do? Kill me to keep the secret? Secondly, Lord Zhu, you are not considering the possibility, and that is whether you can defeat me or not?\"","Zhu Tai gritted his teeth. If this matter really had nothing to do with Ling Han, then with how he had persecuted a prodigy, he would either have to roam the world from now onwards, or kill him to keep him from leaking the secret. He would just have to gamble and see if he would be able to get through it by luck.","However, for the sake of his son, he was willing to take this risk.","As for whether he could defeat Ling Han or not?","Haha, wasn't this the biggest joke in the world?","\"Zhang Hanjun, do you really think that just because you're a Spirit Devouring Physique, you can look down on everyone?\" He sneered, and said, \"I'm a Core Formation Tier cultivator!\"","Compared to the Foundation Building Tier, he had the advantage of a whole two major cultivation levels, and in the cultivation world, putting aside the fact that the gap of a major cultivation level would crushing enough, even the gap of a minor cultivation level would be extremely, extremely difficult to breach.","Ling Han crooked a finger at him, \"Come!\"","—To have some private words with him, Yan Yan deliberately chose a very secluded small forest, and this also created an absolutely good opportunity for Zhu Tai to make a move. Otherwise, he would definitely have to wait until Ling Han walked to some secluded place to make his move.","Zhu Tai was instantly enraged. He, a dignified Core Formation Tier cultivator, was actually provoked like this by a mere Foundation Building Tier cultivator?","Even a clay figurine would get angry, what more when he was not made of clay.","He didn't waste any more words, and he immediately lashed out with his palm. He was just about to subdue Ling Han and drag him to a more secluded location for interrogation.","He was sure that his son was definitely still alive. It was just that Ling Han had locked him up somewhere.","Ling Han raised his hand, and grabbed back at Zhu Tai's wrist.","\"Where did you get the courage to—\"","Zhu Tai had not even finished his words, when he realized that his wrist had already fallen into Ling Han's hand.","This was very easy and natural, as if he had taken the initiative to stretch out his hand for Ling Han to grasp.","He looked down, then raised his head to look at Ling Han, his face filled with surprise.","This was completely unacceptable.","\"You father and son, why do you always think of using your superior strength to bully others?\" Ling Han shook his head.","\"Y-y-you, what cultivation level are you at?\" Zhu Tai asked in a trembling voice. At this moment, he sensed an indescribable aura from Ling Han, causing him to shiver in fear.","This was an absolutely one-sided suppression.","\"Me?\" Ling Han pondered for a moment before saying, \"That's hard to say.\"","Whatever cultivation level he was at, that was that. What did it mean that it was not easy to say?","Zhu Tai looked humiliated and furious. He was already in such a state, yet Ling Han was still toying with him.","Ling Han couldn't help but smile, and said, \"I'm a fifteen-star Venerate. Have you ever heard of something like that?\"","Of course, I know about Venerate Tier, but what the hell was a fifteen-star Venerate?","Venerate Tier only had one to nine stars!","The humiliated and furious expression on Zhu Tai's face became even more pronounced. 'As expected, you're still toying with me!'","Ling Han sighed, \"Could it be that I have countered too many people verbally, so no one would believe me even if I told the truth now?\"","\"Sigh, when I go back, I will slap Old Black; it's all his fault for leading me astray!\"","With a thought from Ling Han, boom, the Heavenly Dao Flames burned fiercely, immediately burning Zhu Tai into ashes, leaving nothing behind.","Then, he retracted all of his aura. He was no different from any other Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivator, and headed towards the Martial Hall.","He had to end this adventure as soon as possible, and advance into Saint Tier. Only then would he be able to truly compete with the king tiers of the younger generation."]},{"number":4666,"title":"Chapter 4666 Wait Three days for me","paragraphs":["Zhu Tai's death did not cause any reaction.","Because the Martial Halls tournament had ended, he should have returned to Fortune Dragon City by now. Thus, his \"disappearance\" was naturally very normal.","—He had gone back.","When it was truly discovered that Zhu Tai had disappeared, Ling Han would have already gone to Heavenly Prosperity City. In fact, he may have even entered into the Royal Capital. Who would be able to trace it to him?","On the second day, Ling Han brought his token and headed to Buddhist Tower.","With this token, he could cultivate in the Little Pond of Life for three days.","White River City was very big, but his speed was also very fast. Even if he couldn't use his normal speed, he was now at least \"Ultimate Dao Foundation\".","Not long after, he arrived before the Buddhist Tower.","This Buddhist Tower was extremely tall, and looked like it could pierce through the clouds and tear open the sky. Because the power of faith of all living beings was too dense, it turned into a seven-coloured light, making this Buddhist Tower appear even more sacred.","Even outside of Buddhist Tower, there were still a great many believers that were sincerely kowtowing, delivering slivers of power of belief.","Ling Han couldn't figure it out at all. Since the Lords of Death had completely become the opposing side of the Living Realm, why did he still keep this piece of territory?","Shouldn't they be like the Sea Emperor, all alone and with only one Imperial Son?","Forget it, he wouldn't think about it.","Ling Han circled around, and arrived at the main entrance.","There was a flight of stairs that led upwards, and there were about a few hundred steps. At the end was the main doors of the Buddhist Tower.","Ling Han was just about to ascend the stairs, when he suddenly glimpsed a group of people.","There were people coming and going here, so it wouldn't be strange to see more people. However, there was one person in this group that Ling Han recognized.","Zhou Shaolin, that guy who had cuckolded his old man.","\"It's you!\" Zhou Shaolin also saw Ling Han, and couldn't help but feel angry. He immediately rushed over, looking like he was about to eat someone.","\"Brother Shaolin, what is it?\" The people beside him all caught up and asked.","\"Zhang Hanjun, I never thought that I would see you here!\" Zhou Shaolin ignored everyone else, and only gritted his teeth at Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded, \"Who would've thought? You stole your father's woman, yet he didn't break your third leg.\"","Hiss, everyone in the surroundings inhaled sharply.","They had indeed heard some rumors, but they had all heard it from hearsay. Now that they had personally heard Ling Han say this, they were instantly greatly shocked.","Some people were disdainful. This Zhou Shaolin had cuckolded his own father. He was practically a beast among beasts, but there were also some that expressed their envy. Just thinking about this kind of thing was exciting.","Zhou Shaolin was furious. This was his humiliation, yet Ling Han had publicly exposed it.","\"Haidong, do me a favor and give this brat a beating,\" he said to a young man beside him.","This Niu Haidong was the top elite of their group, and had already advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier.","Cauldron Forging Tier against Foundation Building Tier, no matter how high your natural talent was, so what?","Niu Haidong nodded, and stepped out.","Though his cultivation level was higher, his background was inferior to the others. He came from a small clan, and with his high talent in martial arts, he managed to sneak into the ranks of these second-generation young masters. Thus, he could not possibly refuse Zhou Shaolin's request.","\"Sorry!\" Niu Haidong immediately threw a punch at Ling Han.","Sigh!","Ling Han sighed. This was a persona, and he couldn't allow his persona to collapse.","Thus, he could only turn around and flee.","His target was Buddhist Tower!","Everyone faltered upon hearing this. They hadn't imagined that Ling Han would dare to run toward the Buddhist Tower.","It should be known that in the hearts of these people, Buddhist Tower was sacred and could not be blasphemed against.","If you drew the flames of war to Buddhist Tower, you would be condemned by everyone, and there would definitely be no place for you in the future.","\"You are really outrageously bold!\" Zhou Shaolin declared. With a wave of his hand, he beckoned Niu Haidong to set off in pursuit as well.","Niu Haidong faltered for a moment, but still gave chase.","Ling Han ran quickly, and arrived at the entrance to the Buddhist Tower. He saw two monks immediately stand up from their cross-legged positions at the entrance, looking at him balefully.","\"This is a peaceful place of the Buddhist Sect, so don't be impudent!\" they both said in ice-cold voices.","Ling Han smiled, and took out his token, \"I have come to soak, er, enter the Little Pond of Life to cultivate.\"","At this time, Zhou Shaolin and Niu Haidong had also caught up, but in front of the two monks, they did not dare make a move.","In Buddhist Land, monks were also known as ascetic monks. They were completely devoted to serving Ancestral Buddha, and would never marry for the rest of their lives. Thus, the status of monks was also very, very high. Even the City Lord would not dare to easily offend them.","A monk took the token, looked at it, and nodded: \"Go in.\"","Ling Han walked in, then turned around and said with a smile, \"I'll battle again in three days. Do you dare?\"","\"To say nothing of three days, even if it was thirty days, I would still wait until you appear!\" Zhou Shaolin said through gritted teeth. Then, with a wave of his hand, he brought Niu Haidong to the foot of the steps to wait.","He didn't dare to block Buddhist Tower's entrance.","However, once Ling Han came out, he would definitely beat this guy to death.","So what if he was a prodigy of the Martial Hall? It wasn't like he would kill or cripple his opponent. With his status as the brother-in-law of the Lord City Master, who would dare to make things difficult for him?","'I'll wait!'","...","After Ling Han entered, it wasn't long before a young monk came out and guided him to the Pond of Life.","They actually walked all the way downwards. After a whole eighteen levels, a wide space suddenly opened up ahead of them, and a very large pool appeared.","The waters of the pool were boiling, but it could be clearly seen that it was not steam rising from high temperatures, but rather dense mist.","\"Benefactor, please,\" the young monk said. \"Three days later, I will come and ask you to leave.\"","Ling Han nodded, and without any hesitation, directly walked into the pool waters.","He was sensing, wanting to figure out how to convert the power of belief into pure energy. If he could also imitate it, it would bring great benefits to the cultivation of those around him.","As for absorbing the power in the pool waters?","It was no big deal. With his appetite, wouldn't he be able to absorb all of it in a few moves?","Ling Han released his divine sense, and carefully observed.","The beliefs of all living beings were focused on the Buddhist Tower, which was then converted into a trickle that flowed down from different pipes and converged here.","However, Ling Han still couldn't figure out exactly how it was converted.","\"Perhaps, this involves the techniques of a Great Emperor, and that is not something that I can glimpse now.\"","After Ling Han studied it for half a day, he gave up on the idea of continuing to study it.","He began to absorb the power of all life.","Actually, he wasn't a Spirit Devouring Physique. However, firstly, his cultivation level was too high, and secondly, he still had a Seed of the Holy Flame in his mind. This was a true glutton, and it had surpassed the Spirit Devouring Physique by who knew how much.","Thus, no matter how much energy you had, he would still absorb it all.","Boom!","He relaxed slightly, and went to collect the energy in the pool waters, but the whole Buddhist Tower was releasing loud noises, trembling, as if it was about to collapse.","Hiss!","Ling Han gritted his teeth. There was too little energy in the pool waters. He hadn't gone all out yet, and had only absorbed it for a while. What was the result?","The energy in the pool waters had decreased by one third.","That was too little, wasn't it?","Sigh, so it could only be called Little Pond of Life."]},{"number":4667,"title":"Chapter 4667: Six Cauldrons","paragraphs":["Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple figures flew over. They were all monks cultivating in Buddhist Tower.","They sensed the massive tremors of the Buddhist Tower, and also discovered that the root of these tremors was the Pond of Life at the lowest level. Thus, they naturally had to run over at the first instant to check on the situation.","\"What’s going on?\" a monk who looked like the leader of the group asked.","\"T-the Pond of Life!\" Someone pointed ahead, his finger trembling slightly.","It could be clearly seen that the pool waters had initially been close to the edge of the pool, but now? It had directly declined by one third.","F***!","\"It was this person who absorbed it?\"","\"Hiss, who is he?\"","\"The champion of this year’s Martial Halls tournament, Spirit Devouring Physique.\"","\"Spirit... Spirit Devouring Physique?\"","\"Clearly knowing that he has a Spirit Devouring Physique, yet he was still allowed in?\"","\"Er, according to convention, the champion of every tournament would be qualified to enter the Pond of Life to cultivate for three days. It should be an oversight.\"","That’s right. Who would have thought that a freak like the Spirit Devouring Physique would appear out of nowhere?","\"Quick, hurry up and fish him out. Otherwise, the Pond of Life will be sucked dry by him!\"","Everyone hurriedly dragged Ling Han out of the Pond of Life. In such a short while, it had lost a whole third of its energy.","Meanwhile, Ling Han sighed. The energy in this Pond of Life was really too little.","Thinking about it, it was normal. After all, this was only gathered by the believers of White River City and the 17 ordinary cities under its jurisdiction. Furthermore, it was always used by the monks, so how much could be left?","\"Three days hasn’t passed, right?\" he protested.","\"Shoo, shoo, shoo. Are you trying to suck the Pond of Life dry?\" The monks all treated him like a ferocious beast, directly shooing him away.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. His persona clearly hadn’t collapsed yet, so why was he still able to attract animosity like this?","Reflection, he really had to reflect on himself.","Ling Han walked out in a daze, but he had not taken too many steps, when his aura suddenly fluctuated, and ascended to the next level.","Cauldron Forging Tier!","These monks were the best witnesses.","In the end, these monks were even more troubled.","And what the f****** did you do? You directly advanced into the next major tier, but what was the price? The Pond of Life had lost one third of its energy!","They practically chased Ling Han out the main doors.","Was there a need to do this?","Ling Han shook his head, turned around, and descended the stairs.","\"Haha, so you have actually been chased out.\" When Zhou Shaolin saw Ling Han, his face was filled with pleasant surprise.","He now knew that Ling Han was a Spirit Devouring Physique. Thus, he was really afraid that Ling Han would suddenly advance into the Cauldron Forging Tier three days later. That way, it would be very difficult to beat him up.","However, only half a day had passed, and Ling Han had already come out. Furthermore, he had been chased out.","What did this signify?","This guy must have done something out of line in his speech and actions, angering those monks, and that was why he had been chased out.","In other words, Ling Han was still in the Foundation Building Tier.","Hehe.","Ling Han looked at Zhou Shaolin coldly, and shook his head, \"Foolish clown, you still haven’t scrammed?\"","\"Stubborn fool!\" Zhou Shaolin said with a humph. \"Haidong, hit him. The harder you hit him, the better.\"","\"All right.\" Niu Haidong strode forwards, bearing down on Ling Han.","This time, even if Ling Han ran to the Buddhist Tower’s entrance again, he would still be chased off.","Ling Han smiled, \"Are you sure you want to help the villain?\"","\"You really have a bad mouth!\" Niu Haidong smirked coldly, then charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han casually delivered a palm strike. Pa! Niu Haidong collapsed to the ground, completely unable to get back up.","F***, what was going on here?","Zhou Shaolin wore a dumbfounded expression. He could not accept this at all. What was going on here?","Ling Han kindly explained, \"I’ve broken through again. Now, I’m a Cauldron Forging Tier, and furthermore... Six Cauldrons.\" He very casually set a cultivation level for himself. In any case, the Pond of Life had lost one third of its energy, so it wasn’t impossible for it to send him up to Six Cauldrons.","After all, he was the only \"Spirit Devouring Physique\" in the world, and there was no way to prove it.","This!","Zhou Shaolin was dumbfounded. ’You have just gone in for a tour, and in total, it has not exceeded three hours, and you have broken through just like that?’","Furthermore, not only had he broken through to the next major tier, he had also broken through the limits of the Cauldron Forging Tier?","But if that was not the case, how could Niu Haidong sent flying with a single slap be explained?","This was an absolutely one-sided suppression.","\"You, you, you—\" He stuttered \"you\" for a long time, but did not say anything else.","Ling Han walked over and slapped him onto the ground. \"If you trifle with me again, I’ll chop off your head!\"","If it was not for the fact that his public image could not be destroyed, he would have long since crushed this kind of damn bug.","Zhou Shaolin didn’t even dare to say a word. He had been terrified by Ling Han.","Ling Han returned to the Martial Hall, and the news of his \"breakthrough\" had already spread out, directly rendering the Master of the Martial Hall here speechless.","Advancing to the next major tier in just a few days was practically like a dream.","Spirit Devouring Physique: too freakish.","Another two days later, the team of ten set out. This time, it was led by a Deputy Master.","Outside the city, Yan Yan stared at the spot where Ling Han and the others had disappeared for a long time, unwilling to leave.","\"Young Mistress, let’s go back,\" the Dao Protector appeared and said softly.","Yan Yan nodded. Some people were like True Dragons. Once they soared, they would directly ascend to the Ninth Heaven. The distance between them was too far, and the two of them were not from the same world at all.","...","The journey from White River City to Heavenly Prosperity City would be a long one.","They travelled for a whole nineteen days before finally arriving at their destination.","In comparison, Heavenly Prosperity City was much wider, and the Buddhist Tower stood tall and proud, making for an even grander sight.","The group completed their registration, then entered into the city, and settled into the Martial hall here. Then, they waited for the advancement battles to begin.","The advancement battles were much more important. If one performed well, they would be directly taken in as disciple by the Heavenly Prosperity City’s Martial Hall.","It should be known that this was an A-grade city. It was similarly a Martial Hall, but the resources they could obtain here and in other Martial Halls could not be compared.","Thus, the team members all set out to gather information about the other teams.","\"A prodigy has appeared in the Space Expansion City, and his cultivation level is Four Cauldrons.\"","\"The Great Clouds City is even more kickass. There’s a Five Cauldrons.\"","\"The Heavenly Horse City also has disciples at Five Cauldrons.\"","Everyone exclaimed in shock. In comparison, the Heavenly Prosperity City was much weaker. Even the strongest elite had only broken through the limit once, and was a Four Cauldrons.","Er!","They immediately turned their gazes to Ling Han. They had almost forgotten about this guy— Six Cauldrons!","It couldn’t be helped. Who asked Ling Han’s cultivation level to soar too quickly? Who would have thought they would wake up and find out that the guy who had been a Foundation Building Tier yesterday would become a Cauldron Forging Tier today, and a Six Cauldrons at that.","They were all surprised. Ling Han wouldn’t have the last laugh again, right?","This was really going to break the record!","That was because a rookie like Ling Han would only be able to stand out in the ordinary city competition, at most. To win in the B-level city competition, they would definitely have to wait another three years.","There was no other reason than the fact that his cultivation level was not high enough.","However, there were actually such freakish physiques like the Spirit Devouring Physique in this world. This directly caused Ling Han’s cultivation level to soar in a short few days.","Now, his cultivation level was clearly the highest, so it was really very likely that he would win again.","\"Hiss, look, there’s an even more freakish person in the Great Horse City!\"","\"Mo Taiping, Seven Cauldrons!\"","Everyone exclaimed in shock. On the competitor list that they had just obtained, after Mo Taiping’s name, the words ’Seven Cauldrons’ were shockingly written."]},{"number":4668,"title":"Chapter 4668: Special Physique","paragraphs":["Everyone’s eyes fell on Ling Han again. This time, there was a sliver of sympathy.","Originally, Ling Han could have defied the heavens, but now, an opponent had appeared.","Seven Cauldrons!","Even if your Spirit Devouring Physique was awesome, it would only allow you to break through your cultivation level quickly. It didn’t mean that you could break through one limit after another. These were two completely different matters.","He was already at the Cauldron Forging Tier, so if he wanted to break through to the Core Formation Tier, he would need a huge amount of energy, right?","Thus, the chances of Ling Han breaking through to the Core Formation Tier were very small, and he would need a very, very long time. Thus, he was definitely no match for Mo Taiping.","They went to make some more queries, and obtained even more information about Mo Taiping.","\"This person is only 29 years old!\"","\"He has really obtained the great fortune of heaven and earth. He is already a Seven Cauldrons elite before thirty years old.\"","\"That’s right. There is absolutely no way he can be compared wtih that kind of person that has rushed up with his physique.\"","\"It’s said that he has repeatedly challenged those two levels above him in the Great Horse City. Not only has he defeated those at the same cultivation level, he can even challenge those two levels above him.\"","\"This is what a true prodigy looks like!\"","For example, Ling Han was only a Spirit Devouring Physique. When he reached the peak stage of the True Self Tier, he would no longer be able to rely on his physique to increase his cultivation level. Mo Taiping, on the other hand, may be temporarily surpassed by Ling Han, but in the end, he would still be able to catch up.","That was because the path of cultivation was ultimately something that had to be taken one step at a time, and walked steadily.","Ling Han, on the other hand, was unconcerned. He was already a fifteen-star Venerate, so would he lower himself to the level of these people?","What he was pursuing now was to stimulate the Seed of the Holy Flame, to become a Saint.","Thus, it was fine as long as he could enter the Pond of Life.","More and more teams from B-level cities arrived. Another seven days later, the advancement battles would begin.","The rules were more or less the same as the first stage of the competition. It was still defeating opponents to earn points, but there was an additional option of seizing the flag.","The top four in points, or those who had found a flag and could hold it until the end of the competition would become the five victors to participate in the Royal Capital’s competition.","If one was one of the top four in points and obtained the flag as well, the fifth place in terms of points would fill in the gap.","This added a certain amount of variables, and it was not just limited to fighting and killing.","However, it was not easy to snatch the flag.","Because this flag itself would light up, soaring straight into the skies, and even if they were very far away, they could still see it clearly. Thus, once they successfully captured the flag, they would be hunted down by a great many people. It was really, really too difficult to keep it until the end of the tournament.","The night passed, and the tournament began.","Just like the first round, with cities as the unit of measure, the teams entered the mountains and forests separately. They could first find a suitable location, hide or ambush, as long as they didn’t kill or severely injure their opponents during the battle.","There were more participants this time round. Not only had the number of participants in a team increased to ten, there were also as many as several dozen teams participating, and the total number of participants was close to five hundred.","The moment they entered, Ling Han and his group could do as they liked.","There was really no need to be afraid. They had Ling Han, a Six Cauldrons elite, with them. Among all the participants, this cultivation level was the second highest.","Thus, as long as they didn’t encounter Mo Taiping’s team, they really didn’t have to fear anything.","The ten-man team searched. However, the mountain range where the tournament was held was huge, and five hundred people were like a drop in the ocean. It was too, too difficult to search.","After a day, they had only encountered three teams. Though they had won the battle, seven people had still managed to escape, and had not been \"completely wiped out\".","However, this also caused their fighting spirit to soar, and they became increasingly arrogant.","At noon on the second day, they stopped to rest.","Although they wouldn’t need to eat after ascending to the Celestial Path, many people still maintained this habit of starting a fire to cook. A fragrance instantly wafted out.","If they were a weaker team, they definitely wouldn’t dare to do this. Wouldn’t that be announcing their location to others?","However, things were different now. With Ling Han, a Six Cauldrons, standing guard, what did they have to fear?","This was just right. This could also lure others over.","As expected, someone really discovered the commotion and ran over.","This was a young man who was completely enshrouded in black robes. His expression was cold, and he carried a long sword on his back. Unlike the others, who had stored it in their Spatial Spirit Tool.","He walked over, his eyes sweeping over the surroundings. He clearly saw Ling Han, yet was completely unmoved.","\"Very good, everyone is here.\" He nodded, revealing a cruel smile.","\"Haha, you dare to come alone?\" Someone laughed loudly, pointed at this black-robed young man, and said, \"Where are the others in your team?\"","\"I thought they were in the way, so I got rid of them all,\" the young man in black said calmly.","Hiss!","Everyone couldn’t help but inhale sharply. This guy was really too ruthless, wasn’t he?","It should be known that there was no point awarded for defeating a teammate. Otherwise, a great many teams would have long since fallen into internal strife.","But what did this guy do? Just because he thought they were in the way, he actually defeated all his teammates.","Moreover, when he said the word \"got rid\", it was filled with a baleful killing intent. It could be imagined that if this wasn’t a Martial Halls competition, but a contest inside a Mystery Realm, he would probably really deliver a fatal strike.","Moreover, he was able to get rid of nine of his teammates, so what did that mean?","Even if he had launched a surprise attack, he could \"kill\" one or two people at first, but how could the others be unprepared?","Thus, if he wanted to \"kill\" all his teammates, his personal abilities would also have to be incredibly powerful.","One faltered for a moment before asking, \"Do you know which team we belong to?\"","\"It doesn’t matter. In any case, I will defeat all of you,\" the black-robed young man said calmly.","\"We’re from the White River City!\" the person from before shouted.","\"Oh.\" The black-robed young man nodded. \"So it’s the team that has the Spirit Devouring Physique.\"","Judging by his expression, he wasn’t afraid at all.","Hiss, he clearly knew that there was Ling Han among them, yet was still so careless. This guy was either a maniac, or his abilities were really strong, and that was why he had such confidence.","\"You guys, are you ready to die?\" the black-robed young man asked calmly, his voice chilling to the bone.","Everyone clearly knew that this was only a competition, and no deaths were allowed. In fact, even severe injuries were not allowed, but the words of the black-robed young man were too infectious, causing them to involuntarily feel cold all over.","\"Trash, die!\" The black-robed young man charged out. With a qiang, the long sword on his back was unsheathed, exuding an endless cold light.","No one dared to face this attack head-on, and they all stepped back.","\"Haha!\" The black-robed young man laughed loudly. As his sword slashed out, a coldness intertwined, making everyone feel as if all the blood in their bodies had frozen.","This effect was extremely great, causing everyone’s movements to slow down. They could only unleash 10% of their battle prowess.","\"This is a special physique!\"","Everyone was exclaiming in shock. No wonder this person could \"eliminate\" all his teammates. Under such coldness, everyone’s speed was greatly reduced. Even if they wanted to flee, they couldn’t.","In comparison, this kind of physique was even more terrifying, because it was especially made for battle. It was not like the Spirit Devouring Physique, which only allowed one to improve quickly in cultivation level.","Without the advantage of cultivation level, how could Ling Han rival such a terrifying physique?"]},{"number":4669,"title":"Chapter 4669: Truth and falsehood","paragraphs":["The black-robed young man was incredibly domineering.","Not only did he have a special physique, but his cultivation level wasn’t low either, reaching the level of Five Cauldrons. It could be said that aside from Ling Han, no one could compare to him.","His cultivation level was higher, and he also had a special physique, allowing him to have the upper hand completely even if he was fighting against nine people alone. Furthermore, it was an absolute upper hand.","It wasn’t long before one of them was wounded by his sword. A deep gash was left on his chest, and blood gushed out violently.","And this was still because the black-robed young man had held back. Otherwise, with the might of this strike, it was enough to slice him into two.","The black-robed young man bared his teeth in a grin, \"A bunch of trash!\"","The remaining people were all shocked. Even with nine against one, they were still unable to stop this guy?","\"Zhang Hanjun, are you not going to make your move?\" someone called out to Ling Han.","Though this Lord’s physique was not of much use in battle, he was still a Six Cauldrons. In terms of cultivation level, he was superior to the black-robed young man.","Ling Han wore an expression of righteousness as he said, \"Using numbers to bully someone weaker than me is something that should be disdained. I disdain from doing such a thing!\"","F***!","This made his eight teammates want to turn around and beat him up. How could there be such a pedantic person?","Oh, in a life-and-death battle, do you also have to speak of such so-called righteousness?","Peng!","The black-robed young man shot out a foot, and sent another person flying. He had directly broken three of the latter’s bones, and dealt with another opponent.","He attacked aggressively. If he attacked without any reservations, his battle results would definitely be even more fruitful, but the present him had to hold back when he attacked, which naturally affected his battle prowess.","Even so, his efficiency was still astonishingly high. He would be able to dispose of an opponent in a few exchanges.","And as the number of people ganging up on him became lesser and lesser, the pressure on the black-robed young man also became lesser and lesser, and his expression naturally became more and more relaxed.","In a total of ten minutes, he had defeated all nine of them.","The black-robed young man sheathed his sword, then turned to look at Ling Han, and said calmly, \"Do you think that I would spare you since you had not made your move just now?\"","Meanwhile, Ling Han’s expression was stern, \"Are you doubting my character?\"","\"Haha, are there really such foolish people nowadays? That would be adhering to the rules of fairness?\" The black-robed young man shook his head, appearing very disdainful.","\"Of course there is. I am this kind of righteous, good young man,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Pei!","His nine teammates all grumbled in their minds. If they had known this earlier, they would have let Ling Han attack first. Why had they gone to so much trouble?","The black-robed young man gave an ’oh’, and drew his sword again, \"Whether you are really stupid or just pretending to be stupid, since you have encountered me, your path of advancement will end here.\"","\"Come.\" Ling Han crooked a finger at him.","The black-robed young man immediately charged over with sword in hand. Shua, the strike turned into a cold light. He was one with his sword, showing extremely high natural talent in cultivation.","Ling Han’s feet moved, and he shot out a palm strike.","His movement just happened to dodge the black-robed young man’s attack, and the timing of his palm strike was calculated to the extreme, just landing on the black-robed young man’s waist.","Peng, the black cloth flew like butterflies scattering, and the black-robed young man was instantly sent flying. A patch of white appeared on his waist. As it turned out, his clothes had been shattered by Ling Han’s palm strike.","If it was just a sparring match, the black-robed young man should have already admitted defeat, but now, one had to defeat his opponent.","The black-robed young man lowered his eyes for a look, and couldn’t help but frown, \"I have underestimated you. After all, you are a Six Cauldrons.\"","Weng, he lightly channelled the long sword, and instantly, a coldness rose up.","Ling Han gave an ’oh’, and said, \"So you don’t have any ice physique. This special ability comes from this sword.\"","This was a Spirit Tool.","What!","The people who were knocked down were stunned. A Spirit Tool?","’F*ck! A Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator already possesses a Spirit Tool?’","Did you have heaven-defying luck? Or did you come from a noble clan? Is that why you managed to possess a Spirit Tool so early?","They were also extremely dissatisfied, and thought that they had lost unjustly. They had clearly lost to the other’s Spirit Tool.","The black-robed young man was astounded. \"I didn’t expect your insight to be so good.\"","Ling Han laughed loudly, \"It’s not like you haven’t seen that I am stronger.\"","The expression of the black-robed young man changed drastically, looking a little ugly. The torn clothing at his waist was clear proof of Ling Han’s words.","\"That was just my negligence.\" He humphed, then brandished his sword and charged towards Ling Han.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Coldness continued to form on the blade of the sword, shooting rapidly towards Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t attack at all. He simply formed a shield in front of him, blocking all the coldness that assaulted him.","The black-robed young man had already charged over, his sword slashing towards Ling Han’s neck.","Looking at his ruthless expression, it seemed like he really wanted to chop off Ling Han’s head.","Ling Han’s feet moved, and there was no need for him to use any movement techniques. He had already walked out his own path. Every move, every blow was an amazing move, which conformed to the principles of heaven and earth.","He easily dodged this vicious sword strike, and delivered another light palm strike.","Peng, the black-robed young man was sent flying again. Pieces of cloth flew in the air, and another large part of the fabric at his waist was missing, almost revealing his entire waist.","This strike was not heavy, but the black-robed young man’s expression was ugly.","To him, this was a humiliation.","’You did it on purpose, didn’t you?’","He roared loudly, and charged back again.","Ling Han used the same trick again, easily dodging the attack. Then, he sent out a palm strike.","Peng, this palm strike still landed on the black-robed young man’s waist, but the black-robed young man’s body seemed to have turned into mud. The part that had sustained the force directly collapsed, making Ling Han’s hand seem to have sunk into the other’s body.","Yi?","\"Haha, do you think I’ll fall for this trick after suffering twice?\" the black-robed young man sneered. It was as if the sunken part of his body had turned into threads that wrapped around Ling Han’s wrist.","\"Die!\" He turned around and stabbed his sword at Ling Han’s chest.","In this strike, he had avoided Ling Han’s heart, but as long as it pierced through, it would definitely be considered Ling Han’s loss.","The other nine were all watching dumbfounded. They had never imagined that the black-robed young man’s body would actually undergo such a bizarre change.","\"He certainly has a special physique!\"","\"It’s not something like an ice physique, but something like mud. He can avoid damage and cling to his opponent.\"","\"Hiss!\"","This was too unexpected. After \"revealing\" that he did not have a special physique, no one could have possibly imagined that this guy really did have a special physique.","How could Ling Han block this strike?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and directly shot out a punch.","Peng!","This punch was extremely accurate, and when it landed on the sword’s blade, it avoided the sharp blade. A massive force landed, and the sword’s blade was instantly sent flying.","Simple, rough, but effective.","This was the benefit of having overwhelming power.","Ling Han smiled, and swung his right arm. Because his wrist was \"stuck\" by the black-robed young man, with this wave, the black-robed young man’s whole body was also swung.","Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng!","The black-robed young man was instantly smashed madly, and in a few moments, he was knocked unconscious. His limbs were spread out, and white foam was spewing from his mouth."]},{"number":4670,"title":"Chapter 4670: Mo Taiping","paragraphs":["The battle had ended.","However, when everyone looked at Ling Han, their eyes were filled with resentment.","Wasn’t it?","He clearly could have easily defeated this black-robed young man, so why didn’t he make his move earlier? He caused all of them to be eliminated.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He didn’t have any friendship with these people, so why did he need them to cozy up to him?","Moreover, defeating one’s opponent was a personal responsibility, not accumulate to become points for the whole team. Could it be that they wanted Ling Han to beat their opponent half to death before letting these teammates finish him off to collect points?","This was a tournament!","Ling Han strode away. The flag had not appeared yet. Otherwise, he only had to obtain the battle flag, and he would be able to sit by and wait for others to come one by one to deliver points to his doorstep.","He was not in a rush either. By now, the majority should be hiding, waiting for the appearance of the flag, snatching it and last for the three days of the tournament.","For those whose abilities were not all that strong, this was the best chance for them to win.","That was because the brilliance of the flag soared into the skies. It could be seen from anywhere, and the target was too obvious. If it appeared too early, the chaotic battle it would cause would be too frightening, and the meaning of the tournament was lost.","Thus, the flag would only appear on the morning of the third day, and there was more than half a day’s time to contend for it.","Ling Han strolled slowly. If he encountered anyone, he would beat them up. If he didn’t, he would just treat it as a sightseeing trip.","Time passed very quickly, and two days flew by.","The sun rose on the third day, and at the same time, a dazzling light rose from the mountains, soaring into the skies. No matter which corner of the great mountain one was, they could clearly see it.","Ling Han smiled, and walked towards that streak of light.","In these two days, he had not defeated many people. There were only a mere eight, and they were not even as good as the black-robed young man from before.","—If the tournament ended at this time, then though the black-robed young man had been defeated by Ling Han, his ranking would be higher than Ling Han’s.","However, it didn’t matter how many people they defeated. The one who obtained the flag would definitely win.","This ensured that a great many elites would also come over to compete for the flag.","Obtaining the flag was a sure bet for a winning spot. Otherwise, how would you know if those weaker than you had defeated even more weaklings?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Figures flew through the forest. Even those with weak abilities could no longer hold themselves back, and headed towards the flag.","Who knows, when others fought to the point that both sides were injured, he might be able to take advantage of the situation?","How fast was the speed of Celestial Path-level cultivators?","In a short while, Ling Han arrived at where the light had come from, and he was not the first person to come here. There were already seven people engaged in a battle royale, fighting for the flag. It was about three meters long, and the flag fluttered in the wind.","Ling Han strode over, and when he neared the battle, he saw that the seven people who were embroiled in the chaotic battle had actually all stopped, and then attacked him.","This attack was coordinated and extremely well coordinated.","If they teamed up at the last moment, their cooperation could not possibly be so good.","Thus, these seven people were simply faking it, causing others to be careless, thinking that they could take advantage of the situation. In the end, they would fall for the trap.","He had been caught off guard, and it was a team of seven at that. They were all at Cauldron Forging Tier—although the strongest was only at Three Cauldrons, it was believed that even a Six Cauldrons or even Seven Cauldrons would be affected.","Joy appeared on the seven people’s faces at the same time. If he only reacted now, he would definitely be hit.","Peng!","The seven attacks landed, but the joy on their faces suddenly disappeared.","Where was he?","There was no sign of Ling Han among the seven of them.","\"Are you guys looking for me?\" Ling Han’s calm voice sounded from the sidelines.","\"You!\" The seven of them were both stunned and terrified. How had Ling Han managed to escape from their siege?","\"Because I’m strong!\" Ling Han said with a smile, launching an attack.","Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng!","Even if he had only unleashed the power of Six Cauldrons, his battle awareness was still Saint-level. Wouldn’t it be easy for him to defeat a few cultivators who were only at Three Cauldrons at most?","In just two or three moves, Ling Han defeated all seven of them.","He twisted his neck, and looked towards the forest on his left side, \"How much longer do you want to continue watching?\"","A young man walked out of the forest, his figure as straight as a spear.","\"Zhang Hanjun?\" the young man asked.","\"That’s me.\" Ling Han nodded.","The young man bared his teeth in a grin, \"I am Mo Taiping!\"","Mo Taiping!","The person with the highest cultivation level in this tournament.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t take it to heart. To him, this kind of martial arts competition was only for show, and wasn’t challenging at all.","\"The flag is in my hands now, and you’re here to snatch it?\" Ling Han pulled up the flag that had been planted into the ground, and waved it in a circle in his hands. Then, he gripped it with both hands. It could be used as both a spear and a staff.","Mo Taiping stared at Ling Han and said, \"If you haven’t earned enough points yet, I advise you to hand over the flag. Otherwise, if you’re defeated by me, you won’t be able to enter the top five.\"","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Yi, why did you snatch my lines?\"","Mo Taiping showed a hint of pride, \"In this place, no one can defeat me!\"","What confidence.","However, he was a Seven Cauldrons. How many people in the world could cultivate to this kind of height?","\"I have a nickname, Miracle Creator,\" Ling Han said. \"If you don’t believe it, don’t blame me if you cry after being beaten.\"","\"Hahaha!\" Mo Taiping laughed loudly, and then became baleful, \"Then your path of advancement will end here.\"","Xiu, his figure moved, and charged towards Ling Han.","So fast, as expected of Seven Cauldrons.","Ling Han was unconcerned. No matter how heaven-defying this guy’s abilities were, he could still increase his cultivation accordingly. In any case, he was a \"Spirit Devouring Physique\", and whatever cultivation level he was, wasn’t it up to him to decide?","He used the flag like a staff, and smashed it directly towards Mo Taiping.","The staff was a long weapon, and the longer the weapon, the stronger it was. Condensing the power of Six Cauldrons, it was definitely more terrifying than the crushing power of a mountain.","The might of this weapon had already been unleashed, and even Mo Taiping did not dare to take it head-on. He hurriedly leaped out to dodge.","After dodging this strike, he was about to counterattack, but Ling Han’s staff swept over again. Borrowing the momentum of the previous strike, not only was the force stronger, the attack speed was even faster.","Mo Taiping’s counterattack came to an abrupt stop, and he had no choice but to dodge again.","However, just as he was about to attack again, the staff smashed over again.","F***!","Mo Taiping cursed in his heart, but could only dodge again.","After over a dozen consecutive exchanges, he was completely suppressed. Ling Han’s staff strikes were seamless, and every strike could borrow the power of the previous strike to increase the might of his attack, completely unleashing the weight and ferocity of the long weapon.","If he could suppress Ling Han in terms of power, he could completely take it head-on, but the problem was that he was only \"higher\" than Ling Han by a minor level.","This made him feel depressed and driven mad.","Even against an opponent one or two minor levels higher than himself, he hadn’t felt so aggrieved. He could look for an opportunity to win while being suppressed. In fact, he could directly suppress his opponent.","Hiss, could it be that this opponent was even more awesome than him in terms of natural talent in cultivation?","This thought flashed through Mo Taiping’s mind, and he hurriedly shook his head."]},{"number":4671,"title":"Chapter 4671: No regrets?","paragraphs":["The brilliance of the flag was so dazzling, how could they not see it?","When Ling Han and Mo Taiping were battling, people gradually arrived. However, when they discovered that one of the two sides in the battle was a Six Cauldrons, and the other was a Seven Cauldrons, none of them dared to step forward to participate.","The gap in battle prowess was too wide. If they stepped forwards, they would only be delivering themselves up to be defeated.","However, this was good too. They would have these two strongest people to fight to the point that both of them were injured, and then they would be able to eliminate both of them.","\"Who do you think will win?\" someone asked.","\"It should be Mo Taiping.\"","\"Yi, isn’t he unable to even fight back now? You still think highly of him?\"","\"He’s Seven Cauldrons, after all. The cultivation level is clear for all to see! Moreover, which one of those who can charge up to the Seven Cauldrons isn’t a prodigy among prodigies?\"","\"But his opponent is not weak either. Furthermore, just look at his attacks. They are like the Yangtze River and the Great Sea, endless and unending. This is too terrifying!\"","\"That’s right. I am still more optimistic about Zhang Hanjun. Now that he has gained the upper hand, he should be able to maintain this advantage forever.\"","\"Hehe, it doesn’t matter who wins, as long as both sides suffer.\"","Because they had the thought of eliminating two of their strongest opponents at the same time, these people actually did not make a move on each other. Instead, they were waiting very tacitly.","Mo Taiping felt like he couldn’t hold on any longer.","As he thought about it, if Ling Han focused on attacking, his mystical power would definitely expend far more than his. As long as he could hold on until Ling Han’s power was exhausted, then Ling Han would exhaust it in a single go.","At that time, it would be his turn to counterattack.","But the problem was, Ling Han’s mystical power was endless. On the other hand, as they fought, he was actually starting to feel a little strained.","If this continued, then it would really be like what Ling Han had said, his path of advancement would be cut off here.","But to flee just like that?","He felt humiliated. Previously, he was the one who had told Ling Han to run, and now the one who was running was himself. This was too embarrassing. In future, when he saw Ling Han, wouldn’t he have to cover his face and run?","After exchanging a few more blows, he finally decided to retreat.","Losing face was still better than ruining his future. Moreover, more and more people were coming from the surroundings. It was obvious that they were watching the tigers fight from the sidelines. He didn’t want to fight Ling Han to the point that both sides would suffer, and these people would take advantage of the opening.","Thus, after dodging once, he turned around and shot out quickly.","Everyone was stunned. Then, half of them immediately chased after him, wanting to defeat this competitor, and even more people were eyeing Ling Han covetously.","This person had obtained the flag, so they only had to take advantage of the chaos to snatch the flag. Then, one would have to run around in the mountains, and keep running. After holding on for a while, the three days time limit for the tournament would be over.","Ling Han planted the flag on the ground, swept an eye over everyone, and said with a smile, \"Come!\"","As his words fell, boom, everyone rushed out, charging towards Ling Han.","Peng! Peng! Peng! Peng!","Shadows flew everywhere. There was not a single person that could withstand a single blow from Ling Han. Those who were close to him were all sent flying with a single punch, and then lay on the ground, completely losing their battle prowess.","When everyone’s attacks reached him, Ling Han could be seen moving around in a very small range, dodging these attacks one after another.","This!","The corners of everyone’s mouths twitched. Such powerful battle prowess made them lose all hope, all right?","Some smart people hurriedly drew out the distance, and began to attack from afar. However, this kind of attack lacked variety, so the threat it posed to Ling Han would be even smaller.","This gave the others a hint, and they all leaped back. No one dared to face Ling Han’s power head-on.","’Heh, you people are far too naive.’","Ling Han raised the flag, turning it into a staff that swept out towards the masses.","This time, he was even more terrifying.","Peng, peng, peng! Human figures flew through the air, as if the sky was filled with flying straws.","F***, this was practically a primitive beast in human form.","The remaining people didn’t dare to have any delusions. They hurriedly turned around and fled.","No, no, this guy was really too fierce. The possibility of snatching the flag from his hands was practically zero. They might as well go and defeat other competitors. Now that there were so many less competitors, who knows, they may have a chance of advancing into the top five.","However, Ling Han didn’t give chase. Just then, he had defeated at least 40 people, so his points had most likely soared to the first place. Being in the top three definitely wouldn’t be a problem. Moreover, he had a flag in his hand, and he had already locked onto a spot to qualify for the next round. Thus, he couldn’t be bothered to waste any more time.","After all, he had the battle prowess of a Saint, so what was the point of competing with a bunch of kids?","He just sat there like that, his flag planted beside him, looking very arrogant.","Gradually, more and more people came over. Some turned around and left, while others went up to challenge him. Some even formed teams to challenge him, but they were all easily defeated by Ling Han.","When the sun set, the three-day advancement competition also ended.","It wasn’t long before the scores were also tallied. Ling Han was ranked first, and added with the fact that he had also won the battle flag, it could be said that this first place was very valuable.","Mo Taiping was in second place. After all, he had the \"highest\" cultivation level.","This time, the top five would receive rewards, but the rewards were all the same, and that was entering the Little Pond of Life to cultivate for five days.","—Wouldn’t this allow Ling Han to reasonably level up again?","Because they were entering the Buddhist Tower, this was an extremely sacred matter. Thus, Ling Han and the others all bathed and fasted for three days before heading to the Buddhist Tower together.","The monk led them to the lowest level of the Buddhist Tower. Similar to the White River City, the Pond of Life was located there.","The monk leading the way left, and Ling Han and his group entered into the Pond of Life, beginning to cultivate.","However, Ling Han didn’t enter. Instead, he stood outside.","\"Yi, why doesn’t Brother Zhang enter?\" someone asked. The five of them had emerged victorious, and in future, they would at least be able to stay in the Martial Hall of Heavenly Prosperity City to cultivate. It could be said that they had already stepped onto the path of rising to the top. In future, it was possible that the five of them would also become Sect Brothers, so they naturally wanted to get closer to the others.","\"That’s right. Brother Zhang, are you still going to be reserved with us?\" the second person asked with a smile.","\"Haha, Brother Zhang must feel that his cultivation level is far above ours, so he wants to give us a handicap,\" the third person said.","Ling Han also cracked a smile, \"You guys don’t know that I am a Spirit Devouring Physique?\"","\"Brother Zhang, we know that you’re a Spirit Devouring Physique. However, don’t tell us that the moment you enter, all the energy essence will be sucked dry by you,\" the second person said. He thought that his words were very humorous, and even laughed loudly after he finished speaking.","\"How could that be? Although Brother Zhang is a Spirit Devouring Physique, the energy essence here is astonishing! Brother Zhang, it’s best that you hurry up and come down,\" the first person said.","\"That’s right. Hurry up and come down.\" The third person nodded as well.","Ling Han swept an eye over the three of them, then looked at Mo Taiping, \"Are you guys sure?\"","\"Of course.\" The three of them were very cordial, and even Mo Taiping nodded. In any case, there was no cost to be paid, so why not do him a favor?","\"You really won’t regret it?\" Ling Han asked again.","\"Brother Zhang, stop showing off.\" The four of them felt that Ling Han had gone too far. Who didn’t know that you were a Spirit Devouring Physique? Was there any need to repeatedly emphasize and show off your Spirit Devouring Physique?","\"All right.\" Ling Han nodded, and stepped into the pool."]},{"number":4672,"title":"Chapter 4672: Cry to death","paragraphs":["The moment Ling Han’s foot stepped into the pool waters, the entire Pond of Life immediately boiled over.","W-what was going on?","Mo Taiping and the others were all stunned, and a sense of foreboding rose up in their hearts.","It wouldn’t really be like what Ling Han had said, right?","This thought had just arisen when they discovered that the energy in the entire pool, like a thirsty horse was drinking from a spring, was surging madly towards Ling Han.","And under this kind of mad absorption, Mo Taiping and the others couldn’t get a single bit of energy at all. Even if there was an occasional bit that was about to enter their bodies, it would immediately be forcefully absorbed by the powerful suction force.","’Holy f*ck!’","\"Brother Zhang!\"","\"Halt!\"","The four of them hurriedly called out, all of them looking like their tails were on fire.","As long as Ling Han was here, they could not possibly absorb any kind of energy essence, so how could they not be anxious?","The energy of the Pond of Life was their reward, yet it had all been absorbed by Ling Han now. They wouldn’t be able to reap any benefits at all. Who could withstand this?","\"What is it?\" At this moment, Ling Han asked the four people as he continued to walk, as if he had become stupid.","\"Brother Zhang, you’re absorbing too much energy!\" The four of them were about to cry.","\"Yi, wasn’t it you guys that said it was all right?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","\"We were wrong!\" the four people hurriedly said.","Hong long long, but right at this moment, a loud boom was heard. The tower trembled violently, and visibly, the water level of the pool was rapidly declining.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The monks appeared one after another.","\"What’s going on?\"","\"Why would there be such a huge commotion?\"","\"Heavens, why is the Pond of Life expending so much energy?\"","The monks were all shocked, and hurriedly pulled out Ling Han and the others.","Boom!","Right at this moment, Ling Han’s aura surged, and he began his performance.","Core Formation Tier!","Pu!","Mo Taiping and the others were all throwing up blood. F***, they hadn’t gotten any benefits yet, yet Ling Han had broken through to the next major tier. How could they endure this?","\"Spirit Devouring Physique!\" Realization dawned on the monks as well. They suddenly realized that they had actually allowed a Spirit Devouring Physique in this time.","Who would’ve thought that the Spirit Devouring Physique was so terrifying?","In reality, Ling Han didn’t know how powerful the Spirit Devouring Physique was. In any case, he felt that he should absorb more energy. Otherwise, it would be a bit unreasonable for him to directly advance to the next major tier, wouldn’t it?","Immediately, Ling Han was chased out of the Buddhist Tower, and Mo Taiping and the others were also implicated. They were chased out together with Ling Han.","\"Brother Zhang!\" The four of them wanted to cry but had no tears.","But would they be able to fight Ling Han to the death?","Cauldron Forging Tier against Core Formation Tier? Wasn’t that courting death?","Moreover, Ling Han could still easily advance to the True Self Tier. Right until the peak stage of the True Self Tier, his rapid breakthrough wouldn’t stop.","In other words, they would be left behind by Ling Han for a very long time.","Thus, how could they go all out against him?","Ling Han simply chuckled. He had already confirmed this several times before, yet they were so determined to force him to come into the waters. What could he do?","After returning to the Martial Hall, Mo Taiping and the others went to sleep with their heads down. They were completely out of spirits now, and nothing they did was fun.","Two days later, they teamed up with the five veteran disciples of the Heavenly Prosperity City’s Martial Hall, heading towards the Imperial Sea Royal Capital.","The Buddhist Land had ten great Royal Capitals, and this Imperial Sea Royal Capital was one of them.","Among the ten team members, the five people selected from the Heavenly Prosperity Martial hall were all in the Core Formation Tier. Their expressions were all very arrogant, but faced with Ling Han, they were slightly awkward.","—Because they were all in the Core Formation Tier, even if there were differences in minor level, they were still on equal footing.","The problem was that Ling Han had just fought his way up from a B-level city this year, and as for them? They had all stayed in an A-level city for a very, very long time.","When they found out that Ling Han was only a Meridian Opening Tie a month ago, they were all stunned, and had even less confidence in front of Ling Han.","Because it was possible that in a few more days, Ling Han would surpass them in terms of cultivation level.","They both looked down on Ling Han, and thought that Ling Han was completely depending on his physique. However, at the same time, they were also filled with fear, because Ling Han could surpass them in cultivation level at any time.","There was a strict hierarchy in the cultivation world. When a Core Formation Tier cultivator encountered a True Self Tier cultivator, they had to treat them with utmost respect.","Thus, these people naturally distanced themselves from Ling Han.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t pay any heed to this. He simply focused on traveling.","A whole twenty-four days later, Ling Han and his group arrived at the Royal Capital.","The Imperial Sea Royal Capital was a few times larger. After all, the Imperial Sea Royal Capital ruled over tens of thousands of ordinary cities. If its bearing wasn’t strong enough, how could it be worthy of the status as a Royal Capital?","The ruler here was the Imperial Sea King. He was the descendant of the general that had followed Ah Han to conquer the world, and was also one of the core members of the Buddhist Race.","It was said that the Imperial Sea King was a high-level Venerate.","After entering into the Royal Capital, everyone exclaimed in shock.","There were quite a number of people here who had come to the Royal Capital for the first time, and were naturally intimidated by the majestic and grand sight of the Royal Capital, and those five veteran disciples were very disdainful: what a bunch of country bumpkins.","When they arrived at the Martial Hall, they showed their proof of identity and were then settled down.","Ling Han wore a smile. After passing through an ordinary city, a B-level city, an A-level city, and then to the Royal Capital, his identity was continuously cleared. By now, would anyone still investigate where he had come from?","Otherwise, if he disguised himself as a prodigy and immediately displayed the cultivation level of Spirit Transformation Tier or Minor Advanced Tier, he would definitely be thoroughly investigated, right?","Right now, his false identity was far too stable. It was impossible for his public persona to collapse.","En, it definitely wouldn’t collapse.","Ling Han emphasized internally.","There were many elites in the Royal Capital, and the people walking on the streets were all either rich or noble, so everyone kept a very low profile. If they trifled with anyone here, it may bring about a calamity.","It was best to keep a low profile first. If they could advance further, and be taken into the Sacred Land, they would really soar into the skies.","Moreover, there was no shortage of True Self Tier disciples in the Martial Hall here. Merely cultivators of this level were not people that they could afford to trifle with.","Below the Imperial Sea Royal Capital, there were a total of 82 A-level vassal cities. In other words, there were a total of 82 teams that would come to the Royal Capital to participate in the advancement battle for the second round.","In the past few days, more and more teams had arrived. They were young people, after all, so they definitely couldn’t sit still. Thus, some people started to gather information about which city had a powerful elite in their teams.","Because they had all fought their way up level by level, the composition of the teams was more or less the same. There were five Cauldron Forging Tiers that had risen above the others in the advancement battles, and added with the Core Formation Tier ss that had been chosen from the Martial Hall of the A-level city.","\"Among the new disciples, a prodigy named Jia Tailong has appeared!\"","\"It’s said that this person is born with wisdom, and has already gained the favor of the Sacred Land. After this competition, he will definitely be absorbed into the sect.\"","\"He’s not even fifty years old, yet he’s already at the Core Formation Tier, which is extremely shocking.\"","This caused a commotion. Though this kind of aptitude was not comparable to Buddha Son, being able to gain the favour of the Sacred Land was the best proof.","\"There’s also a person called Zhang Hanjun, and he’s a Spirit Devouring Physique of the ancient times. He can advance his cultivation as if he’s drinking water.\"","\"Pei, this kind of improvement would only reach the True Self Tier. In future, wouldn’t he still be beaten back to his original state?\"","\"True.\"","Thus, Ling Han was ostentatiously ignored by everyone."]},{"number":4673,"title":"Chapter 4673: Imperial Sea Prince?","paragraphs":["It couldn’t be helped. Rapid advancement of cultivation level would always be looked down on, and one of the reasons was naturally jealousy.","Oh, I have worked so hard to cultivate to this cultivation level, and you have easily caught up to me?","How could they not be envious, jealous, and hateful?","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t care. He only hoped that the competition would begin soon. After winning this time, he would be able to enter into the final battle between the Sacred Land and begin the final battle with the other contestants from the other nine Royal Capitals.","If he took another step further, he would be very, very close to the Pond of Life.","He didn’t step out of the Martial Hall, simply staying inside and counting down the days.","A few days later, he suddenly discovered a commotion in the courtyard.","—Every team that had come from an A-grade city had been arranged to stay in an independent courtyard. Logically speaking, it should be very quiet.","Ling Han exited, only to see a handsome young man in embroidered robes standing in the courtyard. He had a dignified air about him, and it was as if he had enjoyed a high position for a long time.","Yi?","His eyes narrowed slightly, then revealed a smile.","\"You’ve seen me, hurry up and pay your respects!\" This young man in embroidered robes was currently shouting at the masses, and after hearing the commotion, more and more people came out. When they saw this young man, they were all slightly stunned.","Who was this? How could he be so arrogant?","If this were their own territory, they would definitely have rushed out and slapped the other party long ago, but now, they did not dare to make any rash moves.","\"Who are you?\" someone asked.","\"You guys don’t even know who I am?\" the young man in embroidered robes asked in a very arrogant manner.","Er, they really didn’t know.","These people had just arrived, and there were even some that had come to participate in the competition three years ago. However, they had come and gone in a hurry, so how could they possibly have any knowledge?","Everyone shook their heads. They were also curious. Who exactly was this person?","\"I am Huangfu Cong, the fifteenth son of the Imperial Sea King!\" This young man in fine clothes declared proudly.","Imperial Sea King!","When everyone heard this, their hearts trembled.","This was the ruler of the Imperial Sea Royal Capital, and furthermore, belonged to the higher ranks of the Buddhist Race. Just how high and mighty was he?","His son... would naturally be able to do as he liked in the Royal Capital.","\"Yi, there is finally someone who is slightly more beautiful.\" Huangfu Cong stared at a woman that had just arrived. This was one of the five \"older\" disciples that had been selected by the Heavenly Prosperity Martial Hall, and was also the only woman in the team.","She was indeed quite good-looking, because there were less women among the cultivators, and beauties were even rarer. Thus, she was also very popular in the team, and was always surrounded by others.","It was also because of this that many people looked furious upon seeing her being teased by Huangfu Cong.","However, no one dared to say anything, let alone step forward to stop him.","—As the son of the Imperial Sea King, who would dare stop him?","Huangfu Cong walked towards the woman, and stretched out a hand to touch her face.","The woman instinctively took a step back, dodging this groping hand.","If this Huangfu Cong had fallen in love with her at first sight, then she would definitely not mind marrying into a noble clan. However, this person was obviously a playboy at first glance, so she was naturally unwilling to be reduced to a plaything.","When he saw the woman move aside, Huangfu Cong immediately looked displeased, \"This young master thinks highly of you, so don’t be so ungrateful!\"","These words caused the woman to feel humiliated and furious. Being toyed with, did she still have to feel honored?","She looked at her teammates around her, but these people either lowered their eyes and pretended not to see it, or only dared to be angry but did not dare to say anything.","She couldn’t help but feel hopeless.","\"Your skin is so soft, let me touch it.\" Huangfu Cong stretched out his hand again, to touch the beautiful face of the woman.","This time, the woman accepted her fate and didn’t dodge.","Pa!","Huangfu Cong’s hand had not even landed on the woman’s face, when it was firmly grabbed by a large hand.","Yi?","It was Ling Han!","Everyone could clearly see that Ling Han had arrived at the woman’s side at some point in time and grabbed onto Huangfu Cong’s wrist.","This guy... how dare he!","You dare to interfere in the business of the Imperial Sea King’s son?","Huangfu Cong looked furious, \"You despicable person, you actually dare touch me?\"","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"What kind of person you are, you yourself should know very well.\"","Huangfu Cong’s expression involuntarily changed drastically, and he looked suspicious.","Yi, could it be that this person could see through to his real self?","\"This is my last warning, let go immediately!\" he said harshly.","\"Zhang Hanjun, hurry up and let go!\" His teammates hurriedly rebuked. What if they angered Huangfu Cong, or even in fact injured this royal prince? Would it be the elites of the Royal Capital that would move out next, capturing all of them?","At that time, to say nothing of not being able to participate in the second round of advancement battles, they might even lose their lives.","\"Don’t drag others down with you!\"","\"Don’t hurt Young Master Huangfu!\"","They said one after another, and even that woman looked at Ling Han like he was being too nosy.","Did he think that he was the savior of the world? If he stubbornly stepped out, not only would he not be able to save her, he would even push her into an even deeper dilemma!","\"Did you hear that?\" Huangfu Cong said proudly.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"Before you guys cower, why didn’t you confirm his identity first?\"","’What do you mean?’","\"He said he’s the son of the Imperial Sea King, and you guys believe him?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","Yi?","With this reminder, the others all looked doubtful.","That’s right. Huangfu Cong’s identity was only his own declaration, so who would know if it was true or false?","Huangfu Cong’s expression also changed drastically, and he hurriedly said, \"I am naturally the son of the Imperial Sea King. You lowly commoners actually dare to doubt my identity?\"","Ling Han slightly exerted force with his fingers, and Huangfu Cong immediately screamed in pain, tears streaming down his face.","\"Come, tell me your identity obediently,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","\"You lowly commoners are dead if you dare to harm a single hair on my head!\" Huangfu Cong shouted. His mouth was quite stubborn.","No one dared to confirm it, because Huangfu Cong seemed to be very confident.","\"Zhang Hanjun, let go of him first. We’ll see after we’ve investigated thoroughly.\"","\"That’s right, let go first.\"","They all advised. If Huangfu Cong was really injured, and this person was really the son of the Imperial Sea King, then the matter would become serious.","Ling Han ignored them. How could he possibly care about the words of these people?","\"This Young Master, why don’t you let go first?\" At this moment, a woman’s voice rang out, gentle and melodious.","Everyone looked over, only to see a woman in white standing at the entrance. She was clearly dressed in an extremely plain white dress, and she wasn’t wearing any makeup at all. However, she radiated with an aura of elegance and beauty.","What a beautiful woman in an empty <anno data-annotation-id=\"d548c7a5-f852-451f-8e8a-6270451ce34b\" data-title=\"valley\">valley 1 </anno>. She was too beautiful.","In comparison, that first woman was practically a village girl, without any bearing at all.","\"Why?\" Ling Han asked.","This caused everyone to glare angrily at him. How could he refuse such a beautiful woman?","The woman in white smiled faintly, yet it was as if 100 flowers had bloomed at the same time. Her beauty was indescribable, and everyone was captivated by her beauty, unable to extricate themselves.","\"It’s indeed Xiaoyun’s fault this time. I’ll apologize on his behalf.\" She curtsied slightly and bowed to everyone.","This caused everyone to be at a loss for what to do. They only felt as if they had made a colossal mistake, and had greatly offended the beauty.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">’Beautiful woman in an empty valley’ is a literal translation of 空谷佳人, which is a phrase used to praise the orchid flower. Throughout history, Chinese people have viewed the orchid as a symbol of elegance and nobility.</annotations>"]},{"number":4674,"title":"Chapter 4674: The woman in white","paragraphs":["Ling Han thought for a moment, then released his grip.","Huangfu Cong immediately dashed toward the woman in white as if he were fleeing. He then dove into her embrace.","\"Wuwuwu, he bullied Xiaoyun!\"","F***!","Seeing this scene, everyone couldn’t help but feel a strong urge to kill this guy.","’You f*cking dare to bury your head into the woman in white’s chest? And you’re even rubbing your face back and forth?’","He was really too shameless!","The woman in white stroked Huangfu Cong’s head, and said, \"Return to your original appearance and apologize to everyone!\"","\"Sister!\" Huangfu Cong was still very dissatisfied, and kept shaking his head, rubbing even more happily in the woman in white’s arms.","Everyone stared at him, wanting to kill even more.","\"Be good!\" the woman in white said softly.","Only then did Huangfu Cong raise his head. Then, everyone felt their vision blur. The body of this arrogant young man was actually shrinking rapidly. Even his clothes were shrinking, and he had become a little boy who was only four or five years old.","This!","Everyone gritted their teeth. They were actually being toyed around with by a little brat?","Heavens, if this spread out, wouldn’t they become eternal jokes?","\"This is my younger brother, Guo Yun,\" the woman in white said. \"He was young and ignorant, so please bear with him.\"","When they discovered that \"Huangfu Cong\" was only a little boy, the killing intent in everyone’s hearts naturally vanished without a trace. Even if this brat had previously played around with them, but for the sake of the woman in white, who would really be angry?","\"It’s fine, it’s fine.\"","\"He’s a child, after all, so it’s normal for him to be a little mischievous.\"","\"Oh, that’s right. How should I address you, Miss? Which city are you from?\"","Everyone began to ask questions, their eyes burning.","The woman in white was very reserved, and said calmly, \"My name is Guo Shuang, and I am not a contestant. I have come out to plau, and just happened to pass by here.\"","Oh, so that was the case.","Everyone nodded. Since this woman wasn’t from the Martial Hall, it should be easier to court her, right?","They all stepped forward, saying all kinds of flattering words, trying their best to attract the attention of this beauty.","However, though Guo Shuang did not refuse coldly, her pretty face was calm, making it difficult for anyone to get close to her.","Meanwhile, Guo Yun would occasionally stare at Ling Han. As he touched the wrist that Ling Han had gripped previously, he was still gritting his teeth.","This b@stard! He had hurt him so much!","Ling Han acted as if he hadn’t seen anything, and directly returned to his room.","Guo Shuang was indeed beautiful, and was definitely no less beautiful than Chi Menghan, Song Lan and the others. However, what did this have to do with him?","He had come to break through to Saint Tier, not to pick up girls.","Furthermore, he felt that this woman actually had an unfathomable feeling, which made him feel slightly wary.","However, he wasn’t afraid that he couldn’t defeat her. Instead, he was afraid that his identity would be exposed.","This woman seemed to be enshrouded in a layer of fog. She was definitely not as simple as she seemed.","Thus, it was best not to trifle with her.","Guo Shuang watched as he walked into the room. She withdrew her gaze, and apologized to everyone again. Then, she left with Guo Yun.","Pu, when they had walked to an uninhabited place, Guo Yun actually changed once more, turning into a crimson-coloured squirrel. He leaped onto Guo Shuang’s shoulder, and asked, \"Milady, why do we have to put on such an act?\"","What was surprising was the fact that \"his\" voice had also become a female voice.","Meanwhile, Guo Shuang smiled faintly, \"Only in this way can I see through people’s hearts.\"","\"Milady, are you looking for those who dare to step out?\" the crimson-colored squirrel asked.","Guo Shuang nodded, \"This is only the first stage of the selection. If you don’t even have this little bit of courage, how can you achieve great things?\"","\"Milady, then what should I pretend to be next? Is it still an evil young master?\" the crimson squirrel asked excitedly.","...","After this small interlude, nothing else happened. Everyone waited for another seven days, and it was time for the Royal Capital’s tournament to commence.","The 82 teams from the A-level cities all arrived, and the second round of advancement battles began.","The rules were still the same. Everyone would be placed in a forest, and survival of the fittest. The five people who obtained the highest score would be able to rise above the rest, and together with the contestants from the Royal Capital, enter into the Sacred Land and begin the final competition with the teams from the other nine great Royal Capitals.","Team after team entered into the forest in batches, and in a short while, the 82 teams were all released.","In this competition, the standards would be much more relaxed, allowing the contestants to go all out in battle. The king would send out elites to keep watch. Firstly, it was to ensure that there would be no serious casualties, and secondly, it was also to play the role of referee.","Some teams chose to fight side by side. First, they would use the advantage of a team to increase everyone’s points as much as possible, and lastly, they would carry out internal strife, and some teams had moved separately from the very beginning, fighting individually.","Ling Han paid no heed to the others. He set out alone, walking casually.","This kind of lone person would very easily be targeted by a team.","Sure enough, it wasn’t long before a team of 10 caught up to him.","Ling Han stopped in his tracks, and revealed a faint smile. The fish had taken the bait.","He didn’t know which city this team was from, but he truly didn’t care about the composition of five Cauldron Forging Tiers and five Core Formation Tiers—even if he only used the power of the Core Formation Tier.","\"Brat, you’re moving alone, and you actually dare to act so boldly! Hehe, I really don’t know if you’re an idiot, or if you’re too confident,\" one of the people on the opposing side said with a smile, obviously thinking that Ling Han was in their grasp.","Ling Han crooked a finger at them, \"Why don’t you guys step forwards and give it a try? Won’t you find out?\"","\"All right, I’ll oblige you!\" The ten people charged over, one after another. Even the five Cauldron Forging Tiers were no exception.","Ling Han smiled, and exerted force with his feet, charging back at the ten people.","Boom, he was like a primitive beast. He didn’t care about any technique at all, and just charged forward with his body.","What was terrifying was that his power was too strong. With a crash, one of them was sent flying, and several of his bones were directly broken. He had practically lost his battle prowess.","\"F***!\" This shocked the others greatly. This guy was too fierce, wasn’t he?","However, once Ling Han launched an attack, he would never be able to stop.","He charged madly, and practically every time he charged, one person would be sent flying. After a dozen over times, only one of the ten people could still stand.","However, it wasn’t because this person was more powerful, but rather because he was the fastest. It was because of this that he managed to dodge Ling Han’s few attacks.","\"Come,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","That person trembled, and suddenly let out an exclamation. Then, he turned around and fled.","He was scared out of his wits. It had only been a short while, and his teammates had all been defeated. Furthermore, they had all been knocked down, which scared him out of his wits.","Ling Han didn’t give chase. He was not short of that one point.","He continued to walk in the mountains. There would always be teams or contestants that were filled with confidence that thought he was an easy target to bully, and would make a move on him. In the end, they would all be horribly defeated.","In the blink of an eye, two days had passed, and there was still one day until the end of the tournament.","At this time, the Martial Hall temporarily announced that there would be a fierce beast of the Core Formation Tier in each of the ten areas marked outside the mountain. If one could kill it, they would be rewarded with fifty points."]},{"number":4675,"title":"Chapter 4675: Act of Violence","paragraphs":["This was a good opportunity to catch up in points, or pull apart from the other contestants in points.","A great many people immediately moved, heading towards those ten areas.","And in the skies, Guo Shuang was presently standing proudly. Her divine sense spread out, enshrouding the entire forest.","The crimson squirrel asked, \"Milady, why did you suddenly change the rules of the tournament?\"","Guo Shuang said calmly, \"A real battle changes in an instant. I want to see how these people can adapt on the spot.\"","\"Oh.\" The crimson squirrel nodded, then asked curiously, \"Which contestant does Miladyhave high hopes for?\"","Guo Shuang smiled, and cast her gaze downwards, looking at an area below them.","The crimson squirrel followed her gaze, and involuntarily couldn’t help but bare his teeth.","He was angered!","It was the guy that had hurt it!","...","Ling Han sensed that someone was spying on him from the sky. One was very strong, and in fact, even he was slightly apprehensive of that person, while the other was very weak. He was only in the Core Formation Tier.","He didn’t raise his head to look. Theoretically speaking, they had hidden themselves very well. Even the weakest person had been enveloped by a layer of energy. Thus, even a Sect Master wouldn’t have been able to discover their presence.","Thus, he was now in the Core Formation Tier, so he couldn’t discover these two existences.","Who was monitoring him?","Where had he revealed a weakness?","Impossible. On the way here, his identity should have already been cleared. Furthermore, everyone knew that he was a Spirit Devouring Physique. They had watched him \"grow\" step by step, and that would be very clear with a single investigation.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. He didn’t care about ruining his image. What was important was time.","No matter what, he had to wait until he became a Saint.","Forget it. He would just pretend that he had not discovered anything, and do whatever he had to do.","Ling Han strode forwards, heading in a certain direction.","Not long after, a giant beast that was as tall as 30 meters appeared ahead of him. It had the shape of a tiger, but had wings, and was filled with might.","However, this giant beast seemed to have been restricted in some way, and could only circle around in a fixed area. Even if it flapped its wings and flew, it could only reach a fixed height, as if there was an invisible cage that was trapping it.","Ling Han smiled, and walked towards this great beast.","\"Ang!\" The giant beast immediately roared at Ling Han. Its voice rumbled, forming a powerful hurricane.","Ling Han’s hair billowed in the wind. However, he simply smiled and said, \"Little cat, let’s cooperate.\"","Vicious beasts didn’t have intelligence—even if they did, they wouldn’t be much smarter than a three-year-old child. How could it possibly pay attention to Ling Han? It directly pounced over.","Ling Han moved to parry.","The power he could unleash was far inferior to this giant beast, but he had used every bit of power to the extreme, and added with his exquisite battle techniques, his actual battle prowess was actually superior to the giant beast.","Thus, it was clear that the giant beast was theoretically stronger, yet it was only qualified to be toyed around with by Ling Han.","Finally, Ling Han leaped onto the giant beast’s head, making the giant beast not dare to move at all.","No matter how weak its intelligence was, it knew that its vital points were already restrained by Ling Han, so how could it dare to move recklessly again?","\"Now that’s a good boy, kitten,\" Ling Han said with a smile. He told the giant beast to calm down and wait quietly.","Not long after, someone ran over.","This was a lone contestant who was fighting alone. When he saw the giant beast, he revealed a hint of wariness.","The wild beast’s power was too violent, and its physique was also tough. Without the restriction of cultivation level, as long as it grew normally, whatever cultivation level it was supposed to be at would be its cultivation level.","However, cultivators were different. Breaking through the limits was too difficult.","It was clear from a single glance that this fierce beast’s bloodline was powerful, and its abilities should be superior to his, so he did not dare make any rash moves.","He had best wait. He would first join forces with others, and severely injure this fierce beast, then think of a way to snatch its head.","However, right at this moment, a loud bang was heard. That massive beast was actually charging towards him.","His speed was extremely fast!","That person was shocked. He had clearly not exposed himself, so how had this fierce beast discovered him?","He wanted to flee, but he had started too late, and added with the fact that the ferocious beast was too fast, he had not even unleashed his full speed, when he saw that the ferocious beast had already caught up to him. With a pounce, a terrifying power surged out.","The man was exasperated, and could only turn around to parry.","Peng!","There was absolutely no way he could match the strength of the wild beast, and he was instantly sent flying. And it was at this moment that he suddenly saw a person fly out from the head of the wild beast, his fist directly smashing into his face.","In such a situation, how could he possibly dodge? In fact, he didn’t even have the ability to parry, and could only watch helplessly as this punch landed.","Peng! He instantly fainted.","Before he fell unconscious, he was still filled with confusion.","What was going on?","Why was there a person on the head of the beast?","Wasn’t this just screwing him over?","Ling Han smiled sheepishly. He had obtained another kill, easily and happily.","\"Ang!\" The colossal beast also roared loudly. Being bullied by Ling Han, it was about to doubt its life as a beast. Now, it was finally showing its might, making it feel that this world had become beautiful again.","\"Come, let’s continue waiting,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Boom!","The sound of a great battle was heard from afar. That was a battle with other fierce beasts. Furthermore, this kind of sound rose and fell, spreading out from various places.","Meanwhile, Ling Han was waiting for a chance to strike. He would defeat anyone that came.","Merely a fierce beast was already terrifying enough, and they had to form a team to be able to defeat it. Now, there was also Ling Han commanding it, which compensated for the fact that the brain of the fierce beast was only the size of a walnut.","How could this not be powerful?","Not long after, more than a hundred people had fallen here, far exceeding the \"value\" of a fierce beast.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and patted the beast’s head, \"You have finally realized the value of your life as a beast. Congratulations.\"","After a while, a team arrived.","All of them had blood on them, but they were all exuding an air of ferocity.","—They had just killed a fierce beast, so their morale was still high.","\"Die!\"","The ten of them charged over, besieging and attempting to kill the wild beast.","One person commanded, and the ten of them coordinated very well. Practically every single person’s battle prowess was displayed to the fullest.","If it wasn’t for Ling Han, the fate of this fierce beast would definitely be death, but it was a different story now.","Ling Han did not appear, but rather crouched in the thick and long fur of the wild beast. Ling Han commanded.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Wild beasts were incredibly tenacious, and it fought back and forth with the team of ten.","\"Yi, why is the intelligence of this fierce beast so high?\" This team was very stunned.","\"Isn’t it said that the brains of wild beasts are only the size of walnuts?\"","The wild beast was furious. Whose brain was only the size of a walnut?","Yours, your whole family’s!","It pounced madly, completely disregarding its own safety — wasn’t there someone even more ruthless on it?","The wild beast was strong in the first place, and with its display of might, the pressure on the team of ten instantly increased greatly.","\"Retreat! Retreat! Retreat!\" the person in charge hurriedly shouted.","Xiu, right at this moment, Ling Han charged out.","Who would have thought?","Peng, peng, peng! Ling Han’s fists rained down, and instantly, multiple figures streaked through the skies, as if they were straws.","Eight of the 10 people were instantly knocked out.","Only two of them managed to fortunately escape from the area of activity of the vicious beast. This was something that the vicious beast could not traverse, as there was an invisible power restraining them.","They looked at Ling Han with deep hatred."]},{"number":4676,"title":"Chapter 4676: Care","paragraphs":["Why had a wild beast that had a brain that was only the size of a walnut suddenly become smarter?","The reason was found.","There was actually someone commanding it?","But the problem was this was clearly a stage set by the Martial Hall, so why had a person suddenly appeared?","Moreover, they had killed a fierce beast previously, and had not seen anyone on it.","\"Hiss, he’s the Spirit Devouring Physique!\"","\"Zhang Hanjun of Heavenly Prosperity City!\"","The two of them stared at Ling Han for a while, and finally recognized him.","However, they could not accept this.","Why was Ling Han able to mingle with the wild beasts?","Could it be that this guy could communicate with wild beasts?","F***, that was really too unfair.","\"We definitely have to protest to the Martial Hall!\"","\"That’s right, this is not his strength at all!\"","After this team, other teams arrived, wanting to take down this fierce beast and earn fifty points. However, they were all defeated by Ling Han and the fierce beast.","Some teams were wiped out, while others had survivors. Ling Han didn’t take follow up on his victory and pursue them. This also made those survivors think that Ling Han had cheated.","Who didn’t know that wild beasts couldn’t be tamed? At least, it wasn’t something that could be done in such a short period of time.","Thus, there was definitely something fishy going on here.","Right at this moment, Ling Han also welcomed an \"elite\".","Jia Tailong.","This was the true prodigy of this tournament, and had long since gained the notice of the Sacred Land. They would immediately take him in after this tournament, and focus on nurturing him.","He was all alone, and he held a Demon Subduing Staff in his hand. This was the standard Tool of the Buddhist Race. It was forged as an imitation of the Imperial Weapon.","Tsk, he had not truly entered into the Buddhist Race yet, yet already possessed the standard Buddhist Race Spirit Tool. Merely from this aspect, it was clear how highly this person was valued by the Sacred Land.","\"Zhang Hanjun!\" He stood in front of the colossal beast, and faced with such a colossal creature, he was completely calm, as if this colossal beast was only a docile kitten in front of him.","\"I don’t know what method you have used to cooperate with this fierce beast, but this is contrary to the original intention of the tournament. I hope you can desist from this before it is too late.\"","Ling Han was astonished. No wonder he had been so heavily targeted by the Buddhist Race. He hadn’t even truly entered the Buddhist Race yet, yet he was already so proficient in the brainwashing techniques of the Buddhist Race.","He smiled faintly, and asked, \"What is it? Are you afraid now?\"","\"Humph, I just don’t want you to sink deeper and deeper,\" Jia Tailong said disdainfully.","\"All right, come fight me.\" Ling Han laughed loudly. With a pat, this great beast immediately pounced towards Jia Tailong.","It had long since become impatient from waiting.","\"An!\" Jia Tailong roared loudly, his voice reverberating and deafening.","Six Characters Bright King Curse?","He was astonished. He hadn’t imagined that Jia Tailong had actually learned the secret technique of the Buddhist Race.","This was the Imperial Technique, which had a great influence on the mind.","Even the wild beast was affected, and couldn’t help but pause in its movements, looking confused.","According to legends, the Ancestral Buddha delivered a sermon, and even Saint-level fierce beasts would be influenced, their viciousness erased, and willingly become the guardian beasts of the Buddhist Race.","From this, it could be seen just how terrifying the effects of the Six Characters Bright King Curse on the mind were.","Jia Tailong’s grasp of the Six Characters Bright King Curse was naturally far inferior to the Ancestral Buddha. Moreover, he had only mastered the \"An\" character, so he could only temporarily affect the wild beast.","However, taking advantage of this opportunity, Jia Tailong had already charged over with his Demon Subduing Staff. Golden light radiated in all directions, and it was as if he had transformed into the Guardian Deity of the Buddhist Sect. His eyes were wide with fury, and he was capable of destroying all the demons in the world.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and with a press of his hand, his whole person immediately flew from the beast’s body, greeting Jia Tailong’s attack.","He didn’t battle against the Spirit Tool head-on, but each move was smooth and natural, instantly grasping the rhythm of the battle.","It should be known that not only was he invincible among his peers, he could even win against an opponent at a higher cultivation level. Now that he had lowered his own cultivation level, his ability to battle above his own cultivation level would only be even more terrifying, because he had wider horizons.","Even if Ling Han was extremely reserved, he still easily gained the upper hand.","\"Yi!\" In the skies, the crimson squirrel released an exclamation of surprise, \"Jia Tailong is actually no match for this guy!\"","For an elite of this level, one or two exchanges would reveal who was stronger and who was weaker, and Ling Han had suppressed Jia Tailong without using a Spirit Tool. His strength was not just a little bit stronger.","Guo Shuang was also watching. There was a layer of light on her beautiful face, and she actually seemed incredibly sacred.","After a while, she said in a low voice, \"If we were at the same cultivation level, I don’t have the confidence to defeat him.\"","\"What?!\" The crimson squirrel was astonished. Others might not be aware, but it was aware of the astonishing background of this Lady.","Even she admitted that she could not defeat that brat in a battle of equal cultivation levels, hiss!","Though she had not said that she would lose, this was already shocking enough.","\"Milady, does this brat really have such a freakish talent?\" it asked.","Guo Shuang nodded, \"Looks like this Spirit Devouring Physique does not just have the two strengths of physique and courage.\"","The crimson squirrel was even more stunned, because it knew just how difficult it was for this person to praise others.","Beneath them, no matter what Jia Tailong did, Ling Han’s response was extremely simple, yet also incredibly effective.","He was suppressed all this while, completely unable to turn the tables.","After fighting for 300 rounds, he had no choice but to turn around and flee. However, with a pounce from that ferocious beast, he was instantly turned into a rolling gourd.","Ling Han caught up to him, and with a punch, peng, this rookie was knocked unconscious.","After this, no one dared to challenge Ling Han again.","Everyone knew that he could join forces with that fierce beast, so how could they match that?","Now, everyone was waiting for the tournament to end, and then protest to the Martial Hall.","Soon, three days had passed, and the tournament had ended.","However, the Martial Hall didn’t accept everyone’s protests at all. Instead, they forcefully declared that Ling Han hadn’t cheated and told them not to cause trouble for no reason.","When the results of the tournament came out, Ling Han was naturally ranked first, and second was Jia Tailong.","Though he had been defeated by Ling Han, the number of opponents he had defeated previously was also astonishing, which was still enough to place him in second place.","The top five disciples were decided. Then, the Martial Hall would pick five more people to replenish numbers, and they would be able to enter into the Sacred Land for the final competition.","As a reward for the five victors, they were able to enter into the Royal Capital’s Pond of Life and cultivate for three days. However, Ling Han was refused entry.","Having happened twice, the incident with him absorbing exorbitant amounts of energy essence from the Pond of Life could not be repeated.","Just as Ling Han was feeling regretful that he couldn’t increase his cultivation level in public, a monk suddenly came to pay him a visit, inviting him to the Buddhist Tower.","This surprised him. What was going on?","He went to the Buddhist Tower, and after a short tour, he was allowed to enter the Pond of Life to cultivate. Furthermore, the duration was as long as five days.","Yi, who was secretly taking care of him?","Although Ling Han was puzzled, he didn’t stand on ceremony. He indeed needed a reason to increase his cultivation level.","When he entered into the Pond of Life, he saw the faces of Jia Tailong and the others instantly turn green.","Looks like Ling Han’s previous \"evil deeds\" should have been exposed. Naturally, he had become a rat that everyone despised.","Once this guy entered the pool, wouldn’t the others be immediately chased out?"]},{"number":4677,"title":"Chapter 4677: Entering the Sacred Land","paragraphs":["Upon seeing Ling Han, Jia Tailong and the others all paled in fright.","This was a star of calamity!","\"Zhang Hanjun, don’t harm others!\" they hurriedly said.","It was only one matter for you to be chased away, but don’t implicate them.","Ling Han wore an expression of righteousness, and he said, \"As the saying goes, we share the burden of misfortune and fortune.\"","’Who will share burdens of misfortune and fortune with you? We’re not familiar with each other.’","Seeing Ling Han walk over step by step, the four of them felt their hair stand on end, and they wanted to make a move on Ling Han.","However, they immediately recalled Ling Han’s terrifying abilities. Furthermore, the moment he entered this place, this guy’s cultivation level would probably immediately begin to soar, and they would be even more outmatched.","There was nothing else that could be done. They could only absorb the essence of the energy with all their might. Every bit counted.","Thus, the four of them released their reservations. Previously, they had been afraid that absorbing too strongly would cause harm to their bodies, but how could they care now?","\"Pu!\"","\"Oh!\"","They were all throwing up blood madly, or bleeding from their seven apertures. This was the aftereffect of absorbing too much.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. \"I received special permission to enter this space to cultivate. There should be... no one who would come to chase me away.\"","They clearly knew that Ling Han was a Spirit Devouring Physique, yet they still let him in. Thus, they naturally wouldn’t chase him out again. Otherwise, wouldn’t that be a superfluous action?","He could vaguely guess that this might be related to the people who had been monitoring him in the sky previously.","However, because he hadn’t used his divine sense to observe them, he couldn’t confirm who this person was.","Hearing Ling Han’s words, Jia Tailong and the others wanted to vomit blood again.","F***, why didn’t you say so earlier?","Ling Han began to absorb the energy in the pool waters. Then, he slightly released his aura, and continued his performance.","Hong, long, long! With this absorption, the waters of the pool instantly boiled, and the whole Buddhist Tower was also trembling endlessly.","This caused even Jia Tailong to pale in shock and feel uneasy. Would the monks immediately come out and chase them away?","Thankfully, no one appeared all this while, which made them gradually feel more at ease.","Ling Han seemed to be right.","However, though no one stepped out to chase them away, looking at Ling Han rapidly breaking through one minor level after another, they were driven mad with jealousy.","Especially after half a day, when Ling Han completed his final leap and became a True Self Tier, they wanted nothing more than to kill Ling Han.","Comparisons would drive one crazy.","They could only comfort themselves in this way. When he reached the True Self Tier, Ling Han’s physique would no longer be able to take effect. At most, he would only reach the peak stage of the True Self Tier, and by then, he would be no different from an ordinary cultivator.","You may be one step ahead now, but they would definitely be able to catch up in future.","Ling Han absorbed the pool water’s energy for a while longer, but because the Spirit Devouring Physique’s limit was peak stage of True Self Tier, Ling Han couldn’t raise his cultivation level to Spirit Transformation Tier all at once.","Sigh!","Now that he was here, he \"would have\" a bottleneck in his cultivation. He could not break through too quickly, which would draw suspicion.","Even so, Jia Tailong and the others were still envious.","Because there was already \"no further room for advancement\", three days later, Ling Han left the Pond of Life with Jia Tailong and the others.","When they left, they discovered that the monks were all staring at them with deep hatred, causing a chill to run down their backs.","This was obviously because Ling Han had absorbed too much of the Pond of Life’s energy essence, which was why the monks were glaring at them. But the problem here was, you clearly knew that, so why did you still let Ling Han in?","Wasn’t this just asking for trouble?","The five of them returned to the Martial Hall. After resting for a few days, they would head to the Sacred Land and begin the final contest.","If one could still stand out, he would be directly taken in as a disciple by the Sacred Land, and may even become a Buddha Son in future!","Buddha Son!","When they thought of this word, everyone’s eyes lit up. That was because they already knew that Buddha Son Ah Han had not died, but was still living in this world. As long as one became the Buddha Son, he would definitely be able to receive personal guidance from the Great Emperor.","Just how tempting was this?","Several days later, they set out. Led personally by the Master of the Martial Ha;; of the Imperial Sea City, they headed towards the Sacred Land.","This was a show of respect for the Sacred Land.","The ten Royal Capitals were spread out all around the Sacred Land, guarding the true core of the Buddhist Race. After travelleing for a few days, Ling Han sensed a bitingly cold killing intent ahead of him, causing his hair to stand on end.","Great Emperor killing formation!","Ling Han was both excited and nervous. After lying low for so long, he was finally going to enter into the Sacred Land. However, the Great Emperor killing formation in front of him was the most difficult stage.","Afterward, with his strength of 10 Stars Saint-level and above, who could stop him from stealthily sneaking into the Pond of Life?","The holy flame... was finally about to ignite!","When they arrived at the edge of the Imperial Formation, the Master of the Martial Hall did not immediately step in. Instead, he took out a joss stick of sandalwood, and after respectfully lighting it, he sat down in a cross-legged position, and waited quietly.","Everyone followed suit, and sat down cross-legged.","After a while, a figure walked out of the Great Emperor Formation.","Under the envelopment of the Great Emperor’s killing formation, the entire area ahead of them was filled with fog. Now, in this fog, a hazy light first appeared. After waiting for a while, it could be seen that it was an oil lamp. Then, a person holding an oil lamp was seen walking slowly.","This was a monk. His head was bare, and he was wearing a purple kasaya. He was young, at most 17 or 18 years old, but he actually had a majestic and dignified aura.","\"Benefactors, please follow me,\" the young monk said as he clasped his hands in respect. He then turned around and started to walk toward the Great Emperor Formation.","The Master of the Martial Hall hurriedly called for everyone to follow him. They had to stay under the light enshrouded by the oil lamp. Otherwise, the Great Emperor killing formation would attack them without mercy. No matter how many stars of Saint-level you were, the only result would be death.","Ling Han was also serious. He didn’t dare to be careless, and followed closely behind.","After walking for a while, everything suddenly became clear ahead of them.","They finally walked out of the Great Emperor killing formation.","Ling Han gazed into the distance, only to see the precious towers standing tall and low in the vast expanse of land before him. Apart from these towers, there were also numerous temples. Countless streaks of power of belief hovered above them, some of them directly transforming into a shower that rained down.","Hiss!","In the outside world, only those who had performed a great service could enter into the Buddhist Tower and absorb the energy essence of the Pond of Life, but it would only be for a mere few days.","But here?","There was an endless supply of power of belief, and it directly transformed into a rain of power that fell!","Just how wide was the gap between them?","Although the power of belief couldn’t be absorbed by cultivators without being converted, it was still fine even if they could only obtain a tiny bit of benefit.","Moreover, there was so much that there was no time to convert it, so wouldn’t pure energy be easily obtained?","In this place, perhaps the least valuable item was the power of belief.","Ling Han was also feeling rueful internally. As expected of the force that had the most territory and the most believers in the universe. Even if at least half of the universe had already fallen, the power of belief of the Buddhist Race was still incredibly strong, and could be used for a very, very long time, right?","\"Benefactors, please,\" the young monk said calmly from the sidelines. He was already used to the stunned expressions of those who had just entered the Sacred Land."]},{"number":4678,"title":"Chapter 4678: Search","paragraphs":["Including the Master of the Martial Hall, everyone followed the young monk cautiously.","Though this little novice monk was only a Cauldron Forging Tier, while the Master of the Martial Hall was a great elite of Sect Master-level, this was the true core of the Buddhist Race. In fact, even Buddha Ah Han could possibly be here, so what was a Sect Master worth?","The young monk led them into a temple. The chanting of sutras was endless here, causing one to feel refreshed and energetic after hearing it. It was as if it had become easier to think about problems.","Yet Ling Han knew that this was an illusion.","The brainwashing ability of the Buddhist Race was number one in the world.","It was possible that even Venerate Tiers wouldn’t be able to discover this misconception, and would think that this was a Holy Land of cultivation. As time passed, they would subtly be inclined towards the Buddhist Race and completely submit to them.","In the past, when Ah Han had preached Buddhist sermons, he had even caused a Saint-level beast to \"come to its senses\", and throw itself into becoming the guardian beast of the Buddhist Race, which showed how terrifying the effects this had on the spirit was.","No matter how strong your willpower was, could it withstand millions of years of continuous brainwashing?","Thus, within the Sacred Land, everyone was definitely the most loyal believers and death warriors of the Buddhist Race.","Ling Han guarded his divine sense closely. He didn’t want to be brainwashed into becoming a member of the Buddhist Race before he even entered the Pond of Life.","The young novice monk left very quickly, and everyone hurriedly tried their best to gain appreciation. This was the Sacred Land. If they cultivated here for a day, it would be equivalent to a month outside, or even a year in fact!","Ling Han very much wanted to release his divine sense to sense for the Pond of Life.","Once he found it, he would be able to immediately sneak in and leave, ending this journey to the Buddhist Race.","Unfortunately, he did not dare.","That was because it was very possible that there was a Great Emperor here. Even if due to circumstances, it was impossible for him to fully unleash the Imperial Might, he was still not something that Ling Han could stand against.","Thus, he still had to maintain an absolute low profile.","While others were meditating, he exited the temple and started to walk around.","—No one had made it a rule that anyone who entered here would have to stay in the temple.","When others asked, he could also say that he was curious.","Who could blame the curiosity of a seventeen-year-old country boy?","If he could find the Pond of Life just like that, that was naturally best. If he couldn’t, he could only follow the plan and break through to the core level of the Sacred Land with an outstanding performance. Then, he would naturally have a chance to enter the Pond of Life.","In the Sacred Land, there were temples everywhere. The people living here were the most devout believers of Buddha Ah Han. They recited sutras every day, and did not care about worldly matters.","Hence, no matter where it was, the chanting of sutras would not cease, forming a mysterious power.","\"The power of belief can form a type of Regulation, and in this world, the belief of monks are even firmer, and will form a stronger effect of Regulations.\"","Ling Han reminded himself to be careful. When two opposing Regulations clashed, it would definitely be the stronger Regulation that would emerge victorious. The heaven and earth would act according to these Regulations.","He walked around. There was practically no one walking on the streets here. It was empty. If it was not for the endless chanting of sutras, one would really think that this was a ghost realm.","No one came out to stop Ling Han from going anywhere. It seemed like there were no secrets hidden in the Sacred Land.","Most importantly, there were too many buildings here, and the place was too big. Even if there was no one to stop Ling Han, without releasing his divine sense, Ling Han’s speed of exploration wouldn’t be much faster.","If he wanted to explore the entirety of the Sacred Land, it would take at least a few months. Furthermore, even if he did, it did not mean that he would definitely be able to find the Pond of Life.","The strange thing was that even after a day had passed, there was still no sign of the sun setting. Instead, it continued to circle around the Sacred Land.","In truth, there was no sun in the entire outer circle of the Buddhist Land. It was unknown in the past, but the present sun had long since been extinguished by the invasion of the Netherworld, but in the Buddhist Land, there were still the normal rising and setting of the sun and moon.","This was naturally the handiwork of great elites, who artificially caused day and night to change.","When it came to the \\Sacred Land, the change of day and night was even stranger, directly erasing the darkness of the night.","Fortunately, the people here were all elites above Celestial Path. If they wanted to rest, they could simply meditate. They didn’t need to sleep at all.","In that case, one circle of the sun here would be counted as a day. Ling Han had already walked for two days, but did not discover anything. Thus, he planned to return first, not knowing when the final tournament would be held.","He walked back, and after taking a few steps, a woman in white walked towards him.","Yi, Guo Shuang.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over, and discovered that there was a crimson squirrel on this woman’s shoulder. It was currently staring at him, baring its teeth, as if it had some great enmity with him.","Why had this woman appeared here?","Ling Han couldn’t help but let his imagination run wild. He didn’t dare to observe the other party with his eye technique, because he could sense that the other party was unfathomable. If she really was a super elite, then being observed by him like this would definitely expose him as well.","However, this woman was mysterious, and added with the fact that he had previously felt that an elite was observing him, these two factors added together gave him a feeling that this woman was very possibly the person who had been observing him secretly.","He smiled, and took the initiative to say, \"Lady Guo, what a coincidence.\"","\"It’s not a coincidence.\" Guo Shuang said calmly, \"I have deliberately come to find you.\"","\"Oh, is anything the matter?\" Ling Han asked.","Guo Shuang smiled faintly, and instantly, it was as if hundreds of flowers had bloomed at the same time, indescribably beautiful.","She said calmly, \"I see that you have been roaming around, so I wanted to ask you, where do you want to go? I can be a guide.\"","Ling Han was astonished, and he asked, \"Miss, are you staying here?\"","\"Are you trying to get information out of me?\" Guo Shuang countered.","Ling Han shrugged and said, \"I’m just curious.\"","\"I do indeed live here, so I’m very familiar with this place,\" Guo Shuang said calmly.","Ling Han also admitted honestly, \"This is my first time entering into the Sacred Land, so I’m curious about everywhere. I especially want to see the place where the Ancestral Buddha preached in the past.\"","\"I’ll take you there,\" Guo Shuang said.","\"Then thank you.\"","Ling Han caught up withh her in a few steps, and walked side by side with Guo Shuang. Immediately, he was glared at by that squirrel, as if it was saying, ’Who do you think you are? How dare you walk side by side with this Lady?’","The two of them continued onwards, circling here and there, and finally arrived in front of a temple that was not too conspicuous.","Though there were doors in the temples here, all of them were wide open, and there was no one standing guard.","The two of them entered, yet immediately felt an incredibly powerful aura approach them.","However, this aura immediately withdrew. Furthermore, there was no sign of anyone walking out, as if they were extremely at ease.","Ling Han couldn’t help but look at Guo Shuang, who was beside him. Was it because of this woman?","Guo Shuang smiled sheepishly, \"Like I said, I live here.\"","Ling Han also smiled. He entered the temple, and walked around.","Guo Shuang was really familiar with this place, and gave a lecture to Ling Han. This was the Buddhist staff that the Ancestral Buddha had used before. This was the praying mat that the Ancestral Buddha had sat on. It really seemed like there was nothing that she didn’t know.","Ling Han was naturally not interested in this kind of history, but no matter what, he had to put on an act, so he could only show an expression of high spirits.","He was beginning to regret it."]},{"number":4679,"title":"Chapter 4679: Final Tournament","paragraphs":["Another day later, Ling Han returned to the temple where he was staying.","He did not go out again, fearing that he would encounter Guo Shuang again.","This woman was not ordinary.","Though he had the Soul Forming Technique, if he spent too much time with this woman, it was very possible that she would see through his disguise.","After all, he was pretending to be someone else. As time passed, there would definitely be flaws in his disguise.","Several days later, the ten teams from the Royal Capitals had all arrived.","Next, it was the final battle.","The rules of the competition had finally been changed.","Everyone drew lots, and then battled one-on-one. They would be continuously eliminated, right until the first and second place were decided.","In the face of such rules, cultivation level was too important.","After all, there weren’t many people who could challenge those above their cultivation level. Regardless of how prodigious one was, there was still an insurmountable gulf between his cultivation level and the next major tier.","Thus, those with low cultivation levels could only hope that they would draw a good lot and try their best to fight a few more battles, so that they could unleash their full strength as much as possible.","In this way, it was possible that they would be taken into the Sacred Land.","Cultivating here for a day was equivalent to a month or even a year in the outside world.","There were a total of 100 members in the 10 teams. In the first round, there were 28 people who had passed.","Some people would be happy if they drew an empty lot, because this meant that they would enter into the second round without having to fight, but there were also those who were unhappy if they drew an empty lot, because they were only in the Core Formation Tier. Originally, they had hoped to encounter an opponent who was similarly Core Formation Tier, and show off their strength.","Now that they had directly entered into the second round, the chances of encountering a Core Formation Tier cultivator would be greatly decreased, so it was naturally disadvantageous.","But no matter what, it could not be changed now that the lots were drawn. It could only be left to fate.","On the second day, the final round of advancement battles began.","The Sacred Land also dispatched a Bodhisattva, a Venerate, to observe the tournament, and on the other hand, to keep watch.","The highest level of battle here was True Self Tier. With a Venerate Tier overseer, what need was there for them to fear that they would not be able to go all out?","However, a piece of news immediately broke out. Among the contestants this time, there was actually a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator!","After learning of this, everyone was stunned.","How was this going to be dealt with now?","There was definitely no way they could compete for the place of champion.","No matter how freakish you were, could a True Self Tier cultivator match a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator?","It was impossible. Even the Ancestral Buddha had not been able to do so in the past.","This person’s name was \"Ji Liren\", and he was from the Martial King Royal Capital. It was said that he had participated in several major battles at the Sacred Land—there was an upper limit, and one could only participate a total of three times. Then one had to make way for others, and couldn’t keep occupying the territory.","However, the last time he participated in a battle at the Sacred Land was two hundred years ago. After that, he had been touring the Buddhist Land, issuing challenges everywhere, and tempering his battle prowess.","According to the rules, the age of the participants in the Sacred Land tournament could not exceed three hundred years old, and he just happened to be right in front of this restriction.","However, the selection of talents for the Sacred Land was not just based on battle prowess and cultivation level. More importantly, it was based on natural talent.","Hence, even if Ji Liren should have ascended to the throne of champion without a doubt, everyone didn’t lose their fighting spirit.","The opponent that Ling Han had drawn in the first round was also a True Self Tier. Thus, the battle did not lose the \"suspense\".","The battles began. Because a Venerate was present, battlegrounds could be created at will, allowing everyone to battle at the same time. Thus, the first round of elimination battles began at the same time.","\"Haha, my luck is not too bad. I encountered a rookie that is participating for the first time.\" When Ling Han’s opponent saw him, he immediately bared his teeth in a grin.","Ling Han smiled, \"You should be a rash person.\"","\"Why do you say that?\" His opponent was not in a rush either.","\"Because when you saw my information, you only saw that I was a rookie this year, but forgot to take note of my cultivation level,\" Ling Han said.","\"Could it be that you are in the True Self Tier?\" the opponent said, then laughed out loud himself.","Wasn’t this a huge joke?","This was his first time participating in the Sacred Land Tournament, so how could he possibly be a True Self Tier!","Ling Han smiled as well. It was as if the two of them weren’t rivals, but rather old friends who had known each other for many years.","\"Alright, now that the joke’s over, it’s time to deal with you!\" the opponent said.","Ling Han smiled, \"Come on then.\"","\"Humph, I have to say, as a Core Formation Tier cultivator, your courage is truly commendable,\" the opponent sneered, and delivered a palm strike.","Peng!","Ling Han casually threw a punch, easily dispersing this palm strike.","\"Yi!\" The opponent was stunned. This had exceeded his expectations. \"Are you really a True Self Tier?\"","Ling Han smiled, \"I told you just now.\"","\"How is this possible?!\" The opponent still couldn’t believe it. Those who were only participating in the tournament at the Sacred Land for the first time were definitely Core Formation Tier. This was decided through multiple rounds of selection.","You are really too freakish, aren’t you?","\"Humph, even if you are in the True Self Tier, I can still defeat you!\" That opponent charged over again. This time, his battle prowess was fully unleashed.","He didn’t believe that he wouldn’t be able to suppress this opponent if he went all out.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely, and the opponent shockingly discovered that Ling Han was not only in the True Self Tier, but also in terms of minor level, Ling Han was actually superior to him.","He could not believe it at all. How could it be possible that this kind of contestant would be participating in the Sacred Land Tournament for the first time?","What a joke!","No matter how he tried, he was still unable to turn the tables. In less than a dozen moves, he was defeated.","Ling Han had won, and this was a matter of course. He did not look overjoyed, and quietly waited for the battles of the others to end, and the second round of elimination battles to begin.","Some battles lasted longer, while others were very short. However, they wouldn’t last for more than a day. The Venerate from the Sacred Land would determine who would emerge victorious based on the performance of both sides.","On the second day, the second round of battles finally began.","This time, there was no one else who had gotten an empty turn. One after another, great battles broke out.","Being able to pass through multiple selections and be chosen to participate in the final competition, which one of them was not a prodigy?","Thus, unless a True Self Tier cultivator encountered a Core Formation Tier cultivator and could quickly end the battle, it would be an extremely intense and drawn-out battle.","One day later, the thirty two battles all ended, and only five Core Formation Tiers remained on the field.","After another round of elimination battles, only one Core Formation Tier cultivator remained.","When they reached the quarterfinals, all the Core Formation Tiers finally disappeared. Because there was only one Core Formation Tier, he would definitely encounter a True Self Tier, so how could he not lose?","Coincidentally, it just so happened that Ling Han encountered the only Core Formation Tier cultivator, which also made everyone think that his placement in the top eight was too weak.","However, in the following battle of the semifinals, Ling Han actually encountered Ji Liren.","Hehe, this guy’s good luck had been used up.","As the only Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator, whoever Ji Liren encountered could only be defeated, unable to take another step forward.","\"It can’t be helped. The heavens are fair. He first encountered a Core Formation Tier cultivator, and took full advantage of him, so of course he has to spit back out his unfair advantage.\"","\"Being able to advance into the top eight is already very impressive.\"","\"That’s right. Could it be that he wants to rely on luck to advance into the top four?\"","Just as everyone was discussing this, the battle for the top four began.","There were many people watching this battle, and thinking about it, it would end very quickly. If they wanted to watch the other battles, this would not take up too much time."]},{"number":4680,"title":"Chapter 4680: Failed?","paragraphs":["Ji Liren faced Ling Han proudly, as if he was a supreme god.","As he saw it, any battle would be meaningless — he was a Spirit Transformation True Lord. Who wouldn’t be crushed by him?","Thus, his competition battles were only going through the motions.","\"Just admit defeat,\" he said calmly.","Ling Han smiled, \"You’re that confident?\"","\"This is reality.\" It was rare for Ji Liren to say more. \"I’m a Spirit Transformation True Lord, and you’re only a True Self Tier. Is there any need to say anything else?\"","This was a one-sided suppression. This was the truth of the cultivation world; no one could win against a higher cultivation level!","Of course, Ling Han was an exception. However, there was only one such monster.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"Then I’m sorry. I broke through yesterday, and I’m no longer a True Self Tier.\"","Yi?","Ji Liren faltered upon hearing this. Was this real?","’You’re bluffing, aren’t you? Who doesn’t need to accumulate experience for several years to break through? How can you break through just because you want to?’","\"Hehe, you really know how to brag!\" He shook his head, filled with absolute disbelief.","\"Come.\" Ling Han crooked a finger at him, \"What I like the most is to use my fists to subdue others.\"","How arrogant!","Ji Liren smirked coldly. Even if you truly broke through, you would only be a First Change, and he was a Third Change!","\"Then let me experience it!\" Ji Liren moved, sending out a palm strike towards Ling Han.","Peng!","Ling Han didn’t dodge. Instead, he chose to counterattack.","There was a loud bang, and Ji Liren’s attack was instantly dispersed. However, to complement the fact that he was a First Change of Spirit Transformation Tier, Ling Han also stumbled back continuously.","Now that things had progressed to this point, his image naturally could not be destroyed.","Pu!","Seeing this scene, everyone vomited blood.","How was this possible?","This guy was actually a Spirit Transformation True Lord?","Previously, they had said that this guy was lucky, and encountered the only Core Formation Tier cultivator, easily advancing into the top eight. However, his path of advancement would thus be severed. Who would have thought that this guy would actually break through at such a critical moment?","The second Spirit Transformation True Lord in the tournament, logically speaking, he should be able to secure the second place.","Sigh!","This time, no one thought that he was lucky, but rather unlucky to have encountered Ji Liren so quickly.","You see, the difference between First Change and Third Change was clear at a glance.","However, everyone could see that Ling Han didn’t have the slightest awareness of being a weakling, and actually took the initiative to attack first.","Wasn’t this just asking for a beating?","Everyone shook their heads. This time, Ling Han’s defeat would be very, very soon.","Ji Liren smirked coldly. He had confirmed Ling Han’s cultivation level. He was indeed a Spirit Transformation Tier. However, he was naturally confident that a Third Change would be able to defeat a First Change.","He still dared to attack first?","Where had his courage come from?","He sent out a palm strike, using his full power, wanting to end the battle as soon as possible.","With his cultivation level, it was only right for him to win. Thus, only by ending the battle as quickly as possible would he be able to slightly reflect his natural talent in cultivation.","However, the truth was completely different from what he had imagined.","Ling Han used all his movement techniques, extremely agile, and his punches and kicks were just right, dispersing Ji Liren’s attacks completely.","Ji Liren was clearly at an advantage in terms of power, and he was also at an advantage in terms of cultivation level, yet he couldn’t unleash his full power at all.","Hiss, this was actually a tie?","No!","Those with sharp eyes discovered that the situation was slowly tilting in Ling Han’s direction.","This guy’s natural talent in battle was too terrifying. He had used every single bit of power to the extreme, showing them perfectly how they could defeat the strong as the weak.","As expected, Ji Liren’s advantage gradually fell to a stalemate, and then to a disadvantage.","At this moment, everyone felt that the chances of Ling Han winning were infinitely high.","After another 300 rounds, Ji Liren had no choice but to admit defeat.","If they continued to fight, he would be forcefully defeated. That would really be too ugly. It would be better for him to admit defeat himself. At least, he would still have some face.","He looked at Ling Han, and could not accept this at all.","How could this guy be so freakish? He was clearly not weak either, yet the other had defeated him with a gap of two minor levels.","Ling Han smiled in reply. If it weren’t for the fact that he had held back, he would have been able to surpass seven or eight minor levels, at least, to say nothing of two minor levels.","After this battle, though Ling Han was temporarily ranked in the top four, everyone knew that he was already the champion in reality.","Could it be that there was a second person who could complete the breakthrough from the True Self Tier to the Spirit Transformation Tier in a short one to two days?","That was impossible.","As expected, the outcome of the following two rounds of the competition had no suspense. Ling Han easily won, and locked in on the position of champion.","At this point, the tournament for the Martial Halls had all ended. The majority of people had returned, and only a very limited number of people were able to stay behind. They had been chosen by the Sacred Land, and when they came out in future, they would at least reach the height of a City Lord.","In the past, they could still be sent to the various Heavenly Realms. That could easily become the ruler of a planet or even galaxy, which was even more awesome.","Of course, there was no need to worry about those who returned. After all, there would still be a chance for them to come back again in future. Moreover, even if the Sacred Land did not want them, they would definitely be wanted by the Martial Halls in the various Royal Capitals. That was still an excellent choice.","Unexpectedly, Ling Han wasn’t retained either.","This shocked everyone.","Although Ling Han’s cultivation level had skyrocketed because of the Spirit Devouring Physique, and his cultivation level had accelerated unfairly, his battle with Ji Liren had already fully explained his natural talent in battle.","Why didn’t the Sacred Land want him?","However, how could they question this decision?","Though some people felt that this was unfair to Ling Han, they did not dare say anything, and even more people were rejoicing in his misfortune.","Even Ling Han hadn’t expected this. His performance had been so outstanding, yet he hadn’t been chosen as a member of the Sacred Land?","What was he to do now?","Do everthing again?","What if he was still not chosen?","Time would not wait for him. Now was a time when every second counted. If an ancient Imperial Son became Emperor, he would only be able to watch helplessly.","What was even more terrifying?","If this ancient Imperial Son that had become Emperor belonged to the Twelve Lands of Death, then with a new Emperor and twelve veteran Emperors, who in this world would be able to match such a powerful force?","Without becoming a Great Emperor, so what if Ling Han possessed the Seed of the Holy Flame?","The strongest Saint in history?","So what if this strongest Saint could match the Pseudo-Emperor?","Thoughts raced through Ling Han’s mind, but he didn’t cause a commotion. Instead, he returned with the others in the team.","He was clearly so outstanding, yet had not been detained. That could only mean one thing.","He was presently being examined, and there was a more important purpose for him.","Thus, Ling Han followed everyone back to the Imperial Sea Royal Capital, and agreed to the invitation of the local Martial Hall to stay there.","He cultivated every day, and when he was free, he would also go out for a walk, appearing to be very relaxed.","These days continued for two months, and finally, a change took place.","Someone came to visit Ling Han.","It was Guo Shuang again.","Ling Han understood. The fact that he was allowed to enter into the Pond of Life inside the Buddhist Tower of the Royal Capital was definitely the interference of this woman, and the fact that he couldn’t stay in the Sacred Land was probably also her doing.","He was very curious. Who exactly was this woman?","Unfortunately, he couldn’t use his eye technique. Otherwise, he should have been able to see some clues.","\"Lady Guo, have you come to take me to the Sacred Land?\" he asked bluntly, not beating around the bush."]},{"number":4681,"title":"Chapter 4681: Illuminating oneself","paragraphs":["\"Why do you think that?\" Guo Shuang didn’t answer, but instead asked a question of her own.","Ling Han wore a confident expression, and he said, \"With my performance, who can compare to me? However, I failed to make the cut. Thus, I can only conclude that this is a test of my willpower.\"","Guo Shuang couldn’t help but laugh in spite of herself. However, she nodded and said, \"You’re really confident. However, you guessed correctly. At the peak of your life, you suddenly encountered a head-on blow, and you can still maintain such composure. You indeed have a promising future.\"","Ling Han did not show any joy on his face. Instead, he asked curiously, \"Who exactly are you?\"","\"You will find out in future. Now, follow me,\" Guo Shuang said.","\"Don’t I need to inform the Martial Hall?\"","\"No need.\"","Ling Han nodded, and followed Guo Shuang away. They once again arrived at the Great Emperor formation.","This time, Guo Shuang did not take out sandalwood joss stick to light up. Instead, she took out an oil lamp himself, and after lighting it, she led the way.","Ling Han hurriedly followed after her.","When the two of them walked out of the Great Emperor formation — or rather, when they really walked in, Guo Shuang’s body was seen to suddenly exude a powerful aura. There was also a soft lustre on her body, and she looked incredibly sacred.","This was actually a Saint!","Ling Han only gave an \"oh\" in his mind. This was within his expectations, but a shocked expression appeared on his face, \"Who exactly are you?\"","Guo Shuang glanced at him, her eyes filled with incomparable authority, but did not say anything.","This glance carried endless pressure.","Ling Han was naturally unafraid, but he was presently only a mere Spirit Transformation True Lord. Thus, he naturally had to act as he should. Otherwise, if he really managed to sneak into the Sacred Land with great difficulty, and his public image was ruined, that would really be too unjust.","Guo Shuang waved her hand dismissively, \"Someone will bring you to your accommodations.\"","She took a step, and in an instant, there was no sign of her.","\"A Saint of around 10,000 years old, at most.\" Ling Han looked at Guo Shuang’s back. This time, he could finally use his eye technique. Guo Shuang definitely wouldn’t notice it.","\"It’s said that Ah Han doesn’t have any children, so this should be the personal disciple of Ah Han?\"","\"The Holy Daughter of the first generation?\"","\"In that case, Guo Shuang may not be her real name either.\"","\"That’s right. Even that squirrel can be called Guo Yun so Guo Shuang definitely isn’t her real name.\"","\"But who cares? I only want to enter the Pond of Life.\"","Ling Han felt rueful. He had already been here for so long, and he had indeed entered three times the Little Pond of Life, but what about the real Pond of Life?","It wasn’t long before a young monk came over and led Ling Han to his residence.","It was naturally a temple. Ling Han’s residence was in a small courtyard, and there were three people living here.","When the three people inside saw Ling Han, they were all gaping in shock.","How could it be Ling Han?","These three people were Jia Tailong, Ji Liren and another prodigy who had emerged victorious from this competition. They were all settled here.","They had thought that Ling Han had already been chased off. Who would have thought that he would suddenly appear in front of them again? Naturally, they were incredibly surprised.","Ling Han smiled, \"Everyone, looks like I’ll have to be your neighbor for a while.\"","The three of them sighed. Previously, the Sacred Land had not chosen to retain Ling Han. They all found this strange, because Ling Han’s natural talent in martial arts was clearly superior to Ji Liren’s, and Ji Liren had been retained. Why was it that Ling Han was not?","Now that Ling Han had returned, they all understood that there was something hidden that they did not know, but Sacred Land definitely had a high opinion of Ling Han.","They stayed here for a few days, then were brought to another temple by a young monk.","This temple was much larger.","They arrived at a meditation hall. Strangely, there was a white jade-like wall in the middle of the meditation hall, but it did not connect to the roof. It was about the height of a person.","Aside from Ling Han and the others, there were also a great many people here. They were presently seated in cross-legged positions. It was unknown whether they were meditating, or resting to pass the time.","After the young monk brought the four of them in, he left directly.","Ling Han and the others imitated the others, finding a place to sit cross-legged.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over them, and saw that the cultivation levels of the people here were not uniform. Some were only in Cauldron Forging Tier, while some had even reached Sect Master-level. Some were dressed like monks, while some were people of the mortal <anno data-annotation-id=\"7454bca0-adda-4faf-8ba1-d867cf390048\" data-title=\"world\">world 1 </anno>.","Very soon, he withdrew his gaze. He lowered his head, lowered his head and waited quietly.","After a long while, an old monk appeared.","This was a Venerate, and in the Buddhist Race, Venerate Tiers were also called Bodhisattvas. This one was called Bodhisattva Luo Shu.","The old monk opened his mouth, and said, \"Let us begin today’s contest.\"","Yi, was there a fight?","Ling Han faltered for a moment. The cultivation levels of the people here were all uneven, so how were they supposed to fight?","However, he discovered that the others had all stood up and walked in front of the white jade wall. Then, they turned around and sat with their backs against the wall.","What was going on here?","He followed suit. When he sat down and leaned his back against the white jade wall, he suddenly realized that his mind had actually been connected to a separate dimension.","This?","He thought for a moment, then released a sliver of divine sense, which entered into this space.","Instantly, multiple human figures appeared in front of him.","\"The Void Emperor!\"","\"Ancestral King Lingtian!\"","\"Nine Suns Saint!\"","Ling Han was astounded. Whenever he touched these humanoid figures with his divine sense, information would immediately form in his mind.","These human figures were all mighty figures who had once been all-powerful. Now, as long as he fused his divine sense with this human figure, he could temporarily transform into this kind of existence. It was equivalent to possessing an \"incarnation\".","He understood now. The so-called battle was a contest of manifestations.","Every manifestation had their own techniques, and each had their own specialty.","For example, the unique trait of the True Phoenix was its speed, while the True Dragon had an incredibly tough physique and overwhelming brute force, which was reflected through its abilities.","\"Quickly choose your own battle vehicle.\" A voice rang out. It was precisely that old monk.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over them, and in an instant, he had seen all the manifestations.","There were manifestations of Great Emperors here, incomparably powerful ancient Saints, and even Divine Beasts from the ancient times. However, Ling Han was not satisfied with any of them.","He firmly believed that he himself was the strongest.","Yi?","Shockingly, he discovered that at the end of these figures, there was an embodiment whose features were even blurred.","When he touched it with his divine sense, the information he received was that this could reflect his own body.","—With himself as the template for the embodiment.","Ling Han smiled, and that was it.","He fused his divine sense, and his manifestation immediately analyzed his divine sense, digitizing his power and speed.","However, Ling Han had the Soul Forming Technique, and simulated himself in the Spirit Transformation Tier. All the numbers were what he wanted to show.","This number naturally wouldn’t be excessive. At most, he could only be regarded as a prodigy, or a slightly above average prodigy.","When all this was done, the scene in front of him immediately changed. He had actually appeared in space.","The old monk also appeared. His figure was massive, and his head was even larger than a planet.","\"Let the battle begin!\"","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">This means that they have not become monks.</annotations>"]},{"number":4682,"title":"Chapter 4682: Battle of Manifestations","paragraphs":["Ling Han was still confused. The battle had begun?","Who should he hit? There were so many of them.","However, right at this moment, a \"Great Emperor\" suddenly charged over.","This was the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. He had personally witnessed the corpse of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor, though the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor’s corpse had been even larger than a planet at that time. If he had been standing in one place, he would only have been able to see a single side of it.","When his divine sense swept over, he shockingly discovered that there was actually information being fed back.","This was Jia Tailong!","Great, he had defeated him previously, and he could not swallow this anger, so now he wanted to get his revenge?","However, how could the Great Emperor be blocked?","Boom!","Jia Tailong slashed down with his sword, causing the river of stars to boil.","Yet Ling Han’s heart calmed, because this Great Emperor actually only had the battle prowess of True Self Tier.","He also threw a punch in response.","Only now did he realize that he could only unleash the battle prowess of a True Self Tier.","Oh, their cultivation levels were the same.","No wonder everyone had chosen the Great Emperor’s body as their \"vehicle\". That was because under the prerequisite that their cultivation levels were equal, the Great Emperor’s bodt was naturally the strongest. Only incredibly powerful Saints like the Nine Suns Saint could compare.","Ling Han shook his head. In the beginning, he had really gotten a scare. He had thought that he could simulate the Great Emperor, but from the look of things now, this was only an empty image of the Great Emperor. As for other details, it was all numericalized.","For example, if the Great Emperor’s power was set to the highest level of 100, then the powerful Saint’s power could be set to 99 or something of the sort.","In truth, this had absolutely nothing to do with a Great Emperor.","However, because Ling Han was reflecting his own data, and he was extremely good at hiding his strength, it caused his power and speed to be far inferior. Going by the limit of 100, he could only be 80, or even lower.","Peng!","It was only a single strike, and Ling Han was sent flying, stumbling.","\"Zhang Hanjun, in a true battle of equals, how could I possibly lose to you!\" Jia Tailong said proudly.","Ling Han couldn’t help but wear a strange expression.","Where did your confidence come from?","He was clearly relying on the fact that his incarnation had higher statistics, yet he actually came over to tell him to battle at the same cultivation level?","He steadied his body. The advantage of this kind of battle was that he would not be injured, but he could get experience that was close to the experience of actual battle.","\"The battle has just begun, so don’t you think it’s a joke to talk about victory and defeat now?\" Ling Han said calmly.","\"You are destined to lose!\" Jia Tailong shot over, and struck again with his sword.","Whether it was in terms of speed or power, he had the absolute upper hand.","Using a manifestation as his vehicle, the techniques channeled out were also unique to the vehicle. This had also been digitized. For example, the Great Emperor had a super ultimate move, which was extremely terrifying in might, but after using it, there would be a few seconds of weakness.","Because Ling Han was a clone of himself, he didn’t unleash any powerful attacks. Thus, he was clearly at a huge disadvantage.","A powerful move could instantly burst forth with ten times or even stronger battle prowess. As long as one could grasp the right moment to land a direct hit, he would be able to immediately end the battle.","However, Ling Han was completely unconcerned.","He was only using his own abilities. This was the true path of the greatest strength.","Boom!","Jia Tailong brandished his sword in a slash. This was the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor’s sword technique. However, because it was only an imitation, and not the true Imperial Technique of the Holy Emperor, its might had been forcefully magnified to the level that it should have been.","In any case, this was all a simulation, so the authenticity of it was completely unimportant.","Ling Han was experiencing great difficulty. What he was simulating was his weakened self. In terms of power, speed, and celestial techniques, he was at too much of a disadvantage. However, he was only adapting on the spot, unleashing his battle prowess to the extreme.","—No matter how perfect the data was, that was only theoretical. To truly convert this quantified power and speed into battle prowess, it still required one’s own control.","Could Jia Tailong compare to Ling Han?","Thus, a shocking scene appeared. Ling Han managed to turn the tables with great difficulty, and gradually gained the upper hand.","At the beginning, the others were all focused on their own battles, but there would always be those who glimpsed the battles on this side, and then they would be stunned.","One, two, three, more and more people stopped, watching in disbelief.","Heavens!","Someone had actually used such a crappy vehicle to contend against a Great Emperor-level vehicle?","Just look, which of them hadn’t chosen a Great Emperor? If they were slightly weaker, they would have chosen the Saint. In fact, no one had even chosen the Saint who was only a slight bit weaker.","However, this Zhang Hanjun actually chose to... imitate himself!","Hiss, what kind of powerful confidence was this?","And in truth, this really wasn’t arrogance, but true strength.","Jia Tailong unleashed a powerful attack, yet Ling Han managed to narrowly dodge it. Moreover, after unleashing his powerful attack, Jia Tailong had a short period of weakness. Ling Han seized this opportunity to deal with him in a few moves.","At this point, the battle had ended.","Everyone was in an uproar. In this kind of battle, everyone’s power and speed was limited. The might of the celestial technique was also the same. Weaknesses and advantages were very obvious.","Theoretically speaking, under the condition that all kinds of numerical values were suppressed, it was absolutely impossible to turn the tables.","However, Ling Han had succeeded.","This guy... was too terrifying.","Ling Han, meanwhile, was unconcerned. He had not defeated the Great Emperor in his youth, but merely a bunch of numbers.","What was this?","Of course, if he went all out, he believed that even the young Great Emperor would not be a match for him.","\"Don’t be arrogant, I’ll fight you!\" Another \"Great Emperor\" charged over.","It was Ji Liren.","He chose the White Feather Holy Emperor. With a shake of his arms, countless white feathers shot over, turning into divine light.","This battle prowess had shockingly reached the Spirit Transformation Tier.","Ling Han understood. This would be adjusted according to the cultivation level of both sides, and would be based on the weaker cultivation level.","Previously, Jia Tailong’s cultivation level was \"one\" level weaker than his, so they used the True Self Tier as a base for their battle. Now, he and Ji Liren were \"both\" Spirit Transformation Tier, so the level of their battle had increased by another level.","Ling Han was still fighting with great difficulty, but through seizing opportunities time and time again, he was still slowly gaining the upper hand, and finally defeated his opponent.","This stunned everyone. Winning two battles in a row, this was very convincing.","No one challenged Ling Han again. This was simply seeking their own suffering.","Half a day later, the battles ended, and everyone felt appreciation. After leaving the white jade wall, they discussed their insights from the battles.","And Ling Han became the focal point. A great many people had gathered around him, asking him for guidance on battle techniques. Even that Sect Master, though he could not bring himself to lower himself to their level, had still come closer, pricking up his ears to listen.","Ling Han didn’t hold anything back, and frankly revealed his appreciation.","However, this was the experience that he had tempered through countless battles, so how could it be grasped just by saying it?","It sounded very logical to others, but to practice it in actual battle was an absolutely impossible feat.","Thus, they could only feel rueful. As it turned out, there really were prodigies of battle in this world, who were naturally born for battle.","Subsequently, this kind of simulated battle would take place every few days.","The more Ling Han fought, the fiercer he became, confirming his position as invincible in the simulation battles.","And just like that, three months later, Guo Shuang appeared once more."]},{"number":4683,"title":"Chapter 4683: Three Choices","paragraphs":["\"Your performance has indeed exceeded my expectations,\" Guo Shuang said, a hint of admiration in her eyes.","She already knew that during the simulation battle, Ling Han hadn’t chosen to use the Great Emperor or Saint as his vehicle. Instead, he had directly imitated himself.","Fighting against the manifestation of the Great Emperor alone required courage.","Of course, it was not that there had never been such people in history. However, reality had proven that these people were all overconfident, and they all ended up in defeat.","Thus, people like Ling Han, who had both incomparable confidence and powerful natural talent in cultivation, were really too rare.","Ling Han smiled, \"I am someone that is destined to become a Great Emperor.\"","These words were too airy. Guo Shuang couldn’t help but laugh. How could this young man possibly know that this era was welcoming a golden age when hundreds of flowers bloomed at the same time? The ancient Imperial Sons had all appeared at this time, and there was also Ling Han, Ding Shu, and other super freakish newcomers.","To become Emperor in this era, luck was actually more important.","In the case of the person in front of her, whether his natural talent was strong or not was set aside for the moment. However, his cultivation level was advancing too slowly, and luck was not on his side.","\"To reward you, I can give you three options. You can choose one,\" Guo Shuangliang said. \"First, I’ll teach you the Six Characters Bright King Curse!\"","Peng, Ling Han’s heart couldn’t help but beat in excitement. He really, really wanted to learn.","This was a spirit-type Imperial Technique. Though he had only learnt the \"An\" character, its might was really out of the ordinary.","If he could learn all of them... that would naturally be great.","However, he did not immediately answer, and was very calm.","What were the remaining two options?","\"Secondly, I can send you into the Pool of Life to cultivate for three days,\" Guo Shuang continued.","\"This Pond of Life is nothing like the ones you entered before. Instead, it’s the real Pond of Life that was personally built by the Ancestral Buddha.\"","\"Entering it to temper your physical body can allow you to undergo a complete transformation.\"","\"Though your natural talent in battle is extraordinary, your aptitude is still a little lacking. Through the Pond of Life, it can help you compensate for this weakness.\"","In this instant, Ling Han was elated.","Pond of Life!","He had waited long enough.","\"However, the second option won’t cause an obvious change in your cultivation level. It’ll only strengthen your foundations, and the benefits will only be displayed in the future,\" Guo Shuang continued.","Ling Han nodded. He was still very calm, and did not speak, though there was no need to consider this at all.","\"Thirdly, I can teach you the Kasyapa Dhara Scroll. This is a Saint-level cultivation technique, and using it to cultivate, your advancement will be astonishingly fast,\" Guo Shuang continued.","There were three options. The Imperial Technique directly increased battle prowess, and the Six Characters Bright King Curse could clear one’s heart and suppress one’s internal demon. It was definitely not just an ordinary Imperial Technique. In the case of the Pond of Life, one could get a rebirth, and the Saint Technique would allow the advancement of one’s cultivation level to soar.","If it was someone else who had to choose, it would definitely be difficult.","Every single one of them was very useful to him, so how should he choose?","However, Ling Han didn’t need to hesitate at all. He only pondered for a moment before saying, \"I choose the second option.\"","Guo Shuang couldn’t help but nod in approval, saying, \"Imperial Technique and Saint-level cultivation technique... you’ll have the chance to obtain them again in the future. However, the earlier one can temper one’s physique, the better it is. Once one misses the opportunity to strengthen their foundations, it’ll be extremely difficult to compensate for their shortcomings in the future. Moreover, the price they’ll have to pay will also be far greater.\"","\"I gave you three options, which is also a test for you. You have passed again.\"","Er, was this considered a coincidence?","If Ling Han weren’t going to ignite the holy flame, he would have chosen the Six Characters Bright King Curse. This was because he was already freakishly talented, so the Pond of Life’s tempering effects would definitely be ineffective on him. As for Saint-level cultivation technique... wasn’t this a joke?","He himself already possessed battle prowess that could defeat 99% of Saints, so what need was there for him to use a Saint-level cultivation technique?","\"Take a bath and fast for three days. I’ll have someone bring you to the Pond of Life,\" Guo Shuang said. She then turned around to leave.","Ling Han was certain that this must be the personal disciple of Ah Han. Otherwise, even if she was a Saint, how could she possibly possess such great authority, and make major decisions?","It was said that the Buddhist Race also had a personal disciple of the Great Emperor called Shi Gang. This should be the earliest Buddha Son, right?","Ling Han sat down quietly to calm his emotions.","He could finally enter the Pond of Life.","The position of Saint was finally right in front of his eyes.","He was a little excited.","He had indeed taken a bath and fasted. He had done so much foreplay, so how could he fall on the last stage?","Three days later, a young monk came over and brought him to the Pond of Life.","After going through so many twists and turns, they finally arrived at an extremely large temple. Then, the little monk left, and it was an old monk who continued to lead him.","This old monk... was a Saint!","Though his aura was not apparent, and even his back was stooped, looking old and decrepit, just a sliver of aura that would occasionally seep out was incredibly terrifying.","This was a nine-star Saint.","Ling Han thought. It was possible that he was only a sliver away from becoming a Pseudo-Emperor.","However, even though it was only a sliver, 99% of Saints would never be able to touch it.","Moreover, throughout history, how many Saints had managed to become nine-star Saints?","The old monk took a few steps with Ling Han, and immediately began to pant.","\"Old man, why don’t you take a rest first?\" Ling Han said. Meanwhile, he grumbled in his mind. ’You’re a nine-star Saint, so why are you acting so tired?’","The old monk nodded at him, and really sat on the ground. Then, he said, \"In this day and age, there are not many young people that have patience like you.\"","Ling Han smiled and said, \"Respecting the elderly and caring for the young is a traditional virtue.\"","The old monk nodded, and closed his eyes to rest.","Ten minutes, half an hour, three hours!","The old monk seemed to have turned into stone, and actually did not open his eyes again.","Ling Han did not rush him either. He too sat at the sidelines, and waited quietly.","After a whole seven days, the old monk suddenly opened his eyes, and said, \"Aiyo, I accidentally fell asleep.\"","\"It’s fine,\" Ling Han said with a smile. His expression was calm, and there was no hint of impatience.","This was clearly another test.","Sigh, the people of the Buddhist Race were really petty, and not the slightest bit straightforward.","The old monk stood up and continued forward. However, after taking a few steps, he started to pant again. This time, he didn’t wait for Ling Han to speak before immediately sitting down again and continuing to rest with his eyes closed.","Ling Han smiled, and similarly sat with the other, still having no intention to rush him.","This happened again and again. The old monk would sit down to rest at the drop of a hat, and the time was indefinite. Sometimes, it would only be three minutes, and sometimes, it would be half a month, but no matter how much the old monk sat down at the drop of a hat, Ling Han did not rush him at all.","Just like that, half a year passed in the blink of an eye.","The old monk finally smiled, and said, \"Young man, you are not too bad.\"","Ling Han also smiled, though he was muttering internally, ’If it was not for the Pond of Life, you would have long since been beaten to death, all right?’","The old monk didn’t rest any longer. He brought Ling Han to a Buddha statue, then pointed at it. The Buddha statue immediately turned around, revealing a secret passage."]},{"number":4684,"title":"Chapter 4684: Pond of Life!","paragraphs":["This was their home base, so what need was there to set up a secret passage?","Just how dark is your mentality?","Ling Han mocked internally. He believed that Ah Han definitely couldn’t be so petty. As a dignified Great Emperor, what need was there for him to fear that someone would sneak into the Pond of Life?","Thus, this must have been set up by someone in the later generations.","He followed the old monk into the secret passage, and went all the way downwards. After a very, very long time, the path ahead of him suddenly opened up, revealing an ocean.","This was... the Pond of Life!","Because the power of will of all living beings was too colossal, the energy essence formed actually turned into a boundless ocean.","Impressive.","Just how terrifying was this?","In this world, only the Buddhist Race had such a background. As for the others, even the Chang Clan could not compare.","—In terms of wealth, the Chang Clan was definitely number one, but in terms of the power of faith of all living beings, the Buddhist Race was definitely the strongest.","\"Go on,\" the old monk said. After saying this, he turned around and left.","To say nothing of the fact that this \"Spirit Devouring Physique\" had already reached the upper limit of his cultivation level, even if he hadn’t, starting from zero, he would only be able to absorb a drop of the colossal power of will from all living beings, at most.","However, he would soon know that he had been wrong, and just how overwhelmingly wrong he had been.","Ling Han rubbed his hands together, looking excited.","He could feel that the Seed of the Holy Flame in his mind was also throbbing, as if it could no longer hold itself back.","\"Alright, I’ll satisfy you.\"","Ling Han leaped up, and flew towards the depths of the great ocean.","He still suppressed his cultivation level, but even a Spirit Transformation Tier was fast enough. Thus, he stopped after a few steps, and then dove into the sea, heading downwards.","Boom, endless energy surged out, pure and vast.","Come on then!","Ling Han did not refuse any of it, and began to absorb madly.","There were only three days, so could the Seed of the Holy Flame be completely \"matured\" in that amount of time?","Boom! Endless energy surged into Ling Han’s body and was then absorbed by the Seed of the Holy Flame, and in this process, Ling Han actually didn’t do anything. He only acted as a bridge, pulling the strings between the two of them.","He released his restraints, and absorbed with all his might.","A terrifying scene appeared. Visibly, the water level of this great ocean was actually declining!","It should be known that this great ocean was completely formed from energy essence. The decline in the water level was actually the consumption of the energy essence, and in such a wide ocean, the decline in the water level was actually so obvious, which showed how terrifying Ling Han’s swallowing ability was.","And in his mind, the Seed of the Holy Flame was currently throbbing, ready to \"sprout\" or \"burn\" at any time.","Ling Han didn’t know what would happen, but he believed that once any changes took place, he would definitely be able to ignite the holy flame.","He already had enough Regulations, and was only lacking a little bit of energy.","’Light it up, my holy flame!’","Hong long long, the great ocean howled, forming an endless whirlpool, and the water level was still rapidly receding. The commotion was overwhelmingly great.","This was the Sacred Land, the core area of the Buddhist Race. One could only enter through the Great Emperor Formation, and there was also an old Saint standing guard outside. It could be said that this was one of the safest places in the world.","Who would have thought that an accident would happen here?","Thus, when the water level of the sea had fallen by half, someone finally rushed over. There was not just one, and they were all Saints.","\"What’s going on?\"","\"Why is the Pond of Life’s energy being expended so heavily?\"","\"Has some great change happened?\"","They were stunned, but the energy of the Pond of Life was too colossal. It had turned into a dense mist that rose, greatly affecting the divine sense of the Saints, so they were unable to immediately discover that it was Ling Han who was absorbing the energy.","\"Hurry up and check if anyone has entered the Pond of Life recently.\"","In just an instant, the answer was revealed.","\"Zhang Hanjun?\"","\"Spirit Devouring Physique?\"","\"Even if it’s the Spirit Devouring Physique, after reaching the peak stage of the True Self Tier, it’ll be the end.\"","\"Moreover, even if he starts from the beginning, how cana Spirit Devouring Physique absorb one-ten-thousandth of the energy essence?!\"","All the Saints were confused. This was completely inexplicable.","Right at this moment, the old monk also appeared.","\"Greetings, Buddha Three Miseries!\" When they saw the old monk, the other Saints all paid their respects.","This was a nine-star Saint, a supreme elite that could advance into Pseudo-Emperor at any time.","The old monk nodded. He too looked surprised. Just now, he had gone out for a while, so he had come back a little later. However, he was sure that the only person in the Pond of Life now was Zhang Hanjun.","How could a measly Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator create such a commotion?","\"How could it be!\" He couldn’t help but let out a hiss, \"Buddha Doga is here!\"","Only this great elite knew the Buddhist Race like the back of his hand, and that was why he was able to tread on the Great Emperor formation as if it was flat land, without making a sound.","And it was naturally nothing strange for a Pseudo-Emperor to move and absorb a great amount of the Pond of Life’s energy.","Hearing the words ’Buddha Doga’, the Saints all inhaled sharply.","The Imperial Clan didn’t produce a second Great Emperor. To say nothing of Great Emperors, they didn’t even produce Pseudo-Emperors. It was like a curse.","However, the Buddhist Race had once produced a Pseudo-Emperor, which became the only exception.","Of course, at that time, Buddha Doga and Buddha Ah Han had both become Pseudo-Emperors. However Buddha Ah Han had better luck, or had stronger natural talent, which was why he had advanced another step further, and become a true Great Emperor.","Hence, this kind of example was hard to replicate.","\"The energy of the Pond of Life is still being expended!\" a Saint shouted. The water level was declining far too quickly.","All the Saints were anxious. It should be known that now that the Netherworld was invading, and countless living beings had died, it would be difficult to harvest the power of belief in future.","—If it was not for the fact that this was the Buddhist decree of Ah Han, it was guaranteed that all these Saints would rebel. Wouldn’t that be destroying their own foundations?","Thus, when they saw the Pond of Life being greatly expended, all the Saints were naturally anxious.","\"Hurry up and check out the situation. What on earth is going on?\"","All the Saints moved out. Even if it was really Buddha Doga that had come, they still had to fight. They couldn’t allow others to bully them, right?","Moreover, this was Buddhist Land, which had an Imperial Weapon and an Imperial Formation.","\"Yi!\"","With how fast Saints were, it was not long before they had searched through the Pond of Life, and then located Ling Han.","This!","They could not believe it at all. This was actually the source of everything!","A mere Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator was actually absorbing the energy essence at a terrifying speed.","It should be known that even if it was them doing this, their physical bodies would definitely be crushed by such a colossal amount of energy.","This was accumulated over countless billions of years. Though there had always been a large amount of expenditure, it could not hold up against the Buddhist Race’s continuous expansion of territory, and there was always more profit than expenditure.","As they saw it, this was a suicidal action, but the measly Spirit Transformation Tier below didn’t die, and was still absorbing energy.","\"What kind of freak is this?!\" a Saint exclaimed in astonishment.","\"Could it be that, in this world, there are still mutated Spirit Devouring Physiques that can race madly all the way to the position of Great Emperor?\" another Saint said.","It was impossible for Saints to absorb energy like this. It was simply courting death. Hence, if this \"Spirit Devouring Physique\" was not about to soar to become Emperor, how could it be explained?","\"No matter what it is, we can’t allow him to continue absorbing like this!\" the old monk said. \"Pick him up!\"","\"Yes!\" A Saint nodded, and moved to grab out at Ling Han.","Boom, the large hand spread open, like a mountain."]},{"number":4685,"title":"Chapter 4685: Identity revealed","paragraphs":["Boom, the large hand grabbed out, like a monstrous demonic palm.","Ling Han opened his eyes. At this moment, he finally stopped suppressing his cultivation level, and a terrifying aura surged.","With a flick of his finger, a ray of light shot out, and this large hand immediately crumbled.","He was still lacking a bit before the Seed of the Holy Flame would be satiated.","Thus, he had to stay here for a while longer.","\"What!\" Seeing this scene, all the Saints were stunned.","What was going on here?","Though this Saint that had attacked was not a top-notch Saint, and was only a One Star Saint, wasn’t a Saint awesome enough?","\"Fourth Extreme!\"","\"This guy has become a Venerate!\"","\"Hiss, there really is a mutated Spirit Devouring Physique, whose limits can actually break out of True Self Tier!\"","\"He broke through to Fourth Extreme so quickly!\"","For a moment, these Saints did not doubt Ling Han’s identity. They only thought that his physique had mutated, and he could advance to a higher cultivation level.","\"That’s not right!\" A Saint immediately shook his head, \"Even if his physique has mutated, the Pond of Life has already expended so much energy, yet he has only advanced to the Fourth Extreme?\"","That’s right, this was too illogical.","The Buddha Three Miseries couldn’t help but humph, \"Is now the time to consider these things?\"","True!","Another Saint moved, grabbing out at Ling Han.","He similarly stretched out his hand to grab, but the might of this grab was much stronger. Eight-star Regulations were wrapped around his palm, and there were as many as four of them.","—For those of an Imperial Clan that could become Saints, they must have been Imperial Son or Buddha Son-level in the past. Their battle prowess was naturally terrifying.","Ling Han continued to absorb the energy as he flicked his finger.","Pu, without a doubt, this large hand shattered again.","So what if there were four eight-star Regulations? In front of Ling Han, they were completely insufficient.","Xiu, a figure appeared. It was a young man with an arrogant aura, his features well-defined.","\"Buddha Son!\" Including the Buddha Three Miseries, all the Saints paid their respects to this young man.","It was clear that this young man was only a six-star Saint.","He wasn’t the Buddha Son of this generation, but the personal disciple of Ah Han, the Buddha Son of the ancient times.","Shi Gang!","Shi Gang waved his hand, frowned, and asked, \"What’s going on?\"","Though at his height, the Pond of Life was already ineffective for him, and as long as these billions of years of planning succeeded, the Pond of Life would be even more meaningless, he was still very dissatisfied with the sudden change in circumstances.","It should be known that this was Buddhist Land!","\"Zhang Hanjun, Spirit Devouring Physique?\" He heard the other Saints briefly explain this to him, and a hint of doubt appeared on his face.","With his extensive knowledge, he naturally knew what the Spirit Devouring Physique was. However, what Spirit Devouring Physiquewas so terrifying that it directly absorbed more than half of the ocean-like energy of the Pond of Life?","Furthermore, there was no sign of it stopping at all.","\"Stop him!\" Shi Gang said. No matter what, he couldn’t allow Ling Han to absorb it without any reservations.","\"As you command.\" A Five Star Saint moved, launching an attack at Ling Han.","Previously, Ling Han had easily penetrated the attacks of two Saints in a row. Thus, this time, it was the Five-Star Saint that had directly moved.","He only needed a bit more. Ling Han discovered that the Seed of the Holy Flame seemed to really have a life of its own, and was throbbing.","With a thought, he continued to extract energy as he battled with the five-star Saint.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He controlled his abilities, yet he was still locked in an intense battle with the five-star Saint. It was hard to determine who was stronger between them.","In this way, he could buy time.","Even so, all the Saints were still incredibly stunned.","’F*ck! You’re merely at the Fourth Extreme, yet you’re actually able to block a Five-Star Saint?’","\"It is the fortune of our race; we are about to produce a world-defying prodigy!\" a Saint said in a trembling voice. His voice was filled with emotion.","If this kind of Venerate became a Saint, just how terrifying would his battle prowess be?","Xiu, another figure appeared. Her white skirts fluttered, as if she was a Celestial.","Guo Shuang.","\"You were the one who brought him in?\" Shi Gang immediately shouted at her, his voice slightly high, carrying an accusing tone.","Guo Shuang ignored him, and instead stared at Ling Han.","\"I was talking to you!\" Shi Gang shouted loudly, appearing extremely displeased.","However, Guo Shuangliang still ignored her. Instead, she took a deep breath, and said to Ling Han, \"You’re not Zhang Hanjun, but Ling Han!\"","Unlike the other Saints, who had been cultivating in seclusion in the Buddhist Land, she travelled the world, and knew all the major events that happened in the outside world like the back of her hand.","Throughout history, had there ever appeared a prodigy that could match a Saint when he was only at the Fourth Extreme himself?","There was none!","It was only recently that Ling Han appeared. He was freakish to the extreme. Not only could he match a Saint, he could even defeat a lower level Saint.","How could there be a second prodigy like him in this world?","Thus, this definitely wasn’t Zhang Hanjun, and his true identity had already been revealed.","Ling Han cracked a smile. Finally, there were smart people.","\"That’s right. I am Ling Han.\" With a thought, he had already returned to his original appearance.","Ling Han!","All the Saints were stunned. They had indeed heard of Ling Han’s name. It was said that this boy was incredibly freakish, and when he was a Venerate, he could already match a Saint.","Regarding this kind of legend, they were all doubtful.","How was this possible?","But now that they had witnessed it with their own eyes, they finally knew that the rumors were not false. In fact, they had even underestimated Ling Han.","Being able to match a Five-Star Saint, he was completely capable of defeating all Saints below that level. He was extremely awesome.","Then, they flew into a thunderous rage.","This person actually dared to sneak into Buddhist Land alone and steal the energy essence of the Pond of Life. Just how outrageously bold was he?","Did he still take them seriously?","All of a sudden, all the Saints were filled with killing intent.","\"You’re seeking death!\" The killing intent of the Five-Star Saint was also boiling. Previously, he had only wanted to stop Ling Han, and had no intention of killing him. But now, his mindset had changed.","’Die!’","He used the Imperial Technique, and a Buddha Halo formed behind his head. His hands formed a seal, and then blasted towards Ling Han.","\"Lion Seal!\"","Boom, with the blessing of the power of belief, a total of thirteen eight-star Regulations surged, which was incredibly terrifying.","In fact, he could even battle against some eight-star Saints!","Ling Han let out a battle cry, soared into the skies, and threw a punch.","Peng!","Endless light blossomed, and energy surged. Regulations turned into a shockwave, setting off layers of terrifying waves.","All the Saints were shocked, because in the clash of this blow, Ling Han actually did not fall into a disadvantage.","He had withstood this blow.","Heavens, what kind of freakish Fourth Extreme was this?","However, all the Saints smirked coldly. ’You have come alone, yet there are a great many Saints here. There are also ancient king tiers like Buddha Son and Holy Daughter, and even the Buddha Three Miseries is a nine-star Saint. How are you going to match that?’","Furthermore, there was still an imperial formation outside, so how could you possibly escape?","He was like a turtle in a jar.","\"Ling Han, I have to admit that you are indeed outrageously bold.\" Shi Gang nodded. He did not continue to argue with Guo Shuang, \"However, you are too arrogant. You actually dare to barge into the Buddhist Land. This is an act of courting death.\"","\"Oh?\" Ling Han battled fiercely with that Five Star Saint. Though both sides were more or less equal in terms of power and Regulations, he was clearly stronger.","That was because in terms of power, and the use of Regulations, he was more proficient. Spending 10% of strength could achieve 20% of success, so how could he not be strong?","He was at ease, and could even argue with Shi Gang in the midst of battle."]},{"number":4686,"title":"Chapter 4686: Fighting","paragraphs":["\"I’m right here. Come and beat me to death,\" Ling Han provoked.","In this aspect, he was indeed very talented. Of course, the large black dog was also an absolutely good teacher and friend in this aspect.","Shi Gang sneered, \"There is no need for me to move. Since you have already come here, you still want to leave alive? The consequence of being outrageously bold would be a tragic end!\"","Ling Han shook his head, \"Do you only know how to shoot your mouth off?\"","\"Kill him!\" Shi Gang said coldly. He still disdained from making a move. As the first generation Buddha Son, he was naturally very proud.","\"As you decree!\" The Five-Star Saint nodded, and once again increased his battle prowess, launching a mad barrage of attacks at Ling Han.","Ling Han casually parried, appearing to be completely unconcerned. In truth, a massive change was presently brewing in his mind.","The Seed of the Holy Flame had already absorbed enough energy and entered a temporary hibernation state. Once it exploded, the transformation would be extremely terrifying.","The holy flame would be ignited!","Thus, he wasn’t going all out to battle now. Instead, he was studying how to end this hibernating state as soon as possible.","After all, this was Buddhist Land, where there was an ancient Great Emperor.","Even if Ling Han became a Saint, he could only retreat in the face of a Great Emperor.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The attacks of the five-star Saint became increasingly fierce. This was a battle between a Saint and a Venerate, yet he was actually unable to end the battle even after so long. This was a great humiliation to him.","Thus, he definitely had to get rid of Ling Han as soon as possible.","However, Ling Han had long since walked out on his own path. Furthermore, previously, he had suppressed his cultivation level in battle, so his use of power had improved further, and became truly and extremely meticulous in his use of power.","Thus, even if his power was actually inferior to that Five Star Saint, he was not the slightest bit inferior in this situation.","The longer this battle continued, the uglier Shi Gang’s expression became.","How humiliating!","This was the Buddhist Land. Years ago, Ah Han’s Buddhist might had suppressed the world. Many forces had come deliberately to pay their respects, and which one of them was not incredibly reverent?","Now, however, a measly Fourth Extreme was allowed to act so wantonly here!","\"Could it be that I really have to move personally?\" he asked in displeasure.","The Five-Star Saint’s face flushed red.","He also felt humiliated. However, though Ling Han was at the Fourth Extreme, 99 Seven Star Regulations were entwined around him as he launched his attack. He was extraordinarily powerful, and he was completely capable of matching him. Even if he was boosted by the power of belief, he would only be able to fight him to a tie.","\"Die!\" he roared. He swung his saber again. Boom! The holy flame blazed.","He was forced into desperate straits, and even used the holy flame.","It should be known that the holy flame was the foundation of a Saint. Every time it was used, it would decrease, and once the holy flame was completely exhausted, the cultivation level of the Saint would drop drastically. In future, if he wanted to light up the holy flame again, it was practically impossible for him to return to Saint Tier.","But now, he was really desperate to take Ling Han down, so he had no choice but to use the holy flame.","Of course, it was definite that an amount of the holy flame would be exhausted, but it was impossible that it would be completely exhausted. After all, it was only a single battle.","Now that he had used the holy flame, the situation was completely different.","The might of the holy flame was too terrifying, and its destructive power was incomparably powerful. If one wanted to resist, they could only use their own holy flame to counter.","But where would Ling Han get the holy flame from?","Thus, he could only continuously dodge. Using Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he was still unafraid.","One round, two rounds, and another hundred moves had passed.","Peng!","Ling Han flew upwards. Since his identity had already been exposed, there was naturally no need for him to have any more reservations. He directly shot out from the ground.","All of a sudden, the entire Buddhist Land rumbled and shook.","This was Saint-level battle prowess, and if it was not for the fact that the Buddhist Land was continuously strengthened by the divine power of the Great Emperor, a single strike would be enough to make the entire Buddhist Land crumble.","What was going on?","The people on the surface were completely unaware of the situation, appearing extremely dumbfounded.","Had a battle taken place?","How was this possible?","This was Buddhist Land, and furthermore, it was the Sacred Land at that. Who would dare to be insolent here?","Even the ascetic monks that were cultivating in seclusion in the Buddhist Hall ran out, and raised their heads to look at the skies, revealing expressions of shock.","That was because there really was someone fighting.","\"Who would be so outrageously bold to dare make a move in the Sacred Land?\"","\"Hiss, that’s the Smiling Buddha!\"","\"What, Smiling Buddha who is a Five Star Saint?\"","Everyone was astounded. A Five-Star Saint had moved, and he was actually still unable to obtain victory in the battle?","Who was this opponent?","\"So young!\" a Venerate exclaimed.","\"Heavens, I know who this person is!\"","\"Ling Han!\"","When this name was spoken, it instantly stunned a great many people into dumbfounded shock.","Ling Han was publicly acknowledged as the number one prodigy. If it wasn’t for the fact that his cultivation level was a little low, he would also be the best candidate for becoming Emperor!","\"This guy actually dares to come to our Buddhist Race?\"","\"Humph, does he really think that just because he’s a prodigious freak, he can do as he pleases?\"","\"We are an Imperial Clan!\"","\"Furthermore, our Ancestral Buddha is still alive!\"","After the shock, everyone was furious. This Ling Han was really too condescending.","\"Yi, how did he sneak in?\"","That’s right, everyone was curious again.","It should be known that the Sacred Land was protected by the Great Emperor Formation, and he still managed to barge in?","Have you become a Pseudo-Emperor?","—Even if it was a Pseudo-Emperor, could he really force his way through the Great Emperor formation?","A Saint heard this, and did not want everyone to beautify or exaggerate Ling Han’s strength. Immediately, he revealed the truth.","Oh, everyone finally understood. As it turned out, Ling Han had disguised himself and snuck in quietly.","Others would only admire Ling Han’s courage, but those like Ji Liren and Jia Tailong were directly scared silly.","As it turned out, the person who had been with them all these days was Ling Han.","That strongest prodigy of all eternity?","Heavens, they had actually not been killed.","Thinking about it, they were also a little excited. To actually be able to exchange blows with the strongest prodigy of all eternity, they could brag about it for a few years in future.","They looked at Ling Han, whose battle prowess was fully unleashed. As his flaming wings flapped, his speed was extraordinarily fast. Even the Saint could not catch up to him.","However, no matter how hard Ling Han struggled, he could only circle around within the limited range of the Sacred Land, and could not go out.","Because they had the Great Emperor Formation, even Saints would only die if they barged in forcefully, what more when it was a Fourth Extreme.","\"You’re like a turtle trapped in a jar. What need is there for you to stubbornly resist?\" Shi Gang asked coldly, a strong displeasure in his expression.","It had been so long, yet he was still unable to capture Ling Han. This was humiliating to him, a leader of the Buddhist Race.","Meanwhile, Guo Shuang was curious. She only knew that Ling Han was freakish, but if she had not seen it with her own eyes, she really could not imagine that Ling Han was actually capable of contending against a Saint, and one that was not a low-level Saint either.","However, why had the other party gone to so much effort to enter into the Sacred Land?","She could guess that Ling Han was definitely doing this for the Pond of Life, but what was his purpose for entering the Pond of Life?","Now, two thirds of the energy in the Pond of Life had been directly consumed, which showed how much energy Ling Han had absorbed. The question was, what use did he have for this?","For a peak stage Venerate like Ling Han, the tempering effects of the Pond of Life was already meaningless. Moreover, it would not help him to light up the holy flame, because this was the converted power of belief.","Thus, she was extremely curious, but could not figure it out no matter what.","\"Is there something between you and him that can’t be revealed?\" Shi Gang suddenly targeted Guo Shuang and asked through divine sense."]},{"number":4687,"title":"Chapter 4687: Battling a nine-star Saint","paragraphs":["Guo Shuang ignored him completely.","\"I hit the nail on the head, so you’re speechless?\" Shi Gang gritted his teeth, \"Don’t forget, our betrothal was approved by the Ancestral Buddha!\"","Guo Shuang looked at him coldly, her heart filled with utter disdain.","Speaking of natural talent in martial arts, this Shi Gang was indeed very talented, and was the top prodigy of his generation. Otherwise, he would not have been qualified to be taken as disciple by Buddha Ah Han. However, in terms of magnanimity, this person was too narrow-minded. Thus, she had chosen to have the Ancestral Buddha seal herself in advance because she did not want to take another look at this guy.","But destiny... sigh!","Right at this moment, Ling Han suddenly revealed a smile.","The Seed of the Holy Flame finally ended its hibernation state and underwent a change.","Fine, there was no need for him to waste any more time.","Ling Han stretched out a hand and pressed down. The four pinnacle pillars appeared, and trapped the five-star Saint within.","\"Using the four pinnacle pillars to create a cage?\" The five-star Saint sneered, \"Do you think I’m a Venerate?\"","This was too funny. The four pinnacle pillars could indeed trap people, but would they be effective against Saints?","’Fine, I’ll shatter your pinnacle pillars. Let’s see how you can continue to be a prodigy!’","The five-star Saint condensed the holy flame and shot it toward one of the pillars.","Peng!","His palm struck the pinnalce pillar, and a scene that stunned him appeared. With this palm strike, the four pinnacle pillars were all glowing, but they did not shatter in the slightest.","What!","The Five-Star Saint was so stunned that his scalp was slightly numb. It was one thing for Ling Han to possess a battle prowess that could match him, but even the four pinnacle pillars were so awesome... how could he accept this?","\"Freeze!\" Ling Han said. Weng, the seals on each four pinnacle pillars lit up.","The Five-Star Saint was stunned to discover that he was actually unable to move.","How was this possible?","A dignified Saint was actually trapped by the four pinnacle pillars? Who would believe this?","Others would probably be laughing their heads off.","Seeing this scene, everyone’s eyes widened, and their minds went blank.","This!","Were they dreaming?","Ling Han threw another punch. Peng! The five-star Saint was sent flying, blood spraying through the air.","He smiled faintly, and looked towards Shi Gang, \"Are you prepared to be beaten by me?\"","Shi Gang’s expression was dark. This was practically a slap to his face.","\"Three Miseries, deal with this guy!\" he spat out word by word, his killing intent overflowing.","\"As you decree!\" Buddha Three Miseries recited a Buddhist proclamation. With a single step, he had already arrived in midair, standing face to face with Ling Han.","\"Young man, you had best surrender yourself,\" he said calmly. As a nine-star Saint, he naturally had the pride of a nine-star Saint.","All this while, there had been no Emperor in the world. The nine-star Saint was the absolute overlord, the strongest existence in the world. Naturally, his every word and action would be filled with arrogance.","Ling Han broke into a grin, and put away the four pinnacle pillars. Faced with a nine-star Saint, he did not dare to be careless.","It was extremely likely that his opponent’s battle prowess had surpassed the limit of the four pinnacle pillars. If he really destroyed the four pinnacle pillars, he would definitely cry himself to death.","\"Nine-star Saint?\" Ling Han murmured. \"Come, I want to see how strong you are.\"","\"Young man, you are too arrogant!\" Buddha Three Miseries snorted, and delivered a palm strike towards Ling Han.","This palm strike was clearly light and nonchalant, without the slightest bit of anger, but its might was terrifying without bounds. The whole heaven and earth was responding, and tens of thousands of Dao were illuminated by auspicious red clouds. Buddhist lotuses bloomed everywhere.","When a Saint absorbed Regulations, they could be viewed as the embodiment of heaven and earth, and the Nine-Star Saint had reached the pinnacle.","Amidst the myriad of auspicious clouds, a large hand suddenly swatted out. Its fingers were slender, and its skin was snow-white and lustrous, like fine jade.","However, there were eighteen eight-star Regulations entwined around this large hand.","Eighteen flashes!","Sure enough, those who could become nine-star Saints were definitely prodigies among prodigies.","And this was still because the Buddha Three Miseries hadn’t used the power of belief. Otherwise, his battle prowess would have increased a few more levels.","Ling Han didn’t take it head-on—he wouldn’t be a match if he took it head-on. He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and his figure flew through the air at an indescribably fast speed.","\"Humph!\" Buddha Three Miseries advanced. Though the Sacred Land was not small, it was not big for a Saint. With such a small place, where could you hide?","He began to seal off the space with Regulations, compressing the area that Ling Han could move in.","This was something that only he could do. That was because the strength of the five-star Saint from before was not stronger than Ling Han, so Ling Han was completely capable of breaking through his blockade by force.","However, in the hands of Buddha Three Miseries, the number of Regulations that were used as a seal had reached as many as eighteen, and they were definitely not something that Ling Han could easily destroy.","And with the Saint’s speed, as long as Ling Han was unable to succeed with a single blow, he would be caught up to. If he did not parry, he would die!","Thus, under the control of the Buddha Three Miseries, Ling Han’s range of activity began to shrink bit by bit.","Beneath them, whether it was Saints or others, they all smirked coldly.","Ling Han’s fate had already been decided.","This was the consequence of provoking the Buddhist Race. He would die to atone for his crime.","However, everyone couldn’t help but admire Ling Han’s strength, because he was only at the Fourth Extreme.","\"As expected of the strongest Fourth Extreme in history.\"","\"It’s a shame that he’s going to die in the end.\"","\"Humph, who asked him to be so outrageously bold? He actually dared to come to our Buddhist Race!\"","Shi Gang also smirked coldly. His natural talent in cultivation was extremely high, but he was too narrow-minded, and could not allow anyone’s natural talent to be superior to his.","And now, this publicly acknowledged number one prodigy of all eternity was finally about to disappear.","Very good!","Ling Han’s space of movement became smaller and smaller, but he wasn’t nervous at all.","In his mind, the Seed of the Holy Flame had completely combusted, and his four pinnacle pillars had also automatically fused together, turning into a pillar that connected to the heavens.","The Seed of the Holy Flame was at the top of this pillar. After burning to a certain extent, the four pinnacle pillars were also ignited.","Boom!","An astonishing wave instantly surged out of Ling Han’s body, spreading out in all directions.","\"W-what?!\"","All of a sudden, everyone was stunned.","\"This is the fluctuation of the holy flame!\"","\"This guy is actually going to break through during battle, and advance into Saint Tier!\"","\"Impossible!\"","\"How important is breaking through to Saint Tier? One would need to be extremely cautious. It would not be strange for one to cultivate in seclusion for a few thousand years, so how could one possibly break through in battle?\"","No one believed that Ling Han could break through. This was too exaggerated. Breaking through in battle was really too much of a joke!","\"I know now. This guy is in desperate straits, and has no choice but to take a gamble.\"","\"En, that must be the case!\"","\"Though it is definitely impossible for this guy to succeed, but to avoid any further delays, we had best dispose of him as soon as possible.\"","\"That’s right.\"","Everyone nodded. Though they definitely did not believe that Ling Han could break through during battle, this guy was too freakish. Everyone was afraid of what if.","Buddha Three Miseries no longer hesitated. He chanted a Buddhist chant, and when he delivered another palm strike, boom, there were shockingly 22 eight-star Regulations wrapped around him.","\"An, ma, ne, ba, mi, mo!\" In the heaven and earth, the Buddhist lotuses bloomed everywhere, and there was also the chanting of the Six Characters Bright King Curse. Each character took form, and charged towards Ling Han.","Boom! This palm strike locked down Ling Han’s escape route."]},{"number":4688,"title":"Chapter 4688: Igniting the holy flame","paragraphs":["The larger the surface of the attack, the weaker the power would definitely be. This was inevitable.","Thus, the more elites battled, the less large-scale destructive moves would be used. This was because it would be too easy for their opponents to break through their defenses and easily disperse their attacks.","Unless one’s battle prowess was overwhelming, then so what if they expanded their attack range? Even if their power was dispersed over a larger area, they would still possess the ability to crush their opponents.","Now, Buddha Three Miseries had used the power of belief, and the attacks he delivered had reached the height of 22 eight-star Regulations. This naturally was completely overwhelming.","Moreover, he had already sealed off the entire space. Ling Han would definitely have to face this palm strike head-on.","Taking it head-on?","Wouldn’t that be a path of death?","However, what could he do even if he didn’t face it head-on? Space had already been sealed off, so where could he hide?","Thus, no matter how one looked at it, Ling Han definitely wouldn’t be able to escape from this tribulation.","Everyone nodded. This time, this prodigy of all eternity was finally going to die here.","However, Ling Han was completely unfazed.","At this moment, the Seed of the Holy Flame had already combusted completely, and the four pinnacle pillars had also been ignited. In Ling Han’s eyes, the whole world was completely different.","He saw the eight-star Regulations!","If he didn’t ignite the holy flame, he wouldn’t be able to see the eight-star Regulations. He would only be able to vaguely touch a sliver of it. This also allowed a small number of prodigies to ignite the holy flame with their own power when they were at Fourth Extreme.","However, it was far too difficult for Ling Han to reach this level. He had broken through the limits of Fourth Extreme, and he had even obtained the Seed of the Holy Flame, which he had infused with the intertwining Seven Star Regulations. This was equivalent to an eight-star Regulation.","It was equivalent to him first grasping the battle prowess of Saint Tier, and then igniting the holy flame. Was this something that all the other Saints in the world could compare to?","So... that was the case!","Understanding dawned on Ling Han. The eight-star Regulations instantly intertwined in his mind, as if he had long since grasped it.","At the same time, the millions and millions of living beings in the dimensions inside his body also seemed to be responding. Endless beings were revering him, worshipping him with incense.","Power of belief!","At this moment, the power of belief was no longer untouchable and incomprehensible. Instead, it was truly laid out in front of him.","He stretched out a hand, and multiple Regulations intertwined on his fist. They were not Seven Star Regulations, but rather... Eight Star Regulations!","One, five, ten, fifteen!","Boom, Buddha Three Miseries’ massive palm was already upon him, as if the heaven and earth were collapsing.","His palm strike caused heaven and earth to pale, and brilliance to blaze. Boundless Regulations exploded. So what if he was a Saint? He would still have no choice but to retreat.","Saints were difficult to kill, and that was because they could flee if they were outmatched. If they insisted on fighting head-on, it was guaranteed that they would also die very quickly.","Buddha Three Miseries did not make another move. After suffering such a blow from him, even if Ling Han did not die, he would definitely be severely injured. Next, any Venerate would be able to apprehend Ling Han. If he was to make another move, wouldn’t that be demeaning his own status?","He turned around and strode forward.","\"As expected of Buddha Three Miseries!\"","\"Hehe, when he was young, there was also practically no one in the world that could match him.\"","\"Now, the strongest king tier of all eternity has passed.\"","\"Hmph, this is what happens to those who bite off more than they can chew.\"","Everyone chanted loudly. Since he was already dead, they would not mind expiating Ling Han’s dead soul.","The brilliance that filled the skies withdrew, and the shards of Regulations also returned to the heaven and earth.","Yet a figure appeared amidst the shattered light. He stood proudly, as straight as a spear.","Instantly, everyone could not help but gape, as if they could not believe it at all.","That was... Ling Han!","He actually didn’t die!","Not only had he not died, there was actually not the slightest injury on his body.","Heavens!","No one dared to believe this. Wasn’t this just nonsense?","\"Humph, this brat must have used the Imperial Weapon!\" someone immediately said.","With these words, everyone came to a sudden realization. That’s right. Ling Han had also obtained Empres Qingzhu’s Imperial Weapon, so wasn’t it only natural that the Imperial Weapon would be able to block the attack of a nine-star Saint?","However, the Saints all frowned slightly, because they did not sense Imperial Might.","When the Imperial Weapon was activated, how could Imperial Might not permeate the whole area?","Thus, they suspected that it was extremely likely that Ling Han hadn’t used the Imperial Weapon. However, this confused them even more. If he didn’t use the Imperial Weapon, how could he possibly block the attack of a nine-star Saint?","Ling Han slowly withdrew his fist, then opened his mouth. \"Wa,\" he spat out a mouthful of blood, and the aura all over his body fluctuated endlessly, appearing extremely unstable.","In this strike, he naturally did not use the Imperial Weapon. Thus, it was precisely because of this that his blood boiled, and even his soul was about to be thrown of his mind.","However, he was not shocked, but rather pleased.","Because he had completely relied on his own power to disperse this attack.","It should be known that before this, it was impossible for him to take the attack of a nine-star Saint head-on, what more when it was a Saint who had been further boosted with the power of belief to the point of 22 flashes of eight-star Regulations.","But now, he had withstood it, though this made him feel very terrible.","More importantly, what was it?","His four pinnacle pillars were burning fiercely, causing the number of Regulations he had grasped to continue increasing.","The reason why his eyes were still tightly closed was because he was rapidly improving. With every second that passed, he would be able to capture an additional portion of the eight-star Regulations, which was contained in his body.","Saints possessed Regulations, and it was as if they were manifestations of heaven and earth. It was because of this that they could wield the power of belief. It was also because of this that eight-star Regulations possessed a crushing might.","Sixteen flashes, seventeen flashes, eighteen flashes... this speed wasn’t as exaggerated as it had been at the beginning, and it was still decelerating continuously. However, the number of Regulations in Ling Han’s body was still increasing.","Ahead of him, Buddha Three Miseries also stopped.","He turned around slowly, his eyes fixed on Ling Han, as if he was observing.","\"Half-Saint!\" he spoke up.","With his keen senses as a Nine-Star Saint, he could confirm that Ling Han had already ignited the holy flame. However, the Fourth Extreme pillar had not been completely ignited yet. Thus, he was presently in the state of Half-Saint.","This process could be long or short. Some people did not have enough comprehension, or the power of belief was not enough to support their comprehension. Then, the Fourth Extreme pillar would stop burning, and the holy flame would naturally be extinguished.","However, it did not mean the longer it took to burn, the better it was. On the other hand, the faster the Fourth Extreme pillar was burnt to nothing, the deeper and more thorough one’s grasp of Regulations would be. Only if one’s grasp of Regulations was just barely enough, would it be slow and take a very long time. Furthermore, it was very likely that it would be extinguished midway.","However, no matter what, the burning of the Fourth Extreme pillar would have to continue for about ten days. This was already publicly acknowledged as the fastest record.","Even for Buddha Three Miseries, he had also used seventeen days to incinerate the Fourth Extreme pillar.","\"As expected of the strongest prodigy of all eternity. He actually managed to successfully combust the holy flame under such great pressure, and became a Half-Saint!\" Buddha Three Miseries did not hide his admiration at all, and this caused Shi Gang’s expression to become very ugly — this guy was really narrow-minded.","\"However!\" Buddha Three Miseries suddenly changed the topic, and said, \"No matter what, you’re still only a Half-Saint. It’s still difficult to change your fate.\"","Boom, he controlled his Saint-level power, which blasted towards Ling Han.","—So what if you have the Imperial Weapon? I only have to force you to expend all your power, and the Imperial Weapon would only be a decoration."]},{"number":4689,"title":"Chapter 4689: The Strongest Saint","paragraphs":["Ling Han cracked a smile, and charged forwards fearlessly.","That’s right. At present, he could indeed only be considered a Half Saint. However, his Fourth Extreme pillar was burning at an astonishing speed. At most, it would be completely burnt to nothing in half an hour, and by then, he would be a true Saint.","And even now, his body could accommodate as many as nineteen Regulations. In truth, he had already surpassed Buddha Three Miseries.","Thus, what did he have to fear?","He was no longer concerned about a Nine-Star Saint!","It couldn’t be helped. In the first place, he was freakish, what more when he had a holy flame that was burning with the Seed of the Holy Flame. It should be known that in order to burn this Seed of the Holy Flame, how much energy had he used to nurture it?","If he was not boosted with incredibly awesome battle prowess, could this still be called the Seed of the Holy Flame? Would it still be able to produce the strongest Great Emperor in history?","Ling Han’s excitement soared. He wanted to see just what kind of terrifying battle prowess he could unleash.","’Die!’","He let out a battle cry, and with a shake of his fists, nineteen eight-star Regulations wrapped around him, blasting towards Buddha Three Miseries.","F*ck!","Seeing this scene, everyone was numb with shock.","They all thought that Ling Han had been able to block the attack of Buddha Three Miseries because he had used the Imperial Weapon, but now... they could see it clearly. Where was the Imperial Weapon?","It was just a pair of bare fists.","Heavens, they only wanted to grab their heads and exclaim in shock. What kind of monster was this? He had clearly just advanced into Saint Tier, no, he was still only a Half-Saint, and could already fire out nineteen flashes of Eight Star Regulations.","Even if he had borrowed the power of belief, it was still indescribably terrifying.","Then, when this guy truly advanced into Saint Tier, just how much would his strength increase to?","The process of burning the Fourth Extreme pillar was the process of quickly transforming the accumulated energy into true strength. Thus, with every second that passed, Ling Han’s strength would become slightly stronger.","Which also meant that nineteen flashes of eight-star Regulations was actually not Ling Han’s limit!","Heavens! Heavens! Heavens!","The most terrifying miracle in history was about to happen. He had just advanced into Saint Tier, and he was already capable of matching a Nine-Star Saint.","This was practically, practically...!","Everyone was speechless. This kind of miracle was too shocking, causing their minds to go blank.","Guo Shuang was also stunned. In the past, she had accompanied the Ancestral Buddha by his side. As the personal disciple of Ah Han, she naturally knew just how powerful the Great Emperor was.","However, if Ah Han suppressed his cultivation level, would he be a match for Ling Han if they were both One Star Saints?","She actually had no wish to know this answer!","\"Damn it!\" Shi Gang clenched his fists tightly, his expression slightly twisted.","He was really too narrow-minded. Seeing a freak like Ling Han, he was naturally filled with jealousy.","Buddha Three Miseries was also dazed with shock. The strength and freakishness of this opponent was unimaginable to him.","There was actually such a monster in this world?","How could the heaven and earth allow this?","And this was only a Half-Saint. If this guy became a Nine Star Saint, then wouldn’t he be able to pull down even a Pseudo-Emperor from his pedestal?","Buddha Three Miseries was internally stunned, but his fighting spirit increased madly. As a Nine Star Saint, he would definitely not allow himself to lose to a Half-Saint. Furthermore, this was an important place of the Buddhist Race, and an outsider actually managed to barge in. If he did not suppress this outsider, not only would he be humiliated, this would also be a great humiliation to the entire Buddhist Race.","\"An!\" He used the Six Characters Bright King Curse again. Not only could it suppress the internal demon in one’s heart, it also had an astonishing intimidating effect on the human heart.","Ling Han smiled faintly as he unleashed his murderous aura.","This time, the effects of the barrage of murderous aura were completely different.","Weng, the barrage of murderous aura surged out, and actually turned into a fist that blasted towards the \"An\" character.","This punch was indescribably fast, because it was on the level of divine sense.","Ling Han was also surprised. He himself had not foreseen that after he had advanced into Saint Tier, the barrage of murderous aura would undergo such a change.","Peng, under the strike of the murderous aura, the \"An\" character immediately crumbled, and this fist was completely unaffected, continuing to attack Buddha Three Miseries.","This was too fast. Even a Nine-Star Saint would only be able to dodge three feet away in time, and this fist was comparable to the size of a house. How could he possibly dodge it entirely when he could only dodge a mere three feet away?","With a single strike, the Buddha Three Miseries’ figure instantly slid backwards, retreating a total of over 50km before finally coming to a stop.","But looking at him, he was completely unscathed.","This was natural. The barrage of murderous aura was on the spiritual level, and would not cause any physical damage.","However!","Buddha Three Miseries’ face was as white as a sheet, and even the old skin on his neck was trembling. Even his pupils had shrunk to a point.","From this, it could be seen how terrifying the impact he had sustained was.","After resting for at least three seconds, Buddha Three Miseries took a deep breath, \"Perhaps, you are already the strongest Saint in history.\"","Though Buddha Three Miseries was a Nine Star Saint, he definitely could not represent the strongest Saint in history. But the problem was, he was definitely not too weak either. Otherwise, he would not have been able to become a Nine Star Saint.","Thus, his words naturally carried a lot of weight.","Hearing these words, the whole area was in an uproar.","This guy... was still only a Half-Saint, yet had already been acclaimed as the strongest Saint in history. Was it really that exaggerated?","Shi Gang humphed heavily, appearing very displeased.","This old b@stard, not working hard in battle, he was actually praising his opponent. Did he want to defect to the enemy?","\"However, this is ultimately Buddhist Land!\" Buddha Three Miseries said calmly, \"This is your greatest mistake, and will also cause the calamity of death for you.\"","These words were powerful and resonating, filled with the pride of Buddhist Race.","That’s right, this was Buddhist Land!","Everyone calmed down. No matter how prodigious you were, so what if you were the number one Saint in history? You have already come to the Buddhist Land, and you still want to leave alive?","To say nothing of the fact that the Great Emperor had awakened, as long as the Great Emperor killing formation was activated, it would be able to easily kill Ling Han.","You are merely a trapped beast. Even if you are courageous, it would only be short-lived.","The older one was, the wiser they were. This was a mental attack!","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, \"It’s really a waste of your eloquence that you didn’t become a lobbyist.\"","\"I’m only telling the truth.\" Buddha Three Miseries had already gotten his breath back. He sent out a palm strike, which turned into a massive lotus seat that pressed down on Ling Han.","Ling Han extracted the power of belief from within his body, and instantly, it was seen that there were originally only nineteen streaks of Regulations entwined around his fist, but now, there were shockingly twenty streaks of Regulations.","Yi?","This wasn’t the power of belief directly transforming into Regulations, but rather stimulating some kind of change in heaven and earth, boosting his body.","He didn’t use his full power. He only chose to extract a bit more. The number of Regulations instantly increased to 21, then 22.","At this moment, he was already no weaker than Buddha Three Miseries in terms of Regulations.","Peng!","He threw a punch, and the lotus seat was instantly destroyed.","They were equal in Regulations, so who would be weaker than the other?","F***!","Everyone was dumbfounded. 22 flashes of eight-star Regulations.","Heavens! Heavens! Heavens!","Was this really a Half-Saint?","Buddha Three Miseries was also stunned, then felt a deep sense of powerlessness."]},{"number":4690,"title":"Chapter 4690: Kicked to burst","paragraphs":["A mere Half-Saint actually possessed 22 flashes of eight-star Regulations.","Just how terrifying was this?","This meant that once Ling Han had completely advanced into Saint Tier, his maximum battle prowess would surpass 22 flashes of eight-star Regulations.","Heavens!","Starting from the Spirit Transformation Tier, especially in the Saint Tier, Regulations were too important. It could be said that the comparison of battle prowess could completely be determined by the number of Regulations.","—Aside from a very small number of prodigies who were able to use battle skill and techniques to compensate for their disadvantage in Regulations.","However, it wasn’t as exaggerated as this extent.","If a Half-Saint was already so awesome, then just how strong would Ling Han be when he became a Nine-Star Saint?","Was this the number one prodigy of all eternity?","Buddha Three Miseries revealed a bitter smile. Though he still had a great many ultimate techniques that he had not used yet, he knew that even if he used these ultimate techniques, it would be useless. How many of them could be more powerful than the Six Characters Bright King Curse?","He took a deep breath and closed his eyes. When he opened them again, boom, flames were shockingly burning on his body.","This flame looked very much like a lotus flower, and was as big as a house.","The holy flame!","The nine-star Saint’s holy flame was actually as large as a house.","He even used the holy flame. Buddha Three Miseries was really going all out.","This time, Ling Han didn’t retreat.","Since they were both Saints, what did he have to fear?","However, he didn’t want to use the holy flame.","F***, he had just ignited the holy flame, and it was only the size of a human head. If he were to expend it now, that would really be a great loss.","However, he still had another trick up his sleeve.","Boom! Black flames ignited on his fist.","Destructive Energy!","\"Yi, a black, black holy flame!\"","\"A nine-star Saint!\"","Everyone was stunned. The colour of the holy flame represented one’s cultivation level. Just look at the Buddha Three Miseries’ holy flame; it was as black as ink.","So, Ling Han was a nine-star Saint?","But hadn’t he just broken through?","When they thought that Ling Han was a Nine-Star Saint, everyone instead breathed a sigh of relief. That was because Ling Han wasn’t so freakish anymore.","However, the expressions of the Saints were all grim. They could confirm that this was definitely not the holy flame, but a high-level energy that could make them feel terror.","Buddha Three Miseries had already charged over. After using the holy flame, it was equivalent to him unleashing his full strength and reaching his strongest state.","If his strongest state was still inferior to his opponent, then he would have to resign himself to fate.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Ling Han and Buddha Three Miseries clashed, making everyone want to grab their heads and exclaim in shock.","That was because Ling Han had actually blocked the holy flame.","Heavens!","Just how terrifying was the destructive power of the holy flame? However, it was as if the heavens had placed some restrictions on it. The more the holy flame burned, the less there would be. Thus, unless it was absolutely necessary, no Saint would use it.","However, once it was used, its might would also be world-destroying.","It was said that if a little bit of the holy flame landed on a planet, it could easily destroy a planet.","If it was not for the fact that this was Buddhist Land that had been boosted by the Great Emperor, Buddha Three Miseries wouldn’t dare to act so recklessly at all.","However, Ling Han had blocked it!","This... was it really not the holy flame?","Apart from the holy flame, what other energy could resist the holy flame?","No one dared to believe it, but the truth surpassed all else.","Ling Han aggressively attacked. So what if his opponent was a nine-star Saint? He would still beat him up.","Weng!","He didn’t increase the number of Regulations, suppressing his abilities to the same level as Buddha Three Miseries. Then, he used his murderous aura to attack. Fists of murderous aura continuously appeared out of thin air, blasting towards Buddha Three Miseries.","Although Buddha Three Miseries used the Six Characters Bright King Curse to resist, it was completely no match for the fists of murderous aura.","Thus, this had become his weakness.","Ling Han grabbed onto this weakness, and continued to expand his advantage. The situation could be clearly seen now. Buddha Three Miseries was beginning to fall into a disadvantage, and was becoming more and more passive.","After more than 500 exchanges, Buddha Three Miseries was already unable to attack. He could only defend passively.","This!","If someone had told them beforehand that there was a Half-Saint that could force a Nine-Star Saint into such desperate straits, who would believe it?","However, the bloody truth was right in front of them. They could not believe it, but they had no choice.","Peng!","Ling Han raised his foot and kicked Buddha Three Miseries’ face. The old monk was instantly sent flying.","When he steadied himself, his whole face had caved in, revealing a clear footprint. He opened his mouth and spat out blood, as well as multiple broken teeth.","Though Saints could regrow even their severed limbs, this kind of injury was naturally no big deal, but if they were kicked to the point that their teeth fell out and their face collapsed, how could they still have the face to continue fighting?","\"Wa!\" Buddha Three Miseries was throwing up blood continuously. Firstly, his injuries were indeed very severe, and secondly, he had been angered.","He was a Nine-Star Saint!","Ling Han wagged his finger, and looked towards Shi Gang, \"Little Gang, now, do you want to battle me?\"","Little Gang?","Shi Gang couldn’t help as his face twitched. ’You’ve gone too far!’","He humphed, \"If you are so determined to seek death, then I shall oblige you!\"","The first generation Buddha Son was about to make a move!","Everyone couldn’t help but feel excited. Even if Buddha Three Miseries was a Nine Star Saint, compared to the first Buddha Son... he should still be inferior.","Shi Gang took a step, and was already standing in midair, while a demon-subduing staff appeared in his hand.","This wasn’t the Imperial Weapon, but it wasn’t an ordinary replica of an Imperial Weapon either. Instead, it was a Saint Tool that had been personally forged by Buddha Ah Han and bestowed upon him.","How could the Saint Tool that the Ancestral Buddha had forged be ordinary?","He clenched his fists, and instantly, eighteen eight-star Regulations appeared.","As expected.","Ling Han nodded in understanding. Ordinary Saints would only be able to grasp one more Regulation with every level that they advanced. However, even more powerful Saints would be able to grasp two Regulations. However, this wasn’t something that could be done with every level.","—Even for the Golden Generation, after advancing into Nine Star Saint-level, they could only use 14 to 18 flashes of Eight Star Regulations.","However, the ancient Imperial Son was a different story. Every time they advanced a level in Saint Tier, they would be able to grasp three more Eight Star Regulations.","Ling Han was extremely curious. Then what about Ding Shu and the others?","As he saw it, the Genesis World’s masters were even more naturally talented than the Great Emperors’ children. In that case, it was extremely likely that they could grasp as many as four Regulations.","Of course, he was definitely different. Just look, he had not truly become a Saint, and he could already use nineteen flashes of Eight Star Regulations.","Who asked him to have cultivated every cultivation level to perfection on his way to this point? Add to that the Seed of the Holy Flame, and he had become freakishly powerful.","\"Come!\" Ling Han crooked a finger at Shi Gang.","He really detested this person’s lofty bearing. So what? Did he think an ancient Imperial Son was superior to others?","I’ll beat you to death.","Shi Gang raised the Demon Subduing Staff, and with the surge of divine sense, this Saint Tool was immediately revived.","Weng, weng, weng! The Demon Subduing Staff released a frightening killing intent.","Shi Gang shouted again, and the power of belief surged over, boosting his body. Instantly, the Buddha Halo behind his head shone brilliantly, and the number of Regulations broke through to as many as 22 flashes in a single stroke. Even that Saint Tool also grew greatly in might.","This time, he pushed his battle prowess to the extreme.","\"Die!\" Brandishing the Demon Subduing Staff, he charged over.","A top grade Saint Tool added with his battle prowess that was as high as twenty two stars, just how terrifying was that?"]},{"number":4691,"title":"Chapter 4691: The Imperial Weapon appears","paragraphs":["Ling Han smiled, and brandished his fist towards the Demon Subduing Staff.","Peng!","The light of Regulations burst from his fist, firmly blocking this blow.","This!","Everyone was speechless with shock. This was too ridiculous; taking a Saint Tool head-on with bare hands?","Just what kind of freak are you?","That’s right. It may be true that one could be strong in terms of battle prowess, but taking on a Saint Tool with one’s bare hands would depend on the strength of one’s physique.","Thus, being strong in battle prowess did not mean that one’s physique was strong. These were two different matters.","However, Ling Han had already demonstrated to them what a true freak was.","\"Hehe!\" Ling Han bared his teeth in a grin. He swung his fist again, and struck out at Shi Gang.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","His hands were the strongest Saintly Material in the world, and each of his strikes greeted the Saint Tool head-on. He did not show the slightest bit of weakness.","Moreover, his strength was still increasing.","The Fourth Extreme pillar was burning fiercely. With every bit burned, the Regulations that Ling Han had grasped would increase slightly.","Twenty flashes! Twenty one flashes! Twenty two flashes!","There was less than one-tenth of the Fourth Extreme pillar remaining. Ling Han had a feeling that when the Fourth Extreme pillar was completely burnt, the Regulations he had grasped would reach around 25.","Twenty-five flashes.","What kind of terrifying number was this? If someone like Buddha Three Miseries knew about this, he would definitely despair.","\"Ling Han, you’re dead!\" Shi Gang said balefully. Did he think this was his full battle prowess?","Wrong!","\"Vajra Subduing Demon Formation!\" he exclaimed lightly.","All of a sudden, the Saints in the surroundings began to chant Buddhist chants. They formed seals at the same time, and struck out at Shi Gang.","Shockingly, the aura that Shi Gang Gang released actually became slightly stronger.","Ling Han immediately understood. Every Saint was funneling power into Shi Gang, allowing him to gain strength that surpassed his cultivation level for a short period of time.","\"Ignorant brat, die!\" Shi Gang threw a heavy punch, and there were shockingly 25 flashes of Regulations entwined around his fist.","It should be known that his battle prowess limit had only been 22 streaks of Regulations.","An increase of three eight-star Regulations in one go was practically terrifying.","Yet Ling Han smiled, and similarly shot out a punch.","This time, he didn’t hold back anymore. Not only did he unleash the 22 Regulations in his body, but he even activated the power of belief to the extreme. There were as many as 27 eight-star Regulations wrapped around his fists.","Heavens!","Shi Gang’s expression instantly became one of utter terror, as well as shock and disbelief.","27 flashes!","How was this possible?","Peng!","Their fists collided. Power collided, and Regulations also collided.","Then, Shi Gang was sent flying. Cracks immediately appeared on his skin, and blood gushed out.","The spectators couldn’t believe their own eyes. It could be said that Shi Gang had used all the trump cards that he could use—the power of belief, the Saint Tool, the formation techniques, but?","He was actually still outmatched.","The greatest prodigy of all eternity, this was the greatest prodigy of all eternity.","Ling Han smiled, \"I said I would beat you up, and you still don’t believe me?\"","He set off in hot pursuit, throwing punch after punch.","Under the crushing pressure of battle prowess, who would be able to turn the tables in his hands?","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Shi Gang instantly became a punching bag, and Ling Han pummeled him madly.","Below them, everyone was speechless.","Shi Gang was the top elite of their Buddhist Land. Of course, Buddha Ah Han definitely couldn’t be counted in, but now, their top elite was being thrashed by Ling Han, unable to fight back at all.","This was too humiliating.","Every time Ling Han threw a punch, the entire Buddhist Race would lose a little face.","This was a great humiliation, something that had never been experienced in all of history!","As a member of an Imperial Clan, they had always been the ones to rule the world. Now, however, they were being bullied right on their doorstep.","Was this still the Imperial Clan?","\"Enough!\" Guo Shuang stepped into the air, and shouted coldly at Ling Han.","Though she did not like Shi Gang, no matter what, they were both on the same side now, and Ling Han was an outsider through and through.","Ling Han stopped, looked towards Guo Shuang, and asked calmly, \"Does Miss Guo also want to battle me?\"","Shi Gang finally breathed a sigh of relief. His expression was twisted. With his narrow-mindedness, how could he swallow this anger?","Furthermore, the moment Guo Shuang opened her mouth, Ling Han immediately stopped. Was there some unspeakable relationship between the two of them?","All of a sudden, he felt as if he had been cuckolded.","\"That’s my intention.\" Guo Shuang brandished her sword. The sword was three feet long, and it was almost transparent, as if it was made of crystal.","With a casual kick, Ling Han sent Shi Gang flying, directly facing Guo Shuang.","Previously, he had already felt that Guo Shuang gave him an unfathomable feeling, and considered her a strong rival. Of course, he was already a Half-Saint now, and was just a little bit away from becoming a true Saint. His abilities had soared, and Guo Shuang could no longer pose a threat to him.","Shi Gang rolled into the distance. His expression was twisted, and there was a murderous glint in his eyes.","However, his abilities were inferior, so what could he do no matter how furious he was?","Guo Shuang let out a soft exclamation, and brandished her sword in a slash.","Shua, the sword light surged 30,000 meters, incredibly terrifying.","Yi?","Ling Han was astonished. This Guo Shuang was actually a Seven Star Saint!","The sword light slashed over. There were shockingly 21 flashes of Regulations, and this was still without using the power of belief. Otherwise, the battle prowess would be even more terrifying.","However, compared to Ling Han, she was still slightly inferior.","Even if Ling Han didn’t use the power of belief, he could still blast out 22 streaks of Regulations. Even though there was only one additional streak, in a clash of elites, could one afford the difference of one streak?","Moreover, Ling Han was already capable of defeating a stronger opponent as a weaker opponent. Now that he was still the stronger party, how could a weaker opponent possibly turn the tables?","Of course, that was impossible.","Under Ling Han’s powerful suppression, Guo Shuang was at a complete disadvantage, and this was under the condition that Ling Han didn’t use any powerful moves at all.","With a thought, boom, the barrage of murderous aura surged out, turning into a fist that ruthlessly blasted towards Guo Shuang.","\"Spiritual Power attack? Humph!\" Guo Shuang was completely unafraid. She had a precious tool that had been personally forged by a Great Emperor, and could be immune to all negative effects.","However, when the punch landed, she retreated rapidly, and then her face became incredibly pale. At the same time, she was also incredibly stunned.","She had actually been hit!","How was this possible?","She had a precious tool that had been personally refined by the Great Emperor, and could be immune to all attacks of Spiritual Power.","Meanwhile, Ling Han broke into a grin. After he had advanced into Saint Tier, his Spiritual Power attack had also improved further. More importantly, there was still a sliver of the might of the Seed of the Holy Flame within.","This was obtained from the great fissure at the edge of the universe, and could even allow one to become the strongest Great Emperor!","Even Empress Qingzhu had died because of this, so how could it not be awesome?","Hence, even the precious tool of a Great Emperor would not be able to block it.","Of course, this was unless the Great Emperor made a move himself.","Ling Han stood proudly. This was clearly the territory of the Buddhist Race, yet he was like a ruler, looking down on the heavens.","This infuriated the Buddhist Land elites. This was far too detestable!","Who would deal with him?","It didn’t matter who it was, as long as they could deal with him. Otherwise, what face would the Buddhist Race have?","Weng!","Right at this moment, a majestic light shot into the skies, then rapidly soared in their direction.","This speed was astonishingly fast, but when the light arrived, it came to an abrupt stop.","Demon Subduing Staff.","It wasn’t a replica, but the genuine Imperial Weapon!"]},{"number":4692,"title":"Chapter 4692: Saint Tier, Ling Han!","paragraphs":["The Demon Subduing Staff was in midair. There was clearly no one controlling it, yet it was exuding an aura of Imperial Might.","The Imperial Weapon... had awakened!","Everyone was stunned. There was clearly no one wielding it, so why had the Imperial Weapon awakened?","This was impossible.","It should be known that resuscitating the Imperial Weapon needed a great amount of spiritual power and mystical power. Even a Saint would not be able to last very long. For someone as strong as a Nine-Star Saint, being able to last for ten minutes was already awesome enough.","But now?","The Imperial Weapon awakened on its own, as if it had a life of its own.","But it was only an instant, and realization dawned on them.","Ancestral Buddha!","Buddha Ah Han had revived. Perhaps, it was only a sliver of willpower. Thus, he did not move personally. However, he had revived the Imperial Weapon to kill Ling Han.","Haha, this time, Ling Han would definitely be dead.","The Imperial Weapon had awakened. Moreover, it had been awakened by the Great Emperor, so there was definitely no time limit to how long it could be used. In that case, who in the world could stop it?","Even a Pseudo-Emperor couldn’t do it.","The revived Imperial Weapon was equivalent to a Great Emperor. Aside from another Great Emperor, who could resist it?","How was Ling Han going to resolve this crisis?","Ling Han merely smiled faintly, \"Who would’ve thought? I’m quite a respected person. Even Buddha Ah Han personally made a move!\"","Weng, the Demon Subduing Staff shone brightly, its might awe-inspiring.","This was the Imperial Weapon, the most powerful weapon in the world. It could easily kill Saints.","No matter what kind of Saint it was, clashing head-on with the Imperial Weapon would only lead to death.","A Great Emperor was superior to the Nine Heavens, and could not be offended.","\"How dare you! You actually dare to blaspheme the Ancestral Buddha?!\" everyone shouted. They all wore furious expressions.","In their eyes, Ah Han was like a god.","Ling Han cracked a smile. In his mind, the last segment of the Fourth Extreme pillar had also been burnt to nothing. He had also officially advanced into Saint Tier.","A One Star Saint.","Those who possessed Regulations were Saints.","However, Regulations belonged to the heaven and earth, so how could they be absorbed into one’s body?","Ling Han discovered that a part of his body had lost vitality, as if he had been assimilated by the heaven and earth.","He instantly came to a realization. Saint Tier wasn’t the true name of this cultivation level. Instead, it was called Silent Destruction Tier.","Only by assimilating with the heaven and earth could he accommodate the Regulations.","Hence, Saints were called Silent Destruction Tier elites. This was a process of slowly allowing oneself to perish.","While he was lost in thought, the Demon Subduing Staff had already shot over, bringing with it a supreme imperial might. It was really capable of killing gods and demons.","As the attack swept out, a hole was forcefully blasted into the skies. Imperial might blazed, and spread far and wide.","Everyone revealed a smile. This time, Ling Han was definitely going to die.","The Imperial Weapon launched a barrage of attacks. So what if you are the strongest prodigy of all eternity?","However, when the light completely dispersed, Ling Han was still standing proudly, but there was a bamboo sword hanging above his head.","Clear Bamboo Sword, Imperial Weapon!","It could not be helped. The Imperial Weapon had already unleashed its might, and only another Imperial Weapon could stand against it. Otherwise, only a Great Emperor could be mobilized.","He hadn’t died yet!","Everyone was speechless. Why was Ling Han so hard to kill?","However, Ling Han didn’t linger in battle any longer. He grabbed the Clear Bamboo Sword, and using the Imperial Weapon as his blade, he directly charged towards the outskirts of the Sacred Land.","Great Emperor formation?","With the Imperial Weapon protecting him, he could even barge through the Imperial Formation.","Ling Han didn’t want to continue battling with the Demon Subduing Staff.","Although his battle prowess was heaven-defying, he was only a One Star Saint, after all. He couldn’t maintain the recovery of the Imperial Weapon forever.","Thus, it was time for him to retreat.","After all, even the Great Emperor had made a move, though it was only an attack from the Imperial Weapon.","Behind him, the Demon Subduing Staff was presently catching up.","Pu!","The Clear Bamboo Sword barged into the Great Emperor formation. Endless imperial might spread out, forming a fierce collision.","The Great Emperor killing formation was indeed powerful, but the Imperial Weapon wasn’t to be trifled with either. It exuded light that surrounded Ling Han, allowing him to charge forward madly.","Shua, he broke through the blockade of the Imperial Formation, and charged out of the Sacred Land.","He no longer hesitated, tearing open space with both hands, and stepped in.","Boom!","The Demon Subduing Staff arrived, blasting open the Void, forming a powerful shockwave that set off in pursuit of Ling Han.","Ling Han humphed, and brandished the Clear Bamboo Sword in a slash.","Shua, a flash of sword light lit up, illuminating even the Void.","Peng, the strike of the Demon Subduing Staff was instantly dispersed.","Ling Han stopped in his tracks. Right now, he had to return to the Four Origin Planet. However, the Four Origin Planet wasn’t motionless. Instead, it was constantly being pushed by the formation toward the edge of the universe.","Thus, he needed to locate it first.","Yi?","To his shock, he discovered that after becoming a Saint, he had absorbed Regulations. It was as if the entire universe had become one with him. No matter how far away it was, he would be able to sense it very quickly.","It was as if there were multiple veins growing in the universe.","Of course, it would not be possible for him to go any further. This could only be limited to areas where there were planets.","Ling Han quickly located the location of Four Origin Planet. He then started to hurry, and in just half a day, he came out of the Void and landed on the Four Origin Planet.","There was a hint of a smile at the corners of his lips. He had finally returned as a Saint.","\"Ling Han!\"","When he appeared, the empress, Hu Niu, and the others all rushed over.","Although he hadn’t left for long this time, he had snuck into the Buddhist Land this time. How dangerous was it?","This naturally caused everyone to worry.","Now that Ling Han had returned safely, everyone was naturally relieved and extremely happy.","Very soon, everyone asked about Ling Han’s experiences, whether he had become a Saint and other questions.","After a while, they burst into laughter.","Ling Han had become a Saint.","\"Little Han, have you finally become a Saint?\" the large black dog called out.","Ling Han nodded, \"Finally!\"","For this day, he had really, really waited too long.","Right now, the large black dog, Brother Monkey, and the others had all become Two-Star Saints. Meanwhile, Ling Han had finally become a Saint after much anticipation and waiting.","It should be known that it would take tens of millions of years for a Saint to advance to the next level.","But now, all the waiting was worth it. The Saint that Ling Han had become was really, really too strong.","\"Little Han, how powerful is a Saint like you?\" the little azure dragon asked curiously. He had always had a wish to defeat Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Come, give it a try!\"","He stepped into space, waiting for the little azure dragon to come up for a battle.","The little azure dragon naturally wouldn’t cower. It immediately charged into space and launched an attack at Ling Han.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han casually parried. The little azure dragon was indeed extraordinary, but compared with Ling Han, it was still far inferior. So what if it was a Two Star Saint? The gap between them was extraordinarily large.","After blocking over a hundred moves, Ling Han finally moved. He shot out a punch, and peng, the little azure dragon was instantly sent flying.","The battle had ended.","The little azure dragon bared its teeth as it ran back, and asked, \"Little Han, how much battle prowess did you use in this attack?\"","Ling Han pondered for a moment before replying, \"30%, maybe.\"","In reality, he hadn’t even unleashed 1% of his full strength. However, in order to prevent the little azure dragon from being hit too hard, he told a white lie.","\"Alright, I’ll definitely defeat you!\" The little azure dragon’s fighting spirit was ignited.","Meanwhile, the large black dog glanced at him sympathetically. With his understanding of Ling Han, he naturally knew that Ling Han was comforting the little azure dragon.","Just wait to be defeated with every challenge you issue."]},{"number":4693,"title":"Chapter 4693: Great trend","paragraphs":["Ling Han had returned, and he had also become a Saint. Four Origin Planet instantly had a stabilizing force.","However, even though he had been away for a long time, Ling Han still had no way to find out what was going on in the universe at this moment. He had no idea how far the invasion of the Netherworld had progressed, and he had no idea how great the losses of the Living Realm were.","If he wanted to obtain any information now, the Saint could only personally investigate himself. Firstly, it would be faster, and secondly, it would also be safe if he was strong enough. He could leave as he liked.","However, the Saint’s speed could only be limited to between two points. With how wide the universe was, it would be difficult for Saints to set foot on every point.","Hence, everyone’s news was very limited at present.","From this aspect, the existence of the Chang Clan was really too important. The moment they rebelled, it was equivalent to turning everyone blind and deaf.","After Ling Han became a Saint, he became incredibly sensitive to changes in heaven and earth.","Taking in Regulations was actually, from a certain aspect, annihilating oneself, and assimilating with the heaven and earth.","Thus, when heaven and earth changed, he would naturally become very sensitive to it.","Ling Han discovered that the foundation stone of Regulations was on the verge of collapse.","This was extremely terrifying. If the Regulations collapsed, would the entire universe suddenly explode? Or would some super energy storm happen, engulfing everything and destroying everything?","Why was it like this?","Of course, it was because of the invasion of the Yin souls, causing the two Realms to forcibly merge.","These two Realms were originally on opposing sides, and were incompatible with each other, yet now that they had been forcefully fused, it was natural that they would clash strongly with the Regulations of the present.","Though the Regulations were strong, they had been born from the power of heaven and earth. Now, even the power of heaven and earth was about to be destroyed, so what was left of the Regulations?","Ling Han frowned at this. Who would benefit from this?","Could it be that those ancient Great Emperors wanted to destroy the universe?","Weren’t they demanding immortality? What benefits would destroying the universe bring them?","This was something that he could not understand at all. Furthermore, those Imperial Sons would definitely know about this kind of change, and even Saints could sense it, so why would they still be willing to do it?","Without the skin, where would the fur <anno data-annotation-id=\"b3d82490-23fb-478d-8282-f48d42b63a41\" data-title=\"go\">go 1 </anno>?","Ling Han shook his head. This should be the greatest secret of the ancient Great Emperors, right?","Improve his strength!","Only if one had enough abilities, would they be able to participate in this battle of the great era. Otherwise, they would only be cannon fodder, dying in the storm of destruction.","After advancing into Saint Tier, Ling Han’s rate of improvement became even faster.","When he was at the Fourth Extreme, even if Ling Han had all kinds of Regulations and comprehension ability, he was limited by Celestial Qi, so he could only advance bit by bit. However, after entering into Saint Tier, the only thing that was important was comprehension of cultivation level.","Silent Destruction Tier was to allow one’s body to die, and be assimilated with the heaven and earth.","Ling Han soon pushed his body to its limits, accommodating a total of 25 eight-star Regulations. If he wanted to accommodate even more Regulations, there was only one way, and that was to break through his limits.","In other words, he was already at the peak stage of One Star Saint.","It couldn’t be helped. He had accumulated too much power, and that was why he burst it out in a single stroke. He had just broken through, and had already leaped to the peak stage.","The nine levels of Saint Tier was the process of breaking through one’s limits, step by step.","Realization dawned on Ling Han. No wonder there were so few high-level Saints.","In truth, Saints could completely disregard their own cultivation level, because every step they took was breaking through their limits.","Ling Han frowned. Step by step, Silent Destruction Tier cultivators were being assimilated with heaven and earth, so how could they become Emperor?","As a Great Emperor, he was superior to the Regulations, but assimilating with the heaven and earth, and absorbing the Regulations in his body, how could he achieve this step?","For others, becoming a Saint was their ultimate goal. However, Ling Han’s ambition was to become a Great Emperor, so he had to prepare for the worst.","\"The so-called rebuilding after destruction?\"","Ling Han murmured to himself. Every step of Silent Destruction Tier was equivalent to losing oneself. It was clear that his abilities had improved, but in essence, he was actually falling, becoming a slave of heaven and earth.","Thus, after reaching the pinnacle level, he would break through the shackles and rise from the dead?","Ling Han was still far from reaching the level of a nine-star Saint, so he could only guess at this moment.","\"However, it has always been the case that the Great Emperor would advance from One Star Saint to Nine Star Saint, then become Pseudo-Emperor, and finally complete that leap, becoming the strongest of an era.\"","\"Thus, Saint Tier is a path that one has to pass through.\"","\"Then I can only take it one step at a time and wait and see.\"","Ling Han tossed all his doubts aside. He first calmed himself down, and adjusted his condition. Next, he would have to break through his limits, and become a Two Star Saint. This would need a considerable amount of time to stabilize his cultivation.","In Silent Destruction Tier, it was no big deal to spend tens of thousands of years to advance one minor level.","In truth, the majority of Saints had only been stuck for so long because they wanted to break through their limits.","No one could help him with this step, not even a Great Emperor.","He could only depend on himself.","True, now that they had reached this step, they had absorbed Regulations, and assimilated with the heaven and earth. If others interfered, it would be equivalent to making an enemy of the heaven and earth.","Of course, even the Great Emperor couldn’t do it. Otherwise, how could the Great Emperor die?","Even for those like the Lords of Death, didn’t they all hide themselves? They must have been limited by heaven and earth, or they would have long since come out and barged around.","Was a Great Emperor not awesome enough?","Faced with this kind of barrier, Ling Han was also trapped. It was impossible for him to break through in the short term.","There was no rush. Ling Han could only slowly accumulate power, and when he reached a limit, he would charge forwards.","This was the only way.","He did not stay idle either, and travelled all over the universe. Firstly, he wanted to see how Ding Shu and the others were doing, and secondly, he also wanted to get to know the great trends of the world.","Ding Shu and the other Genesis World Rulers were all fine, and they had all reached the level of three or four stars. Even though the distance between them was not very wide, if Ling Han wanted to catch up to them, it was very likely that he would need hundreds of years.","After all, he had spent too much time breaking through his limits when he had been at the level of Sect Master and Venerate Tier. Furthermore, he had also spent a lot of additional time to light up the holy flame.","In terms of comprehension ability, the Genesis World’s rulers were all heaven-defying freaks.","Thus, if Ling Han wanted to catch up to them, he would probably have to wait until he reached the level of Pseudo-Emperor, or when he obtained some supremely precious herb that could accelerate his speed to break through the limits of his body.","There were Great Herbs like this, but there were pitifully few of them. They would be fought over madly by Saints.","The ancient Imperial Sons also improved rapidly. When they were sealed, they were already Saints, and when they were sealed, their divine sense could also channel to a limited extent, which was equivalent to constantly appreciating heaven and earth.","Thus, after they were unsealed, their rate of advancement was frighteningly fast.","The strongest ancient Imperial Son was already a six-star Saint. In comparison, the Golden Generation Imperial Sons were far inferior. By now, no one spoke of them, and their brilliance had long since been concealed.","Now, it was publicly acknowledged that the candidates that could possibly become Emperor were the ancient Imperial Sons, as well as Ling Han, Ding Shu and the other Genesis World Rulers.","Some people were very optimistic about Ling Han, and bestowed him the title of savior. After all, he was publicly acknowledged as the strongest king tier of all eternity. However, there were also some people that thought that his cultivation level had improved too slowly, and had already been left far behind in terms of cultivation level. Clearly, heaven and earth were not optimistic about him.","—To become Emperor, he definitely had to obtain the blessing of heaven and earth.","Thus, the ancient Imperial Sons were the most favored candidates. After all, the ancient Imperial Sons all had the bloodline of a Great Emperor. Furthermore, this era was too different, and it was very likely that the curse of the Imperial Clan being unable to produce a second Great Emperor would be broken.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">This refers to the loss of crucial foundations.</annotations>"]},{"number":4694,"title":"Chapter 4694: Attack of the Skeleton Saint Tool","paragraphs":["Ling Han didn’t care what others said.","He charged into the Yin soul army, and began a massacre.","At present, what did he have to fear?","Boom!","He barged around, completely outmatched.","Previously, when he had still been a Venerate Tier, he had practically been able to sweep aside Yin souls. He had only been afraid of the Skeleton Saint Tool. Now that he had become a Saint, his fighting spirit was naturally blazing, and he wanted to battle the Skeleton Saint Tool.","The others were all mediocre, and did not garner his interest to battle at all.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He was extremely casual. Sometimes he would throw punches, sometimes he would kick, and sometimes he would use the murderous aura to attack, but no matter what, with a single strike, thousands of Yin souls would be killed by him.","This was a completely one-sided battle. In fact, even the Yin Saint didn’t dare to step forward.","Even without using Destructive Energy, killing the Yin Saint would be child’s play for Ling Han now.","In the past, he would change locations with every strike, fearing that he would be targeted by the Netherworld, who would lay out an inescapable net to besiege and kill him. Now, he was completely unafraid.","Who cares who comes? Worse come to worst, I’ll use the Imperial Weapon to tear a hole, and completely leave calmly.","He killed for seven consecutive days, killing all the enemies in the surrounding dozen over galaxies. There was not a single Yin soul left, and further away, the dozen over Yin Saints were all looking at him coldly, shock visible in their empty eyes.","They had never seen such battle prowess before.","Ling Han looked at these Yin Saints, and said calmly, \"Why did you guys invade the Living Realm? If anyone can tell me the reason, I can spare his life!\"","Though there were more than a dozen galaxies separating them, his divine sense was too strong, and easily transmitted this message to every Yin Saint.","Yin souls didn’t have a physical body; it was just a soul.","These Yin Saints were all cold, completely unmoved.","\"Since that is the case, then you all shall surrender your lives!\" Ling Han took a step forwards, and Phoenix Wings Divine Flight spread out. A pair of flaming wings blotted out the skies and covered the earth. They were actually even larger than a galaxy. With a light flap, he had already appeared in front of the Yin Saints.","’Holy f*ck! How is he so quick?!’","These Yin Saints were all shocked. Previously, Ling Han had swept through the desolate lands, but he had never used this kind of extreme speed, causing them to be extremely passive.","Peng!","Ling Han shot out a punch, and the power of his fist turned into a streak of light that blasted towards a Yin Saint. As high as 25 flashes of eight-star Regulations were fused within, and this was without using the power of belief. Otherwise, Ling Han’s current limit was 30 flashes of eight-star Regulations.","It could be said that even if the ancient Imperial Sons had reached the level of nine-star Saint, then if they used the power of belief, the number of Regulations would only be equal to Ling Han’s.","In a situation when their cultivation levels were equal, who wouldn’t be trampled under Ling Han’s feet?","Unless it was Ding Shu and the other Genesis World Rulers, they were definitely more freakish than the ancient Imperial Sons. However, they were only two or three minor levels above Ling Han, and without an absolute lead, they were still no match for Ling Han.","It could be said that Ling Han was indeed the strongest Saint in the world. This was not an exaggeration in the slightest.","The fist of light struck, its speed indescribably fast. That Yin Saint didn’t even have the time to dodge, and could only be forced to parry.","However, his resistance was like a mantis trying to stop a chariot, completely meaningless.","A brilliant light burst forth, and the fist of light crushed down. That Yin Saint was instantly turned into ash.","Ling Han could feel that the heaven and earth had rewarded him, slightly improving his life force.","—Now, even the reward for killing the Yin Saint was so measly?","Ling Han shook his head, but even so, it did not affect his determination to kill Yin souls.","Since he had already become a Saint, he would kill Yin souls until they trembled in fear — if they still had the courage and heart.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","He threw a casual punch, but the fist light was like a shooting star, indescribably fast, forcing the Yin Saint to have no choice but to take it head-on, and the result of taking it head-on would be having both his form and spirit destroyed.","This was the might of the strongest Saint.","The Yin Saints were all terrified. They hurriedly turned around and fled.","It was difficult to kill Saints, because they could still flee if they were no match. This was also applicable to Yin Saints.","However, don’t forget that Ling Han had grasped the fastest movement technique in the world.","With a flap of his fiery wings, he had already caught up to a Yin Saint. With a punch, peng, this Yin Saint was instantly blown up.","What Saint? In front of him, they were practically trash.","If there was still Galaxy Network at this time, and someone was broadcasting live, then the whole universe would be in an uproar.","This was far too powerful! Was this really a Saint?","To definitely be capable of killing a Saint if he wanted to, this was practically a Pseudo-Emperor.","However, the Saints were indeed very fast. Even if they were all inferior to Ling Han, with this delay, the other Yin Saints had long since fled without a trace. Even if he wanted to give chase, he did not know where to start.","It didn’t matter.","Ling Han continued to advance, and continued to sweep through the enemy ranks.","After conquering over a hundred galaxies, he arrived in front of an extinguished sun.","The first step to transform the Living Realm into the Netherworld was to extinguish the sun, and if Ling Han wanted to revive the Living Realm, the first step would also be to reignite the sun.","This was the flame of life.","\"Burn.\" Ling Han injected power into the sun, but this sun was lifeless, and showed no signs of burning again.","’Hmm?’","Ling Han humphed, and channelled the Heavenly Dao Flames again. This time, it was different. There were veined patterns glowing on the surface of the sun, as if lava was surging underneath.","Boom, the whole sun suddenly began to burn fiercely, exuding endless brilliance in the dark universe.","Ling Han smiled. Though this was like a solitary light in the boundless darkness, it was a light filled with hope, like a totem.","This marked the first step for him to recover the lost territory of the Living Realm.","\"Once I leave, the Netherworld will definitely make a comeback and destroy the sun again.\"","\"Thus!\"","Ling Han smiled, and walked into the sun.","If the sun exploded, then even Saints would have to retreat. If they were directly hit, even if they did not die, they would be crippled.","However, it was not a big deal to just walk into the sun.","He made arrangements, then walked out, and continued to reignite the other suns.","As long as the sun burned brightly, every galaxy would slowly recover its vitality, and the darkness... would eventually recede.","One, two, three, more and more suns lit up, causing this galaxy to no longer be dark.","All of a sudden, Ling Han felt a terrifying aura approaching.","He stopped, and looked towards the dark space.","A colossal creature was approaching at an incredibly fast speed. In only an instant, \"he\" had already stopped thirty thousand meters in front of Ling Han. His body was completely made up of white bone, exuding a terrifying aura.","The Skeleton Saint Tool!","Finally, the Netherworld unleashed their most powerful attacks.","Ling Han smiled faintly. Very good, the Skeleton Saint Tool had finally arrived.","Boom!","The Skeleton Saint Tool didn’t have any emotions, and it wouldn’t speak any words of coercion. It immediately lashed out, unleashing a palm strike that unleashed a devastating aura toward Ling Han.","This was practically a Saint Tool, and it was not just one Saint Tool at that. Instead, it was the combination of over a hundred Saint Tools. Just how terrifying was that?"]},{"number":4695,"title":"Chapter 4695: Resistance","paragraphs":["In the past, Ling Han would have immediately fled upon seeing the Skeleton Saint Tool.","To say nothing of him, even the Nine-Star Saint was no exception to this rule. Fighting head-on against such an existence would be seeking death.","With over a hundred Saint Tools attacking him at the same time, who in the world would be able to stop them?","No matter what, it had to be a Pseudo-Emperor.","But now, Ling Han was itching to give it a try.","Would he... be able to match this?","With a soft exclamation, he went all out, extracting the power of belief and turning it into his strongest punch.","Boom!","He threw a punch, which clashed with the Skeleton Saint Tool.","The moment they came into contact, Ling Han felt a terrifying power surge over, and he was directly sent flying. Meanwhile, countless blades of Regulations slashed over, wanting to blast him into smithereens.","In the past, it wasn’t that he hadn’t parried a move before, but he had only parried it from afar. There was also the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to reduce its destructive power, but now, he was completely on his own.","He retreated explosively for more than 5,000 km, and the might of this blow finally surged past him.","Ling Han bared his teeth. A great many bloody marks had been left on his body, but thankfully, he had not sustained any serious injuries. It did not affect his battle prowess at all.","On the other hand, the Skeleton Saint Tool was completely unscathed.","This was truly terrifying. Not only was his battle prowess boundlessly strong, but his defenses were also so freakish.","It should be known that Ling Han had shot out 30 eight-star Regulations, and they actually did not hurt the Skeleton Saint Tool in the slightest.","As expected of a war machine made up of Saint Tools.","With a sweep of his divine sense, he discovered that a great many Yin Saints had already made a comeback, and were presently pouncing towards the multiple suns. Clearly, they wanted to destroy the suns again, so that the universe that had just been revitalized a little would once again be transformed into Netherworld.","Ling Han didn’t try to stop them. He was being targeted by a Skeleton Saint Tool, so how could he find the time?","It was also because of this that those Yin Saints were bold enough to extinguish the suns without worry.","Boom!","The Skeleton Saint Tool took a step forwards, and its speed was frighteningly fast, far surpassing any ordinary Saint Tool. No wonder it could make all the Saints tremble in fear upon hearing its name. It was really only slightly inferior to a Pseudo-Emperor.","It moved again, delivering a palm strike at Ling Han.","The attacks were extremely simple, without any fancy moves, but they were also extremely practical, without the slightest bit of power wasted.","The large hand struck out, like the palm of an apocalyptic demon.","Ling Han shouted loudly, unafraid of facing it head-on, and this time, he used Destructive Energy.","Peng!","With this strike, Ling Han was once again sent flying. However, the Skeleton Saint Tool’s body also flashed wildly with brilliance, which then dimmed slightly.","Destructive Energy was still very effective, and caused a certain amount of damage. However, the Skeleton Saint Tool was made up of over a hundred Saint Tools, and they divided the destructive power of Destructive Energy among themselves, so it was difficult to cause any destructive damage.","In this exchange, it could be considered a tie. Ling Han was sent flying, and there were many light injuries all over his body. The Skeleton Saint Tool had also suffered a slight loss.","If other Saints were present, they would definitely grab their heads and exclaim in shock.","Finally, someone managed to withstand the head-on attack of the Skeleton Saint Tool. Furthermore, this was based on the premise that they would not use the Imperial Weapon at all.","\"Ah!\"","\"Ah!\"","Right at this moment, a powerful shockwave traveled over. That was a tragic scream on the level of divine sense.","It could be seen that in the distance, multiple suns were spitting out Destructive Energy, burning the Yin Saints that had made a move into nothing.","Ling Han smiled faintly. Previously, he had made arrangements, and left the Destructive Energy in every sun. Now that these Yin Saints had gone to extinguish the sun, it naturally triggered the Destructive Energy.","This Destructive Energy, boosted by the power of the sun, suddenly exploded, and even the Yin Saints were directly killed.","Boom! However, the Skeleton Saint Tool remained unfazed. With a wave of its hand, it launched another attack.","Ling Han raised his fist to parry each blow head-on, unafraid.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","They battled fiercely, neither gaining the upper hand, resulting in a stalemate.","In the distance, the Yin Saints did not dare to make another move, fearing that they too would be destroyed in form and spirit.","As they watched the intense battle between Ling Han and the Skeleton Saint Tool, they all looked stunned.","Too strong!","How could there be such a powerful Saint?","Moreover, Ling Han was only a One-Star Saint.","If this guy advanced into Two Stars, then his abilities would definitely soar to a new level.","Then what about three stars, or four stars?","With his freakish talent, he could easily reach five stars. At that time, would the Skeleton Saint Tool be able to stop him?","Hiss, he was holding back the waves with his own power. This was the bearing of a Great Emperor.","However, the Yin Saints immediately calmed down, because when it came to Great Emperors, they had a total of 12 on their side.","Even if Ling Han had become Emperor, how could he have any chance of winning in a battle of one against twelve?","At that time, Xuan Taiyu was strong enough, wasn’t he? Yet, he was still heavily injured, and soon died.","Ling Han also frowned.","Though he could now hold up to the Skeleton Saint Tool, this was only one.","How many Skeleton Saint Tools did the Netherworld possess?","There were at least close to a hundred of them.","What if two of them joined forces?","This was enough to make him suffer, and if there were three or four of them, then even he would have to flee upon hearing the news.","Strength, strength was still not enough.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. He definitely had to break through to Two Stars as soon as possible, and accommodate more Regulations. Only then would he be able to fight against two, three or four.","The Skeleton Saint Tool moved as quick as lightning. It was born for battle.","Ling Han humphed, and summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Though he had the Imperial Weapon, this was ultimately not something that he had personally refined, and there was a barrier between them. Secondly, reviving the Imperial Weapon was too exhausting, and even he could not bear it.","Thus, it was naturally best to use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","As his cultivation level increased, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower also became a Saint Tool.","Just how terrifying was a Saint Tool forged from Origin Gold?","Boom, lightning channelled, striking out at the Skeleton Saint Tool.","It was only a single strike, and the Skeleton Saint Tool was forced back. It was actually even more powerful than Ling Han’s own attack.","It couldn’t be helped. Th Origin Gold already possessed the potential to become the strongest in the world, and it was only limited by Ling Han’s cultivation level that it couldn’t unleash its full potential.","But now, Ling Han had already become a Saint, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had also become a Saint Tool. It was just a little bit away from becoming an Imperial Weapon, so how could its might not be strong?","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower hovered above Ling Han’s head. The aura of Primal Chaos descended, forming an incredibly powerful defense. Ling Han himself shot out a punch, blasting the Skeleton Saint Tool madly.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Under his powerful attacks, the Skeleton Saint Tool retreated continuously. It was actually completely outmatched.","However, the defenses of the Skeleton Saint Tool were far too terrifying, and it wasn’t damaged even after being attacked for so long. More than 100 Saint Tools divided the damage equally among themselves, so it would be extremely difficult to kill it.","Of course, this was unless Ling Han was powerful enough to obliterate over a hundred Saint Tools with a single strike. Only then would he be able to succeed.","To say nothing of him, perhaps even a Pseudo-Emperor was not that awesome, right?","The Yin Saint s were all trembling. Just looking at this kind of Saint was enough to make them shiver.","Weng, right at this moment, another frightening aura assaulted, and a massive figure appeared in the distant space.","This was the second Skeleton Saint Tool!","Boom! This Skeleton Saint Tool didn’t speak any nonsense at all—perhaps it couldn’t speak at all. Why would this war machine have the ability to speak?","It directly charged over, and delivered a palm strike. Saintly might diffused through the air.","Peng!","The two Skeleton Saint Tools joined forces, and their battle prowess naturally soared.","With the help of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, Ling Han could fight to a tie. However, this was also his limit."]},{"number":4696,"title":"Chapter 4696: An army bearing down on the border","paragraphs":["The two Skeleton Saint Tools surrounded Ling Han.","If word of this battle could spread throughout the universe, Ling Han’s name would definitely spread throughout the universe, and he would instantly become publicly acknowledged as the greatest Saint in the universe.","This was the Skeleton Saint Tool! Just how powerful was it? It was so powerful that any Saint would have no option but to flee upon seeing it.","However, Ling Han was actually capable of not falling into a disadvantage in a battle of two against one.","This!","Wasn’t he the greatest Saint in the world?","Aside from Pseudo-Emperor, who else could compare?","However, after only a short while, a third Skeleton Saint Tool arrived.","Ling Han was not the slightest bit surprised that the Netherworld would react so quickly, because the Chang Clan was standing on the side of the Netherworld, and had grasped the Galaxy Network, so the news was naturally transmitted in real time.","These were three Skeleton Saint Tools!","Even with Ling Han’s freakish talent, he still had no option but to fall into a disadvantage.","However, he held on stubbornly. Though he was at a disadvantage, he was still undefeated.","However, were there only three Skeleton Saint Tools?","Of course not.","Only a while later, the fourth Skeleton Saint Tool appeared.","This time, even Ling Han couldn’t hold on any longer.","The limit of what he could resist was three Skeleton Saint Tools. If there were four of them, he would not be able to match them.","Retreat!","He did not choose to confront them head-on, and chose to retreat.","\"You want to flee?\" Di Wuji appeared. He summoned the Imperial Weapon, which he shot towards Ling Han.","Not only him, but Tong Ming also unleashed his Imperial Weapon.","Ling Han no longer hesitated. The Clear Bamboo Sword awakened, and Imperial Might spread out, forcibly carving out a path.","Then, he used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, instantly fleeing millions and millions of km away.","With his extreme speed, if a Pseudo-Emperor didn’t appear, who could compete with him?","After throwing off his pursuers, he tore a rip into space and returned to the Four Origin Planet.","\"I can only match three Skeleton Saint Tools?\" Ling Han frowned. His abilities were far from enough.","The number of Netherworld’s Skeleton Saint Tools was in the hundreds. If they attacked together, even a Pseudo-Emperor would have to give them a wide berth.","\"I need to break through!\"","But when one had reached Saint Tier, how could breaking through be done just by thinking about it?","Ling Han switched directions, and again caused a heavy blow to the Netherworld. Only when the Skeleton Saint Tools joined forces against him did he retreat.","After several times, the invasion of the Netherworld had no choice but to stop.","It had to be admitted that Ling Han was too strong. He practically dominated the battle situation single-handedly.","However, the Netherworld weren’t idiots.","On this day, Ling Han was resting at Four Origin Planet when he suddenly sensed a powerful aura assaulting.","He immediately leaped into space, and shockingly discovered that twelve Skeleton Saint Tools had arrived together.","This!","This was enough to drive one to despair. Even though Ling Han was incredibly powerful, fighting against three of them alone was already his limit. However, there were 12 Skeleton Saint Tools, so how could he block them?","It was unknown who was the Netherworld’s strategist, to have directly struck at Ling Han’s weakness.","Shi Gang appeared before Ling Han. He wore a cold expression as he glared at Ling Han. There was a powerful hatred in his eyes.","\"Ling Han, you wouldn’t have thought that you would have such a day, right?!\"","By Ling Han’s side, Brother Monkey, the large black dog, the empress, and the other Saints all appeared, frowning deeply.","With so many Skeleton Saint Tools, how were they supposed to block them?","Imperial Weapon?","Ling Han had it, but so did the other side. They cancelled each other out, and the Skeleton Saint Tools could not be blocked either.","\"You are nothing but a vile character who is momentarily conceited,\" Ling Han said with a shake of his head. \"What right does a defeated opponent have to speak so boldly?\"","Shi Gang’s expression changed drastically. This person was the most narrow-minded, and Ling Han had struck a sore spot, causing him to feel extremely terrible.","\"Humph, you’ve become a trapped beast today. Let’s see how you can still be arrogant!\" He humphed, and with a wave of his hand, the Skeleton Saint Tools immediately moved at the same time, charging towards Four Origin Planet.","What could they do?","Ling Han handed the Clear Bamboo Sword over to Brother Monkey, while the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower hovered above his head, heading towards the Skeleton Saint Tools.","Brother Monkey resuscitated the Imperial Weapon and raised a barrier for the Four Origin Planet. This blocked the Skeleton Saint Tools, but how long it could last was an extremely serious problem.","Of course, the large black dog, the little azure dragon, the empress and the others could also fight. However, there were only so many Saints, and their numbers could be counted.","\"Father, let us help you!\"","The seven Calabash Brothers rushed over, and as Ling Han advanced into Saint Tier, their strength also rose accordingly, advancing into Saint Tier.","However, they had their own limitations. They were unable to revive a Saint Tool.","According to Brother Monkey, they were actually the manifestations of a Saint Tool. Since that was the case, it was naturally impossible for them to activate the Imperial Weapon.","However, what use was a Saint Tool against a Skeleton Saint Tool?","Only the Imperial Weapon could suppress everything.","There was not the slightest change in the bodies of the seven Calabash Brothers. They still looked like the babies they had been several hundred years ago. They gave a soft exclamation in their childish voices, and the seven children instantly crashed into each other.","Then, with a flash of brilliance, they actually fused together, turning into... a large seven-coloured gourd.","This!","Ling Han felt powerless to complain. Why was it still a gourd?","However, he discovered that the aura exuding from this seven-coloured gourd was actually incredibly shocking. Though it was still Saint Tier, it was superior to any ordinary Saint Tool.","Yi, was this also a combination Saint Tool?","Furthermore, this could be split into seven babies, and all of them had intelligence, no different from a real person.","This caused Ling Han to become suspicious. Could a Saint forge such a Spirit Tool?","Impossible!","Absolutely impossible!","Hence, this was definitely not forged by the Ancient Sun Saint. It was not that Ling Han looked down on this Saint, but rather that Saints really could not do so. In fact, even the Great Emperor could not.","Just look at the Skeleton Saint Tool. It was indeed powerful, but did it have any intelligence?","A thought suddenly flashed through his mind.","The great fissure at the edge of the universe.","Could it be that this was where the seed of the gourd had come from?","Otherwise, how could there be such an amazing Saint Tool?","Who cares!","Ling Han discovered that his divine sense was connected to the seven-colored gourd. With a single thought, he could control this Saint Tool. Furthermore, there was no need for him to expend any energy at all, because this was actually being controlled by seven babies. He was only playing the role of commander.","Boom! A streak of light shot out from the seven-colored gourd and struck at a Skeleton Saint Tool.","The Skeleton Saint Tool was actually sent flying by this strike.","What powerful attack power!","Ling Han nodded internally. It could be imagined that the Ancient Sun Saint definitely hadn’t been able to unleash the true power of the infants. Otherwise, even if several hundred Yin Saints had come, they would definitely have been defeated by the combined forces of the infants.","M-hm, perhaps those babies had only been a seed at that time, and had been accidentally obtained by the Ancient Sun Saint.","No matter what, it was fine as long as they were strong enough.","Ling Han also launched an attack himself, blocking the attacks of three Skeleton Saint Tools.","Now, he had blocked three of them, while the babies had blocked one. There were still eight remaining, and they were all blocked by the Imperial Weapon.","From the looks of things now, the Four Origin Planet could still hold on. However, Shi Gang definitely also had an Imperial Weapon, which he hadn’t unleashed yet. Moreover, on the side of the Four Origin Planet, how long could the Clear Bamboo Sword be maintained in a state of recovery?","Ling Han was filled with anxiety. Could it be that he would have to watch helplessly as Four Origin Planet was destroyed?","He became ruthless, a cold light flickering in his eyes.","He was going to give it his all!","He shook his fist, and not only was the Destructive Energy entwined around him, he even used the holy flame.","He was going all out. The holy flame was the foundation of Saints. Once it was completely burnt, one would fall out of Saint Tier, and Ling Han was only a One Star Saint. The holy flame was only the size of a human head. Though it was much larger than the holy flame of an ordinary One Star Saint, how long could it last?","\"Charge!\" Ling Han charged out resolutely."]},{"number":4697,"title":"Chapter 4697: Going all out","paragraphs":["Ling Han rushed in front of a Skeleton Saint Tool, and shot out a punch.","This time, he was really going all out. He had even used the holy flame.","Boom! The punch arrived, yet the Skeleton Saint Tool wasn’t stupid either. It immediately raised its fist to block the attack.","The two fists that were extremely different in size crashed into each other, immediately releasing a blinding light. The Regulations exploded, forming a powerful shockwave.","Peng! Ling Han was instantly sent flying. In terms of power, he was still inferior to the Skeleton Saint Tool.","5,000 kilometers away, Ling Han stopped, and when the light completely dissipated, the entire right hand of the Skeleton Saint Tool had dimmed, and there was no longer any sign of saintly might.","This!","The right hand of the Skeleton Saint Tool had actually been forcefully destroyed.","It should be known that the Skeleton Saint Tool was equivalent to a combination of over a hundred Saint Tools. Now, its right hand had dimmed, which was equivalent to several Saint Tools having been destroyed, and could no longer show their might.","The might of Ling Han’s punch was actually so terrifying!","This was something that even Ling Han hadn’t expected. He raised his fist to take a look. The combination of the Destructive Energy and the holy flame had actually exploded with such astonishing destructive power?","He had once guessed that the Destructive Energy had originated from the abyss at the edge of the universe, and there was no need to mention the Seed of the Holy Flame. It must have come from there, or it was even highly possible that Genesis World rulers such as himself and Ding Shu, and the others had also come from the abyss of the universe, and that was why they were so freakish.","Then, it could be imagined that when the beings at the three great abysses at the edge of the universe joined forces, they would resonate, and explode with destructive power that surpassed their cultivation level.","Ling Han couldn’t imagine this scene, and those people from the Netherworld couldn’t imagine it even more.","One after another, the Yin Saints were all dumbfounded, completely unable to believe what they had seen. Meanwhile, Shi Gang was also surprised. He still had the Imperial Weapon in his hand, which he had not shot out yet. This was meant to deliver a fatal blow to Ling Han.","How was this possible?","The Skeleton Saint Tool had been created by the Great Emperors after they had entered into the abyss of the universe. It possessed battle prowess that could crush all Saints. In fact, even against a Pseudo-Emperor, it was unafraid. With over a hundred Saint Tools dividing the destructive power among themselves, it was completely indestructible.","However, a punch from Ling Han actually damaged a few Saint Tools.","Though this did not have much effect on the Skeleton Saint Tool, if he threw a few more punches, even something as strong as the Skeleton Saint Tool could possibly be shattered.","Ling Han laughed loudly. This was a new discovery.","He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and charged towards that Skeleton Saint Tool from before.","Injuring all of a man’s fingers is not as effective as chopping off one!","However, the other two Skeleton Saint Tools immediately came over to block him, exerting pressure on Ling Han and preventing him from succeeding.","Ling Han was already fighting with his life on the line. With a battle cry, he charged forwards to meet the attack. The holy flame and Destructive Energy fused together, turning into a terrifying destructive power. So what if it was the Skeleton Saint Tool? As long as it was hit, it would definitely be damaged.","Even though the attacks of the Skeleton Saint Tool were powerful, it wasn’t intelligent like the babies. It would only battle to the death against its opponents.","Under normal circumstances, with their powerful battle prowess, they would naturally be invincible. This was an advantage.","However, things were different now. Ling Han’s destructive ability was far too terrifying. Moreover, these Skeleton Saint Tools were fighting to the death and refusing to retreat. They would face Ling Han’s attacks head-on, and the damage they suffered was also incredibly terrifying.","Shi Gang hurriedly issued an order for the three Skeleton Saint Tools to retreat. Otherwise, it was really possible that they would die here.","It should be known that the Skeleton Saint Tool was a weapon that they had used to sweep aside all opposition in this world. Otherwise, could they rely on the Yin Saints alone?","What a joke. Though there were many Yin Saints, their battle prowess was far from being comparable to a true Saint.","He looked at Ling Han with jealousy. When he thought about how Ling Han had entered into the Sacred Land and become a Saint after obtaining the great fortune in the Pool of Life, he was filled with anger.","You have benefited from the glory of the Buddhist Race, and that is why you have the glory that you have now!","And this should have been his.","The first generation Buddha Son!","Ling Han also stopped his attacks. The more the holy flame was used up, the less there would be left. He didn’t want to waste it, and as long as he advanced into Two Stars, his battle prowess would naturally be greatly improved, and he wouldn’t be forced into such a miserable state.","Shi Gang activated the Imperial Weapon and charged at Ling Han. However, Brother Monkey also charged over with the Clear Bamboo Sword in hand.","Boom!","In a clash of Imperial Weapons, who would be weaker than the other?","Meanwhile, Ling Han charged toward the remaining eight Skeleton Saint Tools. Although he was definitely no match for eight Skeleton Saint Tools at once, he had also caused great damage to these Skeleton Saint Tools.","After battling for half a day, Shi Gang had no choice but to call a ceasefire.","If it was just an Imperial Weapon, it would not be enough to destroy Four Origin Planet.","\"Ling Han, when I make a comeback, the Nine Suns Holy Land will be destroyed,\" he said balefully.","He had initially thought that this assault would be an absolutely one-sided suppression, yet he had no choice but to return in defeat, causing him to lose all face. Thus, he definitely had to say these words.","Ling Han said coldly, \"Bring it on, and see how I chop off your dog’s head.\"","\"Woof!\" the large black dog shouted in displeasure. You can’t insult me as well like this, all right?","\"Fine, I’ll chop off your pig head.\" Ling Han changed his words.","\"Gu, gu, gu!\" This time, the pervert pig was displeased. Did Uncle Pig trifle with you?","Ling Han hadn’t even opened his mouth, when he saw the little azure dragon glaring at him.","Er... you already know to snatch my lines first.","Shi Gang was almost angered to death. None of these people took him seriously.","He humphed, and with a wave of his hand, retreated with his troops.","He swore that the next time he came, he would definitely destroy Four Origin Planet.","Ling Han’s revenge?","Hehe, what need was there for him to be concerned? Even if he did not destroy Four Origin Planet, Ling Han was still sniping the Netherworld everywhere.","So, this was their revenge, all right?","After Shi Gang and the others left, Ling Han didn’t give chase.","The other side had the Imperial Weapon, as well as twelve Skeleton Saint Tools. This kind of power was too powerful, and there was absolutely no way to destroy them.","Most importantly, Ling Han’s holy flame was limited, and couldn’t withstand this kind of exhaustion.","\"Next time, what if they come with two Imperial Weapons, and send out twenty or thirty Skeleton Saint Tools?\" Ling Han frowned.","He could cause damage to the Skeleton Saint Tool, but that did not mean that he was invincible.","On the other hand, if a dozen or so Skeleton Saint Tools attacked him at the same time, even if one or two of them would be destroyed, it would still be enough to blast him into smithereens.","Moreover, two Imperial Weapons were enough to suppress the Clear Bamboo Sword.","If Ling Han was all alone, then there was absolutely no need for him to be afraid. If he couldn’t win, he could just run.","But now, he could run, but what about the Four Origin Planet?","\"I have to think of some way to unite the Imperial Clans.\"","\"There are at least a few dozen Imperial Clans in the world, and if these powers are pulled together, they would be completely capable of fighting against the Skeleton Saint Tools.\"","\"Alright, I’ll go and ’convince’ them to join.\"","This time, he planned to use both force and persuasion. It was best if you agreed, but even if you didn’t, you would have no choice.","He brought the Imperial Weapon and began to move.","Time was limited, and he had to make the most of it.","The first stop was naturally Donglin Imperial Clan.","After hearing his reason for coming, the Chi Clan immediately decided to join the alliance that Ling Han had advocated.","—Firstly, Ling Han was the son-in-law of the Chi Clan, so no matter what, he was one of their own. Secondly, Ling Han had already become a Saint, and had grown to become a powerful backer.","Ling Han didn’t stop, and for the second stop, he chose Ziwei Imperial Clan."]},{"number":4698,"title":"Chapter 4698: Zhen Baili","paragraphs":["Ling Han chose Ziwei Imperial Clan for his second stop.","He had a grudge with a great many Imperial Clans, and the one he had the greatest grudge with was definitely the Baili Clan.","Since he had already become a Saint, he naturally had to keep his promise.","Ling Han released his divine sense and searched for the planet where the Ziwei Clan was located. After a short while, a smile appeared at the corners of his lips.","Found it.","Saints were awesome indeed. They could absorb Regulations, and assimilate with the heaven and earth. It was as if the heaven and earth had become a part of their bodies, and it would be too easy to find a planet.","Of course, this was only limited to searching for planets. He couldn’t use this to locate a person.","Ling Han tore open the Void and rushed over with Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. After only two days, he reappeared from the Void, only to see that there were shockingly 27 planets floating in front of him.","It was as if these planets were fitted with some kind of propulsion device. They were not orbiting around a certain sun at all, but were rather heading straight ahead.","This wasn’t strange.","Saint-level formations were definitely laid out on every planet, forming a continuous propulsive force that headed towards the edge of the universe.","Tsk, the Ziwei Imperial Clan was truly rich and imposing, being able to set up 27 Saint-level formations in one go.","It should be known that formations needed formation foundations to set up, and the higher the level of the formation, the rarer and more precious the formation foundations needed. That was even more so the case for Saint-level formations.","After being robbed by Ling Han and Brother Monkey, the Ziwei Imperial Clan could actually set up 27 Saint-level formations?","Thus, a cunning rabbit has three burrows. Looks like what Brother Monkey had emptied out previously was only one of the treasure chambers of the Baili Clan.","Among these 27 planets, one was obviously larger, and the other 26 planets added together might only be this big.","This was the Ziwei Planet.","Ling Han had already been here once, so he was naturally familiar with this place. With a single step, he had already landed on the Ziwei Planet.","This wasn’t the core area of the Ziwei Imperial Clan, so it wasn’t very heavily guarded. Ling Han walked around casually, and no one came to ask for his identity.","However, this place was bustling with noise and excitement, as if it was completely unaffected by the invasion of the Yin souls.","Ling Han made some queries, and couldn’t help but reveal a strange expression.","Because today was Baili Tian’s wedding day.","This guy was getting married again?","Previously, he had wanted to marry Chi Menghan, but in the end, Ling Han barged into the wedding venue, defeated the groom, and snatched the bride from him. This caused Baili Tian to be utterly humiliated.","And now, this guy actually dispelled his psychological trauma, and was getting married again?","En.","Ling Han rested his chin on his hand. He had actually come here at such a coincidental time. It must be heaven’s will.","Alright, the will of the heavens told him to cause trouble again, so how could he act in defiance of the will of heaven?","—If the large black dog knew about this, his expression would definitely be filled with disdain. Since when did you not act in a heaven-defying manner?","However, Ling Han was very excited about ruining Baili Tian’s wedding.","Moreover, he couldn’t just stand by and watch as some girl fell into a tiger’s den.","This was called saving a life, which would garner more blessing than building a seven-storey pagoda.","This was what the Ancestral Buddha had said.","Thus, Ling Han walked slowly and leisurely towards the main venue of the wedding.","Ever since the incident of Ling Han and Brother Monkey sneaking in, all banquets that involved inviting outsiders, such as the 100,000-year-old birthday of an elder, the 500,000-year-old birthday celebration, or the wedding of some prodigy, were not held in the ancestral grounds..","They were all outside the Great Emperor Formation. The ancestral grounds were heavily guarded, and not even a fly could fly in.","Thus, the main venue for Baili Tian’s wedding was also arranged to be held at Xuanyun City. This was the largest city outside of the ancestral grounds. There were many guests here, and all of them were smiling. They did not look like refugees at all.","True, with the collective relocation of 27 planets, they could completely form their own society. Even if the galaxy fell, they would still be able to live well.","Thus, some people were short-sighted, only looking at the present, and getting by.","Ling Han made some queries about the bride, and shockingly discovered that Baili Tian was actually very popular. His bride was shockingly another noble daughter of an Imperial Clan, but not the Imperial Daughter.","After all, in the cultivation world, there were more men than women. Among the top-notch elites, the number of women was relatively small.","Of course, there had also been existences like Empress Qingzhu, who had reigned supreme over an era, suppressing all the men in the world to the point that they had to bow their heads.","The partner that Baili Tian was marrying for a matrimonial alliance was a daughter of the Peacock Imperial Clan, and the bride was called Kong Ling’er. It was said that she was extremely beautiful. However, in this kind of matrimonial alliance, whether she was beautiful or not was not important. What was important was the significance that she represented.","It was very lively today, and there were as many guests as clouds. However, those that could come to Xuanyun City were all mighty figures, and as for the two Imperial Clans, to say nothing of Saints, there were tens of thousands of elites above Spirit Transformation Tier.","And this was still because it was currently a time of crisis. Otherwise, which sect wouldn’t give the Golden Generation some face during their wedding?","As for now? The majority of forces had already fallen, and those that had not died were still fleeing, so how could they have the time to attend some wedding?","Ling Han smiled. Since there were two Imperial Clans, this was just right, saving him the trouble of making another trip.","He sat at the side and began eating. No one cared if he was qualified to sit here or not.","In truth, there were too many elites. Though every single one of them had restrained their aura, added together, they still formed a powerful oppressive force. Without a high enough cultivation level, coming here would only be seeking their own humiliation.","Ling Han waited quietly. He was not in a rush to reveal his identity yet.","At noon, the banquet began, and dishes were served. However, there was still no sign of the bride and groom. They would definitely only come out during the evening banquet.","The Ziwei Imperial Clan didn’t move the sun along with them. This was relatively difficult. After all, the sun was a giant fireball, and it was difficult to set up formations. It wasn’t that it couldn’t be done, but the price was too high.","However, the Saint of the Ziwei Imperial Clan had still used his great power to create a sun. If it was only used to illuminate the Ziwei Imperial Clan, it was naturally more than enough.","Very quickly, the light dimmed, and the bright moon rose — this was also the handiwork of a Saint.","There were even more guests at night, and this was the real banquet.","A group of people were walking around, and this was a good opportunity for them to get to know people and expand their networks.","\"This brother looks unfamiliar. How should I address you?\" Just as Ling Han was eating and drinking with his head lowered, he saw someone approach with a wine cup in hand, taking the initiative to strike up a conversation.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before saying, \"Gao Bupan?\"","What kind of name was that?","That person thought for a moment, and immediately understood. This was <anno data-annotation-id=\"ceecde30-a5d6-4a09-a703-9f2e2c71e1d7\" data-title=\"unattainable\">unattainable 1 </anno>.","Hiss, was there anyone as shameless as you?","\"Humph!\" That person instantly flicked his sleeves and left.","Ling Han smiled, and continued to eat and drink. Later, he was going to cause a great commotion at the wedding, and he was not here to make friends.","After a while, he shockingly discovered that the person from before had actually come again. Furthermore, there was another person beside him, dressed in a tight-fitting green suit.","\"I heard that you’re very proud!\" the man in green said coldly.","Ling Han was surprised, \"What does my pride have to do with you?\"","\"My name is Baili Bahuang!\" the man in green said proudly.","Oh, so he was a member of the Baili Clan.","Ling Han glanced at him. This person was at the level of Sect Master. He was about a thousand years old, and it could be said that his natural talent was astonishing.","He smiled, \"I also have another nickname, and that is Zhen <anno data-annotation-id=\"b9aeb799-b085-4445-b8c9-b894c82df5c6\" data-title=\"Baili.\">Baili. 1 </anno>\"","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">MC’s alias literally means that he was ’unattainable’.Literally translates to suppressing Baili Clan.</annotations>"]},{"number":4699,"title":"Chapter 4699: Again","paragraphs":["Hiss!","The person who had spoken up earlier couldn’t help but inhale sharply. This was too arrogant, wasn’t it?","On the Ziwei Planet, you actually dare call yourself Zhen Baili, aren’t you afraid of being blasted into dust?","\"How dare you!\" Baili Bahuang flew into a thunderous rage. He did not believe that Ling Han really had the nickname of \"Zhen Baili\", but was something that the latter had come up with.","His expression turned cold, and he was just about to make a move.","Ling Han waved his hand, and said, \"Think about it. Today is Baili Tian’s wedding day. Aren’t you afraid of making that Imperial Son unhappy, and he would use you as a sacrifice?\"","When these words fell, Baili Bahuang’s aura immediately weakened.","If a fight broke out at the wedding venue, it was naturally not auspicious, what more when it involved murder and bloodshed.","Moreover, Baili Tian had already experienced a failed wedding once, so he was especially sensitive about this. If he caused any commotion, this person would probably go crazy.","Although the person with the greatest hopes of becoming Emperor in the Baili Clan now was Baili Haojie, Baili Tian was still a Golden Generation after all. Even if he couldn’t become Emperor, he still had a high chance of becoming a nine-star Saint. He was still very impressive.","Thus, Baili Bahuang had to consider carefully.","\"You are indeed very arrogant,\" Baili Bahuang said in a baleful voice. He had already suppressed his urge, but he would definitely not give up just like that.","When the wedding ended, this guy would know the consequences of being insolent in the Baili Clan.","Humph, how ignorant and fearless.","He didn’t leave, and he simply sat down at this table. He definitely wouldn’t give Ling Han the chance to sneak away.","Ling Han didn’t mind, and continued to eat and drink.","Time slowly passed, and finally, the bride and groom came out, preparing to pay their respects and complete the ceremony.","When this couple was about to bow to the heaven and earth, Ling Han suddenly stood up.","Sigh, without the cooperation of the large black dog, he could only do things himself.","Hiss, what do you want to do?","Baili Bahuang couldn’t help but feel shocked. If Ling Han dared to ruin the wedding in front of him, then he would definitely be reprimanded by Baili Tian afterwards.","\"Sit down quickly!\" he hurriedly shouted.","How could Ling Han possibly pay any heed to him? He said calmly, \"I object!\"","’I! Object!’","Though these three words were melodious, they were like a resounding bell, deafening.","Yi?","Who was being insolent?","No one asked if anyone objected, so why did you suddenly jump out to join in on the excitement?","Was he seeking death?","Meanwhile, Baili Tian’s expression darkened, and a strong sense of familiarity rose up in him.","’F*ck! This scene is so familiar!’","\"How dare you!\" Baili Bahuang could no longer bear it, and immediately moved to attack Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Sit down, and watch the show obediently.\"","Pa, Baili Bahuang immediately flopped onto the ground, feeling his mind go blank. Then, a layer of cold sweat broke out on his back, and his hands and feet were completely cold.","This was far too terrifying. It was as if he were facing a Great Emperor.","\"Impudence!\" One of the elites from the Peacock Imperial Clan shouted immediately, \"Which arrogant brat dares to be impudent in this place!\"","This was not only the Baili Clan’s wedding, but also the Kong Clan’s.","However, someone from the Baili Clan immediately spoke up, and said balefully, \"Ling Han, how dare you come here!\"","What, Ling Han?","The elite from the Peacock Clan immediately shut his mouth, not daring to make another sound.","Though he was also a Venerate Tier, could he compare to Ling Han?","Who didn’t know that Ling Han was capable of matching Saints? In fact, he was actually capable of sweeping aside all opposition below five stars of Saint-level.","In front of Ling Han, who was he?","Ling Han chuckled, and mumbled, \"You speak as if I’ve never been here before.\"","Though this was a murmur, quite a number of people had heard it, which immediately made the members of the Baili Clan feel stifled.","Indeed, Ling Han had already come once, and he had even ransacked the ancestral grounds. Even now, this was still a great humiliation to the Baili Clan. This was something that had never happened before in hundreds of millions of years.","What could the Baili Clan do?","Ling Han was still alive and well.","And now, he had come again!","\"Ling Han, you are really courting death!\" A Saint from the Baili Clan stepped out. He was a six-star Saint. Otherwise, he would not have dared to step out.","Who didn’t know that Ling Han was capable of matching a Five Star Saint?","However, the Galaxy Network was already cut off, and there was no news. The Baili Clan definitely couldn’t anticipate that Ling Han had already become a Saint.","—If he had known, he probably would not have jumped out now.","Ling Han had become a Saint, and he had absorbed Regulations, assimilating with heaven and earth. If he didn’t reveal his aura, no one would be able to see through him.","He smiled slightly, \"Don’t you guys think that this wedding is too monotonous?\"","’F*ck! Are you trying to add to the excitement of the wedding?’","This was practically causing trouble, all right!","\"You’ve gone too far!\" The six-star Saint stretched out a finger, and pressed it down on Ling Han.","This was the Ziwei Planet. In the past, it had been reinforced by the Great Emperor. Otherwise, he would definitely not dare make a move on his home planet.","Ling Han also pointed a finger at the six-star Saint. He then turned to the bride who was wearing a red veil, and said, \"I say, young lady, have you considered carefully? Do you really want to marry that guy?\"","Peng!","The two attacks collided, instantly setting off a terrifying storm of energy. Instantly, figures flew, and the ground trembled. The entire city was on the verge of collapse.","The Ziwei Planet had been strengthened by the Great Emperor, so there was no fear of it being destroyed by Saints. However, this didn’t mean that the structures on it were the same.","In short, in this short while, the wedding venue was already in a complete mess.","Baili Tian was in a towering rage. He very much wanted to make a move himself, but firstly, he was the groom, so it was not appropriate. Secondly, in the grounds of the Chi Clan, he had already made a move once. Though he had been a Half-Saint then, he had still been beaten up by Ling Han.","Under the strong psychological trauma, he unconsciously cowered in front of Ling Han.","\"As expected of the greatest prodigy of all eternity!\" Baili Haojie appeared, looking down on Ling Han with disdain and condescension.","He was the son of a Great Emperor, and now, he was a six-star Saint!","They were both six-star Saints, so how could his battle prowess compare to that Saint from before?","His battle prowess... was as high as eighteen stars, and this was without taking into account the blessing of the power of belief.","\"However, what kind of place do you think this is?\" he asked balefully, his killing intent soaring.","\"Cough!\" Ling Han waved his hand, indicating for Baili Haojie to calm down. \"The reason why I have come here today is mainly to deliver a notice, inviting your Baili Clan to join my alliance and join forces to resist the invasion of the Netherworld.\"","\"As for the matter of the wedding, hehe, it can’t be helped. I’m a straightforward person, and I can’t bear to see anyone fall into a fire pit, so I stepped out to speak up for justice.\"","’Holy f*ck! Is this the attitude of an invitation?’","He had already ruined their wedding, so who would want to form an alliance with him?","\"Oh, that’s right. Since the Kong Clan is also here, I’ll inform them as well. Come, join my alliance,\" Ling Han added.","\"Ling Han, are you daydreaming?\" Baili Haojie said coldly. He had already lost his patience.","Are you toying with the Baili Clan like we are monkeys?","Ling Han sighed, \"You see, I am very seriously and sincerely negotiating with you.\"","\"Die!\" Baili Haojie couldn’t endure it any longer, and he launched an attack at Ling Han."]},{"number":4700,"title":"Chapter 4700: Threat","paragraphs":["Ling Han activated the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and suddenly moved at an indescribably fast speed.","’What?’","Baili Haojie paled in shock. How had Ling Han suddenly arrived in front of him?","However, after a moment of shock, he calmed down. The other had grasped the True Phoenix’s movement technique, and his speed was indeed fast. However, he was a six-star Saint, and was also the son of a Great Emperor. Just how powerful was his battle prowess?","Aren’t you just walking right into a trap?","\"If you want to die, I’ll oblige you!\" He sent out a palm strike towards Ling Han.","If they distanced themselves from each other and exchanged blows, then even if one was outmatched, he would still have a chance to escape. However, if they were to exchange blows at close quarters, it was possible that the outcome of the battle would be revealed in just a few moves.","Saints were hard to kill, but he could not help it that Ling Han was seeking death.","Boom, he sent out a palm strike, eighteen streaks of eight-star Regulations entwined around it, indescribably mighty.","Baili Haojie couldn’t be bothered to use the power of belief at all. With his battle prowess of eighteen stars, how could it be that he couldn’t suppress a puny Fourth Extreme?","Ling Han smiled, and waved out a palm.","Peng!","Without a doubt, Baili Haojie flew out and instantly became a small black dot in the horizon, disappearing into space.","This!","In an instant, everyone was dumbfounded, their minds completely blank.","F***, was there something wrong with their eyes?","Baili Haojie was a six-star Saint!","He was actually sent flying with a single palm strike?","You’ve got to be joking, right? It must be fake, right?","However, they only saw Ling Han standing proudly where he was. As for Baili Haojie, well, there was no sign of him at all.","How was this possible!","Everyone was numb with shock. This was too terrifying, wasn’t it? Just how powerful was Ling Han?","\"You’ve become a Saint!\" Baili Tian said in a trembling voice.","Right now, most of the young king tiers had already become Saints. Only Ling Han was an exception.","But it was this one exception that was the strongest prodigy in history.","And now, this guy had become a Saint.","This was too terrifying. Baili Haojie, a six-star Saint, was actually sent flying with a single palm strike. That was the battle prowess of an eighteen-star Saint.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"That um, you guys haven’t answered my suggestion yet?\"","\"You’ve gone too far!\" The nine-star Saint from the Baili Clan stepped forward. His name was Baili Chao, and he had already lived for over 900,000 years. His entire body was exuding an aura of decay, and the flame of life was on the verge of extinguishing.","However, once this kind of old Saint unleashed his might, he would still possess a terrifying battle prowess that would cause heaven and earth to pale in colour.","He directly drew the Imperial Weapon. The Purple Star Sword floated above his head. It had already awakened, and was emitting Imperial Might.","Ling Han chuckled, and similarly drew the Clear Bamboo Sword..","The Imperial Weapons cancelled each other out, and he was still invincible.","This!","The members of the Baili Clan were all sullen. Could it be that they would have retreat to their ancestral grounds, and depend on the Great Emperor formation for protection?","After entering the Imperial Formation, so what if Ling Han possessed the Imperial Weapon? There was a time limit to the might of the Imperial Weapon, but the power of the Great Emperor Formation originated from the compressed stars, which were endless.","Thus, it was because of this that the Imperial Clans had such powerful confidence. Even if they were trapped, they would at least be able to ensure their safety.","But the problem was, being forced by a Saint to the point that they could only struggle at death’s door in the ancestral grounds, how could they bear with that?","\"Ling Han, what exactly do you want to do?\" Baili Chao was afraid now. The situation was far too dire right now, so Ling Han’s battle prowess was already extremely terrifying. Moreover, he also possessed the Imperial Weapon, so who in the world could stop him?","Probably only Pseudo-Emperors, right?","Unfortunately, the Baili Clan did not have any Pseudo-Emperor.","\"Huh? Didn’t I say? Join my alliance,\" Ling Han said with a smile. \"When Yin souls invade, no one can stay out of it.\"","\"What if we refuse?\" Baili Chao asked. If they were really forced to agree by Ling Han like this, that would really be too vexing.","Ling Han hadn’t even finished speaking when he saw a figure descend from the sky. It was Baili Haojie.","His expression was livid, his fury blazing.","He was the son of a Great Emperor, and he had actually been sent flying with a single palm strike. How could he accept this?","\"Ling Han!\" he said through gritted teeth.","\"Yo, you’re back so soon,\" Ling Han greeted.","\"Damn guy!\" Baili Haojie snatched the Ziwei Sword=, and said, \"Let’s battle again!\"","\"Come on,\" Ling Han said with a hook of his finger. If he wanted the Ziwei Imperial Clan to join his alliance, he obviously couldn’t rely on words alone. He had to force them into submission.","Baili Haojie charged over, while Ling Han unleashed his Imperial Weapon to oppose the Ziwei Sword.","Boom!","Imperial Weapon against Imperial Weapon, Saint against Saint.","It was impossible that anyone who could become a Great Emperor would be weaker than the other. However, it was a different story for Saints.","Pa, Ling Han sent out a palm strike, and Baili Haojie turned into a black dot again, disappearing into the horizon.","This...","Everyone was speechless. This time, Baili Haojie had obviously used the power of belief. It could be said that aside from the holy flame, he had already gone all out, but was still no match for Ling Han, which showed how great the gap between the two of them was.","The greatest prodigy of all eternity. Once he became a Saint, he would have the strength to sweep aside all opposition in Silent Destruction Tier.","Who could not submit?","Ling Han withdrew his palm as if nothing had happened, and said to Baili Chao, \"If you guys refuse, then I can only go on a killing spree! In front of a great enemy, you guys are still so selfish. You only worry about yourselves, so what is the point of leaving you alive?\"","These words caused the expressions of all the members of the Baili Clan to change drastically. Ling Han was too strong. If they were really targeted by him, they could only duck into the Great Emperor formation.","However, with how domineering this guy was, if he attacked madly with the Imperial Weapon, would the Great Emperor Formation collapse?","Though the advantage of the Great Emperor Formation was that it could be channeled continuously, in terms of power alone, it was inferior to the Imperial Weapon.","After all, after the awakening of the Imperial Weapon, it was equivalent to the arrival of the Great Emperor himself. However, the Imperial Weapon was only one of the arrangements that the Great Emperor had set up.","Baili Chao gritted his teeth, and said, \"All right, let’s form an alliance!\"","Ling Han smiled and said, \"That’s more like it. Come, let’s discuss the details.\"","Not only were there members of the Baili Clan, but even the Saints of the Peacock Clan also sat down to discuss the matter of the alliance.","In addition to some ordinary offensive and defensive assistance, Ling Han also took advantage of the opening to make an exorbitant demand, demanding a large amount of cultivation resources from the two great Imperial Clans.","He had already become a Saint, so there were really too few Great Herbs that could help him improve. Even the two great Imperial Clans could not produce them.","However, he still had a great many friends and family by his side, such as Lin Luo, Zhou Heng, Karmic Life Heavenly Venerable and so on. None of them had become a Saint.","Being able to cultivate to Heavenly Venerable Tier in Genesis World, even if they were inferior to rulers of the Genesis World, they still possessed astonishing natural talent in cultivation. Once they became Saints, their battle prowess would definitely be extraordinary, and it was precisely battle prowess that he needed the most at present.","\"You’ve gone too far!\" the two Imperial Clans objected. This was an attempt to rob them clean.","Ling Han did not speak either. He stretched out his hand, and 30 eight-star Regulations surged out. Furthermore, he had also released his own holy flame. It was white, and clearly showed that he presently was still only a One Star Saint.","’Holy f*ck!’","The Saints from the two Imperial Clans were all so shocked that the corners of their mouths twitched. A One Star Saint was capable of using 30 Eight Star Regulations; what kind of concept was that?","Even if Baili Haojie was the son of a Great Emperor, and had excellent natural talent, when he had reached the level of Nine Star Saint, he would only be able to use 30 flashes of Eight Star Regulations, which was his maximum.","But what about Ling Han?","This was a One Star Saint!","They were all thinking that if Ling Han had reached the level of Nine Star Saint, would he be able to match a Pseudo-Emperor, or even... defeat a Pseudo-Emperor?","And if this guy had reached Pseudo-Emperor-level?","They didn’t dare to think about it anymore. That would be too terrifying."]}]);
